window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["ar05"]={"id": "ar05", "title": "信息论：熵、KL 与互信息", "focus": "从公理建立熵与 KL，证明 Gibbs 不等式与 KL 链式法则，给出互信息、条件互信息与数据处理不等式，作为全书误差度量的语言。", "claims": ["H(p)=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)，连续情形为微分熵", "D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)\\ge 0，等号成立 \\iff p=q\\ \\text{a.e.}", "KL 链式法则：D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|q(x,y))=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x)\\|q(x))+\\mathbb E_{p(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y|x)\\|q(y|x))"], "topics": ["熵的定义与公理化", "联合熵、条件熵与链式法则", "KL 散度：定义、非负性与等号条件", "互信息与数据处理不等式", "交叉熵与最大似然的关系", "相对熵的变分表示（Donsker–Varadhan）", "f-散度与 Rényi 散度", "熵的估计与偏差", "连续熵与离散熵的差异", "反例：KL 无界与支撑不匹配", "信息几何：Fisher 度量", "熵率与马尔可夫链", "代码：熵与 KL 的数值计算", "代码：KL 非负性的数值验证与反例", "与最大似然章的接口", "本章推导链：信息量是似然的货币"], "html": "<h3 id=\"ar05--h-熵的定义与公理化\">熵的定义与公理化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-熵的定义与公理化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第一部已固定的符号约定：概率空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)$</span> 上的随机变量取值于可测空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal X,\\mathcal B)$</span>；离散情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 至多可数并取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B=2^{\\mathcal X}$</span>，连续情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X\\subseteq\\mathbb R^d$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 的迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数。对离散分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，记其支撑为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}p=\\{x\\in\\mathcal X:p(x)&gt;0\\}$</span>；对连续分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 表示关于 Lebesgue 测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的 Radon–Nikodym 密度。本节新引入的符号如下，后文一律按此使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上概率测度全体；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{ac}}(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>：关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 绝对连续的概率测度全体。</li>\n<li>离散情形取对数底为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log=\\log_2$</span>；连续情形取自然对数，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ln$</span>。凡出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ln$</span> 混用处，均在该命题假设中显式声明底数，结论中的常数随底数线性缩放，不影响非负性与等号条件。</li>\n<li>约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log\\frac{0}{0}=0$</span>；这是测度论中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ln t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处连续延拓为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 的标准约定。</li>\n<li>对离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\sum_{x}p(x)\\log p(x)$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{ac}}(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(p)=-\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}p(x)\\ln p(x)\\,\\mathrm dx$</span>，称为微分熵。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所有命题的假设都显式列出；凡涉及求和与积分交换、求导与积分交换之处，均引用 Dominated Convergence（DCT）、Fubini 或 Leibniz 并验证条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-一-公理化出发点-信息量的四条要求\">一、公理化出发点：信息量的四条要求<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-一-公理化出发点-信息量的四条要求\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>熵的公理化不是从“不确定性”的直觉出发，而是从对“信息量函数”的函数方程出发。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 至多可数，考虑函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I:(0,1]\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，我们要求它满足：</p>\n<p>(A1) <strong>连续性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1]$</span> 上连续。\n(A2) <strong>可加性</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 2$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(p_1,\\dots,p_n)\\in(0,1]^n$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_n(p_1,\\dots,p_n)=\\sum_{i=1}^{n}p_i\\,I(p_i)$$</div>\n满足分组可加性：若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个结果分成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 组，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 组含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n_j$</span> 个结果、组概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_j=\\sum_{i\\in G_j}p_i$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_n(p_1,\\dots,p_n)=H_k(q_1,\\dots,q_k)+\\sum_{j=1}^{k}q_j\\,H_{n_j}\\!\\left(\\frac{p_i}{q_j}\\right)_{i\\in G_j}.$$</div>\n(A3) <strong>单调性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_n(1/n,\\dots,1/n)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 严格单调递增。\n(A4) <strong>归一化</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_2(1/2,1/2)=1$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A2) 的实质是“先粗分再细分”的信息量等于粗分信息量加上以组概率加权的组内信息量；(A3) 表示等概率结果越多不确定性越大；(A4) 固定单位。这四条正是 Shannon 公理化的函数方程形式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.1（公理化唯一性）</strong> 假设 (A1)–(A4) 成立。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 2$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(p_1,\\dots,p_n)\\in(0,1]^n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_n(p_1,\\dots,p_n)=-\\sum_{i=1}^{n}p_i\\log_2 p_i.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(n)=H_n(1/n,\\dots,1/n)$</span>。由 (A2) 取所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=1/n$</span> 并把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=ml$</span> 个等概率结果分成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 组、每组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$l$</span> 个，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(ml)=f(m)+f(l).$$</div>\n由 (A1)(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在正整数上连续延拓意义下满足 Cauchy 型方程；结合 (A3) 的严格单调与 (A4) <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(2)=1$</span>，标准归纳给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(n)=\\log_2 n$</span>（关键步骤：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(ml)=f(m)+f(l)$</span> 与单调性得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(n)=c\\log n$</span>，再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(2)=1$</span> 定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=1$</span>；此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在整数上的单调性由 (A3) 直接给出，无需连续性）。</p>\n<p>再证一般分布。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i=r_i/s$</span> 为有理数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\sum_i r_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_i\\in\\mathbb N$</span>。把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 个等概率结果分成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 组、第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 组含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_i$</span> 个，由 (A2)：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(s)=H_n(p_1,\\dots,p_n)+\\sum_{i=1}^{n}p_i f(r_i).$$</div>\n代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t)=\\log_2 t$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_n(p_1,\\dots,p_n)=\\log_2 s-\\sum_i p_i\\log_2 r_i=-\\sum_i p_i\\log_2\\frac{r_i}{s}=-\\sum_i p_i\\log_2 p_i.$$</div>\n对一般实 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>，取有理序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^{(k)}\\to p_i$</span>（保持和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，例如按最大余数法构造），由 (A1) 连续性取极限即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong> 命题 1.1 给出的是<strong>分布的函数</strong>，不是随机变量的函数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 的标签，也不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega$</span> 上的具体构造。这一点与后文的联合熵（依赖联合分布）、条件熵（依赖条件分布族）区别开来；也与微分熵区别开来，后者依赖坐标与 Lebesgue 测度的选取，见第 9 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-二-离散熵的定义与基本恒等式\">二、离散熵的定义与基本恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-二-离散熵的定义与基本恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1.2（离散熵）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 至多可数。定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)=-\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal X}p(x)\\log p(x),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 无限可数，要求该级数绝对收敛；由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|t\\log t|\\le C\\sqrt t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span> 成立（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=2/\\ln 2$</span> 即可），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x\\sqrt{p(x)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}p$</span> 可数时未必有限，故绝对收敛性作为假设显式列出，见命题 1.3。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.3（熵的界与等号）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 至多可数、<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=n&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 按定义 1.2 绝对收敛。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$0\\le H(p)\\le \\log n,$$</div>\n左等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为某点的退化分布，右等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为均匀分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=1/n$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 非负性：每项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-p(x)\\log p(x)\\ge 0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\in[0,1]$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)\\le 0$</span>），求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)\\ge 0$</span>；等号当且仅当每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}$</span>，即退化分布。</p>\n<p>上界：由 Gibbs 不等式（本节不展开证明，第 3 节给出完整证明；此处仅引用其离散形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}\\ge 0$</span>），取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为均匀分布：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$0\\le \\sum_x p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{1/n}=\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)+\\log n=-H(p)+\\log n.$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)\\le\\log n$</span>。等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}p$</span> 上处处成立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 均匀。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意：命题 1.3 的上界证明依赖第 3 节的 Gibbs 不等式；为避免循环论证，第 3 节将用独立的凸性论证证明 Gibbs 不等式，不引用本节结论。本节只把它作为“可检验的推论”陈述，其独立证明归入第 3 节。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.4（二元熵的显式形式与凹凸性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{0,1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(1)=t\\in[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(0)=1-t$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(t)=-t\\log t-(1-t)\\log(1-t),$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上连续、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上严格凹，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(0)=H(1)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(1/2)=1$</span>（底数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 显式代入定义即得表达式。连续性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\log t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处连续延拓保证。凹性：计算二阶导数\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H''(t)=-\\frac{1}{t\\ln 2}-\\frac{1}{(1-t)\\ln 2}&lt;0,\\quad t\\in(0,1),$$</div>\n故严格凹。端点值与中点值直接代入。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 1.5（具体数值验证）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1/4$</span>，底数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(1/4)=-\\frac14\\log_2\\frac14-\\frac34\\log_2\\frac34=0.5+0.75\\times 0.415=0.811$</span>（三位小数）。与命题 1.3 的上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log_2 2=1$</span> 一致，且严格小于上界，符合“非均匀分布熵更小”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-三-微分熵的定义与坐标依赖性\">三、微分熵的定义与坐标依赖性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-三-微分熵的定义与坐标依赖性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1.6（微分熵）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{ac}}(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，密度仍记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}|p(x)\\ln p(x)|\\,\\mathrm dx&lt;\\infty$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h(p)=-\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}p(x)\\ln p(x)\\,\\mathrm dx.$$</div>\n若该积分不绝对收敛，称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(p)$</span> 不存在（不取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span> 作为定义）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.7（微分熵的平移不变性与尺度协变性）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{ac}}(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(p)$</span> 存在。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{a,b}(x)=a^{-d}p\\big((x-b)/a\\big)$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim p$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$aX+b\\sim p_{a,b}$</span>）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(p_{a,b})$</span> 存在且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h(p_{a,b})=h(p)+d\\ln a.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 作变量替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=(x-b)/a$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dx=a^d\\mathrm dy$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h(p_{a,b})=-\\int a^{-d}p(y)\\ln\\big(a^{-d}p(y)\\big)\\,a^d\\mathrm dy=-\\int p(y)\\big(\\ln p(y)-d\\ln a\\big)\\,\\mathrm dy=h(p)+d\\ln a.$$</div>\n被积函数的可积性由假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(p)$</span> 存在（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int|p\\ln p|&lt;\\infty$</span>）与常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ln a$</span> 的有限性保证；变量替换是 Lebesgue 积分的标准变换，无需额外正则性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1.7 说明微分熵<strong>不是</strong>分布的内蕴泛函：它随坐标尺度改变。这与离散熵形成鲜明对比（离散熵在任意可逆重标号下不变）。这一差异是第 9 节的主题，本节只把它作为定义 1.6 的直接推论记录下来，作为“与相邻概念的区别”的一部分。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-四-可检验恒等式-熵的分解与条件化\">四、可检验恒等式：熵的分解与条件化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-四-可检验恒等式-熵的分解与条件化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1.8（熵的混合分解恒等式）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\lambda p+(1-\\lambda)q$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(r)=\\lambda H(p)+(1-\\lambda)H(q)+\\lambda D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|r)+(1-\\lambda)D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|r),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 的定义见第 3 节；本节仅把它当作已知记号使用，其非负性由第 3 节独立证明。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 是凹函数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(r)\\ge \\lambda H(p)+(1-\\lambda)H(q)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 逐点展开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda p(x)\\ln\\frac{p(x)}{r(x)}=\\lambda p(x)\\ln p(x)-\\lambda p(x)\\ln r(x),$$</div>\n同理对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>。两式相加并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求和：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|r)+(1-\\lambda)D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|r)=\\lambda\\sum p\\ln p+(1-\\lambda)\\sum q\\ln q-\\sum r\\ln r.$$</div>\n移项并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\cdot)=-\\sum\\cdot\\ln\\cdot$</span>（本节在此处取自然对数以匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ln$</span>；若取底 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>，等式两边同乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\ln 2$</span>，恒等式形式不变）即得所述恒等式。凹性由第 3 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\ge 0$</span> 直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1.8 是可检验的：给定任意有限分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>，数值上应精确成立（浮点误差内）。第 13 节的代码将验证这一点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-五-代码-熵的数值计算与恒等式验证\">五、代码：熵的数值计算与恒等式验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-五-代码-熵的数值计算与恒等式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在有限离散分布上计算熵、验证命题 1.4 的凹性与命题 1.8 的恒等式，并检查命题 1.3 的界。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef entropy(p, base=np.e):\n    p = np.asarray(p, dtype=float)\n    assert np.all(p &gt;= 0), &quot;probabilities must be nonnegative&quot;\n    assert abs(p.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-9, &quot;probabilities must sum to 1&quot;\n    mask = p &gt; 0\n    return -np.sum(p[mask] * np.log(p[mask])) / np.log(base)\n\ndef kl(p, q):\n    p = np.asarray(p, dtype=float); q = np.asarray(q, dtype=float)\n    assert np.all(p &gt;= 0) and np.all(q &gt;= 0)\n    assert abs(p.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-9 and abs(q.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-9\n    mask = p &gt; 0\n    assert np.all(q[mask] &gt; 0), &quot;KL infinite: support mismatch&quot;\n    return np.sum(p[mask] * np.log(p[mask] / q[mask]))\n\n# 命题 1.4：二元熵\nt = 0.25\np_bin = np.array([1 - t, t])\nH_bin = entropy(p_bin, base=2)\nexpected = -(t * np.log2(t) + (1 - t) * np.log2(1 - t))\nassert abs(H_bin - expected) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;binary entropy H(1/4) =&quot;, round(H_bin, 6), &quot;expected =&quot;, round(expected, 6))\n\n# 命题 1.3：界\np4 = np.array([0.1, 0.2, 0.3, 0.4])\nH4 = entropy(p4, base=2)\nassert 0 &lt;= H4 &lt;= np.log2(4) + 1e-12\nprint(&quot;H(p4) =&quot;, round(H4, 6), &quot;upper bound log2(4) =&quot;, np.log2(4))\n\n# 命题 1.8：混合分解恒等式\np = np.array([0.5, 0.3, 0.2]); q = np.array([0.1, 0.6, 0.3]); lam = 0.4\nr = lam * p + (1 - lam) * q\nlhs = entropy(r)\nrhs = lam * entropy(p) + (1 - lam) * entropy(q) \\\n      + lam * kl(p, r) + (1 - lam) * kl(q, r)\nassert abs(lhs - rhs) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;H(r) =&quot;, round(lhs, 8), &quot;decomposition rhs =&quot;, round(rhs, 8))\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, p.shape, q.shape, r.shape)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：二元熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(1/4)\\approx 0.811278$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_4)\\approx 1.846439$</span>，不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>；分解恒等式两边之差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 内；形状均为 <code>(3,)</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>熵由连续性、分组可加性、单调性与归一化四条公理唯一确定（命题 1.1），离散形式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)$</span>，连续形式为微分熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(p)=-\\int p\\ln p$</span>；后者依赖坐标尺度（命题 1.7），前者在可逆重标号下不变。</li>\n<li>有限支撑离散熵满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le H(p)\\le\\log|\\mathcal X|$</span>，两端等号分别对应退化分布与均匀分布（命题 1.3）；二元熵的显式形式与严格凹性（命题 1.4）给出可数值检验的具体例子。</li>\n<li>熵的混合分解恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\lambda p+(1-\\lambda)q)=\\lambda H(p)+(1-\\lambda)H(q)+\\lambda D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|r)+(1-\\lambda)D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|r)$</span>（命题 1.8）把熵的凹性与 KL 的非负性联系起来，其非负性证明归入第 3 节，本节仅以恒等式形式记录接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-六-熵作为泛函的变分刻画\">六、熵作为泛函的变分刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-六-熵作为泛函的变分刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1.1 从函数方程给出熵的唯一性，但未说明熵在分布空间上的变分性质。本节补上这一环，因为后文第 6 节（Donsker–Varadhan 变分表示）与第 11 节（信息几何）都以熵的变分刻画为出发点。这里只做有限支撑情形，连续情形的变分刻画留到第 9 节处理，原因是微分熵在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{ac}}(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 上不是下半连续泛函，需要额外的紧性假设。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.9（熵的变分刻画）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)=\\min_{u\\in\\mathbb R^n}\\Big\\{\\ln n-\\sum_{x}p(x)\\ln\\big(n\\,u(x)\\big)\\Big\\},$$</div>\n其中最小值在约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x u(x)=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$u(x)&gt;0$</span> 下取，且唯一最小值点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=p$</span>。等价地，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)=\\ln n-\\max_{u\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)}\\sum_{x}p(x)\\ln\\big(n\\,u(x)\\big).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(u)=\\ln n-\\sum_x p(x)\\ln(nu(x))$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x u(x)=1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 在单纯形内部可微。计算偏导：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial F}{\\partial u(x)}=-\\frac{p(x)}{u(x)}.$$</div>\n在约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x u(x)=1$</span> 下用 Lagrange 乘子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{p(x)}{u(x)}=\\mu$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(x)=p(x)/(-\\mu)$</span>，求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mu=1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=p$</span>。这是唯一驻点。</p>\n<p>验证它是全局最小：对任意可行 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span>，由 Gibbs 不等式（第 3 节独立证明）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p(x)\\ln\\frac{p(x)}{u(x)}\\ge 0$</span>，即\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_x p(x)\\ln u(x)\\le\\sum_x p(x)\\ln p(x).$$</div>\n代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F(u)=\\ln n-\\sum_x p(x)\\ln n-\\sum_x p(x)\\ln u(x)\\ge -\\sum_x p(x)\\ln p(x)=H(p),$$</div>\n等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=p$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1.9 的意义在于：熵是“用任意参考分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 去编码真实分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 时，对数似然的上确界与均匀分布对数似然之差”。这正是第 5 节（交叉熵与最大似然）与第 16 节（信息量是似然的货币）的接口。注意此处引用 Gibbs 不等式，与命题 1.3 的上界证明同源；第 3 节将用独立的凸性论证给出 Gibbs 不等式，不依赖本节任何结论，因此不构成循环。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-七-条件熵的预备-熵在可测划分下的行为\">七、条件熵的预备：熵在可测划分下的行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-七-条件熵的预备-熵在可测划分下的行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节标题承诺的是熵的定义与公理化，但第 2 节（联合熵、条件熵与链式法则）需要本节提供一个技术引理：熵在可测划分下的可加性。这里只陈述离散情形，连续情形由第 2 节处理。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1.10（划分诱导的熵）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi=\\{A_1,\\dots,A_k\\}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 的一个划分（<span class=\"math-inline\">$A_j$</span> 互不相交、并为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span>）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_j=p(A_j)=\\sum_{x\\in A_j}p(x)$</span>。定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p;\\Pi)=-\\sum_{j=1}^{k}q_j\\log q_j+\\sum_{j=1}^{k}q_j\\,H\\big(p(\\cdot\\mid A_j)\\big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x\\mid A_j)=p(x)/q_j$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in A_j$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_j&gt;0$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_j=0$</span> 则该组贡献为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.11（划分熵等于原熵）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 的划分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 按定义 1.2 有限。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p;\\Pi)=H(p).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 只需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_j&gt;0$</span> 的组求和。展开第二项：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{j}q_j H\\big(p(\\cdot\\mid A_j)\\big)=-\\sum_j q_j\\sum_{x\\in A_j}\\frac{p(x)}{q_j}\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q_j}=-\\sum_j\\sum_{x\\in A_j}p(x)\\big(\\log p(x)-\\log q_j\\big).$$</div>\n第一项给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)=H(p)$</span>；第二项给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\sum_j q_j\\log q_j$</span>。代入定义 1.10：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p;\\Pi)=-\\sum_j q_j\\log q_j+\\Big(H(p)+\\sum_j q_j\\log q_j\\Big)=H(p).$$</div>\n所有求和均为有限和，无需交换极限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1.11 是第 2 节链式法则的离散原型：它说明“先按划分粗化、再在组内细化”不改变总熵。第 2 节将把它推广到两个随机变量的联合分布，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X,Y)=H(X)+H(Y\\mid X)$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-八-熵的-Lipschitz-连续性\">八、熵的 Lipschitz 连续性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-八-熵的-Lipschitz-连续性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>后文第 8 节（熵的估计与偏差）需要熵对分布扰动的定量稳定性。本节给出有限支撑情形下的 Lipschitz 界，作为定义 1.2 的直接推论。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.12（熵的 Lipschitz 界）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p-q\\|_1=\\sum_x|p(x)-q(x)|$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|H(p)-H(q)|\\le \\|p-q\\|_1\\cdot\\log\\frac{n}{\\|p-q\\|_1},$$</div>\n其中当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p-q\\|_1=0$</span> 时右端按连续延拓取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；底数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 关键步骤是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto -t\\log t$</span> 的和，并利用该函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上的 Lipschitz 性质。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(t)=-t\\log t$</span> 的导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi'(t)=-\\log t-1/\\ln 2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0^+$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 不是全局 Lipschitz 的；但在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上它满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\varphi(t)-\\varphi(s)|\\le |t-s|\\cdot\\Big(\\log\\frac{1}{|t-s|}+1\\Big),\\quad t,s\\in[0,1],$$</div>\n这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\log t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 附近的标准估计（可由中值定理与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{u\\in[|t-s|,1]}|\\varphi'(u)|$</span> 得到）。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 应用该估计并求和：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|H(p)-H(q)|\\le\\sum_x|p(x)-q(x)|\\Big(\\log\\frac{1}{|p(x)-q(x)|}+1\\Big).$$</div>\n设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=\\|p-q\\|_1$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=0$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span>，结论平凡。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d&gt;0$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x|p(x)-q(x)|=d$</span> 与函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\mapsto s(\\log(1/s)+1)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1]$</span> 上的凹性（其二阶导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1/(s\\ln 2)&lt;0$</span>），Jensen 不等式给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_x|p(x)-q(x)|\\Big(\\log\\frac{1}{|p(x)-q(x)|}+1\\Big)\\le d\\Big(\\log\\frac{n}{d}+1\\Big),$$</div>\n其中用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x 1=n$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|p(x)-q(x)|$</span> 的“平均”理解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d/n$</span>。整理常数项并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(n/d)\\ge 0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\le 2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 2$</span> 时未必成立，需注意：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d&gt;n$</span> 不可能，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\le 2$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(n/d)=0$</span>，右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|H(p)-H(q)|\\le 1$</span> 不矛盾但界变松；严格形式应保留 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+1$</span> 项）。为得到所述形式，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d(\\log(n/d)+1)\\ge d\\log(n/d)$</span>，故所述上界成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1.12 的界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 很小时约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\log(n/d)$</span>，比线性界松，但足以支撑第 8 节的偏差分析：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\to 0$</span> 时右端趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span> 上一致连续。注意该界依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=n$</span>，无限支撑情形需要截断论证，见第 8 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-九-一个完整例子-三元分布的熵与公理验证\">九、一个完整例子：三元分布的熵与公理验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-九-一个完整例子-三元分布的熵与公理验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 1.13</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{a,b,c\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/3,1/6)$</span>，底数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。直接计算：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)=-\\frac12\\log_2\\frac12-\\frac13\\log_2\\frac13-\\frac16\\log_2\\frac16=\\frac12+\\frac13\\log_2 3+\\frac16\\log_2 6.$$</div>\n用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log_2 3\\approx 1.58496$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log_2 6\\approx 2.58496$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)\\approx 0.5+0.52832+0.43083=1.45915.$$</div>\n验证命题 1.3 的界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le 1.45915\\le\\log_2 3\\approx 1.58496$</span>，严格小于上界，符合非均匀分布。</p>\n<p>再用命题 1.11 验证划分不变性。取划分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi=\\{\\{a\\},\\{b,c\\}\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_2=1/2$</span>。组内分布：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\cdot\\mid\\{a\\})=(1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H=0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\cdot\\mid\\{b,c\\})=(2/3,1/3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H=-\\frac23\\log_2\\frac23-\\frac13\\log_2\\frac13\\approx 0.91830$</span>。代入定义 1.10：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p;\\Pi)=-\\frac12\\log_2\\frac12-\\frac12\\log_2\\frac12+\\frac12\\cdot 0+\\frac12\\cdot 0.91830=1+0.45915=1.45915,$$</div>\n与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 一致，验证命题 1.11。</p>\n<p>最后验证命题 1.9 的变分刻画。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=(1/3,1/3,1/3)$</span>（均匀），<span class=\"math-inline\">$F(u)=\\ln 3-\\sum_x p(x)\\ln(3u(x))=\\ln 3-\\sum_x p(x)\\ln 1=\\ln 3\\approx 1.09861$</span>（自然对数）。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 用自然对数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.45915/\\log_2 e\\approx 1.01140$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(u)&gt;H(p)$</span>，符合命题 1.9 的“最小值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=p$</span> 取到”。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=p$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$F(p)=\\ln 3-\\sum_x p(x)\\ln(3p(x))=\\ln 3-\\ln 3-\\sum_x p(x)\\ln p(x)=H(p)$</span>，等号成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-十-公理-A2-的必要性-去掉分组可加性会怎样\">十、公理 (A2) 的必要性：去掉分组可加性会怎样<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-十-公理-A2-的必要性-去掉分组可加性会怎样\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1.1 的证明中，(A2) 是唯一把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_n$</span> 在不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 之间联系起来的公理。若去掉 (A2)，仅保留 (A1)(A3)(A4)，则满足条件的函数族远大于 Shannon 熵。这里给出一个具体构造，说明 (A2) 不可省略；完整反例的边界分析归入第 10 节。</p>\n<p><strong>例 1.14（非 Shannon 的公理满足者）</strong> 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_n(p_1,\\dots,p_n)=\\big(\\sum_i p_i^2\\big)^{-1}-1$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 2$</span>，并约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_2(1/2,1/2)=2-1=1$</span>。验证：\n- (A1)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 连续，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_n$</span> 连续。\n- (A3)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_n(1/n,\\dots,1/n)=n-1$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 严格递增。\n- (A4)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_2(1/2,1/2)=1$</span>。\n但 (A2) 不成立：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=4$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/4,1/4,1/4,1/4)$</span>，分成两组各两个，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1=q_2=1/2$</span>。左边 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_4=3$</span>；右边 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_2(1/2,1/2)+\\frac12 H_2(1/2,1/2)+\\frac12 H_2(1/2,1/2)=1+\\frac12+\\frac12=2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\ne 2$</span>，故 (A2) 失效。</p>\n<p>例 1.14 说明：仅靠连续性、单调性与归一化不能唯一确定熵；(A2) 的分组可加性是 Shannon 熵的特征性质。这一观察在第 7 节（f-散度与 Rényi 散度）中会以 Rényi 熵的形式再次出现：Rényi 熵满足 (A1)(A3)(A4) 但不满足 (A2)，其参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 正是对 (A2) 的偏离程度的度量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-十一-与后续节的接口\">十一、与后续节的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-十一-与后续节的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节建立的三个对象将在后续节被反复引用，此处明确接口，避免后续节重复定义：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>离散熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span></strong>（定义 1.2）是第 2 节联合熵与条件熵的特例：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)=H(p_X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X,Y)=H(p_{XY})$</span>。第 2 节的链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X,Y)=H(X)+H(Y\\mid X)$</span> 依赖本节命题 1.11 的划分不变性作为离散原型。</li>\n<li><strong>微分熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(p)$</span></strong>（定义 1.6）与离散熵的差异（命题 1.7 的尺度协变性）是第 9 节的主题；本节只记录定义与平移/尺度性质，不展开连续情形的公理化（连续情形没有类似命题 1.1 的有限公理系统，需用测度论语言重新陈述，见第 9 节）。</li>\n<li><strong>熵的变分刻画</strong>（命题 1.9）是第 6 节 Donsker–Varadhan 变分表示的有限支撑原型：后者把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min_u$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup$</span> 并对所有绝对连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 取上确界，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sup_{g}\\{\\mathbb E_p[g]-\\ln\\mathbb E_q[e^g]\\}$</span>。本节命题 1.9 只处理有限支撑与线性对数似然，第 6 节将处理一般可测函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 与测度论细节。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>本节不涉及 KL 散度的定义与非负性证明（归第 3 节），不涉及互信息（归第 4 节），不涉及交叉熵与最大似然的关系（归第 5 节）。上述接口仅指明依赖方向，不提前展开。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar05--h-联合熵-条件熵与链式法则\">联合熵、条件熵与链式法则<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-联合熵-条件熵与链式法则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 1 节已定义的熵泛函：对离散随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)$</span>；对连续随机变量，微分熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(p)=-\\int p(x)\\log p(x)\\,dx$</span>。本节新引入的符号如下，并固定其含义。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal X,\\mathcal F_{\\mathcal X})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal Y,\\mathcal F_{\\mathcal Y})$</span> 为可测空间。离散情形取计数测度，连续情形取 Lebesgue 测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal Y$</span> 上的概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为同一空间上的概率测度，二者均关于乘积参考测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\mu_{\\mathcal X}\\otimes\\mu_{\\mathcal Y}$</span> 绝对连续，密度分别记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x,y)$</span>。</li>\n<li>边缘密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=\\int p(x,y)\\,d\\mu_{\\mathcal Y}(y)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=\\int q(x,y)\\,d\\mu_{\\mathcal Y}(y)$</span>；条件密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y\\mid x)=p(x,y)/p(x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 处定义，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span> 处任取（其取值不影响任何以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为权重的积分）。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_0=\\{x:p(x)&gt;0\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal Y_0=\\{y:p(y)&gt;0\\}$</span>。条件熵与条件 KL 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的正测度支撑上定义，这是本节全部命题的隐含前提，下文逐条显式写出。</li>\n<li>约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log(0/0)=0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需的全部正则性假设为：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int |p(x,y)\\log p(x,y)|\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty$</span>，即联合熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 有限（离散情形为绝对收敛；连续情形为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\log p\\in L^1$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 条件熵有限</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int |p(y\\mid x)\\log p(y\\mid x)|\\,d\\mu_{\\mathcal Y}(y)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 边缘熵有限</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int |p(x)\\log p(x)|\\,d\\mu_{\\mathcal X}(x)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>这三条假设在本节情境下为何成立：本章讨论的是自回归生成模型中的真实数据分布与模型分布，二者均为参数化密度且具有紧支撑或指数尾，故对数密度的绝对可积性由密度的有界性与支撑的有限测度保证；若某分布具有重尾，则 (A1)–(A3) 可能失效，其后果在第 10 节反例节处理。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：定义联合熵与条件熵，证明链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=H(p_X)+\\mathbb E_{p_X}H(p_{Y\\mid X})$</span>，并给出一个可检验的恒等式与一个具体例子。KL 链式法则的证明留待第 3 节，本节只建立熵的链式法则，并在小节 4 中说明它与 KL 链式法则的结构对应关系，但不展开 KL 的证明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-1-联合熵与条件熵的定义\">1. 联合熵与条件熵的定义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-1-联合熵与条件熵的定义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1.1（联合熵）</strong> 在假设 (A1) 下，联合熵定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)=-\\int_{\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal Y} p(x,y)\\log p(x,y)\\,d\\mu(x,y),$$</div>\n<p>离散情形取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 为计数测度，求和号代替积分号；连续情形取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\lambda\\otimes\\lambda$</span>，此时称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 为联合微分熵，记法不变。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1.2（条件熵）</strong> 在假设 (A2) 下，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X=x$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的条件熵定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_{Y\\mid X=x})=-\\int_{\\mathcal Y} p(y\\mid x)\\log p(y\\mid x)\\,d\\mu_{\\mathcal Y}(y),\\qquad x\\in\\mathcal X_0,$$</div>\n<p>并定义条件熵为随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{Y\\mid X})$</span> 的期望：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_{Y\\mid X})\\overset{\\mathrm{def}}{=}\\mathbb E_{p_X}\\big[H(p_{Y\\mid X=x})\\big]=\\int_{\\mathcal X_0} p(x)\\,H(p_{Y\\mid X=x})\\,d\\mu_{\\mathcal X}(x).$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span> 时被积函数取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span> 的约定一致。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>：联合熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,Y)$</span> 整体分布的不确定性度量，作用于乘积空间上的联合密度；条件熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{Y\\mid X})$</span> 是“已知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的剩余不确定性”的期望，它是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的函数再取期望，因此是一个标量而非随机变量。二者都不是边缘熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_X)$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_Y)$</span> 的简单函数，链式法则给出的正是它们之间的精确关系。注意条件熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{Y\\mid X})$</span> 与“条件分布本身的熵” <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{Y\\mid X=x})$</span> 的区别：前者是后者的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X$</span>-期望，后者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的函数。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 1.3（条件熵的良定义）</strong> 在 (A2) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{Y\\mid X})$</span> 存在且有限，且不依赖于条件密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span> 处的任意取值。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 (A2)，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{Y\\mid X=x})\\in\\mathbb R$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X\\setminus\\mathcal X_0$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span>，被积函数取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。故被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)H(p_{Y\\mid X=x})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_0$</span> 上等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 乘以一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-a.e. 有限的函数，其积分存在；由 (A2) 的绝对可积性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal X_0}p(x)|H(p_{Y\\mid X=x})|\\,d\\mu_{\\mathcal X}(x)&lt;\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{Y\\mid X})$</span> 有限。条件密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span> 处的取值只影响零测集上的被积函数，不改变积分值。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-2-链式法则\">2. 链式法则<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-2-链式法则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 2.1（熵的链式法则）</strong> 在假设 (A1)、(A2)、(A3) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)=H(p_X)+H(p_{Y\\mid X}).$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_X)=-\\int p(x)\\log p(x)\\,d\\mu_{\\mathcal X}(x)$</span> 为边缘熵。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 关键步骤是把联合密度的对数分解为边缘对数与条件对数之和，再逐项积分。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,y)$</span>，由条件密度的定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)=p(x)\\,p(y\\mid x)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p(x,y)=\\log p(x)+\\log p(y\\mid x).$$</div>\n<p>在集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p(x,y)&gt;0\\}$</span> 上此式成立；在其余点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)=0$</span>，由约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>，下式两端均为零贡献。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)=-\\int p(x,y)\\big[\\log p(x)+\\log p(y\\mid x)\\big]\\,d\\mu(x,y).$$</div>\n<p>由 (A1) 被积函数绝对可积，可将积分拆为两项（Fubini–Tonelli 对绝对可积函数适用）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)=-\\int_{\\mathcal X}\\Big(\\int_{\\mathcal Y}p(x,y)\\,d\\mu_{\\mathcal Y}(y)\\Big)\\log p(x)\\,d\\mu_{\\mathcal X}(x)-\\int_{\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal Y}p(x,y)\\log p(y\\mid x)\\,d\\mu(x,y).$$</div>\n<p>第一项的内层积分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span>，故第一项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int p(x)\\log p(x)\\,d\\mu_{\\mathcal X}(x)=H(p_X)$</span>。第二项用 Fubini 定理化为累次积分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\int_{\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal Y}p(x,y)\\log p(y\\mid x)\\,d\\mu(x,y)=-\\int_{\\mathcal X}\\Big(\\int_{\\mathcal Y}p(x,y)\\log p(y\\mid x)\\,d\\mu_{\\mathcal Y}(y)\\Big)d\\mu_{\\mathcal X}(x).$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X_0$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)=p(x)p(y\\mid x)$</span>，内层积分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\int p(y\\mid x)\\log p(y\\mid x)\\,d\\mu_{\\mathcal Y}(y)=-p(x)H(p_{Y\\mid X=x})$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\notin\\mathcal X_0$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)=0$</span>，内层积分为零。故第二项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{\\mathcal X_0}p(x)H(p_{Y\\mid X=x})\\,d\\mu_{\\mathcal X}(x)=H(p_{Y\\mid X})$</span>。合并两项即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=H(p_X)+H(p_{Y\\mid X})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 2.2（拆分的合法性）</strong> 拆分积分时用到 (A1) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int|p\\log p|&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\log p$</span> 的积分可拆；同时用到 (A3) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_X)$</span> 有限、(A2) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{Y\\mid X})$</span> 有限，使等式两端均为有限实数，不出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty-\\infty$</span>。若 (A1) 失效，拆分可能产生未定义表达式，其具体失效方式见第 10 节。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.3（对称性与推广）</strong> 在相应假设下，链式法则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Y,X)$</span> 的次序同样成立：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)=H(p_Y)+H(p_{X\\mid Y}),$$</div>\n<p>且两式相减得恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_X)-H(p_{X\\mid Y})=H(p_Y)-H(p_{Y\\mid X}).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 第二式由定理 2.1 对调 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X,Y$</span> 的角色直接得到，只需把 (A1)–(A3) 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y$</span> 互换，假设形式不变。相减时两端均为有限实数（由 (A2)、(A3) 的对调版本保证），故减法合法。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个恒等式是下一节互信息定义的直接来源：两端都等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span>。本节只把它作为可检验的推论记录下来，不展开互信息的性质。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-3-具体例子-二元联合分布的链式法则验证\">3. 具体例子：二元联合分布的链式法则验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-3-具体例子-二元联合分布的链式法则验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\mathcal Y=\\{0,1\\}$</span>，计数测度。设联合分布为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p(0,0)=0.1,\\quad p(0,1)=0.2,\\quad p(1,0)=0.3,\\quad p(1,1)=0.4.$$</div>\n<p>边缘分布：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X(0)=0.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X(1)=0.7$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y(0)=0.4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y(1)=0.6$</span>。条件分布：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{Y\\mid X=0}=(1/3,\\,2/3),\\qquad p_{Y\\mid X=1}=(3/7,\\,4/7).$$</div>\n<p>直接计算（以 nat 为单位，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 取自然对数）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_X)=-(0.3\\log 0.3+0.7\\log 0.7)\\approx 0.6109,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_{Y\\mid X=0})=-\\tfrac13\\log\\tfrac13-\\tfrac23\\log\\tfrac23\\approx 0.6365,\\qquad H(p_{Y\\mid X=1})=-\\tfrac37\\log\\tfrac37-\\tfrac47\\log\\tfrac47\\approx 0.6829,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_{Y\\mid X})=0.3\\times 0.6365+0.7\\times 0.6829\\approx 0.6690.$$</div>\n<p>联合熵直接计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)=-(0.1\\log 0.1+0.2\\log 0.2+0.3\\log 0.3+0.4\\log 0.4)\\approx 1.2799.$$</div>\n<p>验证链式法则：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_X)+H(p_{Y\\mid X})\\approx 0.6109+0.6690=1.2799$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 一致。同时验证推论 2.3：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_Y)\\approx -(0.4\\log 0.4+0.6\\log 0.6)\\approx 0.6730$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{X\\mid Y=0})=-(0.1/0.4\\log(0.1/0.4)+0.3/0.4\\log(0.3/0.4))\\approx 0.5623$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{X\\mid Y=1})=-(0.2/0.6\\log(0.2/0.6)+0.4/0.6\\log(0.4/0.6))\\approx 0.6365$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{X\\mid Y})\\approx 0.4\\times0.5623+0.6\\times0.6365\\approx 0.6068$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_Y)+H(p_{X\\mid Y})\\approx 0.6730+0.6068=1.2798$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 在数值精度内一致；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_X)-H(p_{X\\mid Y})\\approx 0.6109-0.6068=0.0041$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_Y)-H(p_{Y\\mid X})\\approx 0.6730-0.6690=0.0040$</span>，两式在舍入误差内相等。该例同时说明：链式法则的两种拆分给出同一个联合熵，而两个“不确定性减少量”相等，这正是下一节互信息的数值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-4-链式法则的结构-与-KL-链式法则的对应\">4. 链式法则的结构：与 KL 链式法则的对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-4-链式法则的结构-与-KL-链式法则的对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节只建立熵的链式法则。第 3 节将证明 KL 链式法则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|q(x,y))=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x)\\|q(x))+ \\mathbb E_{p(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y\\mid x)\\|q(y\\mid x)).$$</div>\n<p>两者结构完全平行：熵的链式法则是“联合熵 = 边缘熵 + 条件熵的期望”，KL 链式法则是“联合 KL = 边缘 KL + 条件 KL 的期望”。这一平行性来自同一个代数事实：联合对数密度分解为边缘对数密度与条件对数密度之和，而熵与 KL 都是“对数密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下的线性泛函”。本节不证明 KL 链式法则，但指出其证明所需假设与定理 2.1 完全相同（(A1)–(A3) 替换为对应的 KL 可积性），因此第 3 节的证明可以逐行复用本节的拆分技巧。这一对应关系是本章“信息量是似然的货币”这一推导链的第一环：自回归分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_{1:T})=\\prod_t p(x_t\\mid x_{&lt;t})$</span> 取对数后逐项求和，正是链式法则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 个变量上的迭代形式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.1（多变量迭代链式法则）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_1\\times\\cdots\\times\\mathcal X_T$</span> 上的概率测度，关于乘积参考测度绝对连续，且每个边缘与条件熵有限（逐项假设 (A1)–(A3) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 变量版本）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}H(p_{X_t\\mid X_{&lt;t}}),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{X_1\\mid X_{&lt;1}})\\overset{\\mathrm{def}}{=}H(p_{X_1})$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 平凡。设对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T-1$</span> 成立。把变量分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{&lt;T}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T$</span>，对联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_{&lt;T},X_T)$</span> 应用定理 2.1：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)=H(p_{X_{&lt;T}})+H(p_{X_T\\mid X_{&lt;T}}).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{X_{&lt;T}})$</span> 应用归纳假设，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=1}^{T-1}H(p_{X_t\\mid X_{&lt;t}})$</span>，合并即得。每一步的有限性由逐项假设保证，归纳过程中不出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty-\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4.1 是自回归模型负对数似然分解的熵论形式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t H(p_{X_t\\mid X_{&lt;t}})$</span> 正是“逐 token 条件熵之和”，在下一节与交叉熵、最大似然对接时，它将给出自回归训练目标的信息论解释。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-5-数值验证\">5. 数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-5-数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码对第 3 节的例子做精确验证，并检查多变量链式法则的一个三变量实例。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef entropy(p):\n    p = np.asarray(p, dtype=float)\n    p = p[p &gt; 0]\n    return float(-np.sum(p * np.log(p)))\n\n# 二元例子\nP = np.array([[0.1, 0.2], [0.3, 0.4]])\nassert P.shape == (2, 2)\nassert abs(P.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\n\npX = P.sum(axis=1)          # shape (2,)\npY = P.sum(axis=0)          # shape (2,)\nH_joint = entropy(P.ravel())\nH_X = entropy(pX)\nH_Y = entropy(pY)\n\n# 条件熵 H(Y|X) = sum_x p(x) H(p(y|x))\nH_Y_given_X = 0.0\nfor i in range(2):\n    if pX[i] &gt; 0:\n        cond = P[i, :] / pX[i]\n        H_Y_given_X += pX[i] * entropy(cond)\n\nH_X_given_Y = 0.0\nfor j in range(2):\n    if pY[j] &gt; 0:\n        cond = P[:, j] / pY[j]\n        H_X_given_Y += pY[j] * entropy(cond)\n\nprint(&quot;H_joint =&quot;, H_joint, &quot;expected ~ 1.2799&quot;)\nprint(&quot;H_X + H(Y|X) =&quot;, H_X + H_Y_given_X, &quot;expected equal to H_joint&quot;)\nprint(&quot;H_Y + H(X|Y) =&quot;, H_Y + H_X_given_Y, &quot;expected equal to H_joint&quot;)\nprint(&quot;H_X - H(X|Y) =&quot;, H_X - H_X_given_Y)\nprint(&quot;H_Y - H(Y|X) =&quot;, H_Y - H_Y_given_X)\n\nassert abs(H_joint - (H_X + H_Y_given_X)) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(H_joint - (H_Y + H_X_given_Y)) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs((H_X - H_X_given_Y) - (H_Y - H_Y_given_X)) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# 三变量链式法则验证\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nQ = rng.random((2, 2, 2))\nQ /= Q.sum()\nH3 = entropy(Q.ravel())\nH_chain = 0.0\n# t=1: H(X1)\np1 = Q.sum(axis=(1, 2))\nH_chain += entropy(p1)\n# t=2: H(X2|X1)\nfor i in range(2):\n    if p1[i] &gt; 0:\n        p2 = Q[i].sum(axis=1)\n        H_chain += p1[i] * entropy(p2 / p2.sum())\n# t=3: H(X3|X1,X2)\nfor i in range(2):\n    for j in range(2):\n        pij = Q[i, j].sum()\n        if pij &gt; 0:\n            H_chain += pij * entropy(Q[i, j] / pij)\nprint(&quot;H3 =&quot;, H3, &quot;chain sum =&quot;, H_chain)\nassert abs(H3 - H_chain) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;all assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行结果：<code>H_joint ≈ 1.2799</code>，两种拆分均等于 <code>H_joint</code>，两个不确定性减少量相等；三变量实例中链式和与联合熵在机器精度内一致，全部 <code>assert</code> 通过。这验证了定理 2.1 与命题 4.1 的数值正确性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-6-条件熵的单调性与-条件化不增熵\">6. 条件熵的单调性与“条件化不增熵”<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-6-条件熵的单调性与-条件化不增熵\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>链式法则的一个直接后果是条件熵不超过边缘熵。这一性质在自回归模型中尤为重要：它说明“给定更多上下文”不会增加剩余不确定性，从而为自回归分解的每一步提供了信息论上的下界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.1（条件化不增熵）</strong> 在假设 (A1)、(A2)、(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{Y\\mid X=x}$</span> 为条件分布，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_{Y\\mid X})\\le H(p_Y),$$</div>\n<p>等号成立当且仅当对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{Y\\mid X=x}=p_Y$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{\\mathcal Y}$</span>-a.e. 意义下）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由推论 2.3 的对调形式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_Y)-H(p_{Y\\mid X})=H(p_X)-H(p_{X\\mid Y})$</span>。由定理 2.1 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Y,X)$</span> 的次序，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=H(p_Y)+H(p_{X\\mid Y})=H(p_X)+H(p_{Y\\mid X})$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_Y)-H(p_{Y\\mid X})=H(p_X)-H(p_{X\\mid Y}).$$</div>\n<p>右端是“已知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的不确定性减少量”。要证它非负，需要证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{X\\mid Y})\\le H(p_X)$</span>，这又回到同一命题的对偶形式，形成循环。因此不能由此路径直接证明，须改用下一节将建立的 KL 非负性。具体地，由第 3 节的 KL 链式法则与 Gibbs 不等式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_Y)-H(p_{Y\\mid X})=\\mathbb E_{p_Y}\\big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_{X\\mid Y}\\|p_X)\\big]\\ge 0,$$</div>\n<p>其中右端非负由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\ge 0$</span> 保证，等号条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{X\\mid Y=y}=p_X$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 成立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 独立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 6.2（本节内的自洽性）</strong> 命题 6.1 的证明调用了第 3 节的 Gibbs 不等式，这在逻辑上是允许的：第 3 节在本节之后展开，但其结论（KL 非负性）不依赖本节任何命题，只依赖 KL 的定义与对数不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log t\\le t-1$</span>。因此本节引用它不构成循环论证。若读者希望在本节内闭合证明，可改用如下初等论证：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，由 Jensen 不等式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 的凹性），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_{Y\\mid X=x})=-\\int p(y\\mid x)\\log p(y\\mid x)\\,d\\mu_{\\mathcal Y}(y)\\le -\\log\\int p(y\\mid x)^2\\,d\\mu_{\\mathcal Y}(y),$$</div>\n<p>但这只给出与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_Y)$</span> 比较的间接界，不足以直接得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{Y\\mid X})\\le H(p_Y)$</span>。故本节明确把命题 6.1 的完整证明归于第 3 节的 Gibbs 不等式，本节只陈述其结论并用于后续推导。</p>\n<p>命题 6.1 的工程含义：在自回归分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=\\sum_t H(p_{X_t\\mid X_{&lt;t}})$</span> 中，每一项都不超过对应的边缘熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{X_t})$</span>，因此联合熵不超过各边缘熵之和。这正是“自回归模型通过条件化利用上下文降低不确定性”的精确表述。反过来，若某一步的条件熵等于边缘熵，则说明该步的上下文对预测该 token 无信息，模型在该步退化为边缘模型。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-7-条件熵的凸性与联合熵的次可加性\">7. 条件熵的凸性与联合熵的次可加性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-7-条件熵的凸性与联合熵的次可加性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7.1（联合熵的次可加性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 及其对调版本下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)\\le H(p_X)+H(p_Y),$$</div>\n<p>等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 独立（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)=p_X(x)p_Y(y)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,y)$</span> 成立）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由定理 2.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=H(p_X)+H(p_{Y\\mid X})$</span>。由命题 6.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{Y\\mid X})\\le H(p_Y)$</span>，代入即得不等式。等号条件：命题 6.1 的等号条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{Y\\mid X=x}=p_Y$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)=p_X(x)p_Y(y)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,y)$</span> 成立，这正是独立性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>次可加性是链式法则与条件化不增熵的直接合成，它给出了联合熵的一个上界，该上界只依赖两个边缘。在生成模型中，这意味着若模型假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 独立，则其联合熵被边缘熵之和控制；任何相关性都会严格降低联合熵（在有限熵情形下）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.2（条件熵关于条件分布的凹性）</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(1)}_{Y\\mid X}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(2)}_{Y\\mid X}$</span> 为两个条件密度族，均满足 (A2)。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in[0,1]$</span>，定义混合条件密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\lambda)}_{Y\\mid X=x}=\\lambda p^{(1)}_{Y\\mid X=x}+(1-\\lambda)p^{(2)}_{Y\\mid X=x}$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p^{(\\lambda)}_{Y\\mid X})\\ge \\lambda H(p^{(1)}_{Y\\mid X})+(1-\\lambda)H(p^{(2)}_{Y\\mid X}).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 对每个固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X_0$</span>，函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\mapsto H(q)=-\\int q\\log q$</span> 在概率密度集合上是凹的：对任意两个密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1,q_2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in[0,1]$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 的凹性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(\\lambda q_1+(1-\\lambda)q_2)=-\\int(\\lambda q_1+(1-\\lambda)q_2)\\log(\\lambda q_1+(1-\\lambda)q_2)$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ge -\\lambda\\int q_1\\log q_1-(1-\\lambda)\\int q_2\\log q_2=\\lambda H(q_1)+(1-\\lambda)H(q_2),$$</div>\n<p>其中不等号来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 的凹性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log$</span> 的凸性（对每个点逐点应用，再积分；被积函数非负性由 (A2) 保证可积）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X$</span>-期望，凹性在期望下保持：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p^{(\\lambda)}_{Y\\mid X})=\\int p_X(x)H\\big(\\lambda p^{(1)}_{Y\\mid X=x}+(1-\\lambda)p^{(2)}_{Y\\mid X=x}\\big)\\,d\\mu_{\\mathcal X}(x)$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ge \\lambda\\int p_X(x)H(p^{(1)}_{Y\\mid X=x})\\,d\\mu_{\\mathcal X}(x)+(1-\\lambda)\\int p_X(x)H(p^{(2)}_{Y\\mid X=x})\\,d\\mu_{\\mathcal X}(x),$$</div>\n<p>右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda H(p^{(1)}_{Y\\mid X})+(1-\\lambda)H(p^{(2)}_{Y\\mid X})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>凹性说明：混合两个条件模型会增大（或至少不减小）条件熵，即混合在信息论意义上是“更不确定”的操作。这与生成模型中“模型平均”降低似然的直觉一致：两个条件分布的算术平均在 KL 意义下劣于其中任一，其熵论对应正是命题 7.2。注意凹性方向：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 是凹的，故混合的熵不小于熵的混合，这与 KL 的凸性方向相反，二者在第 3 节与第 7 节（f-散度）中形成对照。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-8-连续情形-微分熵的链式法则与坐标变换\">8. 连续情形：微分熵的链式法则与坐标变换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-8-连续情形-微分熵的链式法则与坐标变换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节定理 2.1 的证明只用到密度的代数分解与 Fubini，对离散与连续情形一视同仁。但连续情形有一个离散情形不存在的现象：微分熵在坐标变换下不守恒，这会影响链式法则的“形式不变性”表述。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1（微分熵的坐标变换）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>，密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续且满足 (A3)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\Phi(X)$</span>，其密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y(y)=p_X(\\Phi^{-1}(y))|\\det D\\Phi^{-1}(y)|$</span>。则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_Y\\log p_Y\\in L^1$</span> 时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h(p_Y)=h(p_X)+\\mathbb E_{p_X}\\big[\\log|\\det D\\Phi(X)|\\big].$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由变量替换公式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h(p_Y)=-\\int p_X(\\Phi^{-1}(y))\\big|\\det D\\Phi^{-1}(y)\\big|\\log\\Big(p_X(\\Phi^{-1}(y))\\big|\\det D\\Phi^{-1}(y)\\big|\\Big)\\,dy.$$</div>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=\\Phi^{-1}(y)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$dy=|\\det D\\Phi(x)|\\,dx$</span>，并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D\\Phi^{-1}(\\Phi(x))=(D\\Phi(x))^{-1}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\det D\\Phi^{-1}(\\Phi(x))|=|\\det D\\Phi(x)|^{-1}$</span>。代入得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h(p_Y)=-\\int p_X(x)\\log\\big(p_X(x)|\\det D\\Phi(x)|^{-1}\\big)\\,dx=-\\int p_X(x)\\log p_X(x)\\,dx+\\int p_X(x)\\log|\\det D\\Phi(x)|\\,dx,$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(p_Y)=h(p_X)+\\mathbb E_{p_X}[\\log|\\det D\\Phi(X)|]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.2（链式法则在坐标变换下的协变形式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,Y)$</span> 的联合密度满足 (A1)–(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal Y$</span> 上的微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tilde X,\\tilde Y)=(\\Phi(X),\\Psi(Y))$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h(\\tilde p)=h(p)+\\mathbb E_p\\big[\\log|\\det D\\Phi(X)|\\big]+\\mathbb E_p\\big[\\log|\\det D\\Psi(Y)|\\big],$$</div>\n<p>且链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(\\tilde p)=h(\\tilde p_{\\tilde X})+h(\\tilde p_{\\tilde Y\\mid \\tilde X})$</span> 仍成立，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_{\\tilde Y\\mid \\tilde X=\\tilde x}$</span> 是变换后的条件密度。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 联合密度的变换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p(\\tilde x,\\tilde y)=p(x,y)|\\det D\\Phi(x)|^{-1}|\\det D\\Psi(y)|^{-1}$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p\\log\\tilde p$</span> 积分并做变量替换，得第一式。链式法则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p$</span> 成立是因为定理 2.1 的假设（可积性、条件熵有限、边缘熵有限）在微分同胚下保持不变（雅可比行列式有界且远离零，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi,\\Psi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚及紧支撑假设保证）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 8.2 的要点：链式法则的<strong>形式</strong>在坐标变换下不变，但每一项的<strong>数值</strong>会因雅可比项而改变。这与离散情形形成鲜明对比——离散熵在可逆映射下严格不变（因为计数测度在双射下守恒）。第 9 节将系统处理这一差异；本节只记录它对链式法则表述的影响：在连续情形下陈述链式法则时，必须固定参考测度（Lebesgue），否则“联合熵 = 边缘熵 + 条件熵”的等式两端会各自带上不同的雅可比修正，等式不再成立。这是本节所有连续情形命题都显式写出“关于 Lebesgue 测度”的原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-9-一个可检验的恒等式-条件熵的塔性质\">9. 一个可检验的恒等式：条件熵的塔性质<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-9-一个可检验的恒等式-条件熵的塔性质\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>链式法则还可以迭代出条件熵的“塔性质”，它是条件期望塔性质的熵论对应，在自回归模型中对应“多层上下文的条件化可以逐层剥离”。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1（条件熵的塔性质）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,Y,Z)$</span> 的联合密度满足三变量版本的 (A1)–(A3)。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_{Z\\mid X})=\\mathbb E_{p_{X,Y}}\\big[H(p_{Z\\mid X,Y})\\big]+\\mathbb E_{p_X}\\big[H(p_{Y\\mid X})\\big]-\\mathbb E_{p_X}\\big[H(p_{Y\\mid X})\\big]$$</div>\n<p>不成立为恒等式；正确的塔性质应表述为如下两条链式法则的合成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_{Z\\mid X})=\\mathbb E_{p_{X,Y}}\\big[H(p_{Z\\mid X,Y})\\big]+\\mathbb E_{p_X}\\big[H(p_{Y\\mid X})\\big]-\\mathbb E_{p_X}\\big[H(p_{Y\\mid X,Z})\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中最后一项是“给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,Z)$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的条件熵”的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{X,Z}$</span>-期望，一般不为零。因此条件熵<strong>不满足</strong>简单的塔性质 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid X)=\\mathbb E[H(Z\\mid X,Y)]$</span>；只有在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 下与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 条件独立时，最后一项才等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_X}[H(p_{Y\\mid X})]$</span>，两项相消。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,Y,Z)$</span> 应用命题 4.1 的两种不同分组。分组一：先 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>，再 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y\\mid X$</span>，再 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\mid X,Y$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)=H(p_X)+H(p_{Y\\mid X})+H(p_{Z\\mid X,Y}).$$</div>\n<p>分组二：先 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>，再 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\mid X$</span>，再 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y\\mid X,Z$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)=H(p_X)+H(p_{Z\\mid X})+H(p_{Y\\mid X,Z}).$$</div>\n<p>两式相减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_X)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 消去，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_{Z\\mid X})-H(p_{Z\\mid X,Y})=H(p_{Y\\mid X})-H(p_{Y\\mid X,Z}).$$</div>\n<p>移项即得所陈述的恒等式。最后一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_{X,Z}}[H(p_{Y\\mid X,Z})]$</span> 一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_X}[H(p_{Y\\mid X})]$</span>；等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 下与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 条件独立，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{Y\\mid X,Z}=p_{Y\\mid X}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{X,Z}$</span>-a.e. 成立，两项相消，塔性质 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Z\\mid X)=\\mathbb E[H(Z\\mid X,Y)]$</span> 成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 9.2（塔性质失效的工程含义）</strong> 命题 9.1 说明：在自回归模型中，“给定更多上下文”对条件熵的降低量不是可加的——把上下文从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 扩展到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,Y)$</span> 所降低的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 的不确定性，等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 下对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 提供的信息量，而这个量依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 是否已被观测。这正是下一节互信息与条件互信息要精确刻画的量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{Z\\mid X})-H(p_{Z\\mid X,Y})$</span> 恰是条件互信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Z;Y\\mid X)$</span>。本节不展开互信息的定义与性质，只把这一恒等式作为链式法则的可检验推论记录下来，供第 4 节直接引用。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>联合熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 是联合密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下的负对数期望，条件熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{Y\\mid X})$</span> 是逐点条件熵的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X$</span>-期望；二者在 (A1)–(A3) 下均为有限实数，且条件密度在零测集上的任意取值不影响结果。</li>\n<li>链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=H(p_X)+H(p_{Y\\mid X)}$</span> 由对数密度的代数分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)=p(x)p(y\\mid x)$</span> 与 Fubini–Tonelli 对绝对可积函数的拆分直接得到；对调次序后两式相减给出恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_X)-H(p_{X\\mid Y})=H(p_Y)-H(p_{Y\\mid X})$</span>，这是下一节互信息的来源。</li>\n<li>多变量迭代链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=\\sum_t H(p_{X_t\\mid X_{&lt;t}})$</span> 由两变量情形归纳得到，它是自回归分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_{1:T})=\\prod_t p(x_t\\mid x_{&lt;t})$</span> 的熵论对应，也是第 3 节 KL 链式法则证明技巧的原型。</li>\n<li>链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=H(p_X)+H(p_{Y\\mid X})$</span> 由对数密度的代数分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)=p(x)p(y\\mid x)$</span> 与 Fubini–Tonelli 对绝对可积函数的拆分直接得到；对调次序后两式相减给出恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_X)-H(p_{X\\mid Y})=H(p_Y)-H(p_{Y\\mid X})$</span>，这是下一节互信息的来源；条件化不增熵与联合熵次可加性是其直接推论，条件熵关于条件分布的凹性则给出混合操作的熵论方向。</li>\n<li>多变量迭代链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=\\sum_t H(p_{X_t\\mid X_{&lt;t}})$</span> 由两变量情形归纳得到，它是自回归分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_{1:T})=\\prod_t p(x_t\\mid x_{&lt;t})$</span> 的熵论对应；连续情形下链式法则形式不变但各项带雅可比修正，条件熵不满足简单塔性质，其修正项恰为下一节的条件互信息。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar05--h-KL-散度-定义-非负性与等号条件\">KL 散度：定义、非负性与等号条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-KL-散度-定义-非负性与等号条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前两节已定义的符号：对可数集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的概率质量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span>，记支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}p=\\{x:p(x)&gt;0\\}$</span>；对概率空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)$</span> 上的概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 绝对连续。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>离散 KL 散度：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上概率质量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q):=\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal X}p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)},$$</div>\n并约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0$</span> 时该式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li>连续 KL 散度：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上概率密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span>（关于 Lebesgue 测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q):=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}\\,\\mathrm dx,$$</div>\n约定被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span> 处取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0,q(x)=0$</span> 处取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li>测度论 KL 散度：对概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm dP}{\\mathrm dQ}$</span> 为 Radon–Nikodym 导数，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q):=\\int_\\Omega \\frac{\\mathrm dP}{\\mathrm dQ}\\log\\frac{\\mathrm dP}{\\mathrm dQ}\\,\\mathrm dQ=\\mathbb E_Q\\!\\left[\\frac{\\mathrm dP}{\\mathrm dQ}\\log\\frac{\\mathrm dP}{\\mathrm dQ}\\right];$$</div>\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\not\\ll Q$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q):=+\\infty$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节贯穿以下假设。</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性。</strong> 离散情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 可数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为概率质量函数，求和绝对收敛或取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>；连续情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为 Borel 可测概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\log p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\log q$</span> 在扩充实数轴上良定义（允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>）。测度情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q$</span> 为概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm dP}{\\mathrm dQ}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-可测非负函数。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 对数底。</strong> 全书固定自然对数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log=\\ln$</span>，熵以 nat 为单位；换底只改变常数因子，不影响非负性与等号条件。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 支撑约定。</strong> 离散情形若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0,q(x)=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>；连续情形若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{q=0\\}$</span> 上给正质量，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>。此约定与测度论定义中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\not\\ll Q\\Rightarrow D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=+\\infty$</span> 一致。</p>\n<p>本节只处理定义、非负性与等号条件；KL 的链式法则、变分表示、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度推广、数值计算与反例构造分别在后续第 4、6、7、13、14、10 节展开，本节不重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-定义与相邻概念的区别\">定义与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-定义与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>KL 散度不是度量。它不满足对称性与三角不等式，因此与“距离”有本质区别；它是两个概率分布之间“信息量差”的期望，而不是几何距离。与熵的关系是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\mathbb E_p[\\log p]$</span> 只依赖单个分布，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\mathbb E_p[\\log p-\\log q]$</span> 依赖两个分布，且可写成\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=-H(p)-\\mathbb E_p[\\log q],$$</div>\n右端第二项即交叉熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,q):=-\\mathbb E_p[\\log q]$</span>（第 5 节展开）。因此 KL 是“交叉熵减熵”，衡量用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 编码来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的样本时相对最优编码 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的额外代价。与互信息的关系是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|p(x)p(y))$</span>，即联合分布与其乘积边缘的 KL（第 4 节展开）。本节只强调：KL 的定义域是“概率分布对”，且方向性内建于定义中——<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)$</span> 一般不等。</p>\n<p>离散与连续的定义在形式上一致，但连续情形因涉及密度而依赖参考测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>；改变参考测度会改变 KL 的值（第 9 节讨论连续熵与离散熵差异时会用到这一事实）。测度论定义是二者的统一：离散情形取计数测度，连续情形取 Lebesgue 测度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-主定理-Gibbs-不等式与非负性\">主定理：Gibbs 不等式与非负性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-主定理-Gibbs-不等式与非负性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理（Gibbs 不等式）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal F)$</span> 上概率测度，满足 (A1)。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)\\ge 0,$$</div>\n且等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=Q$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设核查.</strong> 证明只用到：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q$</span> 为概率测度（故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(\\Omega)=Q(\\Omega)=1$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span> 时 Radon–Nikodym 导数存在（Radon–Nikodym 定理）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 上的凸性与不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log u\\le u-1$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u&gt;0$</span>）。不需要任何光滑性、紧支撑或可积性以外的条件；<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=+\\infty$</span> 的情形由定义直接非负。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\not\\ll Q$</span>，由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)=+\\infty&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ne Q$</span>，结论成立。以下设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\frac{\\mathrm dP}{\\mathrm dQ}\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e. 有定义。</p>\n<p>第一步，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log u\\le u-1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$u&gt;0$</span>）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log u\\le u-1,$$</div>\n等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=1$</span>。此不等式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 的凹性（或直接求导验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u-1-\\log u$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=1$</span> 取最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>）得到。</p>\n<p>第二步，在集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{f&gt;0\\}$</span> 上逐点应用。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega\\in\\{f&gt;0\\}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(\\omega)\\log f(\\omega)\\ge f(\\omega)(f(\\omega)-1)=f(\\omega)^2-f(\\omega).$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{f=0\\}$</span> 上，按约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f=0$</span>，而右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^2-f=0$</span>，故不等式在全集上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e. 成立。</p>\n<p>第三步，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 积分。由第一步，被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f-(f^2-f)$</span> 非负且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e. 有定义，积分（取扩充实数）满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)=\\int f\\log f\\,\\mathrm dQ\\ge \\int (f^2-f)\\,\\mathrm dQ.$$</div>\n这里用到积分的单调性（非负函数积分比较），无需 Dominated Convergence：两端均为非负可测函数在扩充实数轴上的积分，单调性对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 情形自动成立。</p>\n<p>第四步，计算右端。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\frac{\\mathrm dP}{\\mathrm dQ}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q$</span> 为概率测度，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int f\\,\\mathrm dQ=P(\\Omega)=1,\\qquad \\int f^2\\,\\mathrm dQ\\ge \\left(\\int f\\,\\mathrm dQ\\right)^2=1,$$</div>\n其中不等式为 Jensen 不等式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\mapsto u^2$</span> 凸，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 为概率测度）。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int (f^2-f)\\,\\mathrm dQ=\\int f^2\\,\\mathrm dQ-1\\ge 0.$$</div>\n结合第三步得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)\\ge 0$</span>。</p>\n<p>第五步，等号条件。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)=0$</span>，则第三步与第四步中的两个不等式同时取等。第四步 Jensen 取等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e. 常数；结合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\,\\mathrm dQ=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=1$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.。第三步取等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f=f^2-f$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.，由第一步这等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=1$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{f&gt;0\\}$</span> 上）。两种论证一致给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=1$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=Q$</span>。反之若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=Q$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=1$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=0$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论（离散与连续形式）.</strong> 在 (A1) 下，离散情形取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Omega=\\mathcal X$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 为计数测度归一化，连续情形取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 的密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>，定理给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_x p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}\\ge 0,\\qquad \\int p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}\\,\\mathrm dx\\ge 0,$$</div>\n等号均当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span>（相应测度下 a.e.）。这与本章 canonical claims 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)\\ge 0$</span>、等号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iff p=q$</span> a.e. 完全一致。</p>\n<p><strong>区别说明.</strong> 本定理的等号条件是“<span class=\"math-inline\">$P=Q$</span> 作为测度”，而非“<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> 逐点”。逐点相等是充分不必要的更强条件；在连续情形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 可在 Lebesgue 零测集上不同而仍满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=0$</span>。这正是 canonical claim 写“a.e.”的原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-可检验的恒等式-KL-与熵-交叉熵的关系\">可检验的恒等式：KL 与熵、交叉熵的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-可检验的恒等式-KL-与熵-交叉熵的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题（KL 的熵分解）.</strong> 设离散情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上概率质量函数，满足 (A1)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)$</span> 有限、<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,q)=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log q(x)$</span> 有限。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=H(p,q)-H(p).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由定义，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)-\\sum_x p(x)\\log q(x).$$</div>\n右端第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-H(p)$</span>，第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,q)$</span>（按第 5 节将给出的交叉熵定义，本节仅作为恒等式陈述，不展开交叉熵性质）。逐项相减即得。关键步骤是：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span> 时两项均按约定取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故逐点等式成立；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0,q(x)=0$</span> 时两端同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，等式在扩充实数轴上成立。证毕。</p>\n<p>此恒等式可检验：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,p)=H(p)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=0$</span>，与非负性等号条件一致。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上均匀分布，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,q)=\\log|\\mathcal X|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\log|\\mathcal X|-H(p)\\ge 0$</span>，即“均匀分布是最大熵分布”的等价表述（第 1 节已证最大熵，此处仅作一致性检验）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-具体例子-二元分布上的-KL\">具体例子：二元分布上的 KL<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-具体例子-二元分布上的-KL\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{0,1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_0,p_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(q_0,q_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0,p_1,q_0,q_1&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0+p_1=q_0+q_1=1$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=p_0\\log\\frac{p_0}{q_0}+p_1\\log\\frac{p_1}{q_1}.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.9,0.1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(0.5,0.5)$</span>，计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=0.9\\log\\frac{0.9}{0.5}+0.1\\log\\frac{0.1}{0.5}=0.9\\log 1.8+0.1\\log 0.2.$$</div>\n数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 1.8\\approx 0.5878$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 0.2\\approx -1.6094$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)\\approx 0.9\\times 0.5878+0.1\\times(-1.6094)\\approx 0.5290-0.1609=0.3681&gt;0.$$</div>\n反向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)=0.5\\log\\frac{0.5}{0.9}+0.5\\log\\frac{0.5}{0.1}\\approx 0.5\\times(-0.5878)+0.5\\times 1.6094\\approx 0.5108$</span>，与正向不等，验证了方向性。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span>，两项均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\log 1=0$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，验证等号条件。此例同时验证了恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)\\approx -0.9\\log 0.9-0.1\\log 0.1\\approx 0.3251$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,q)=-\\mathbb E_p[\\log q]=\\log 2\\approx 0.6931$</span>，差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.3680$</span>，与直接计算在舍入误差内一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-数值验证-可运行代码\">数值验证（可运行代码）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-数值验证-可运行代码\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码对离散 KL 的非负性与等号条件做数值验证，并对连续情形的密度对做 Monte Carlo 一致性检查。所有断言在双精度下成立。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef kl_discrete(p, q, eps=1e-12):\n    p = np.asarray(p, dtype=np.float64)\n    q = np.asarray(q, dtype=np.float64)\n    assert p.shape == q.shape\n    assert np.all(p &gt;= 0) and np.all(q &gt;= 0)\n    assert abs(p.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-9 and abs(q.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-9\n    mask = p &gt; 0\n    if np.any(q[mask] &lt;= 0):\n        return np.inf\n    return float(np.sum(p[mask] * np.log(p[mask] / q[mask])))\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nK = 7\nfor _ in range(1000):\n    p = rng.dirichlet(np.ones(K))\n    q = rng.dirichlet(np.ones(K))\n    d = kl_discrete(p, q)\n    assert d &gt;= -1e-12, d\n    d_self = kl_discrete(p, p)\n    assert abs(d_self) &lt; 1e-12, d_self\n\np = np.array([0.9, 0.1]); q = np.array([0.5, 0.5])\nprint(&quot;binary KL(p||q) =&quot;, kl_discrete(p, q))\nprint(&quot;binary KL(q||p) =&quot;, kl_discrete(q, p))\nprint(&quot;KL(p||p) =&quot;, kl_discrete(p, p))\nassert kl_discrete(p, q) &gt; 0\nassert kl_discrete(q, p) &gt; 0\nassert abs(kl_discrete(p, q) - kl_discrete(q, p)) &gt; 1e-3\n\n# 连续情形：两个一维正态密度的 KL 有闭式，Monte Carlo 验证\nmu1, s1 = 0.0, 1.0\nmu2, s2 = 1.0, 2.0\ndef logpdf_normal(x, mu, s):\n    return -0.5*np.log(2*np.pi*s*s) - 0.5*((x-mu)/s)**2\nxs = rng.normal(mu1, s1, size=200000)\nmc = np.mean(logpdf_normal(xs, mu1, s1) - logpdf_normal(xs, mu2, s2))\nexact = np.log(s2/s1) + (s1**2 + (mu1-mu2)**2)/(2*s2**2) - 0.5\nprint(&quot;MC KL =&quot;, mc, &quot; exact KL =&quot;, exact, &quot; shape =&quot;, xs.shape)\nassert abs(mc - exact) &lt; 0.02\nassert exact &gt; 0\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>binary KL(p||q)</code> 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.3681$</span>，<code>binary KL(q||p)</code> 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5108$</span>，<code>KL(p||p)</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；Monte Carlo 与闭式相差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.02$</span>，形状为 <code>(200000,)</code>。所有 <code>assert</code> 通过，验证了非负性、等号条件与方向性。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>KL 散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)$</span> 定义为 Radon–Nikodym 导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\mathrm dP/\\mathrm dQ$</span> 的期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\not\\ll Q$</span> 时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>；离散与连续形式是其特例，且方向性内建于定义，不满足对称性与三角不等式。</li>\n<li>Gibbs 不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)\\ge 0$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log u\\le u-1$</span> 逐点比较加积分单调性证明，等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=Q$</span>（等价地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=1$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.），即 canonical claim 中的“<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> a.e.”。</li>\n<li>恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=H(p,q)-H(p)$</span> 将 KL 分解为交叉熵与熵之差，二元分布数值例子与可运行代码同时验证了非负性、等号条件、方向性与该恒等式。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-等号条件的精细刻画-逐点比较与积分取等的对齐\">等号条件的精细刻画：逐点比较与积分取等的对齐<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-等号条件的精细刻画-逐点比较与积分取等的对齐\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节给出的 Gibbs 不等式证明中，等号条件由“逐点不等式取等”与“积分不等式取等”两步同时成立推出。此处把这两步的对齐关系单独陈述为命题，因为它在后续第 4 节证明数据处理不等式、第 6 节推导 Donsker–Varadhan 变分表示时都会被反复引用；同时它澄清了一个容易混淆的点：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)=0$</span> 并不意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f=f^2-f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-零测集之外处处成立，而只意味着二者之差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 下积分为零。</p>\n<p><strong>命题（等号对齐）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q$</span> 为概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\mathrm dP/\\mathrm dQ$</span>，满足 (A1)。则以下三条等价：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)=0$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=1$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.；</p>\n<p>(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=Q$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设核查.</strong> 只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-可测性；不需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log f$</span> 可积，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=0$</span> 本身蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\log f\\,\\mathrm dQ$</span> 有限（非负性已证，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 是有限值）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> (ii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(iii)：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=1$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\in\\mathcal F$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(A)=\\int_A f\\,\\mathrm dQ=Q(A)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=Q$</span>。(iii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(i)：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=Q$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=1$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f=0$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.，积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=0$</span>。(i)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(ii)：由 Gibbs 不等式证明第三步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)=\\int f\\log f\\,\\mathrm dQ\\ge\\int(f^2-f)\\,\\mathrm dQ\\ge 0$</span>。若左端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，则两个非负被积函数之差的积分为零，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int[f\\log f-(f^2-f)]\\,\\mathrm dQ=0$</span>。被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{f&gt;0\\}$</span> 上等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\log f-(f-1))$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log u\\le u-1$</span> 知它非负；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{f=0\\}$</span> 上按约定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。非负函数积分为零当且仅当其为零 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.（这是 Lebesgue 积分的基本性质，无需额外假设），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\log f-(f-1))=0$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{f&gt;0\\}$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log f=f-1$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log u=u-1$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=1$</span> 成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=1$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题的关键在于：等号条件不是通过“<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 的表达式逐项为零”得到的，而是通过“非负被积函数积分为零”得到的。后者是测度论层面的陈述，与逐点陈述之间有零测集的间隙；canonical claim 写“a.e.”正是为了覆盖这一间隙。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-非负性的另一条证明路径-Jensen-不等式\">非负性的另一条证明路径：Jensen 不等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-非负性的另一条证明路径-Jensen-不等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Gibbs 不等式的证明用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log u\\le u-1$</span> 这条逐点不等式。另一条常见路径是把 KL 写成对数似然比的期望，再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 用 Jensen 不等式。两条路径给出相同的结论与相同的等号条件，但 Jensen 路径更直接地暴露了“KL 是凸函数在概率单纯形上的取值”这一结构，且在第 7 节推广到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度时是更自然的出发点。此处给出 Jensen 路径作为独立命题，并显式验证其所需条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题（Jensen 路径）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q$</span> 为概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\mathrm dP/\\mathrm dQ$</span>，满足 (A1)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\log f\\,\\mathrm dQ$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\,\\mathrm dQ\\log\\int f\\,\\mathrm dQ$</span> 均在扩充实数轴上良定义。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)=\\int f\\log f\\,\\mathrm dQ\\ge \\left(\\int f\\,\\mathrm dQ\\right)\\log\\left(\\int f\\,\\mathrm dQ\\right)=1\\cdot\\log 1=0.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设核查.</strong> Jensen 不等式对凸函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(u)=u\\log u$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\ge 0$</span>，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>）成立，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 凸、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-可积非负函数、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 为概率测度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\infty)$</span> 上凸：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi''(u)=1/u&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u&gt;0$</span>，且在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 连续（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{u\\downarrow 0}u\\log u=0$</span>），故凸性在闭区间上成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-可积性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 为概率测度保证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\,\\mathrm dQ=P(\\Omega)=1&lt;\\infty$</span>。不需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log f$</span> 的可积性；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\log f\\,\\mathrm dQ=+\\infty$</span>，Jensen 不等式在扩充实数轴上仍成立（右端有限，左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty\\ge 0$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 对凸函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(u)=u\\log u$</span> 与概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-可积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 应用 Jensen 不等式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varphi\\!\\left(\\int f\\,\\mathrm dQ\\right)\\le\\int\\varphi(f)\\,\\mathrm dQ.$$</div>\n即\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left(\\int f\\,\\mathrm dQ\\right)\\log\\left(\\int f\\,\\mathrm dQ\\right)\\le\\int f\\log f\\,\\mathrm dQ.$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\,\\mathrm dQ=1$</span> 得左端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\cdot\\log 1=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)\\ge 0$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>等号条件的独立验证.</strong> Jensen 不等式取等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 的仿射部分上取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(u)=u\\log u$</span> 严格凸（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi''&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span>），故仿射部分仅为单点，取等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.；结合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\,\\mathrm dQ=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=1$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.。这与上一命题的 (ii) 一致，构成对等号条件的交叉验证。</p>\n<p>两条路径的差别值得记录：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log u\\le u-1$</span> 路径把 KL 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(f^2-f)\\,\\mathrm dQ$</span> 比较，后者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的二次泛函，在数值上给出一个显式的下界估计；Jensen 路径把 KL 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\cdot\\log 1$</span> 比较，不经过二次泛函。前者在第 14 节构造数值反例时更有用（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(f^2-f)\\,\\mathrm dQ$</span> 可直接计算），后者在第 7 节推广到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度时更自然（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_Q[\\varphi(f)]$</span>，Jensen 直接给出非负性）。本节两条路径都给出，是为了让后续两节各有可引用的现成命题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-与熵的符号约定一致性检验\">与熵的符号约定一致性检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-与熵的符号约定一致性检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 1 节定义熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)$</span>，第 2 节定义条件熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y|X)=\\mathbb E_{p(x)}H(p(y|x))$</span>。本节定义 KL 时使用了同一符号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 与同一约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>。此处检验三处约定的一致性，因为符号不一致是后续推导链中最常见的错误来源。</p>\n<p><strong>命题（符号一致性）.</strong> 在 (A1) 下，离散情形有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log q(x)+\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)=H(p,q)-H(p),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,q):=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log q(x)$</span> 为交叉熵。若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|p)=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,p)=H(p)$</span> 同时成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第一式由 KL 定义直接展开；第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p(x)/p(x))=0$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span>）逐点得到。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题看似平凡，但它固定了三个约定：(a) 熵与 KL 使用同一对数底，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,p)=H(p)$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)/\\log 2$</span>；(b) <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span> 在熵与 KL 中一致使用，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的零支撑点不贡献熵也不贡献 KL；(c) 交叉熵的符号约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,q)=-\\mathbb E_p[\\log q]$</span> 与熵的符号约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\mathbb E_p[\\log p]$</span> 一致，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=H(p,q)-H(p)$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)-H(p,q)$</span>。后续第 5 节把交叉熵与最大似然联系起来时，这三个约定必须原样沿用，否则负号会出错。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-一个可检验的推论-KL-对第二个参数的凸性\">一个可检验的推论：KL 对第二个参数的凸性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-一个可检验的推论-KL-对第二个参数的凸性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>非负性本身不涉及凸性，但 KL 的凸性是后续第 6 节变分表示与第 11 节信息几何的必要工具。此处给出凸性作为非负性证明的副产品，并显式验证其所需条件，因为凸性证明中交换积分与极限需要 Dominated Convergence，而这是本节唯一需要引用收敛定理的地方。</p>\n<p><strong>命题（KL 对第二参数的凸性）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为固定概率质量函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1,q_2$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上概率质量函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\lambda=\\lambda q_1+(1-\\lambda)q_2$</span>，满足 (A1)。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q_\\lambda)\\le\\lambda D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q_1)+(1-\\lambda)D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q_2).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设核查.</strong> 离散情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 可数，求和为可数和，无需 Dominated Convergence；连续情形需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\log q_i$</span> 有限（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,2$</span>），此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q_\\lambda$</span> 的可积性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 的凹性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\lambda\\ge\\lambda q_1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\lambda\\ge(1-\\lambda)q_2$</span> 保证，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\log q_\\lambda$</span> 可由 Dominated Convergence 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q_\\lambda\\le\\log(\\lambda q_1)$</span> 控制（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span>）。以下证明在离散情形给出，连续情形逐字相同，只需把求和换为积分并引用上述可积性。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 KL 定义与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\lambda$</span> 的定义，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q_\\lambda)=\\sum_x p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{\\lambda q_1(x)+(1-\\lambda)q_2(x)}.$$</div>\n对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>，函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\mapsto-\\log u$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 上凸，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\log(\\lambda q_1(x)+(1-\\lambda)q_2(x))\\le-\\lambda\\log q_1(x)-(1-\\lambda)\\log q_2(x).$$</div>\n两边乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\ge 0$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求和（可数和的逐项不等式保持方向），得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_x p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q_\\lambda(x)}\\le\\lambda\\sum_x p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q_1(x)}+(1-\\lambda)\\sum_x p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q_2(x)}.$$</div>\n右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q_1)+(1-\\lambda)D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q_2)$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>此推论在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1=q_2=q$</span> 时退化为等号，与等号条件一致；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1\\ne q_2$</span> 时给出严格不等式（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log$</span> 严格凸且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1\\ne q_2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的正支撑上）。它同时说明：固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\mapsto D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span> 是概率单纯形上的凸函数，故其最小值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 处取到且唯一（由严格凸性与等号条件），这为非负性提供了一个变分视角的独立佐证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-边界情形的显式处理-infty-与零测集\">边界情形的显式处理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 与零测集<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-边界情形的显式处理-infty-与零测集\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节定义中允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=+\\infty$</span>，非负性证明对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 情形自动成立，但等号条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 情形下需要单独说明，因为“<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=0$</span>”与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=+\\infty$</span>”是互斥的，等号条件只在前者中有意义。此处把边界情形逐条列出，作为后续第 10 节反例节的接口；本节只陈述事实，不构造反例。</p>\n<p><strong>命题（边界情形）.</strong> 在 (A1) 下：</p>\n<p>(a) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\not\\ll Q$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)=+\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ne Q$</span>，故非负性与“等号仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=Q$</span>”均成立（后者为逆否形式）。</p>\n<p>(b) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span> 但存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\in\\mathcal F$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(A)=0&lt;P(A)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=+\\infty$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e. 意义下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-零测集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在其上无有限值），<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)=+\\infty$</span>；此情形已包含在 (a) 中，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(A)=0&lt;P(A)$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\not\\ll Q$</span>。</p>\n<p>(c) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f&gt;0$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)&lt;+\\infty$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f|\\log f|\\,\\mathrm dQ&lt;\\infty$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e. 有正下界，则自动有限。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> (a) 由定义。(b) 由绝对连续的定义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(A)=0\\Rightarrow P(A)=0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(A)&gt;0$</span> 矛盾，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\not\\ll Q$</span>，归入 (a)。(c) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f&gt;0$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e. 有有限值；<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=\\int f\\log f\\,\\mathrm dQ$</span> 有限当且仅当正部与负部均可积，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f|\\log f|\\,\\mathrm dQ&lt;\\infty$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\,\\mathrm dQ=1$</span> 已有限）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e. 有正下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|f\\log f|\\le\\|f\\|_\\infty\\max(|\\log c|,|\\log\\|f\\|_\\infty|)$</span>，被积函数有界，积分有限。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题的作用是把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=+\\infty$</span>”的两种来源分开：支撑不匹配（<span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\not\\ll Q$</span>）与对数比不可积（<span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f|\\log f|=\\infty$</span>）。前者是结构性的，后者是分析性的；第 10 节将分别构造这两类反例。本节只记录：非负性对两类来源均成立，等号条件只对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=0$</span> 的情形陈述，故不受 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 情形影响。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-与后续节的接口-本节命题在推导链中的位置\">与后续节的接口：本节命题在推导链中的位置<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-与后续节的接口-本节命题在推导链中的位置\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的三条 canonical claims（KL 定义、非负性与等号条件、链式法则）中，前两条已在本节完成；链式法则留待第 4 节与互信息一并处理。本节完成的命题在全书推导链中的位置如下，供后续节引用时定位。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>等号对齐命题（<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=0\\iff P=Q$</span>）是第 4 节数据处理不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)\\ge I(X;Z)$</span> 等号条件的基础：数据处理不等式的证明把互信息写成两个 KL 之差，等号条件归结为某个条件 KL 为零，再由本命题化为条件分布相等。</li>\n<li>Jensen 路径命题是第 7 节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度非负性的模板：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_Q[\\varphi(\\mathrm dP/\\mathrm dQ)]$</span>，非负性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span> 凸与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(1)=0$</span> 经 Jensen 直接得到，本节命题即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi(u)=u\\log u$</span> 的特例。</li>\n<li>KL 对第二参数的凸性命题是第 6 节 Donsker–Varadhan 变分表示中“上确界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 处取到”的依据，也是第 11 节信息几何中 KL 作为 Bregman 散度的凸性来源。</li>\n<li>边界情形命题是第 10 节反例节的分类框架：支撑不匹配与对数比不可积两类反例分别对应 (a)(b) 与 (c)。</li>\n<li>符号一致性命题是第 5 节交叉熵与最大似然关系推导的约定基础，确保 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=H(p,q)-H(p)$</span> 的符号在后续节中不被翻转。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节不展开上述后续内容，只记录接口位置，以避免后续节重复证明本节已完成的命题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar05--h-互信息与数据处理不等式\">互信息与数据处理不等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-互信息与数据处理不等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：对离散随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim p(x)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y\\sim p(y)$</span>，联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)$</span>，条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y|x)$</span>，边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=\\sum_y p(x,y)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y)=\\sum_x p(x,y)$</span>。熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)$</span>，联合熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X,Y)=-\\sum_{x,y}p(x,y)\\log p(x,y)$</span>，条件熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y|X)=\\mathbb E_{p(x)}H(p(y|x))$</span>，KL 散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sum_x p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}$</span>，且已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)\\ge 0$</span>，等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> 几乎处处（对离散情形即逐点相等）。本节所有对数以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 为底，单位为比特；换底只改变常数因子，不影响不等式方向与等号条件。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>互信息</strong>：对离散随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,Y)\\sim p(x,y)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y):=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(p(x,y)\\,\\|\\,p(x)p(y)\\big)=\\sum_{x,y}p(x,y)\\log\\frac{p(x,y)}{p(x)p(y)}.$$</div>\n要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)p(y)$</span> 的支撑一致（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)&gt;0\\iff p(x)p(y)&gt;0$</span>），否则按第 10 节约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=+\\infty$</span>。本节主定理均在支撑一致且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X),H(Y)&lt;\\infty$</span> 下陈述。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>条件互信息</strong>：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\sim p(z)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y|Z):=\\mathbb E_{p(z)}\\Big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(p(x,y|z)\\,\\|\\,p(x|z)p(y|z)\\big)\\Big],$$</div>\n要求对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(z)$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，条件分布支撑一致。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>数据处理（信道）设定</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim p(x)$</span>，信道 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W(y|x)$</span> 满足对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W(\\cdot|x)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 上概率分布；输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y)=\\sum_x p(x)W(y|x)$</span>，联合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)=p(x)W(y|x)$</span>。再经信道 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V(z|y)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 构成马尔可夫链，联合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y,z)=p(x)W(y|x)V(z|y)$</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需正则性假设统一列出：(A1) 所有随机变量取值于有限或可数集，故求和绝对收敛；(A2) 所涉熵有限；(A3) 支撑一致（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span> 与各条件互信息）；(A4) 马尔可夫链的转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W,V$</span> 为概率核，即每行非负且和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。这些假设在本节情境下成立：本章处理离散序列模型，词表有限，故 (A1)(A2) 自动满足；(A3) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 处由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 的定义保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)=p(x)W(y|x)$</span>，只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W(y|x)&gt;0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y)&gt;0$</span> 一致，这在信道无零概率截断时成立，若有截断则按第 10 节处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-定义辨析-互信息不是-相关性-的度量\">定义辨析：互信息不是“相关性”的度量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-定义辨析-互信息不是-相关性-的度量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>互信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span> 与协方差、相关系数有本质区别。协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(X,Y)=\\mathbb E[XY]-\\mathbb E[X]\\mathbb E[Y]$</span> 依赖数值尺度与线性结构，对非线性依赖可能为零；互信息是分布层面的量，度量的是“知道 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的不确定性减少了多少”，对任意可测变换不变：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 为单射，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=I(f(X);Y)$</span>。这一点由 KL 散度在可测双射下的不变性直接得到，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)/[p(x)p(y)]$</span> 在双射下逐点保持。</p>\n<p>互信息与 KL 散度的关系是定义性的：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|p(x)p(y))$</span>。它与条件熵的关系由链式法则给出（下一小节），与熵的关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(X)+H(Y)-H(X,Y)$</span>，该恒等式在 (A1)–(A3) 下成立，证明见推论 5.4.2。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-5-4-1-互信息的链式分解与对称性\">命题 5.4.1（互信息的链式分解与对称性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-5-4-1-互信息的链式分解与对称性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3) 成立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,Y)\\sim p(x,y)$</span> 支撑一致且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X),H(Y),H(X,Y)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：下列恒等式成立：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y)=H(X)-H(X|Y)=H(Y)-H(Y|X)=H(X)+H(Y)-H(X,Y),$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=I(Y;X)\\ge 0$</span>，等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 独立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)=p(x)p(y)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,y)$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 KL 链式法则（第 3 节已证）应用于联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)$</span> 与乘积分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x,y)=p(x)p(y)$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=p(x)\\sum_y p(y)=p(x)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y)$</span> 为概率分布），<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y)=p(y)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y|x)=q(x,y)/q(x)=p(x)p(y)/p(x)=p(y)$</span>。链式法则给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|q(x,y))=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x)\\|q(x))+\\mathbb E_{p(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y|x)\\|q(y|x)).$$</div>\n第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x)\\|p(x))=0$</span>。第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y|x)\\|p(y))$</span>。将 KL 定义展开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y|x)\\|p(y))=\\sum_x p(x)\\sum_y p(y|x)\\log\\frac{p(y|x)}{p(y)}=\\sum_{x,y}p(x,y)\\log\\frac{p(x,y)}{p(x)p(y)}=I(X;Y).$$</div>\n另一方面，由条件熵定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y|X)=\\mathbb E_{p(x)}H(p(y|x))=-\\sum_{x,y}p(x,y)\\log p(y|x)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X,Y)=-\\sum_{x,y}p(x,y)\\log p(x,y)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)$</span>。直接计算：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X)-H(X|Y)=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)+\\sum_{x,y}p(x,y)\\log p(x|y).$$</div>\n利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x|y)=p(x,y)/p(y)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p(x,y)=p(y)$</span>，第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x,y}p(x,y)\\log p(x,y)-\\sum_{x,y}p(x,y)\\log p(y)=\\sum_{x,y}p(x,y)\\log p(x,y)-\\sum_y p(y)\\log p(y)=-H(X,Y)+H(Y)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)-H(X|Y)=H(X)+H(Y)-H(X,Y)=I(X;Y)$</span>。对称性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)/[p(x)p(y)]$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y$</span> 对称直接得到。非负性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|p(x)p(y))\\ge 0$</span>（第 3 节 Gibbs 不等式），等号条件由 KL 等号条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)=p(x)p(y)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,y)$</span> 成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.4.2（条件互信息的非负性与链式法则）</strong>：在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对任意三个离散变量，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y|Z)\\ge 0,\\qquad I(X;Y,Z)=I(X;Z)+I(X;Y|Z).$$</div>\n等号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y|Z)=0$</span> 成立当且仅当对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(z)$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y|z)=p(x|z)p(y|z)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：非负性由条件互信息定义为条件 KL 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(z)$</span>-期望，每一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 0$</span>，期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 0$</span>。链式法则展开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y,Z)=\\sum_{x,y,z}p(x,y,z)\\log\\frac{p(x,y,z)}{p(x)p(y,z)}.$$</div>\n将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y,z)=p(z)p(x,y|z)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y,z)=p(z)p(y|z)$</span> 代入，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y,Z)=\\sum_{x,y,z}p(x,y,z)\\log\\frac{p(x,y|z)}{p(x)p(y|z)}=\\sum_{x,y,z}p(x,y,z)\\log\\frac{p(x,y|z)}{p(x|z)p(y|z)}+\\sum_{x,y,z}p(x,y,z)\\log\\frac{p(x|z)}{p(x)}.$$</div>\n第一项按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 分组即为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p(z)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y|z)\\|p(x|z)p(y|z))=I(X;Y|Z)$</span>。第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x,z}p(x,z)\\log\\frac{p(x|z)}{p(x)}=I(X;Z)$</span>（由命题 5.4.1 的对称形式）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-5-4-3-数据处理不等式\">命题 5.4.3（数据处理不等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-5-4-3-数据处理不等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 为马尔可夫链，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y,z)=p(x)W(y|x)V(z|y)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)&lt;\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span>，等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Z\\to Y$</span> 亦为马尔可夫链（即给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 条件独立）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由互信息的链式法则（推论 5.4.2），对联合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y,z)$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y,Z)=I(X;Z)+I(X;Y|Z)=I(X;Y)+I(X;Z|Y).$$</div>\n马尔可夫性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(z|x,y)=p(z|y)$</span>，即给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 条件独立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z|Y)=0$</span>（推论 5.4.2 的等号条件）。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Z)+I(X;Y|Z)=I(X;Y).$$</div>\n由非负性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y|Z)\\ge 0$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span>。等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y|Z)=0$</span>，即给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 条件独立，这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Z\\to Y$</span> 马尔可夫。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：上述证明只用了链式法则与条件互信息非负性，未交换任何极限与积分（离散求和有限或绝对收敛，由 (A1)(A2) 保证）。若取值可数无限，求和绝对收敛性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证，此时 Fubini 定理适用（非负项求和可交换次序），无需额外 Dominated Convergence。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-5-4-4-可检验恒等式-互信息的变分上界\">命题 5.4.4（可检验恒等式：互信息的变分上界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-5-4-4-可检验恒等式-互信息的变分上界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：对任意函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,y)$</span>（实值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-可积），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y)\\ge \\mathbb E_{p(x,y)}[f(x,y)]-\\log\\mathbb E_{p(x)p(y)}[e^{f(x,y)}].$$</div>\n等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,y)=\\log\\frac{p(x,y)}{p(x)p(y)}+c$</span> 对某常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)$</span>-几乎处处）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：这是 Donsker–Varadhan 变分表示在有限集上的特例，但此处只用 Gibbs 不等式给出初等证明，不依赖第 6 节。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x,y)=p(x)p(y)$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x,y)=e^{f(x,y)}/\\mathbb E_q[e^{f}]$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[g]=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-密度（在有限集上逐点非负且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。由 KL 非负性：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$0\\le D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q\\cdot g)=\\sum_{x,y}p(x,y)\\log\\frac{p(x,y)}{q(x,y)g(x,y)}.$$</div>\n展开对数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p-\\log q-\\log g$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum p\\log g=\\mathbb E_p[f]-\\log\\mathbb E_q[e^f]$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$0\\le -I(X;Y)-\\mathbb E_p[f]+\\log\\mathbb E_q[e^f],$$</div>\n移项即得所述不等式。等号条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|qg)=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=qg$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=p/q$</span>，亦即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^f/\\mathbb E_q[e^f]=p/q$</span>，取对数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\log(p/q)-\\log\\mathbb E_q[e^f]$</span>，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=-\\log\\mathbb E_q[e^f]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>可检验推论</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,y)=\\lambda\\,\\mathbb 1\\{x=y\\}$</span>，则上界化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)\\ge \\lambda p(X=Y)-\\log(\\lambda^2 p(X=Y)+(1-p(X=Y))+\\text{交叉项})$</span>，具体形式依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)p(y)$</span> 的对角质量。该式可在代码节数值验证（见第 13 节接口）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-具体例子-二元对称信道\">具体例子：二元对称信道<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-具体例子-二元对称信道\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\in\\{0,1\\}$</span> 均匀分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 经二元对称信道 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W(y|x)$</span>：以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\epsilon$</span> 正确传输，以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 翻转，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le\\epsilon\\le 1/2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y)=1/2$</span> 均匀，联合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2(1-\\epsilon)$</span>（对角）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2\\epsilon$</span>（非对角）。计算：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y)=\\sum_{x,y}p(x,y)\\log\\frac{p(x,y)}{1/4}=1-h_2(\\epsilon),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_2(\\epsilon)=-\\epsilon\\log\\epsilon-(1-\\epsilon)\\log(1-\\epsilon)$</span> 为二元熵。验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=1$</span> 比特（完全确定）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=1/2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=0$</span>（独立）。此例满足 (A1)–(A3)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=H(Y)-H(Y|X)=1-h_2(\\epsilon)$</span> 与命题 5.4.1 一致。若再串联一个翻转概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 的信道得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span>，数据处理不等式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-h_2(\\epsilon\\oplus\\delta)\\le 1-h_2(\\epsilon)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\oplus$</span> 为模 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 加，等号当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\in\\{0,1/2\\}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-与相邻概念的区别-互信息-vs-总相关\">与相邻概念的区别：互信息 vs. 总相关<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-与相邻概念的区别-互信息-vs-总相关\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>互信息是两变量间的量；对多变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_1,\\dots,X_n)$</span>，总相关（total correlation）定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=\\sum_i H(X_i)-H(X_1,\\dots,X_n)=\\sum_i I(X_i;X_{-i})$</span> 的某种聚合，它度量整体依赖，不等于成对互信息之和。本节只处理二元互信息及其条件版本，多变量聚合留待熵率节（第 12 节）处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-5-4-5-互信息的凸性与信道容量上界\">命题 5.4.5（互信息的凸性与信道容量上界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-5-4-5-互信息的凸性与信道容量上界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4) 成立，固定信道 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W(y|x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 在单纯形上变动，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\mapsto I(X;Y)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 是凹函数，即对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1,p_2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I\\big((1-t)p_1+tp_2;\\,W\\big)\\ge (1-t)I(p_1;W)+tI(p_2;W).$$</div>\n由此，信道容量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=\\sup_{p(x)}I(X;Y)$</span> 在单纯形紧集上由某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star$</span> 达到（有限字母表情形）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=(1-t)p_1+tp_2$</span>。互信息可写为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(p;W)=\\sum_{x,y}p(x)W(y|x)\\log\\frac{W(y|x)}{p(y)},\\qquad p(y)=\\sum_x p(x)W(y|x).$$</div>\n关键观察：对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的线性函数；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\mapsto\\sum_y p(y)\\log p(y)$</span> 是凸函数（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\log u$</span> 的凸性逐点求和保持凸性）。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 改写为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(p;W)=\\sum_{x,y}p(x)W(y|x)\\log W(y|x)-\\sum_y p(y)\\log p(y).$$</div>\n第一项关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 是线性的（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 固定），第二项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_y p(y)\\log p(y)$</span>，即负的凸函数，故为凹函数。线性项加凹项仍为凹。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(p_t;W)\\ge(1-t)I(p_1;W)+tI(p_2;W)$</span>。容量上界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(p;W)\\le H(Y)\\le\\log|Y|&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 在紧单纯形上凹，凹函数在紧集上的上确界由某点达到（凹函数最大值可在内部或边界，但上确界可达，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 上半连续且单纯形紧）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>：凹性说明“混合两个输入分布不会降低互信息”，这与 KL 散度关于第二参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的凸性方向相反（<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 凸、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 凸；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 关于输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 凹）。此区别在变分推断中至关重要：ELBO 关于变分分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 是凹的（最大化），而 KL 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 是凸的（最小化），二者对偶。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-5-4-6-Fano-不等式-互信息下界误差概率\">命题 5.4.6（Fano 不等式：互信息下界误差概率）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-5-4-6-Fano-不等式-互信息下界误差概率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 取值于有限集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=M$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 为任意观测，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat X=\\hat X(Y)$</span> 为任意估计器（可测函数），误差概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_e=\\Pr(\\hat X\\neq X)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X|Y)\\le h_2(P_e)+P_e\\log(M-1),$$</div>\n从而\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y)=H(X)-H(X|Y)\\ge H(X)-h_2(P_e)-P_e\\log(M-1).$$</div>\n特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 均匀，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)\\ge \\log M-h_2(P_e)-P_e\\log(M-1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E=\\mathbb 1\\{\\hat X\\neq X\\}$</span>。由条件熵链式法则（第 2 节），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X|Y)=H(X,E|Y)=H(E|Y)+H(X|E,Y).$$</div>\n第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(E|Y)\\le H(E)=h_2(P_e)$</span>（条件降低熵）。第二项按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E$</span> 分解：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X|E,Y)=(1-P_e)H(X|E=0,Y)+P_e H(X|E=1,Y).$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X=\\hat X(Y)$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 确定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X|E=0,Y)=0$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\neq\\hat X(Y)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X\\setminus\\{\\hat X(Y)\\}$</span>，该集合大小至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M-1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X|E=1,Y)\\le\\log(M-1)$</span>。合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X|Y)\\le h_2(P_e)+P_e\\log(M-1)$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=H(X)-H(X|Y)$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>可检验推论</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_e=\\epsilon$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)\\ge 1-h_2(\\epsilon)$</span>（均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>）。这与二元对称信道的等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=1-h_2(\\epsilon)$</span> 一致，说明 Fano 界在该情形下紧。对一般信道，Fano 给出的是下界而非等式，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X|E=1,Y)$</span> 未必达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(M-1)$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-5-4-7-互信息的变分表示-与-Donsker-Varadhan-的接口\">命题 5.4.7（互信息的变分表示：与 Donsker–Varadhan 的接口）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-5-4-7-互信息的变分表示-与-Donsker-Varadhan-的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：互信息有变分表示\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y)=\\sup_{f}\\Big\\{\\mathbb E_{p(x,y)}[f(x,y)]-\\log\\mathbb E_{p(x)p(y)}[e^{f(x,y)}]\\Big\\},$$</div>\n上确界取遍所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-可积实值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，且最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star(x,y)=\\log\\frac{p(x,y)}{p(x)p(y)}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)$</span>-几乎处处，相差常数）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：命题 5.4.4 已证对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I\\ge \\mathbb E_p[f]-\\log\\mathbb E_q[e^f]$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I\\ge\\sup_f\\{\\cdots\\}$</span>。反向：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star=\\log(p/q)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[e^{f^\\star}]=\\sum_{x,y}q(x,y)\\frac{p(x,y)}{q(x,y)}=\\sum_{x,y}p(x,y)=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathbb E_q[e^{f^\\star}]=0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[f^\\star]=I$</span>。于是上确界至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span>，结合前不等式得等号。最优性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 达到上确界，则命题 5.4.4 的等号条件给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=f^\\star+c$</span>，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 不影响泛函值（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[c]=c$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\mathbb E_q[e^{f^\\star+c}]=c$</span> 相消）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与第 6 节的接口</strong>：此表示是 Donsker–Varadhan 变分公式在有限集上的离散版本；第 6 节将其推广到一般测度空间，需额外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^f$</span> 的可积性。本节只用到有限求和，无需 Radon–Nikodym 导数的一般理论。该表示也是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-GAN 与互信息神经估计（MINE 类方法）的数学基础，但本书不展开算法细节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-5-4-8-强数据处理不等式-条件互信息的单调性\">命题 5.4.8（强数据处理不等式：条件互信息的单调性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-5-4-8-强数据处理不等式-条件互信息的单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 为马尔可夫链，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y|Z)&lt;\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z|Y)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：对任意辅助变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\to X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 马尔可夫（即给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Y,Z)$</span> 条件独立），有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Z|U)\\le I(X;Y|U).$$</div>\n此即强数据处理不等式（strong data processing inequality, SDPI）的条件版本。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span>，条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y,z|u)=p(x|u)W(y|x)V(z|y)$</span> 仍构成马尔可夫链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W,V$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\to X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y,z|x,u)=p(y,z|x)$</span>）。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 应用命题 5.4.3 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z|U=u)\\le I(X;Y|U=u)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(u)$</span> 取期望：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p(u)}I(X;Z|U=u)=I(X;Z|U)\\le\\mathbb E_{p(u)}I(X;Y|U=u)=I(X;Y|U)$</span>。期望保持不等式方向，无需额外可积性假设（非负项，单调收敛定理适用）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：此处对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 取期望时用了单调收敛定理（非负项求和可交换），而非 Dominated Convergence；因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z|U=u)\\ge 0$</span> 且求和绝对收敛由 (A1)(A2) 保证。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 取值可数无限，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z|U)&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证期望有限，这正是假设所列。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-推论-5-4-9-互信息的次可加性与条件版本的差别\">推论 5.4.9（互信息的次可加性与条件版本的差别）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-推论-5-4-9-互信息的次可加性与条件版本的差别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_1,X_2,Y)$</span> 联合分布支撑一致，各熵有限。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X_1,X_2;Y)\\le I(X_1;Y)+I(X_2;Y),$$</div>\n等号成立当且仅当给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_2$</span> 条件独立（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X_1;X_2|Y)=0$</span>）。对条件互信息，类似地\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X_1,X_2;Y|Z)\\le I(X_1;Y|Z)+I(X_2;Y|Z).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由链式法则（推论 5.4.2），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X_1,X_2;Y)=I(X_1;Y)+I(X_2;Y|X_1).$$</div>\n由 SDPI 的条件版本（命题 5.4.8），取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U=X_1$</span>、链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_2\\to(X_1,Y)\\to Y$</span> 不成立；改用另一路径：注意到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X_2;Y|X_1)\\le I(X_2;Y)$</span> 由数据处理不等式应用于马尔可夫链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_2\\to Y\\to(X_1,Y)$</span> 的逆？此路径不合法。正确做法：直接展开\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X_1,X_2;Y)-I(X_1;Y)-I(X_2;Y)=-I(X_1;X_2)+I(X_1;X_2|Y).$$</div>\n由链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X_1;X_2,Y)=I(X_1;X_2)+I(X_1;Y|X_2)=I(X_1;Y)+I(X_1;X_2|Y)$</span>，移项即得上式。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X_1;X_2|Y)\\ge 0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X_1;X_2)\\ge 0$</span> 不能直接得次可加性；需注意差值符号。实际上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X_1,X_2;Y)\\le I(X_1;Y)+I(X_2;Y)$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X_1;X_2|Y)\\le I(X_1;X_2)$</span>，这正是 SDPI 应用于马尔可夫链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\to(X_1,X_2)\\to Y$</span> 的某种形式，但更直接的证明是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X_1,X_2;Y)=H(Y)-H(Y|X_1,X_2)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y|X_1,X_2)\\le H(Y|X_i)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,2$</span> 成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X_1,X_2;Y)\\le H(Y)-H(Y|X_1)=I(X_1;Y)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le I(X_2;Y)$</span>，但这只给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\min$</span>，不足以给和。正确的次可加性证明用 KL 的联合凸性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_1,x_2,y)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_1)p(x_2)p(y)$</span> 的 KL 不超过两个边缘 KL 之和，由 KL 链式法则展开即得。等号条件由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X_1;X_2|Y)=I(X_1;X_2)$</span> 推出，即给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,X_2$</span> 的依赖结构，等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X_1;X_2|Y)=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X_1;X_2)=0$</span> 同时成立？此处需谨慎：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X_1;X_2|Y)\\le I(X_1;X_2)$</span> 由 SDPI（链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\to(X_1,X_2)\\to Y$</span> 不适用），实际等号条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X_1;X_2|Y)=I(X_1;X_2)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 不提供关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,X_2$</span> 依赖的额外信息。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>说明</strong>：上述推导中，次可加性的严格证明依赖 KL 散度关于联合分布的链式展开，完整步骤为：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1,x_2,y)=p(x_1)p(x_2)p(y)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=I(X_1,X_2;Y)$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的边缘匹配时；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x_1,y)\\|p(x_1)p(y))+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x_2,y)\\|p(x_2)p(y))=I(X_1;Y)+I(X_2;Y)$</span>。由 KL 的链式法则与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X_1;X_2|Y)\\ge 0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X_1,X_2;Y)=I(X_1;Y)+I(X_2;Y)-I(X_1;X_2)+I(X_1;X_2|Y)\\le I(X_1;Y)+I(X_2;Y)$</span> 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X_1;X_2|Y)\\le I(X_1;X_2)$</span>，此即 SDPI 在链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\to(X_1,X_2)\\to Y$</span> 上的应用不直接成立；正确路径是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1\\to X_2\\to Y$</span> 不成立。故次可加性的一般证明应直接用 KL 凸性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x_1,x_2,y)\\|p(x_1)p(x_2)p(y))\\le D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x_1,y)\\|p(x_1)p(y))+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x_2,y)\\|p(x_2)p(y))$</span>，此不等式由 KL 的联合凸性与边缘化收缩（data processing）得到，是 KL 凸性的直接推论。等号条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_1,x_2|y)=p(x_1|y)p(x_2|y)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 成立，即给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 后条件独立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-5-4-10-互信息与-KL-的联合凸性-误差度量的稳定性\">命题 5.4.10（互信息与 KL 的联合凸性：误差度量的稳定性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-5-4-10-互信息与-KL-的联合凸性-误差度量的稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3) 成立，两对联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1(x,y),p_2(x,y)$</span> 支撑一致，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=(1-t)p_1+tp_2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(p_t;X,Y)\\le(1-t)I(p_1;X,Y)+tI(p_2;X,Y)$</span>，即互信息关于联合分布是凸的（注意与命题 5.4.5 关于输入边缘的凹性方向相反，因固定的是联合而非信道）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(p;X,Y)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|p(x)p(y))$</span>。KL 散度关于第一参数是凸的（第 3 节已证），但第二参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)p(y)$</span> 也随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 变化，不是固定分布。需用联合凸性：定义映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(p)=p(x,y)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi(p)=p(x)p(y)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\Phi(p)\\|\\Psi(p))$</span>。KL 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Phi,\\Psi)$</span> 联合凸（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\log(u/v)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u,v)$</span> 的联合凸性，逐点求和保持），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 线性、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的二次函数（非凸非凹），故不能直接套用。正确路径：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)+H(Y)-H(X,Y)$</span>，三项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X),H(Y)$</span> 关于边缘线性（因边缘是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的线性函数，熵是凹的，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-H$</span> 凸），<span class=\"math-inline\">$-H(X,Y)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 凸（<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 凹），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 是三个凸函数之和？<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 是凹的，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-H(X)$</span> 凸；同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-H(Y)$</span> 凸；<span class=\"math-inline\">$-H(X,Y)$</span> 凸。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=-H(X)-H(Y)+H(X,Y)$</span> 是凸+凸+凹，符号不定。实际上互信息关于联合分布是凸的，证明用 KL 联合凸性：对任意固定参考分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 凸；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p_t(x)p_t(y)$</span> 不是固定。改用信息不等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(p_t)\\le(1-t)I(p_1)+tI(p_2)$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_t)\\ge(1-t)H(p_1)+tH(p_2)$</span> 加上边缘项，而熵关于联合分布是凹的（标准事实，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\log u$</span> 凹性逐点求和），边缘熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 线性（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 线性），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)$</span> 线性、<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y)$</span> 线性、<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X,Y)$</span> 凹，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=H(X)+H(Y)-H(X,Y)$</span> 是线性+线性-凹=凸。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与命题 5.4.5 的对比</strong>：命题 5.4.5 固定信道 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span>、变动输入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 凹；命题 5.4.10 变动联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 凸。二者不矛盾：变动的是不同对象。这一区别在变分推断中体现为 ELBO 关于变分分布凹（对应命题 5.4.5 的输入变动）与 KL 关于联合分布凸（对应命题 5.4.10）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-5-4-11-互信息的连续性模与误差传播\">命题 5.4.11（互信息的连续性模与误差传播）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-5-4-11-互信息的连续性模与误差传播\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|,|\\mathcal Y|&lt;\\infty$</span>，两联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 支撑一致，总变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p-q\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}=\\frac12\\sum_{x,y}|p(x,y)-q(x,y)|\\le\\delta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|I(p;X,Y)-I(q;X,Y)|\\le 2\\delta\\log\\frac{|\\mathcal X||\\mathcal Y|}{\\delta}$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=0$</span> 时差为零）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 KL 关于第一参数的连续性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p-q\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}\\le\\delta$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 支撑一致，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|r)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|r)|\\le\\delta\\log(1/\\delta)+\\delta\\log(\\sup r/\\inf r)$</span> 类界。此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=p(x)p(y)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 变，需先证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的连续性。用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=H(X)+H(Y)-H(X,Y)$</span> 与熵的连续性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|H(p)-H(q)|\\le\\delta\\log(|\\mathcal X||\\mathcal Y|/\\delta)$</span>（标准界，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|u\\log u-v\\log v|\\le|u-v|\\log(1/|u-v|)+|u-v|\\log N$</span> 逐点求和）。边缘熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X)$</span> 的连续性同理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X,Y)$</span> 用联合字母表大小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X||\\mathcal Y|$</span>。合并三项得所述界（常数因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 来自三项的三角不等式与边缘字母表较小）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>可检验推论</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\to 0$</span> 时界趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\log(1/\\delta)\\to 0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 关于联合分布连续。此连续性保证第 8 节熵估计的偏差分析中，经验分布对真实分布的微小扰动不会导致互信息估计的剧烈跳变；但注意界中含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/\\delta)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 极小时收敛慢，这是高维离散分布互信息估计困难的数学根源。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>互信息定义为联合分布与乘积分布的 KL 散度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|p(x)p(y))$</span>，由 Gibbs 不等式得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I\\ge 0$</span>，等号当且仅当独立；它与熵的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=H(X)+H(Y)-H(X,Y)$</span> 由链式法则导出。</li>\n<li>条件互信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y|Z)$</span> 非负，且满足链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y,Z)=I(X;Z)+I(X;Y|Z)$</span>；马尔可夫链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z|Y)=0$</span>。</li>\n<li>数据处理不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z)\\le I(X;Y)$</span> 对马尔可夫链成立，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\to Z\\to Y$</span> 亦马尔可夫；该不等式是全书误差度量语言的核心工具，后续交叉熵、变分表示与熵率节均以其为接口。</li>\n<li>互信息关于输入边缘（固定信道）是凹的，关于联合分布是凸的；两个方向分别对应信道容量上界与变分推断的 ELBO 凹性，不可混用。</li>\n<li>Fano 不等式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)\\ge H(X)-h_2(P_e)-P_e\\log(M-1)$</span>，将互信息与估计误差概率定量联系；在二元对称信道下该界紧。</li>\n<li>互信息的变分表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=\\sup_f\\{\\mathbb E_p[f]-\\log\\mathbb E_q[e^f]\\}$</span> 是 Donsker–Varadhan 公式的离散特例，最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star=\\log(p/q)$</span>；强数据处理不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Z|U)\\le I(X;Y|U)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U\\to X\\to Y\\to Z$</span> 马尔可夫链成立，是误差度量沿马尔可夫链单调传播的保证。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar05--h-交叉熵与最大似然的关系\">交叉熵与最大似然的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-交叉熵与最大似然的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为概率分布，离散情形记在可数集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上，连续情形记在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上并配 Lebesgue 测度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 为熵（连续情形为微分熵），<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span> 为 KL 散度。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>交叉熵</strong>：对离散分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,q)=-\\sum_{x}p(x)\\log q(x)$</span>；对连续情形，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(p,q)=-\\int p(x)\\log q(x)\\,\\mathrm dx$</span>。约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,q)=+\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>参数化模型</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta\\subseteq\\mathbb R^m$</span> 为参数空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{q_\\theta:\\theta\\in\\Theta\\}$</span> 为一族概率分布（离散时为概率质量函数，连续时为密度）。</li>\n<li><strong>经验分布</strong>：给定观测样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{1:n}=(x_1,\\dots,x_n)$</span>，定义经验分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n\\delta_{x_i}$</span>（离散情形即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n(x)=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n\\mathbf 1\\{x_i=x\\}$</span>）。</li>\n<li><strong>对数似然</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_n(\\theta)=\\sum_{i=1}^n\\log q_\\theta(x_i)$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设统一列于此，各命题再单独声明其所需子集。</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 支撑条件</strong>：对离散情形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{supp}(q)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立；连续情形要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 绝对连续），从而 Radon–Nikodym 导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dp/\\mathrm dq$</span> 存在。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,q)&lt;\\infty$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p}[|\\log q(X)|]&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 模型可微性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 为开集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto q_\\theta(x)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微，且存在可测函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\nabla_\\theta\\log q_\\theta(x)|\\le g(x)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 在紧邻域内一致成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p}[g(X)]&lt;\\infty$</span>（用于 Leibniz 法则交换梯度与积分）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 样本独立性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1,\\dots,x_n$</span> 为独立同分布样本，共同分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\ast$</span>（真实分布）。</p>\n<p>注意 (A1) 与 (A2) 是交叉熵有限的前提；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的正测度集上取零，(A2) 失效，交叉熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，此时 KL 亦为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，Gibbs 不等式仍以“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty\\ge 0$</span>”的扩展实数意义成立，但最大似然估计的渐近理论需另行处理（见反例节）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-交叉熵的定义及其与熵-KL-的恒等关系\">交叉熵的定义及其与熵、KL 的恒等关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-交叉熵的定义及其与熵-KL-的恒等关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 5.5.1（交叉熵）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为可数集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的概率质量函数，且 (A1)(A2) 成立。定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p,q)=-\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal X}p(x)\\log q(x).$$</div>\n<p>连续情形下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的概率密度且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h(p,q)=-\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}p(x)\\log q(x)\\,\\mathrm dx.$$</div>\n<p>交叉熵与熵的区别在于：熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 只用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 自身，度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的内在不确定性；交叉熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,q)$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 作期望、用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 作“编码分布”，度量“用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 编码来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的数据”的平均代价。它与 KL 散度的关系是本节全部推导的起点。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.5.2（交叉熵分解）</strong> 设 (A1)(A2) 成立。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p,q)=H(p)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sum_x p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}$</span>（连续情形为积分）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 离散情形逐项计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p,q)=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log q(x)\n=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)+\\sum_x p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}\n=H(p)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q).$$</div>\n<p>第一个等号是定义；第二个等号在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 处用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q=\\log p-\\log(p/q)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span> 处两项均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（由约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span> 及 (A1) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\log(p/q)=0$</span>）；第三个等号是熵与 KL 的定义。连续情形将求和换为积分，步骤相同，绝对连续性 (A1) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p/q)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 处有定义且可积（由 (A2) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)&lt;\\infty$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5.5.2 表明：<strong>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 固定时，最小化交叉熵等价于最小化 KL 散度</strong>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 无关。这是交叉熵作为损失函数的理论根据，下一小节把它接到最大似然上。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-最大似然的经验交叉熵表示\">最大似然的经验交叉熵表示<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-最大似然的经验交叉熵表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.5.3（负对数似然即经验交叉熵）</strong> 设 (A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 为离散模型且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有观测到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_i$</span> 成立。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac1n\\ell_n(\\theta)=H(\\hat p_n,q_\\theta),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span> 为经验分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\hat p_n,q_\\theta)$</span> 为定义 5.5.1 的交叉熵。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由经验分布的定义，对任意函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_x \\hat p_n(x)f(x)=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n f(x_i).$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=-\\log q_\\theta(x)$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(\\hat p_n,q_\\theta)=-\\sum_x\\hat p_n(x)\\log q_\\theta(x)\n=-\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n\\log q_\\theta(x_i)\n=-\\frac1n\\ell_n(\\theta).$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5.5.3 是本节的核心恒等式：<strong>最大似然估计就是最小化经验交叉熵</strong>。它把统计推断问题翻译成信息论语言，从而使 KL 的非负性、链式法则、数据处理不等式等工具可直接用于分析 MLE。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.5.4（MLE 的 KL 形式）</strong> 在命题 5.5.3 的假设下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n\\in\\arg\\max_\\theta\\ell_n(\\theta)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\theta_n\\in\\arg\\min_{\\theta\\in\\Theta}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 5.5.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\hat p_n,q_\\theta)=H(\\hat p_n)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\hat p_n)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。由命题 5.5.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac1n\\ell_n(\\theta)=H(\\hat p_n)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta)$</span>。于是最大化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_n$</span> 等价于最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意推论 5.5.4 中的 KL 是<strong>经验分布到模型</strong>的方向，而非模型到经验分布。这一方向选择不是任意的：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span> 的支撑上取值，若某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_i$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta(x_i)=0$</span> 则 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，这正是 MLE 对零概率赋值的惩罚机制。反向的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_\\theta\\|\\hat p_n)$</span> 则会对模型在未观测点上的质量赋值施加惩罚，二者在有限样本下行为不同，这一区别在第 10 节的反例中会具体呈现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-总体交叉熵-KL-与-MLE-的一致性\">总体交叉熵、KL 与 MLE 的一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-总体交叉熵-KL-与-MLE-的一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.5.5（期望交叉熵的分解）</strong> 设 (A1)(A2)(A4) 成立，真实分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\ast$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 满足 (A1) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\ast$</span> 成立。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p^\\ast}[-\\log q_\\theta(X)]=H(p^\\ast)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\ast\\|q_\\theta).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 5.5.2 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=p^\\ast$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=q_\\theta$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p^\\ast,q_\\theta)=H(p^\\ast)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\ast\\|q_\\theta)$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p^\\ast,q_\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{p^\\ast}[-\\log q_\\theta(X)]$</span> 是定义 5.5.1 的直接改写。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5.5.5 说明：<strong>总体意义上，最小化期望交叉熵等价于最小化真实分布到模型的 KL 散度</strong>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p^\\ast)$</span> 是常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\min_\\theta\\mathbb E_{p^\\ast}[-\\log q_\\theta(X)]=\\arg\\min_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\ast\\|q_\\theta)$</span>。当模型族包含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\ast$</span> 时，最小值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta=p^\\ast$</span> 处取到且 KL 为零（由前序节的 Gibbs 不等式等号条件）。这给出了 MLE 一致性的信息论表述：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n\\to p^\\ast$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_n$</span> 的极大化子收敛，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n$</span> 收敛到最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\ast\\|q_\\theta)$</span> 的参数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.5.6（交叉熵的样本偏差恒等式）</strong> 设 (A2)(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\ast}[|\\log q_\\theta(X)|]&lt;\\infty$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p^\\ast}\\!\\left[-\\frac1n\\ell_n(\\theta)\\right]=H(p^\\ast,q_\\theta),$$</div>\n<p>且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}_{p^\\ast}\\!\\left(-\\frac1n\\ell_n(\\theta)\\right)=\\frac1n\\mathrm{Var}_{p^\\ast}\\!\\left(\\log q_\\theta(X)\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一个等式：由 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[-\\frac1n\\ell_n(\\theta)]=\\mathbb E[-\\log q_\\theta(X_1)]=H(p^\\ast,q_\\theta)$</span>，最后一步是定义 5.5.1。第二个等式：由独立性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac1n\\ell_n(\\theta)=\\frac1n\\sum_i(-\\log q_\\theta(X_i))$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个独立同分布随机变量的平均，方差为单变量方差除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5.5.6 给出一个可检验的恒等式：经验交叉熵是总体交叉熵的无偏估计，其方差以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/n$</span> 衰减。这解释了为什么以交叉熵为损失的训练在样本量增大时稳定，但也提示有限样本下经验交叉熵的随机波动会直接传入参数估计（熵的估计偏差在第 8 节展开）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-梯度等价性与一个具体例子\">梯度等价性与一个具体例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-梯度等价性与一个具体例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.5.7（交叉熵梯度与 KL 梯度的一致性）</strong> 设 (A1)(A2)(A3)(A4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\ast}[\\nabla_\\theta\\log q_\\theta(X)]$</span> 存在。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta H(\\hat p_n,q_\\theta)=\\nabla_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta),$$</div>\n<p>且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E_{p^\\ast}[-\\log q_\\theta(X)]=\\nabla_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\ast\\|q_\\theta).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 5.5.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\hat p_n,q_\\theta)=H(\\hat p_n)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta)$</span>，右端第一项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故两边梯度相等。第二个等式同理，用命题 5.5.5。这里不需要交换极限与梯度，因为等式是逐点成立的恒等式，两边同时求梯度即可；(A3) 保证梯度本身存在且可积。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5.5.7 排除了一个常见混淆：<strong>交叉熵与 KL 的梯度相等，但函数值不相等</strong>（相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\hat p_n)$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p^\\ast)$</span>）。因此“最小化交叉熵”与“最小化 KL”在优化轨迹上完全一致，但报告的损失数值不可直接比较。这也说明不能把“目标值相等”误当作“梯度相等”的逆命题：梯度相等是恒等式的结果，而目标值相差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数。</p>\n<p><strong>例 5.5.8（伯努利模型的显式计算）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{0,1\\}$</span>，真实分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\ast(1)=\\mu$</span>，模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta(1)=\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in(0,1)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个独立样本，经验分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n(1)=\\bar x$</span>。</p>\n<p>计算熵与交叉熵：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(\\hat p_n)=-\\bar x\\log\\bar x-(1-\\bar x)\\log(1-\\bar x),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(\\hat p_n,q_\\theta)=-\\bar x\\log\\theta-(1-\\bar x)\\log(1-\\theta).$$</div>\n<p>KL 散度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta)=\\bar x\\log\\frac{\\bar x}{\\theta}+(1-\\bar x)\\log\\frac{1-\\bar x}{1-\\theta}.$$</div>\n<p>验证命题 5.5.2：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\hat p_n,q_\\theta)-H(\\hat p_n)=\\bar x\\log(\\bar x/\\theta)+(1-\\bar x)\\log((1-\\bar x)/(1-\\theta))=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta)$</span>，逐项相消成立。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\theta}H(\\hat p_n,q_\\theta)=-\\frac{\\bar x}{\\theta}+\\frac{1-\\bar x}{1-\\theta},$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\theta}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta)=-\\frac{\\bar x}{\\theta}+\\frac{1-\\bar x}{1-\\theta}.$$</div>\n<p>两者相等，验证命题 5.5.7。令梯度为零得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n=\\bar x$</span>，即 MLE 为样本均值，与命题 5.5.4 一致。再验证命题 5.5.6：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\ast}[-\\log q_\\theta(X)]=-\\mu\\log\\theta-(1-\\mu)\\log(1-\\theta)=H(p^\\ast)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\ast\\|q_\\theta)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p^\\ast)=-\\mu\\log\\mu-(1-\\mu)\\log(1-\\mu)$</span>，直接展开即得。</p>\n<p>这个例子还暴露一个边界情形：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar x=0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar x=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\hat p_n)=0$</span>，交叉熵退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log(1-\\theta)$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log\\theta$</span>，KL 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\to 0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\to 1$</span> 时发散。此时 MLE 落在参数空间边界，命题 5.5.7 的梯度在边界处不存在，需将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 取为闭区间并在边界用次梯度语言处理；这属于第 10 节反例节的边界情形，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-与序列模型接口的一个注记\">与序列模型接口的一个注记<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-与序列模型接口的一个注记\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节只处理独立同分布样本。在自回归生成中，样本是序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{1:T}$</span>，模型为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta(x_{1:T})=\\prod_{t=1}^T q_\\theta(x_t\\mid x_{&lt;t})$</span>。此时命题 5.5.3 逐字成立，只需把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_i$</span> 替换为整条序列、把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta(x_i)$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta(x_{1:T}^{(i)})$</span>；命题 5.5.2 中的 KL 则为序列分布之间的 KL。序列情形的 KL 可按本章第 2 节的链式法则分解为各步条件 KL 之和，从而把序列级交叉熵损失分解为逐 token 的交叉熵之和。这一分解的精确形式与条件期望的交换次序在第 15 节“与最大似然章的接口”中给出，本节不重复。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>交叉熵满足恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,q)=H(p)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span>（命题 5.5.2），因此在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 固定时最小化交叉熵与最小化 KL 完全等价；这是交叉熵作为损失函数的理论根据。</li>\n<li>负对数似然恰为经验交叉熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac1n\\ell_n(\\theta)=H(\\hat p_n,q_\\theta)$</span>（命题 5.5.3），故 MLE 等价于最小化经验 KL <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta)$</span>（推论 5.5.4）；总体层面则等价于最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\ast\\|q_\\theta)$</span>（命题 5.5.5）。</li>\n<li>交叉熵与 KL 对参数的梯度逐点相等（命题 5.5.7），但函数值相差一个与参数无关的熵常数；经验交叉熵是总体交叉熵的无偏估计，方差以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/n$</span> 衰减（命题 5.5.6），有限样本的波动通过该恒等式直接传入参数估计。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef entropy(p):\n    p = np.asarray(p, dtype=float)\n    mask = p &gt; 0\n    return -np.sum(p[mask] * np.log(p[mask]))\n\ndef cross_entropy(p, q):\n    p = np.asarray(p, dtype=float)\n    q = np.asarray(q, dtype=float)\n    assert np.all(p &gt;= 0) and np.all(q &gt;= 0)\n    assert abs(p.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-9 and abs(q.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-9\n    mask = p &gt; 0\n    if np.any(q[mask] &lt;= 0):\n        return np.inf\n    return -np.sum(p[mask] * np.log(q[mask]))\n\ndef kl(p, q):\n    p = np.asarray(p, dtype=float)\n    q = np.asarray(q, dtype=float)\n    mask = p &gt; 0\n    if np.any(q[mask] &lt;= 0):\n        return np.inf\n    return np.sum(p[mask] * np.log(p[mask] / q[mask]))\n\n# 例 5.5.8 的数值验证\np_hat = np.array([0.3, 0.7])\nq_theta = np.array([0.4, 0.6])\n\nH_p = entropy(p_hat)\nH_pq = cross_entropy(p_hat, q_theta)\nD_kl = kl(p_hat, q_theta)\n\nprint(&quot;H(p_hat) =&quot;, H_p)\nprint(&quot;H(p_hat, q_theta) =&quot;, H_pq)\nprint(&quot;D_KL(p_hat || q_theta) =&quot;, D_kl)\n\n# 命题 5.5.2：H(p,q) = H(p) + KL(p||q)\nassert np.isclose(H_pq, H_p + D_kl), &quot;命题 5.5.2 失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;命题 5.5.2 验证通过: H(p,q) == H(p) + KL(p||q)&quot;)\n\n# 命题 5.5.3：负对数似然 = 经验交叉熵\nsamples = np.array([1, 1, 0])  # 经验分布 p_hat = [1/3, 2/3]\np_hat_n = np.array([1/3, 2/3])\nq = np.array([0.4, 0.6])\nnll = -np.mean(np.log(q[samples]))\nce = cross_entropy(p_hat_n, q)\nprint(&quot;负对数似然 =&quot;, nll)\nprint(&quot;经验交叉熵 =&quot;, ce)\nassert np.isclose(nll, ce), &quot;命题 5.5.3 失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;命题 5.5.3 验证通过: -mean(log q(x_i)) == H(p_hat_n, q)&quot;)\n\n# 命题 5.5.7：梯度相等（数值差分）\neps = 1e-6\ntheta0, theta1 = 0.4, 0.6\nq_plus = np.array([theta0 + eps, theta1 - eps])\nq_minus = np.array([theta0 - eps, theta1 + eps])\ngrad_ce = (cross_entropy(p_hat, q_plus) - cross_entropy(p_hat, q_minus)) / (2 * eps)\ngrad_kl = (kl(p_hat, q_plus) - kl(p_hat, q_minus)) / (2 * eps)\nprint(&quot;数值梯度 dH/dtheta =&quot;, grad_ce)\nprint(&quot;数值梯度 dKL/dtheta =&quot;, grad_kl)\nassert np.isclose(grad_ce, grad_kl, atol=1e-4), &quot;命题 5.5.7 失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;命题 5.5.7 验证通过: 交叉熵与 KL 的梯度相等&quot;)\n\n# 命题 5.5.6：经验交叉熵的期望等于总体交叉熵（蒙特卡洛）\nmu = 0.3\ntheta = 0.5\np_star = np.array([1 - mu, mu])\nq_model = np.array([1 - theta, theta])\nn_samples, n_trials = 50, 20000\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nce_samples = []\nfor _ in range(n_trials):\n    xs = rng.random(n_samples) &lt; mu  # True 表示取 1\n    p_hat_mc = np.array([1 - xs.mean(), xs.mean()])\n    ce_samples.append(cross_entropy(p_hat_mc, q_model))\nce_samples = np.array(ce_samples)\nexpected_ce = cross_entropy(p_star, q_model)\nprint(&quot;蒙特卡洛均值 =&quot;, ce_samples.mean())\nprint(&quot;总体交叉熵 =&quot;, expected_ce)\nassert abs(ce_samples.mean() - expected_ce) &lt; 0.01, &quot;命题 5.5.6 失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;命题 5.5.6 验证通过: E[H(p_hat_n, q)] == H(p*, q)&quot;)\nprint(&quot;样本形状:&quot;, ce_samples.shape, &quot;预期结果: 均值接近总体交叉熵，方差约 1/n&quot;)\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-交叉熵损失与-KL-的有限样本偏差\">交叉熵损失与 KL 的有限样本偏差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-交叉熵损失与-KL-的有限样本偏差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 5.5.6 给出了经验交叉熵的无偏性，但无偏性只保证一阶矩相等，不保证逐样本的损失值接近总体值。在优化中真正被最小化的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\hat p_n,q_\\theta)$</span>，而它随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 变化的部分才是驱动参数更新的信号。下面的命题把这一信号精确分解为总体 KL 加一个样本噪声项，从而说明为什么有限样本下的 MLE 与总体最优参数之间存在系统性偏差。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.5.9（经验 KL 的偏差分解）</strong> 设 (A1)(A2)(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 有限或紧，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\ast}[(\\log q_\\theta(X))^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\ast\\|q_\\theta)+\\Delta_n(\\theta),$$</div>\n<p>其中</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_n(\\theta)=\\sum_x(\\hat p_n(x)-p^\\ast(x))\\log\\frac{p^\\ast(x)}{q_\\theta(x)}\n+\\sum_x\\hat p_n(x)\\log\\frac{\\hat p_n(x)}{p^\\ast(x)}.$$</div>\n<p>并且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\ast}[\\Delta_n(\\theta)]=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|p^\\ast)\\ge 0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\ast(x)&gt;0$</span> 处，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\hat p_n(x)/q_\\theta(x))$</span> 拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\hat p_n(x)/p^\\ast(x))+\\log(p^\\ast(x)/q_\\theta(x))$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n(x)$</span> 后对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta)\n=\\sum_x\\hat p_n(x)\\log\\frac{\\hat p_n(x)}{p^\\ast(x)}\n+\\sum_x\\hat p_n(x)\\log\\frac{p^\\ast(x)}{q_\\theta(x)}.$$</div>\n<p>第二项再拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p^\\ast(x)\\log(p^\\ast(x)/q_\\theta(x))+\\sum_x(\\hat p_n(x)-p^\\ast(x))\\log(p^\\ast(x)/q_\\theta(x))$</span>，第一项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\ast\\|q_\\theta)$</span>，第二项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_n$</span> 的第一部分，加上第一行即得分解式。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_n$</span> 取期望：第一部分的期望为零，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat p_n(x)]=p^\\ast(x)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p^\\ast/q_\\theta)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span> 的随机性无关（(A2) 保证其可积）；第二部分的期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|p^\\ast)]$</span>，由 Gibbs 不等式逐点非负。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5.5.9 的关键在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\Delta_n(\\theta)]=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|p^\\ast)$</span> <strong>与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关</strong>（它是经验分布到真实分布的 KL，只依赖样本），因此经验 KL 的期望作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的函数等于总体 KL 加上一个常数。这意味着<strong>最小化经验 KL 的期望与最小化总体 KL 给出相同的参数</strong>，偏差不改变最优点的位置，只改变损失曲面的整体高度。但逐样本的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_n(\\theta)$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，其随机波动会使有限样本的极小化子偏离总体极小化子，偏离幅度由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_n$</span> 的梯度方差控制。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.5.10（MLE 偏差的一阶刻画）</strong> 设命题 5.5.9 的假设成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\ast=\\arg\\min_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\ast\\|q_\\theta)$</span> 为内点且 Hessian <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\ast\\|q_{\\theta^\\ast})$</span> 正定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n$</span> 为经验 KL 的内点极小化子。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\Delta_n(\\theta^\\ast)\\|$</span> 充分小时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\theta_n-\\theta^\\ast\\approx-\\big(\\nabla^2_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\ast\\|q_{\\theta^\\ast})\\big)^{-1}\\nabla_\\theta\\Delta_n(\\theta^\\ast).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\ast$</span> 处对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta)$</span> 作一阶展开。由命题 5.5.9，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta)=\\nabla_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\ast\\|q_\\theta)+\\nabla_\\theta\\Delta_n(\\theta)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\ast$</span> 处第一项为零（内点极小化条件），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_{\\theta^\\ast})=\\nabla_\\theta\\Delta_n(\\theta^\\ast)$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_{\\hat\\theta_n})=0$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\ast$</span> 处展开该梯度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$0=\\nabla_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_{\\theta^\\ast})+\\nabla^2_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_{\\theta^\\ast})(\\hat\\theta_n-\\theta^\\ast)+o(\\|\\hat\\theta_n-\\theta^\\ast\\|).$$</div>\n<p>忽略高阶项并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_{\\theta^\\ast})\\approx\\nabla^2_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\ast\\|q_{\\theta^\\ast})$</span>（大数律），解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n-\\theta^\\ast$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 5.5.10 说明有限样本偏差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\Delta_n(\\theta^\\ast)$</span> 驱动，而后者是经验分布与真实分布之差的线性泛函，其量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-1/2})$</span>。这与经典 MLE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt n$</span> 渐近正态性一致，但此处给出了纯信息论的推导路径：偏差来自经验 KL 与总体 KL 之间的随机差，而非来自似然函数的特定形式。注意该推论是<strong>近似</strong>而非恒等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$o(\\cdot)$</span> 项未显式控制；严格的渐近正态性需要 (A3) 之外的一致可微性与 Fisher 信息非退化条件，本节不展开，留待第 15 节接口处处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-交叉熵作为-Proper-Scoring-Rule-的刻画\">交叉熵作为 Proper Scoring Rule 的刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-交叉熵作为-Proper-Scoring-Rule-的刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>交叉熵损失的一个常被引用但少被证明的性质是：它在期望意义下被真实分布唯一最小化。这一性质把交叉熵与一大类损失函数区分开，也是它作为概率预测评估标准的根据。下面的命题给出精确陈述与证明。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 5.5.11（Proper Scoring Rule）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上概率分布的凸集。函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S:\\mathcal P\\times\\mathcal X\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 称为 scoring rule。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathcal P$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(p;q)=\\mathbb E_{q}[S(p,X)]$</span> 为“报告分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>、真实分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>”的期望得分。若对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q\\in\\mathcal P$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S(q;q)\\le S(p;q),$$</div>\n<p>则称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 为 proper；若等号仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> 时成立，则称 strictly proper。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.5.12（交叉熵是 strictly proper）</strong> 设 (A1)(A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P$</span> 为支撑包含于固定可数集上的概率分布全体。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(p,x)=-\\log p(x)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(p;q)=H(q,p)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q,p)\\ge H(q,q)$</span>，等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(p;q)=\\mathbb E_q[-\\log p(X)]=H(q,p)$</span>。由命题 5.5.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q,p)=H(q)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)$</span>。由前序节的 Gibbs 不等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)\\ge 0$</span>，等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> 几乎处处。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q,p)\\ge H(q)=H(q,q)$</span>，等号条件即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5.5.12 是命题 5.5.2 与 Gibbs 不等式的直接推论，但它有独立的解释价值：<strong>交叉熵作为评分规则，其最优报告就是真实分布本身</strong>。这解释了为什么以交叉熵为训练目标的模型在容量足够时趋向于恢复真实条件分布，而不是仅仅拟合某些矩。它也排除了均方误差类损失：均方误差不是 strictly proper 的（对二值变量，报告均值即可最优，无需报告完整分布），因此不能作为概率预测的评估标准。这一区别在生成模型评估中至关重要，第 15 节会把它接到似然评估的具体形式上。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.5.13（交叉熵的 Bregman 表示）</strong> 在命题 5.5.12 的假设下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q\\in\\mathcal P$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(q,p)-H(q,q)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p).$$</div>\n<p>即交叉熵关于其第一个变量的“超额”恰为 KL 散度，后者是负熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-H$</span> 的 Bregman 散度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式即命题 5.5.2 移项。第二句：负熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(p)=-H(p)=\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)$</span> 是凸函数，其 Bregman 散度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(q)-F(p)-\\langle\\nabla F(p),q-p\\rangle$</span>。直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla F(p)$</span> 在第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)+1$</span>，代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 5.5.13 把交叉熵损失嵌入凸分析框架：最小化交叉熵等价于最小化负熵的 Bregman 散度，从而继承了 Bregman 散度的全部性质（非负、凸性、对偶结构）。这也说明交叉熵的梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_p H(q,p)$</span> 与负熵的梯度只差一个常数平移，与命题 5.5.7 的梯度等价性互为表里。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-一个可检验的恒等式-交叉熵的链式分解\">一个可检验的恒等式：交叉熵的链式分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-一个可检验的恒等式-交叉熵的链式分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出一个在序列模型中直接可用的恒等式，它把联合交叉熵分解为逐 token 交叉熵之和。该恒等式只用到本章第 2 节的链式法则与命题 5.5.2，不引入新假设。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.5.14（联合交叉熵的链式分解）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X^T$</span> 上的分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_{1:T})=\\prod_{t=1}^T p(x_t\\mid x_{&lt;t})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T})=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{&lt;t})$</span>，且 (A1)(A2) 对联合分布成立。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p,q)=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\mathbb E_{p(x_{&lt;t})}\\big[H\\big(p(\\cdot\\mid x_{&lt;t}),q(\\cdot\\mid x_{&lt;t})\\big)\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p(\\cdot\\mid x_{&lt;t}),q(\\cdot\\mid x_{&lt;t}))=-\\sum_{x_t}p(x_t\\mid x_{&lt;t})\\log q(x_t\\mid x_{&lt;t})$</span> 为条件交叉熵。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p,q)=-\\sum_{x_{1:T}}p(x_{1:T})\\log q(x_{1:T})\n=-\\sum_{x_{1:T}}p(x_{1:T})\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log q(x_t\\mid x_{&lt;t}).$$</div>\n<p>交换求和次序（有限和，无需 Fubini）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p,q)=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\left(-\\sum_{x_{1:T}}p(x_{1:T})\\log q(x_t\\mid x_{&lt;t})\\right).$$</div>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_{1:T})$</span> 边缘化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_{\\le t})=p(x_{&lt;t})p(x_t\\mid x_{&lt;t})$</span>，并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{&gt;t}$</span> 求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\sum_{x_{1:T}}p(x_{1:T})\\log q(x_t\\mid x_{&lt;t})\n=-\\sum_{x_{&lt;t}}p(x_{&lt;t})\\sum_{x_t}p(x_t\\mid x_{&lt;t})\\log q(x_t\\mid x_{&lt;t}),$$</div>\n<p>右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p(x_{&lt;t})}[H(p(\\cdot\\mid x_{&lt;t}),q(\\cdot\\mid x_{&lt;t}))]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5.5.14 是自回归模型交叉熵损失逐 token 求和的根据：训练时对每个位置 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 计算条件交叉熵并取平均，其期望恰为序列级联合交叉熵。注意分解中的期望是对<strong>真实分布</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的前缀取的，而非对模型分布；在训练中前缀来自数据，因此逐 token 损失的样本平均是联合交叉熵的无偏估计（在 (A4) 的独立性下逐 token 也独立）。这一恒等式与本章第 2 节的熵链式法则形式平行，区别仅在于第二项用的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的条件分布而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的，因此不能直接套用熵链式法则的等号，必须如上逐项展开。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef cond_cross_entropy(p_cond, q_cond):\n    p_cond = np.asarray(p_cond, dtype=float)\n    q_cond = np.asarray(q_cond, dtype=float)\n    mask = p_cond &gt; 0\n    if np.any(q_cond[mask] &lt;= 0):\n        return np.inf\n    return -np.sum(p_cond[mask] * np.log(q_cond[mask]))\n\n# 构造一个 T=2 的序列分布，验证命题 5.5.14\n# 真实分布 p: x1 ~ Bern(0.3); x2|x1=0 ~ Bern(0.8); x2|x1=1 ~ Bern(0.2)\n# 模型分布 q: x1 ~ Bern(0.5); x2|x1=0 ~ Bern(0.6); x2|x1=1 ~ Bern(0.4)\np_x1 = np.array([0.7, 0.3])          # [P(x1=0), P(x1=1)]\nq_x1 = np.array([0.5, 0.5])\np_x2_given_x1 = np.array([[0.2, 0.8], [0.8, 0.2]])  # 行: x1=0,1; 列: x2=0,1\nq_x2_given_x1 = np.array([[0.4, 0.6], [0.6, 0.4]])\n\n# 联合分布\np_joint = np.zeros((2, 2))\nq_joint = np.zeros((2, 2))\nfor a in range(2):\n    for b in range(2):\n        p_joint[a, b] = p_x1[a] * p_x2_given_x1[a, b]\n        q_joint[a, b] = q_x1[a] * q_x2_given_x1[a, b]\n\n# 联合交叉熵\nH_joint = -np.sum(p_joint * np.log(q_joint))\n\n# 链式分解：t=1 的条件交叉熵 + t=2 的条件交叉熵的期望\nH_t1 = cond_cross_entropy(p_x1, q_x1)\nH_t2 = sum(p_x1[a] * cond_cross_entropy(p_x2_given_x1[a], q_x2_given_x1[a]) for a in range(2))\nH_chain = H_t1 + H_t2\n\nprint(&quot;联合交叉熵 H(p,q) =&quot;, H_joint)\nprint(&quot;链式分解 H_t1 + E[H_t2] =&quot;, H_chain)\nassert np.isclose(H_joint, H_chain), &quot;命题 5.5.14 失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;命题 5.5.14 验证通过: 联合交叉熵 == 逐 token 条件交叉熵之和&quot;)\n\n# 命题 5.5.12：交叉熵是 strictly proper\nq_true = np.array([0.7, 0.3])\nq_report = np.array([0.5, 0.5])\nscore_true = cond_cross_entropy(q_true, q_true)\nscore_report = cond_cross_entropy(q_true, q_report)\nprint(&quot;S(q_true; q_true) =&quot;, score_true)\nprint(&quot;S(q_report; q_true) =&quot;, score_report)\nassert score_true &lt; score_report, &quot;命题 5.5.12 失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;命题 5.5.12 验证通过: 真实分布报告的期望交叉熵严格最小&quot;)\nprint(&quot;预期结果: 报告真实分布时得分最低，偏离时得分升高&quot;)\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"ar05--h-相对熵的变分表示-Donsker-Varadhan\">相对熵的变分表示（Donsker–Varadhan）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-相对熵的变分表示-Donsker-Varadhan\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：对可测空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal X,\\mathcal F)$</span> 上的概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span> 时\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\int \\log\\frac{\\mathrm dp}{\\mathrm dq}\\,\\mathrm dp,$$</div>\n否则约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_b(\\mathcal X)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上有界可测实值函数全体，配 sup 范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f\\|_\\infty=\\sup_x|f(x)|$</span>。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in\\mathcal B_b(\\mathcal X)$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle p,f\\rangle=\\int f\\,\\mathrm dp$</span>，并记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Z_q(f):=\\int e^{f}\\,\\mathrm dq\\in(0,\\infty),\n\\qquad\n\\Lambda_q(f):=\\log Z_q(f).$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q$</span> 称为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的对数矩母泛函（log-moment generating functional）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上概率测度全体。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心假设只有一条，且在本节情境下自动成立：</p>\n<p><strong>(A)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal X,\\mathcal F)$</span> 为可测空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in\\mathcal B_b(\\mathcal X)$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^f$</span> 有界且严格正，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_q(f)\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q(f)\\in\\mathbb R$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle p,f\\rangle\\in\\mathbb R$</span>。所有涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int e^f\\,\\mathrm dq$</span> 的量均为有限实数，无需交换积分与极限即可定义。</p>\n<p>注意 (A) 不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>；变分表示的价值恰在于它对奇异 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 也给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 的约定一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-定义-变分泛函与两个相邻概念的区别\">定义：变分泛函与两个相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-定义-变分泛函与两个相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in\\mathcal B_b(\\mathcal X)$</span> 定义 Donsker–Varadhan 泛函\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_q(p;f):=\\langle p,f\\rangle-\\Lambda_q(f).$$</div>\n本节要证明的主结论是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sup_{f\\in\\mathcal B_b(\\mathcal X)}J_q(p;f).\n\\tag{DV}$$</div>\n必须把 (DV) 与两个相邻对象区分清楚。</p>\n<p>其一，(DV) 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的函数的<strong>凸共轭型表示</strong>：右端是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的仿射泛函族的上确界，因此自动是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的凸函数、下半连续函数。这与 KL 的非负性（前序节已证）不冲突：非负性是下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，而 (DV) 给出的是精确值。</p>\n<p>其二，(DV) 不是 Gibbs 变分原理。Gibbs 原理写的是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sup_{g\\in\\mathcal B_b(\\mathcal X)}\\bigl\\{\\langle p,g\\rangle-\\log\\langle q,e^{g}\\rangle\\bigr\\},$$</div>\n形式与 (DV) 相同；但 (DV) 的证明路线不是“对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的 Radon–Nikodym 导数做点态优化”，而是“先用测度论把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的奇异部分隔离，再对绝对连续部分做点态优化并用有界函数逼近”。两条路线给出同一恒等式，但 (DV) 的假设 (A) 更弱、证明更短，且直接暴露 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 的来源。</p>\n<p>其三，(DV) 与 Fisher 度量、信息几何的关系只在后续“信息几何”节展开；本节不涉及二阶结构。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-1-下界-对任意-f-有-J_q-p-f-le-D_-mathrm-KL-p-q\">命题 1（下界）：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(p;f)\\le D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-1-下界-对任意-f-有-J_q-p-f-le-D_-mathrm-KL-p-q\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设 (A) 成立。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 分两种情形。</p>\n<p>情形一：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\not\\ll q$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>，不等式平凡成立。</p>\n<p>情形二：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\mathrm dp/\\mathrm dq$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\ge 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int r\\,\\mathrm dq=1$</span>。由 (A)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^f$</span> 有界且严格正，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r e^f$</span> 可积。计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_q(p;f)=\\int f r\\,\\mathrm dq-\\log\\int e^f\\,\\mathrm dq\n=\\int r\\log e^f\\,\\mathrm dq-\\log\\int e^f\\,\\mathrm dq.$$</div>\n在测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下应用 Jensen 不等式于凸函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log$</span>（或等价地，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 用凹性）：由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^f&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int e^f\\,\\mathrm dq\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\int e^f\\,\\mathrm dq\n=\\log\\int e^f r\\,\\mathrm dq\n\\ge \\int \\log(e^f)\\,\\mathrm dq\\cdot\\!\\!\\int r\\,\\mathrm dq\n=\\int f r\\,\\mathrm dq,$$</div>\n其中第一个等号用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int e^f\\,\\mathrm dq=\\int e^f r\\,\\mathrm dq$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\mathrm dp/\\mathrm dq$</span>），不等号是 Jensen（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 凹，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int r\\,\\mathrm dq=1$</span>）。移项即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(p;f)\\le 0$</span>。另一方面，由前序节已证的 KL 非负性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)\\ge 0$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(p;f)\\le 0\\le D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 说明 (DV) 的右端不超过左端，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> 时右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 0$</span>；结合命题 2 将看到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> 时右端恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-2-上界与等号-sup_f-J_q-p-f-D_-mathrm-KL-p-q-且当-p-ll-q-时上确界由-f-\">命题 2（上界与等号）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_f J_q(p;f)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span> 时上确界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star=\\log r$</span> 的截断逼近达到<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-2-上界与等号-sup_f-J_q-p-f-D_-mathrm-KL-p-q-且当-p-ll-q-时上确界由-f-\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设 (A) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\mathrm dp/\\mathrm dq$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int r\\log r\\,\\mathrm dq&lt;\\infty$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)&lt;\\infty$</span>）。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M:=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\int r\\log r\\,\\mathrm dq$</span>，有限。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\in\\mathbb N$</span> 定义截断对数\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f_n:=\\log\\bigl(r\\vee n^{-1}\\bigr)\\wedge n,$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_n(x)=\\min\\bigl\\{\\max\\{\\log r(x),-\\log n\\},\\log n\\bigr\\}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_n\\in\\mathcal B_b(\\mathcal X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f_n\\|_\\infty\\le \\log n$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_n\\to\\log r$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下几乎处处成立（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r&gt;0$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-a.e.）。由控制收敛（Dominance：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|f_n|\\le \\max\\{\\log n,\\,|\\log r|\\}$</span> 不构成统一控制，故改用单调性论证），需分两步。</p>\n<p>第一步：证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}J_q(p;f_n)=M$</span>。写\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_q(p;f_n)=\\int f_n r\\,\\mathrm dq-\\log\\int e^{f_n}\\,\\mathrm dq.$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_n$</span> 的构造，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{f_n}= (r\\vee n^{-1})\\wedge n$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int e^{f_n}\\,\\mathrm dq=\\int (r\\vee n^{-1})\\wedge n\\,\\mathrm dq$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_n=(r\\vee n^{-1})\\wedge n$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;n^{-1}\\le g_n\\le n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_n\\to r$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 下几乎处处成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_n\\le r+n^{-1}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(r\\vee n^{-1})\\le r+n^{-1}$</span>）。由控制收敛（Dominance：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_n\\le r+1$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 1$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int (r+1)\\,\\mathrm dq=2&lt;\\infty$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int g_n\\,\\mathrm dq\\to\\int r\\,\\mathrm dq=1$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\int e^{f_n}\\,\\mathrm dq\\to\\log 1=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f_n r\\,\\mathrm dq=\\int r\\log g_n\\,\\mathrm dq$</span>。需证它趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int r\\log r\\,\\mathrm dq=M$</span>。写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\log g_n-r\\log r=r\\log(g_n/r)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_n$</span> 构造，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_n/r=1$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n^{-1}\\le r\\le n$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_n/r=n^{-1}/r\\le 1$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r&lt;n^{-1}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_n/r=n/r\\le 1$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r&gt;n$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_n/r\\le 1$</span> 处处成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(g_n/r)\\le 0$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\log(g_n/r)\\le 0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\log g_n\\le r\\log r$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\log g_n\\ge r\\log n^{-1}=-r\\log n$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{r&lt;n^{-1}\\}$</span> 上，而在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{r&gt;n\\}$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\log g_n=r\\log n\\ge 0$</span>；综合得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\log g_n\\ge -r\\log n$</span> 处处成立（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\ge n^{-1}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\log g_n\\ge r\\log r\\ge -r/e$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-r\\log n\\le -r/e$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge e$</span> 成立）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|r\\log g_n|\\le r|\\log r|+r\\log n\\cdot\\mathbf 1_{\\{r&lt;n^{-1}\\}}$</span>。后者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{r&lt;n^{-1}\\}$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le n^{-1}\\log n\\to 0$</span>，且被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r|\\log r|+C$</span> 控制（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为常数），由控制收敛（Dominance：<span class=\"math-inline\">$r|\\log r|\\in L^1(q)$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int r\\,\\mathrm dq=1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int r\\log g_n\\,\\mathrm dq\\to\\int r\\log r\\,\\mathrm dq=M$</span>。</p>\n<p>合并两步得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_n J_q(p;f_n)=M-0=M$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_f J_q(p;f)\\ge M$</span>。结合命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_f J_q(p;f)\\le M$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_f J_q(p;f)=M$</span>。</p>\n<p>第二步：等号条件。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\equiv 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_n\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(p;f_n)\\to 0$</span>，故上确界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|q)=0$</span> 一致。反之若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_f J_q(p;f)=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=0$</span>，由前序节 KL 等号条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=0\\iff r=1$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-a.e.，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 的证明中，截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_n$</span> 的作用是同时保证有界性与可积性；若直接取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\log r$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 可能无界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_q(f)=\\int r\\,\\mathrm dq=1$</span> 仍成立，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\notin\\mathcal B_b$</span>，故必须用截断逼近。这正是假设 (A) 中“有界”的由来：它保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_q(f)$</span> 有限且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q$</span> 良定义，而逼近论证说明有界性不损失上确界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-推论-恒等式-Lambda_q-的凸性与-D_-mathrm-KL-的共轭关系\">推论（恒等式）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q$</span> 的凸性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 的共轭关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-推论-恒等式-Lambda_q-的凸性与-D_-mathrm-KL-的共轭关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设 (A) 成立。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由 (DV)，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sup_{f\\in\\mathcal B_b}\\bigl\\{\\langle p,f\\rangle-\\Lambda_q(f)\\bigr\\}.$$</div>\n右端是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q$</span> 的 Fenchel–Legendre 共轭在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 处的取值。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的凸泛函（由 Hölder 不等式：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g\\in\\mathcal B_b$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Lambda_q(tf+(1-t)g)=\\log\\int e^{tf+(1-t)g}\\,\\mathrm dq\n\\le\\log\\Bigl(\\int e^f\\,\\mathrm dq\\Bigr)^t\\Bigl(\\int e^g\\,\\mathrm dq\\Bigr)^{1-t}\n=t\\Lambda_q(f)+(1-t)\\Lambda_q(g),$$</div>\n不等号是 Hölder），其共轭 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\cdot\\|q)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的凸下半连续泛函。这与前序节 KL 的凸性结论一致，但此处给出了凸性的<strong>构造性来源</strong>：KL 是某个凸泛函的共轭。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论的可检验形式是：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1,p_2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(tp_1+(1-t)p_2\\|q)\\le tD_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_1\\|q)+(1-t)D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_2\\|q),$$</div>\n可由 (DV) 直接取上确界得到（上确界 of 仿射函数族是凸的）。这是前序节凸性的独立验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-具体例子-二点分布上的显式计算\">具体例子：二点分布上的显式计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-具体例子-二点分布上的显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{0,1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(1/2,1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1-\\epsilon,\\epsilon)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\in(0,1)$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(0)=2(1-\\epsilon)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r(1)=2\\epsilon$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=(1-\\epsilon)\\log\\bigl(2(1-\\epsilon)\\bigr)+\\epsilon\\log(2\\epsilon).$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(0)=a$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(1)=b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b\\in\\mathbb R$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Z_q(f)=\\tfrac12(e^a+e^b),\\qquad\nJ_q(p;f)=(1-\\epsilon)a+\\epsilon b-\\log\\tfrac12(e^a+e^b).$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b$</span> 求偏导并令其为零：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial J}{\\partial a}=1-\\epsilon-\\frac{e^a}{e^a+e^b}=0,\\qquad\n\\frac{\\partial J}{\\partial b}=\\epsilon-\\frac{e^b}{e^a+e^b}=0.$$</div>\n两式相加得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-1=0$</span>，相容；相减得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^a/(e^a+e^b)=1-\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^b/(e^a+e^b)=\\epsilon$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{a-b}=(1-\\epsilon)/\\epsilon$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\log(2(1-\\epsilon))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=\\log(2\\epsilon)$</span> 满足此比，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_q(f)=\\tfrac12(2(1-\\epsilon)+2\\epsilon)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q(f)=0$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_q(p;f)=(1-\\epsilon)\\log(2(1-\\epsilon))+\\epsilon\\log(2\\epsilon)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q),$$</div>\n与 (DV) 一致。注意此例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\log r$</span> 恰好有界（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\in(0,1)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,2)$</span>），故无需截断；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(1)\\to 0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r(1)\\to-\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 无界，必须用命题 2 的截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_n$</span> 逼近，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(p;f_n)\\to D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\log\\epsilon\\to 0$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\epsilon)\\log(2(1-\\epsilon))\\to\\log 2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\to\\log 2$</span>，有限；真正发散的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 支撑收缩到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{0\\}$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1\\}$</span> 有质量的奇异情形，见反例节）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-代码-变分表示与截断逼近的数值验证\">代码：变分表示与截断逼近的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-代码-变分表示与截断逼近的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在二点分布上验证 (DV)：对给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span>，用网格搜索 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_f J_q(p;f)$</span> 并与解析 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 比较；同时用截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_n$</span> 验证命题 2 的逼近。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef kl_binary(p, q):\n    p = np.asarray(p, dtype=float); q = np.asarray(q, dtype=float)\n    assert p.shape == q.shape == (2,)\n    assert np.isclose(p.sum(), 1) and np.isclose(q.sum(), 1)\n    mask = p &gt; 0\n    return float(np.sum(p[mask] * np.log(p[mask] / q[mask])))\n\ndef J(p, q, f):\n    p = np.asarray(p, dtype=float); q = np.asarray(q, dtype=float)\n    f = np.asarray(f, dtype=float)\n    Z = np.sum(q * np.exp(f))\n    return float(np.sum(p * f) - np.log(Z))\n\nq = np.array([0.5, 0.5])\nfor eps in [0.1, 0.3, 0.5, 0.9]:\n    p = np.array([1 - eps, eps])\n    target = kl_binary(p, q)\n    # 网格搜索 sup_f J，f 取值于 [-5,5]^2\n    grid = np.linspace(-5, 5, 401)\n    best = -np.inf\n    for a in grid:\n        for b in grid:\n            val = J(p, q, [a, b])\n            if val &gt; best:\n                best = val\n    print(f&quot;eps={eps}: KL={target:.6f}, sup_f J (grid)={best:.6f}, diff={abs(target-best):.2e}&quot;)\n    assert abs(target - best) &lt; 1e-2, &quot;grid resolution insufficient&quot;\n\n# 截断逼近：f_n = clip(log r, -log n, log n)\neps = 0.1\np = np.array([1 - eps, eps])\nr = p / q\nfor n in [2, 10, 100, 1000]:\n    f_n = np.clip(np.log(r), -np.log(n), np.log(n))\n    print(f&quot;n={n}: J(p;f_n)={J(p, q, f_n):.6f}, KL={kl_binary(p, q):.6f}&quot;)\n    assert J(p, q, f_n) &lt;= kl_binary(p, q) + 1e-12\n\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, p.shape, q.shape, &quot;expected (2,) (2,)&quot;)\nprint(&quot;all assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，网格上确界与解析 KL 之差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span>（网格分辨率所限）；截断序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(p;f_n)$</span> 单调上升且始终不超过 KL，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=1000$</span> 时已非常接近。所有 <code>assert</code> 通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-3-奇异情形的显式刻画-p-not-ll-q-时上确界发散-且发散速率可定量\">命题 3（奇异情形的显式刻画）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\not\\ll q$</span> 时上确界发散，且发散速率可定量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-3-奇异情形的显式刻画-p-not-ll-q-时上确界发散-且发散速率可定量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设 (A) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\not\\ll q$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\{x:\\mathrm dp/\\mathrm dq\\ \\text{不存在}\\}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的奇异集，即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\in\\mathcal F$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(A)=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)&gt;0$</span>。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=t\\,\\mathbf 1_A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(A)=0$</span> 得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Z_q(f)=\\int e^{t\\mathbf 1_A}\\,\\mathrm dq=q(\\mathcal X\\setminus A)+e^t q(A)=1,$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q(f)=0$</span>。另一方面\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle p,f\\rangle=t\\,p(A).$$</div>\n于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(p;f)=t\\,p(A)$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_f J_q(p;f)\\ge \\sup_{t&gt;0}t\\,p(A)=+\\infty$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)&gt;0$</span>）。结合命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q\\le D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=+\\infty$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_f J_q(p;f)=+\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明 (DV) 在奇异情形不是“形式上成立”，而是右端确实发散到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 的约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 精确匹配。发散速率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\,p(A)$</span> 给出：每增大指示函数的幅度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，泛函值线性增长，斜率恰为奇异质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)$</span>。这与绝对连续情形形成对照：那里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star=\\log r$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_q(f^\\star)=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q(f^\\star)=0$</span>，泛函值等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int r\\log r\\,\\mathrm dq$</span>，是有限数；奇异情形则不存在这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 上无定义（<span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-a.e. 意义下才存在）。</p>\n<p>必须强调：命题 3 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=t\\mathbf 1_A$</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_b(\\mathcal X)$</span>（有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f\\|_\\infty=t$</span>），故它是 (DV) 右端允许的测试函数。这正是 (DV) 相对 Gibbs 原理的优势：后者若要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 可积，则在奇异集上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的取值不受 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 约束，论证需额外小心；而 (DV) 只用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 侧的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_q$</span>，奇异质量通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle p,f\\rangle$</span> 直接进入。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-4-对偶间隙为零的等价条件-上确界可达当且仅当-p-ll-q-且-log-r-有界\">命题 4（对偶间隙为零的等价条件）：上确界可达当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r$</span> 有界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-4-对偶间隙为零的等价条件-上确界可达当且仅当-p-ll-q-且-log-r-有界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设 (A) 成立。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span>。由命题 1、2、3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_f J_q(p;f)=M$</span> 恒成立。问上确界是否被某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star\\in\\mathcal B_b$</span> 达到，即是否存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(p;f^\\star)=M$</span>。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\not\\ll q$</span>，由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=+\\infty$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(p;f)&lt;\\infty$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in\\mathcal B_b$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle p,f\\rangle\\le\\|f\\|_\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q(f)\\le\\|f\\|_\\infty$</span>），故不可达。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=+\\infty$</span>，同理不可达（每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(p;f)$</span> 有限）。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r\\in\\mathcal B_b$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-a.e. 意义下有正下界与有限上界），取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star=\\log r$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_q(f^\\star)=\\int r\\,\\mathrm dq=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q(f^\\star)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(p;f^\\star)=\\int r\\log r\\,\\mathrm dq=M$</span>，达到。</p>\n<p>反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M&lt;\\infty$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r$</span> 无界，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in\\mathcal B_b$</span>，由命题 1 的证明中 Jensen 不等式的等号条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\int e^f r\\,\\mathrm dq=\\int f r\\,\\mathrm dq$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下几乎必然为常数，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\log r+c$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-a.e.。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r$</span> 无界，矛盾（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r$</span> 超出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f\\|_\\infty$</span> 的集合上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f-\\log r$</span> 不可能为常数）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(p;f)&lt;M$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in\\mathcal B_b$</span>，上确界不可达。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 精确回答了“何时可以把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max$</span>”：仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 有界分离于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 时。这与命题 2 的截断逼近互补——截断序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_n$</span> 是逼近上确界的<strong>可行</strong>有界函数，但不达到上确界，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r$</span> 本身有界。二点分布例子中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\in(0,1)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\in(0,2)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r$</span> 有界，上确界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star=\\log r$</span> 达到，与显式计算一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-推论-变分表示的稳定性-J_q-对-f-的-Lipschitz-连续性\">推论（变分表示的稳定性）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的 Lipschitz 连续性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-推论-变分表示的稳定性-J_q-对-f-的-Lipschitz-连续性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设 (A) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g\\in\\mathcal B_b(\\mathcal X)$</span>。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 估计\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|J_q(p;f)-J_q(p;g)|\\le|\\langle p,f-g\\rangle|+|\\Lambda_q(f)-\\Lambda_q(g)|.$$</div>\n第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\|f-g\\|_\\infty$</span>。第二项用中值定理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q$</span> 沿线段 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g+t(f-g)$</span> 的方向导数\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\Lambda_q(g+t(f-g))\n=\\frac{\\int (f-g)e^{g+t(f-g)}\\,\\mathrm dq}{\\int e^{g+t(f-g)}\\,\\mathrm dq},$$</div>\n其绝对值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\|f-g\\|_\\infty$</span>（因被积函数之比是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f-g$</span> 在概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{g+t(f-g)}\\mathrm dq/Z_q(\\cdot)$</span> 下的期望）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\Lambda_q(f)-\\Lambda_q(g)|\\le\\|f-g\\|_\\infty$</span>。合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|J_q(p;f)-J_q(p;g)|\\le 2\\|f-g\\|_\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明 (DV) 右端作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的泛函是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>-Lipschitz 的，故上确界可在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_b$</span> 的紧子集上取到（若存在），且数值实现中网格搜索的误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f-g\\|_\\infty$</span> 线性控制——这解释了代码节中网格分辨率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span> 量级的误差来源。它也提示：若把测试函数类从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_b$</span> 缩小到某个紧的 Lipschitz 球，上确界会严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span>，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star$</span> 落在该球内；这正是后续“f-散度与 Rényi 散度”节中不同变分族给出不同下界的机制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-5-与-KL-链式法则的相容性-条件变分表示\">命题 5（与 KL 链式法则的相容性）：条件变分表示<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-5-与-KL-链式法则的相容性-条件变分表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设 (A) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\mathcal Y\\times\\mathcal Z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)&lt;\\infty$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y,z)=p(z)\\,p(y\\mid z)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y,z)=q(z)\\,q(y\\mid z)$</span> 为相应分解（假设边缘与条件正则）。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由前序节 KL 链式法则，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\mathbb E_{p(z)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\bigl(p(\\cdot\\mid z)\\|q(\\cdot\\mid z)\\bigr)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(z)\\|q(z)).$$</div>\n对每个固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，对条件 KL 应用 (DV)：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\bigl(p(\\cdot\\mid z)\\|q(\\cdot\\mid z)\\bigr)=\\sup_{f\\in\\mathcal B_b(\\mathcal Y)}\\Bigl\\{\\mathbb E_{p(y\\mid z)}f(y)-\\log\\mathbb E_{q(y\\mid z)}e^{f(y)}\\Bigr\\}.$$</div>\n将此代入并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(z)$</span> 取期望，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p(z)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\bigl(p(\\cdot\\mid z)\\|q(\\cdot\\mid z)\\bigr)\n=\\sup_{f\\in\\mathcal B_b(\\mathcal Y)}\\mathbb E_{p(y,z)}\\Bigl\\{f(y)-\\log\\mathbb E_{q(y\\mid z)}e^{f(y)}\\Bigr\\},$$</div>\n其中交换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p(z)}$</span> 需验证：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup$</span> 的泛函关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>-Lipschitz（推论），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_b(\\mathcal Y)$</span> 上的上确界可由可数稠密子集逼近（取有理系数、有理幅度的阶梯函数），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup$</span> 与期望可交换（单调收敛/控制收敛，控制函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f\\|_\\infty$</span> 的常数倍，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 取自可数稠密集以保证可测选择）。另一方面，对边缘项再用一次 (DV)：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(z)\\|q(z))=\\sup_{g\\in\\mathcal B_b(\\mathcal Z)}\\Bigl\\{\\mathbb E_{p(z)}g(z)-\\log\\mathbb E_{q(z)}e^{g(z)}\\Bigr\\}.$$</div>\n两式相加，右端恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{(f,g)\\in\\mathcal B_b(\\mathcal Y)\\times\\mathcal B_b(\\mathcal Z)}J_q(p;(f,g))$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(f,g)(y,z)=f(y)+g(z)$</span>。故 (DV) 在乘积空间上分解为“条件项 + 边缘项”，与链式法则逐项对应。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：它说明 (DV) 不是孤立的单变量恒等式，而是与链式法则结构相容——乘积空间上的测试函数若取可加形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(y)+g(z)$</span>，则泛函自动分解为条件与边缘两部分。这也为后续“与最大似然章的接口”节埋下伏笔：自回归分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x_{1:T})=\\sum_t\\log p(x_t\\mid x_{&lt;t})$</span> 的每一项都可用 (DV) 表示为该步条件分布上的变分上确界，从而整条链的 KL 是逐步变分泛函之和的上确界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-6-次梯度刻画-f-star-log-r-是-D_-mathrm-KL-cdot-q-在-p-处的次梯度\">命题 6（次梯度刻画）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star=\\log r$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\cdot\\|q)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 处的次梯度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-6-次梯度刻画-f-star-log-r-是-D_-mathrm-KL-cdot-q-在-p-处的次梯度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设 (A) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r\\in\\mathcal B_b$</span>。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由命题 4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star=\\log r$</span> 达到上确界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(p;f^\\star)=M$</span>。由 (DV)，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p'\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p'\\|q)\\ge J_q(p';f^\\star)=\\langle p',f^\\star\\rangle-\\Lambda_q(f^\\star)=\\langle p',\\log r\\rangle,$$</div>\n其中用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q(f^\\star)=\\log\\int r\\,\\mathrm dq=0$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p'=p$</span> 处右端等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle p,\\log r\\rangle=M$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p'\\|q)\\ge D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)+\\langle p'-p,\\log r\\rangle$$</div>\n对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p'$</span> 成立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\cdot\\|q)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 处的次梯度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把 (DV) 与凸分析的标准对偶配对起来：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q$</span> 的共轭在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 处的次梯度恰是达到上确界的测试函数。它给出一个可检验的恒等式——对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p'$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p'\\|q)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)-\\mathbb E_{p'}\\log\\frac{\\mathrm dp}{\\mathrm dq}+\\mathbb E_{p}\\log\\frac{\\mathrm dp}{\\mathrm dq}\\ge 0,$$</div>\n这正是 KL 关于第一个变量的凸性的一阶形式（Bregman 散度非负）。在二点分布例子中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p'=q$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)\\ge 0$</span>，即前序节 KL 非负性在交换参数下的实例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-与相邻节的边界说明\">与相邻节的边界说明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-与相邻节的边界说明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节只承诺 (DV) 的变分表示及其证明，不涉及以下内容，留待后续节处理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度族（包括 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span>、Hellinger、total variation）的变分表示与 (DV) 的关系，见“f-散度与 Rényi 散度”节；<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 的样本估计偏差与 (DV) 中上确界的统计可实现性，见“熵的估计与偏差”节；连续情形下微分熵与 (DV) 的测度论细节（Radon–Nikodym 导数在奇异集上的行为），见“连续熵与离散熵的差异”与“反例：KL 无界与支撑不匹配”节；Fisher 度量作为 KL 的二阶展开与 (DV) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star$</span> 的局部行为，见“信息几何：Fisher 度量”节。本节建立的命题 1–6 是这些后续讨论的共同底座：任何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度的变分表示都可通过选取不同的凸函数替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q$</span> 中的指数而得到，(DV) 是其中指数情形。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-7-变分表示的对偶间隙与-KL-的强凸性下界\">命题 7（变分表示的对偶间隙与 KL 的强凸性下界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-7-变分表示的对偶间隙与-KL-的强凸性下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设 (A) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)&lt;\\infty$</span>，且存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;c\\le C&lt;\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\mathrm dp/\\mathrm dq$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\le r\\le C$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-a.e.（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r\\in\\mathcal B_b$</span> 且有界分离）。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由命题 4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star=\\log r$</span> 达到上确界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(p;f^\\star)=M$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in\\mathcal B_b$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=f-f^\\star$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_q(p;f^\\star+\\delta)-J_q(p;f^\\star)\n=\\langle p,\\delta\\rangle-\\bigl(\\Lambda_q(f^\\star+\\delta)-\\Lambda_q(f^\\star)\\bigr).$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q(f^\\star)=\\log\\int r\\,\\mathrm dq=0$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Lambda_q(f^\\star+\\delta)=\\log\\int e^{\\delta}r\\,\\mathrm dq\n=\\log\\mathbb E_{p}\\,e^{\\delta}.$$</div>\n于是间隙为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M-J_q(p;f)=-\\log\\mathbb E_{p}\\,e^{\\delta}+\\mathbb E_{p}\\,\\delta.$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi(\\delta):=\\mathbb E_p e^\\delta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(\\delta):=\\mathbb E_p\\delta$</span>，则间隙 <span class=\"math-inline\">$= \\phi(\\delta)-\\log\\psi(\\delta)$</span>。由 Taylor 展开（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 处的二阶导为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi(0)=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi'(0)=\\phi(\\delta)$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\psi(\\delta)=\\phi(\\delta)-\\tfrac12\\mathrm{Var}_{p}(\\delta)+O\\bigl(\\|\\delta\\|_\\infty^3\\bigr),$$</div>\n故间隙 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\tfrac12\\mathrm{Var}_p(\\delta)+O(\\|\\delta\\|_\\infty^3)$</span>。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{-\\epsilon,+\\epsilon\\}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p\\delta=0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_p(\\delta)=\\epsilon^2$</span>，间隙 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\tfrac12\\epsilon^2+O(\\epsilon^3)$</span>。这说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(p;\\cdot)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star$</span> 处的上确界是<strong>二阶</strong>的：偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star$</span> 一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 幅度、均值零的扰动，泛函损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta(\\epsilon^2)$</span>，而非线性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于它把 (DV) 的上确界从“值”推进到“局部几何”：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(p;\\cdot)$</span> 的全局最大点，且由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star$</span> 处的 Hessian 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 的协方差算子（正定，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-a.e. 常数时），最大点是严格且孤立的（在商去常数函数的意义下，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q(f+c)=\\Lambda_q(f)+c$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 平移不变）。这与命题 6 的次梯度刻画互补：命题 6 给出全局一阶条件，命题 7 给出局部二阶曲率。曲率常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12$</span> 来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 处的二阶导，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的具体形状无关——只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 有界分离，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下的方差就是唯一的二阶信息。</p>\n<p>必须指出：若去掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 的有界分离假设，命题 7 的 Taylor 余项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|\\delta\\|_\\infty^3)$</span> 不再一致成立，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p e^\\delta$</span> 可能因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 小的区域取大正值而爆炸；此时上确界仍由命题 2 的截断逼近给出，但局部二阶展开需逐点验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p e^{\\delta}&lt;\\infty$</span>。这正是后续“反例：KL 无界与支撑不匹配”节要处理的边界情形。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-8-变分表示在-KL-链式法则下的逐项可加性检验\">命题 8（变分表示在 KL 链式法则下的逐项可加性检验）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-8-变分表示在-KL-链式法则下的逐项可加性检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设 (A) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\mathcal Y\\times\\mathcal Z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)&lt;\\infty$</span>，且条件密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(y\\mid z)=\\mathrm dp(y\\mid z)/\\mathrm dq(y\\mid z)$</span> 与边缘密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(z)=\\mathrm dp(z)/\\mathrm dq(z)$</span> 均满足命题 4 的有界分离条件（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 一致）。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由命题 5，乘积空间上的 (DV) 在可加测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(f,g)(y,z)=f(y)+g(z)$</span> 下分解为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{f,g}J_q\\bigl(p;(f,g)\\bigr)\n=\\sup_f\\mathbb E_{p(y,z)}\\Bigl\\{f(y)-\\log\\mathbb E_{q(y\\mid z)}e^{f(y)}\\Bigr\\}\n+\\sup_g\\Bigl\\{\\mathbb E_{p(z)}g(z)-\\log\\mathbb E_{q(z)}e^{g(z)}\\Bigr\\}.$$</div>\n由命题 4，两个上确界分别由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star(y)=\\log r(y\\mid z)$</span>（对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 固定，作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 的函数）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^\\star(z)=\\log r(z)$</span> 达到。代入得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{f,g}J_q\\bigl(p;(f,g)\\bigr)\n=\\mathbb E_{p(z)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\bigl(p(\\cdot\\mid z)\\|q(\\cdot\\mid z)\\bigr)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(z)\\|q(z)),$$</div>\n右端恰为链式法则给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span>。另一方面，由 (DV) 在乘积空间上的完整形式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{h\\in\\mathcal B_b(\\mathcal Y\\times\\mathcal Z)}J_q(p;h)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 可取不可加的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(y,z)$</span>。故可加测试函数族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{f(y)+g(z)\\}$</span> 上的上确界与全测试函数族上的上确界相等：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{h\\in\\mathcal B_b(\\mathcal Y\\times\\mathcal Z)}J_q(p;h)=\\sup_{f,g}J_q\\bigl(p;f+g\\bigr).$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出一个可检验的恒等式：在链式法则成立且各条件密度有界分离时，<strong>限制测试函数为可加形式不损失上确界</strong>。这与命题 2 的截断逼近形成对照——那里用有界函数逼近无界的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r$</span> 不损失上确界；这里用可加函数逼近一般的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 也不损失上确界，但论证路径不同：前者靠截断的单调收敛，后者靠链式法则的逐项分解。两者的共同结论是：(DV) 的上确界对测试函数类的“自然子类”是稳健的，这为后续“与最大似然章的接口”节中把自回归分解的每一步 KL 写成该步条件分布上的变分上确界提供了合法性——逐步取上确界再求和，与整条链上取上确界，在可加测试函数下相等。</p>\n<p>需要验证命题 8 中“对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 一致有界分离”这一假设的可满足性：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 均为乘积测度且各因子有界分离时，条件密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(y\\mid z)=r(y)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 无关，一致性自动成立；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为一般联合分布时，一致性是额外要求，若去掉则命题 5 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p(z)}$</span> 交换需改用可数稠密逼近并逐点验证可测选择，结论仍成立但证明更长。本节不展开该边界情形，留待反例节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-9-变分表示的数值可实现性-有限网格上确界的误差界\">命题 9（变分表示的数值可实现性：有限网格上确界的误差界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-9-变分表示的数值可实现性-有限网格上确界的误差界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设 (A) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=d&lt;\\infty$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r\\in\\mathcal B_b(\\mathcal X)$</span>（有限空间上自动成立，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 取值于有限集）。取测试函数网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G=\\{f:\\mathcal X\\to[-B,B],\\ f\\text{ 取值于步长 }h\\text{ 的格点}\\}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\ge\\|\\log r\\|_\\infty$</span>。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由命题 4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star=\\log r$</span> 达到上确界，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|f^\\star\\|_\\infty\\le B$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star$</span> 逐坐标舍入到步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 的格点，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde f\\in\\mathcal G$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde f-f^\\star\\|_\\infty\\le h/2$</span>。由推论的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>-Lipschitz 连续性，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_q(p;f^\\star)-J_q(p;\\tilde f)\\le 2\\|\\tilde f-f^\\star\\|_\\infty\\le h.$$</div>\n又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(p;\\tilde f)\\le\\sup_{f\\in\\mathcal G}J_q(p;f)\\le J_q(p;f^\\star)=M$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$0\\le M-\\sup_{f\\in\\mathcal G}J_q(p;f)\\le h.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把代码节中“网格搜索误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span> 量级”的观察提升为定量界：误差不超过网格步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，与维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 无关（因舍入是逐坐标的，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_\\infty$</span> 误差不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 累积）。这解释了为何二点分布例子中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$401$</span> 点网格（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=10/400=0.025$</span>）给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span> 量级的误差：界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=0.025$</span> 略宽于实测，因舍入误差实际为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h/2$</span> 且 Lipschitz 常数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star$</span> 附近常小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。命题 9 也说明：网格搜索的复杂度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O((2B/h)^d)$</span>，随维度指数增长——这正是后续“熵的估计与偏差”节讨论高维情形时必须改用随机优化或对偶采样的原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-10-变分表示与交叉熵的恒等关系\">命题 10（变分表示与交叉熵的恒等关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-10-变分表示与交叉熵的恒等关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设 (A) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r\\in\\mathcal B_b$</span>。记交叉熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,q):=-\\mathbb E_p\\log q$</span>、熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p):=-\\mathbb E_p\\log p$</span>（前序节已定义）。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由命题 4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star=\\log r=\\log p-\\log q$</span> 达到上确界，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M=J_q(p;f^\\star)=\\mathbb E_p\\log\\frac{p}{q}=H(p,q)-H(p).$$</div>\n另一方面，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in\\mathcal B_b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(p;f)=\\mathbb E_p f-\\log\\mathbb E_q e^f$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-\\log q+c$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 为常数使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 有正下界；在有限空间上自动成立），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q e^f=e^c$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q(f)=c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(p;f)=-\\mathbb E_p\\log q+c-c=H(p,q)$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{f\\in\\mathcal B_b}J_q(p;f)\\ge H(p,q),$$</div>\n结合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=H(p,q)-H(p)$</span> 与 (DV)，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,q)\\ge H(p)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=H(p,q)-H(p)\\ge 0$</span>，与前序节 Gibbs 不等式一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明 (DV) 与交叉熵的关系是<strong>恒等</strong>而非近似：交叉熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,q)$</span> 恰是取测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-\\log q$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 有正下界时属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_b$</span>）时的泛函值，而 KL 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,q)$</span> 减去熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span>。因此 (DV) 可重写为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)=\\inf_{f\\in\\mathcal B_b}\\bigl\\{\\mathbb E_p f+\\log\\mathbb E_q e^{-f}\\bigr\\},$$</div>\n这是熵的变分表示（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-\\log q$</span> 时下确界达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 时）。该形式与后续“交叉熵与最大似然的关系”节直接对接：最大似然最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p,q)$</span> 等价于在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span>，而 (DV) 给出后者的变分上确界表示，故最大似然的每一步都可视为在该步条件分布上求解一个 (DV) 型对偶问题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-11-变分表示对测度弱收敛的下半连续性\">命题 11（变分表示对测度弱收敛的下半连续性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-11-变分表示对测度弱收敛的下半连续性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设 (A) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(p_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\subset\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span> 弱收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span>（即对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in\\mathcal B_b(\\mathcal X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle p_n,f\\rangle\\to\\langle p,f\\rangle$</span>）。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 对任意固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in\\mathcal B_b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q(\\cdot;f)=\\langle\\cdot,f\\rangle-\\Lambda_q(f)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的弱连续泛函（第一项由弱收敛定义连续，第二项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 无关）。由 (DV)，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_n\\|q)=\\sup_f J_q(p_n;f)\\ge J_q(p_n;f)$$</div>\n对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 成立。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\liminf_n D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_n\\|q)\\ge J_q(p;f)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 取上确界：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\liminf_n D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_n\\|q)\\ge\\sup_f J_q(p;f)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q).$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出 KL 下半连续性的<strong>变分证明</strong>：无需 Radon–Nikodym 导数的测度论论证，只需注意 (DV) 右端是弱连续泛函族的上确界，而上确界 of 连续函数族自动下半连续。这与前序节 KL 下半连续性的结论一致，但此处暴露了机制：下半连续性来自“上确界”运算，而非来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 的凸性。该机制在后续“信息几何：Fisher 度量”节中将以“KL 是凸泛函的共轭”的形式再次出现，并用于证明 Fisher 度量在弱收敛下的连续性。</p>\n<p>需要指出：命题 11 不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_n\\ll q$</span>，故序列中可有奇异测度，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_n\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\liminf$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，不等式平凡成立。真正有内容的情形是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_n\\ll q$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_n\\|q)$</span> 有界，此时下半连续性保证极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 也满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)\\le\\liminf$</span>——这是变分表示相对逐点定义的又一优势：逐点定义需先验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span> 才能谈有限值，而变分表示对奇异极限自动给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 或有限值，无需分情形。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Donsker–Varadhan 变分表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sup_{f\\in\\mathcal B_b}\\{\\langle p,f\\rangle-\\log\\int e^f\\,\\mathrm dq\\}$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span> 成立，无需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>；奇异情形右端自动为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，与 KL 的约定一致。</li>\n<li>下界由 Jensen 不等式给出（命题 1），上界由截断对数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_n=\\log(r\\vee n^{-1})\\wedge n$</span> 的控制收敛逼近给出（命题 2）；有界性假设 (A) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_q(f)\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>，截断论证说明它不损失上确界。</li>\n<li>该表示将 KL 暴露为对数矩母泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_q$</span> 的 Fenchel–Legendre 共轭，从而构造性地给出 KL 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的凸性与下半连续性，并与前序节的 KL 链式法则、非负性、等号条件完全自洽。</li>\n<li>奇异情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\not\\ll q$</span> 下 (DV) 右端由指示函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=t\\mathbf 1_A$</span> 显式发散到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，斜率等于奇异质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=+\\infty$</span> 精确匹配（命题 3）。</li>\n<li>上确界可达当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r$</span> 有界；此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star=\\log r$</span> 同时是达到函数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\cdot\\|q)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 处的次梯度（命题 4、6），并给出 Bregman 型一阶不等式。</li>\n<li>(DV) 与 KL 链式法则结构相容：乘积空间上取可加测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(y)+g(z)$</span>，泛函分解为条件项与边缘项之和（命题 5）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_q$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>-Lipschitz 连续性（推论）定量控制了数值实现中网格搜索的误差。</li>\n<li>命题 7 给出上确界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star$</span> 处的二阶曲率：偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star$</span> 的均值零扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 造成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\mathrm{Var}_p(\\delta)$</span> 量级的泛函损失，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^\\star$</span> 是严格孤立最大点（商去常数平移），曲率常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 无关。</li>\n<li>命题 8 证明在链式法则成立且条件密度有界分离时，可加测试函数族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{f(y)+g(z)\\}$</span> 上的上确界等于全测试函数族上的上确界，为自回归分解逐步取变分上确界提供了合法性；命题 9 给出有限网格上确界的误差界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，与维度无关但复杂度随维度指数增长。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar05--h-f-散度与-Rényi-散度\">f-散度与 Rényi 散度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-f-散度与-Rényi-散度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：对可数集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的概率分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sum_x p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span> 时；否则取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>）。本节新引入如下符号，并在此集中定义。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 0.1（f-散度）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:(0,\\infty)\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 为凸函数且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(1)=0$</span>。对可数集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的概率分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_f(p\\|q)=\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal X} q(x)\\,f\\!\\left(\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}\\right),$$</div>\n其中约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(0)=\\lim_{t\\downarrow 0}f(t)$</span>（允许为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>），且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0=q(x)$</span> 对某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_f(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>。对一般可测空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal X,\\mathcal F)$</span> 上的概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=\\mathrm dP/\\mathrm dQ$</span> 为 Radon–Nikodym 导数，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_f(P\\|Q)=\\int_{\\mathcal X} f(\\rho)\\,\\mathrm dQ,$$</div>\n并约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\not\\ll Q$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_f(P\\|Q)=+\\infty$</span>。本节始终假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 下半连续、凸、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(1)=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 处取有限值。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 0.2（Rényi 散度）</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1)\\cup(1,\\infty)$</span>，概率分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span> 时定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_\\alpha(p\\|q)=\\frac{1}{\\alpha-1}\\log\\sum_{x} p(x)^\\alpha q(x)^{1-\\alpha},$$</div>\n一般测度情形为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha(P\\|Q)=\\frac{1}{\\alpha-1}\\log\\int \\rho^\\alpha\\,\\mathrm dQ$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=\\mathrm dP/\\mathrm dQ$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span> 处取连续延拓 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_1=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=\\infty$</span> 处取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\infty(P\\|Q)=\\log\\operatorname{ess\\,sup}_{\\mathcal X}\\rho$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span>）。</p>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设逐条列于各命题之前。核心假设为：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 凸、下半连续、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(1)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 处有限；(A2) 所涉概率分布为可数集上的分布或满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span> 的概率测度；(A3) 当涉及求和与极限交换时，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 非负或存在可积控制函数。这些假设在本节情境下均成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 取标准生成函数（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\log t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\alpha-1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(t-1)^2$</span>）时凸性与下半连续性直接验证；可数集上求和即积分，控制条件由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的非负性给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-1-f-散度的定义与基本性质\">1. f-散度的定义与基本性质<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-1-f-散度的定义与基本性质\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1.1（非负性与等号条件）</strong> 假设 (A1)(A2)。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_f(P\\|Q)\\ge 0$</span>，且等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=Q$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 严格凸于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的邻域时）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 Jensen 不等式，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 凸且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int \\rho\\,\\mathrm dQ=1$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_f(P\\|Q)=\\int f(\\rho)\\,\\mathrm dQ\\ge f\\!\\left(\\int \\rho\\,\\mathrm dQ\\right)=f(1)=0.$$</div>\n等号条件：Jensen 等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 严格凸的区域内为常数；结合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho\\,\\mathrm dQ=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\equiv 1$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e.，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=Q$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的邻域严格凸，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 取值于该邻域时等号仍强制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\equiv1$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 取该邻域外的值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_f&gt;0$</span> 由严格凸性直接给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与 KL 的关系</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t)=t\\log t$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_f(P\\|Q)=\\int \\rho\\log\\rho\\,\\mathrm dQ=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t)=(t-1)^2$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\chi^2}(P\\|Q)=\\int(\\rho-1)^2\\,\\mathrm dQ$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t)=(\\sqrt t-1)^2$</span>，得 Hellinger 散度的平方 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H^2(P,Q)=\\frac12\\int(\\sqrt\\rho-1)^2\\,\\mathrm dQ$</span>。这些是不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 生成的散度，区别在于对尾部偏差的惩罚阶数：KL 惩罚 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\log t$</span> 的线性增长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 惩罚二次增长，Hellinger 惩罚 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt t$</span> 的饱和增长。三者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\to Q$</span> 时局部等价（二阶 Taylor 展开均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12 f''(1)\\chi^2$</span> 型），但全局行为不同。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度的变分表示）</strong> 假设 (A1)(A2)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 可微、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f^*$</span> 为其凸共轭。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_f(P\\|Q)=\\sup_{g\\in L^\\infty(Q)}\\left\\{\\mathbb E_P[g]-\\mathbb E_Q[f^*(g)]\\right\\},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^*(s)=\\sup_{t&gt;0}\\{st-f(t)\\}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 Fenchel–Young 不等式，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0,s\\in\\mathbb R$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t)\\ge st-f^*(s)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\rho$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=g$</span> 并关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 积分：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int f(\\rho)\\,\\mathrm dQ\\ge \\int g\\rho\\,\\mathrm dQ-\\int f^*(g)\\,\\mathrm dQ=\\mathbb E_P[g]-\\mathbb E_Q[f^*(g)].$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_f\\ge\\sup_g\\{\\cdots\\}$</span>。反向：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=f'(\\rho)$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 有界时合法；一般情形用截断逼近并取极限，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 下半连续与单调收敛定理控制），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^* (g)=g\\rho-f(\\rho)$</span>，代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_P[g]-\\mathbb E_Q[f^*(g)]=\\int f(\\rho)\\,\\mathrm dQ$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该变分表示是第 6 节 Donsker–Varadhan 公式的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度推广：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t)=t\\log t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^*(s)=e^{s-1}$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)=\\sup_g\\{\\mathbb E_P[g]-\\mathbb E_Q[e^{g-1}]\\}$</span>，与第 6 节一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-2-Rényi-散度-定义-极限与序关系\">2. Rényi 散度：定义、极限与序关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-2-Rényi-散度-定义-极限与序关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.1（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to1$</span> 极限）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int \\rho^{1+\\epsilon}\\,\\mathrm dQ&lt;\\infty$</span> 对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span> 成立。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{\\alpha\\to1}D_\\alpha(P\\|Q)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\alpha)=\\int\\rho^\\alpha\\,\\mathrm dQ$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(1)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z'(1)=\\int\\rho\\log\\rho\\,\\mathrm dQ=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)$</span>（求导与积分交换由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho^{1+\\epsilon}\\,\\mathrm dQ&lt;\\infty$</span> 及 Leibniz 法则保证：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(1-\\epsilon,1+\\epsilon)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\rho^\\alpha\\log\\rho|\\le \\rho^{1-\\epsilon}|\\log\\rho|+\\rho^{1+\\epsilon}|\\log\\rho|$</span>，后者可积）。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha=\\frac{\\log Z(\\alpha)}{\\alpha-1}$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(1)=1$</span>，应用 L'Hôpital 法则（分子分母在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span> 处均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 处可微）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\alpha\\to1}D_\\alpha=\\lim_{\\alpha\\to1}\\frac{Z'(\\alpha)}{Z(\\alpha)}=Z'(1)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q).$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.2（单调性）</strong> 假设 (A2) 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha(P\\|Q)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 单调不减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(\\alpha)=\\log\\int\\rho^\\alpha\\,\\mathrm dQ$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 求二阶导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi''(\\alpha)=\\mathrm{Var}_{Q^{(\\alpha)}}(\\log\\rho)\\ge0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{(\\alpha)}$</span> 为密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\alpha/Z(\\alpha)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 的概率测度（求导交换由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 有界或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho^{1+\\epsilon}&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 凸。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(1)=0$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\phi(\\alpha)-\\phi(1)}{\\alpha-1}\\ge \\phi'(1)$</span> 由凸性给出；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&lt;1$</span> 同理。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha=\\frac{\\phi(\\alpha)}{\\alpha-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge \\phi'(1)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&lt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span>，且整体单调。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.3（与 f-散度的关系）</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1)\\cup(1,\\infty)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha(P\\|Q)=\\frac{1}{\\alpha-1}\\log\\left(1+(\\alpha-1)D_{f_\\alpha}(P\\|Q)\\right)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\alpha(t)=\\frac{t^\\alpha-1}{\\alpha-1}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{f_\\alpha}=\\int\\frac{\\rho^\\alpha-1}{\\alpha-1}\\,\\mathrm dQ=\\frac{Z(\\alpha)-1}{\\alpha-1}$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha=\\frac{\\log Z(\\alpha)}{\\alpha-1}=\\frac{\\log(1+(\\alpha-1)D_{f_\\alpha})}{\\alpha-1}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式表明 Rényi 散度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\alpha$</span>-散度的对数变换，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha\\ge0$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{f_\\alpha}\\ge0$</span>，后者由命题 1.1 给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-3-具体例子-二值分布上的闭式计算\">3. 具体例子：二值分布上的闭式计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-3-具体例子-二值分布上的闭式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{0,1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_0,p_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(q_0,q_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i,q_i&gt;0$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha(p\\|q)$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_\\alpha(p\\|q)=\\frac{1}{\\alpha-1}\\log\\left(p_0^\\alpha q_0^{1-\\alpha}+p_1^\\alpha q_1^{1-\\alpha}\\right).$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.7,0.3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(0.5,0.5)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=2$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_2(p\\|q)=\\log\\left(0.7^2/0.5+0.3^2/0.5\\right)=\\log(0.98+0.18)=\\log 1.16\\approx0.14842.$$</div>\nKL 散度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=0.7\\log(0.7/0.5)+0.3\\log(0.3/0.5)\\approx0.7\\cdot0.33647+0.3\\cdot(-0.51083)\\approx0.08229$</span>。验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_2\\ge D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span>，与命题 2.2 一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 散度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\chi^2}=\\frac{(0.7-0.5)^2}{0.5}+\\frac{(0.3-0.5)^2}{0.5}=0.08+0.08=0.16$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 不同但同阶，符合局部二阶等价。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-4-可检验推论-Rényi-散度的数据处理不等式\">4. 可检验推论：Rényi 散度的数据处理不等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-4-可检验推论-Rényi-散度的数据处理不等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 4.1</strong> 假设 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal Y$</span> 为可测映射（确定性信道）。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha(P^K\\|Q^K)\\le D_\\alpha(P\\|Q)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P^K,Q^K$</span> 为 pushforward 测度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=\\mathrm dP/\\mathrm dQ$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^K=\\mathrm dP^K/\\mathrm dQ^K$</span>。由测度变换，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^K(y)=\\mathbb E_Q[\\rho\\mid K^{-1}(y)]$</span>（条件期望，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^{-1}(\\mathcal F_{\\mathcal Y})$</span>）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span>，函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto t^\\alpha$</span> 凸，由 Jensen 不等式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int(\\rho^K)^\\alpha\\,\\mathrm dQ^K=\\int\\mathbb E_Q[\\rho\\mid K^{-1}(y)]^\\alpha\\,\\mathrm dQ^K\\le\\int\\mathbb E_Q[\\rho^\\alpha\\mid K^{-1}(y)]\\,\\mathrm dQ^K=\\int\\rho^\\alpha\\,\\mathrm dQ.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&lt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\alpha$</span> 凹，Jensen 不等式反向，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha$</span> 的分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha-1&lt;0$</span>，不等式方向翻转后仍得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha(P^K\\|Q^K)\\le D_\\alpha(P\\|Q)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论与第 4 节 KL 的数据处理不等式同构，表明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度族整体满足数据处理不等式；这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度作为“信息度量”的结构性特征。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_f(P\\|Q)=\\int f(\\mathrm dP/\\mathrm dQ)\\,\\mathrm dQ$</span> 对凸 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(1)=0$</span> 非负，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=Q$</span>；KL、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span>、Hellinger 平方均为其特例，区别在于对偏差的惩罚阶数。</li>\n<li>Rényi 散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\alpha(t)=(t^\\alpha-1)/(\\alpha-1)$</span> 散度的对数变换，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{\\alpha\\to1}D_\\alpha=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 单调不减；其数据处理不等式由 Jensen 不等式与条件期望给出。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度的变分表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_f(P\\|Q)=\\sup_g\\{\\mathbb E_P[g]-\\mathbb E_Q[f^*(g)]\\}$</span> 是 Donsker–Varadhan 公式的族推广，为后续熵估计与信息几何节提供统一的凸分析接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-6-f-散度的局部二次型-Fisher-信息作为公共极限\">6. f-散度的局部二次型：Fisher 信息作为公共极限<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-6-f-散度的局部二次型-Fisher-信息作为公共极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已建立 Fisher 度量作为信息几何的局部对象；本节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度族在该局部尺度下的统一展开，说明所有二阶正则的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\to Q$</span> 时以同一二次型为主项，差异仅体现在三阶及更高阶项。这一事实是后续信息几何节把 Fisher 度量作为“普适局部度量”的根据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.1（局部展开）</strong> 假设 (A1)(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的邻域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(1)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f'(1)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f''(1)&gt;0$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta$</span> 为可数集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上由参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 光滑参数化的分布族，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta\\ll Q$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\theta=\\mathrm dP_\\theta/\\mathrm dQ$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\theta_0$</span> 处满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\theta_0}\\equiv1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\theta_0}=Q$</span>）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto\\rho_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(Q)$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i\\rho_{\\theta_0}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i\\partial_j\\rho_{\\theta_0}$</span> 平方可积，则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\to\\theta_0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_f(P_\\theta\\|Q)=\\frac{f''(1)}{2}\\,(\\theta-\\theta_0)^\\top I(\\theta_0)\\,(\\theta-\\theta_0)+o(\\|\\theta-\\theta_0\\|^2),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(\\theta_0)$</span> 为 Fisher 信息矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{ij}(\\theta_0)=\\mathbb E_{P_{\\theta_0}}[\\partial_i\\log p_{\\theta_0}\\,\\partial_j\\log p_{\\theta_0}]$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\theta_0}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{\\theta_0}$</span> 关于某支配测度的密度）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\theta-\\theta_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_u=\\rho_{\\theta_0+u}$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_0\\equiv1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho_u\\,\\mathrm dQ=1$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(\\rho_u-1)\\,\\mathrm dQ=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_Q[\\rho_u-1]=0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 处作 Taylor 展开至二阶：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(\\rho_u)=f(1)+f'(1)(\\rho_u-1)+\\frac{f''(1)}{2}(\\rho_u-1)^2+R_2(\\rho_u),$$</div>\n其中余项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_2(t)=o((t-1)^2)$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^3$</span> 保证）。关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 积分，一次项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_Q[\\rho_u-1]=0$</span> 消失，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_f(P_u\\|Q)=\\frac{f''(1)}{2}\\int(\\rho_u-1)^2\\,\\mathrm dQ+\\int R_2(\\rho_u)\\,\\mathrm dQ.$$</div>\n现在计算二次项。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_u$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=0$</span> 处的展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_u=1+\\sum_i u_i\\,\\partial_i\\rho_0+\\frac12\\sum_{i,j}u_iu_j\\,\\partial_i\\partial_j\\rho_0+o(\\|u\\|^2)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(Q)$</span> 收敛），得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int(\\rho_u-1)^2\\,\\mathrm dQ=\\sum_{i,j}u_iu_j\\int\\partial_i\\rho_0\\,\\partial_j\\rho_0\\,\\mathrm dQ+o(\\|u\\|^2).$$</div>\n关键恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i\\rho_0=\\rho_0\\,\\partial_i\\log\\rho_0=\\partial_i\\log\\rho_0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_0\\equiv1$</span>），故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\partial_i\\rho_0\\,\\partial_j\\rho_0\\,\\mathrm dQ=\\mathbb E_Q[\\partial_i\\log\\rho_0\\,\\partial_j\\log\\rho_0]=I_{ij}(\\theta_0).$$</div>\n余项控制：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_2(t)=o((t-1)^2)$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_u\\to1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(Q)$</span> 中，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int R_2(\\rho_u)\\,\\mathrm dQ=o(\\|u\\|^2)$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e. 逐点用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o$</span> 估计，再用控制收敛定理；控制函数取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\rho_u-1)^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f''$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 邻域的上界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_u$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中收敛保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\rho_u-1)^2$</span> 可积）。合并得命题。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6.2（散度的局部等价类）</strong> 在上述假设下，对任意两个满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f''(1)=g''(1)&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\theta\\to\\theta_0}\\frac{D_f(P_\\theta\\|Q)}{D_g(P_\\theta\\|Q)}=1.$$</div>\n特别地，KL（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f''(1)=1$</span>）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f''(1)=2$</span>）、Hellinger 平方（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f''(1)=1/2$</span>）在局部以固定比例 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1:2:1/2$</span> 相互等价，但经各自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f''(1)$</span> 归一化后给出同一 Fisher 二次型。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 6.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_f=\\frac{f''(1)}{2}u^\\top I u+o(\\|u\\|^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_g=\\frac{g''(1)}{2}u^\\top I u+o(\\|u\\|^2)$</span>。相除，主项比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f''(1)/g''(1)=1$</span>，余项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(1)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一推论解释了为何 Fisher 度量在信息几何中具有“普适”地位：它是所有二阶正则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度在局部尺度下的公共二次型，而各散度的全局差异（如对尾部的惩罚）在局部展开中不可见。后续信息几何节将把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(\\theta)$</span> 作为切空间的 Riemann 度量，其合法性正来自命题 6.1。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-7-Rényi-散度的对偶与-alpha--联合凸性\">7. Rényi 散度的对偶与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>-联合凸性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-7-Rényi-散度的对偶与-alpha--联合凸性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Rényi 散度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\alpha$</span> 之间存在对偶关系，这一结构在后续联合生成节中用于构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>-插值的训练目标。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.1（对偶关系）</strong> 假设 (A2) 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q\\ll P$</span>。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1)\\cup(1,\\infty)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_\\alpha(P\\|Q)=\\frac{\\alpha}{1-\\alpha}\\,D_{1-\\alpha}(Q\\|P).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=\\mathrm dP/\\mathrm dQ$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\mathrm dQ/\\mathrm dP=1/\\rho$</span>。计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{1-\\alpha}(Q\\|P)=\\frac{1}{(1-\\alpha)-1}\\log\\int\\sigma^{1-\\alpha}\\,\\mathrm dP=\\frac{1}{-\\alpha}\\log\\int\\rho^{-(1-\\alpha)}\\,\\mathrm dP.$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dP=\\rho\\,\\mathrm dQ$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho^{-(1-\\alpha)}\\,\\mathrm dP=\\int\\rho^{\\alpha}\\,\\mathrm dQ=Z(\\alpha)$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{1-\\alpha}(Q\\|P)=-\\frac{1}{\\alpha}\\log Z(\\alpha)=\\frac{1-\\alpha}{\\alpha}\\cdot\\frac{\\log Z(\\alpha)}{\\alpha-1}=\\frac{1-\\alpha}{\\alpha}D_\\alpha(P\\|Q).$$</div>\n移项即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>对偶关系表明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\leftrightarrow1-\\alpha$</span> 下与反向散度成比例；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1/2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{1/2}(P\\|Q)=D_{1/2}(Q\\|P)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1/2$</span> 的 Rényi 散度是对称的（等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log$</span> Bhattacharyya 系数）。这与 KL 的非对称性形成对照：KL 无此对偶，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t)=t\\log t$</span> 不满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t)=t\\,f(1/t)$</span> 型对称。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>-联合凸性）</strong> 假设 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_1,P_2\\ll Q_1,Q_2$</span>。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in[0,1]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_\\alpha(\\lambda P_1+(1-\\lambda)P_2\\,\\|\\,\\lambda Q_1+(1-\\lambda)Q_2)\\le \\lambda D_\\alpha(P_1\\|Q_1)+(1-\\lambda)D_\\alpha(P_2\\|Q_2).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i(\\alpha)=\\int\\rho_i^\\alpha\\,\\mathrm dQ_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_i=\\mathrm dP_i/\\mathrm dQ_i$</span>。混合分布的密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\lambda=\\frac{\\lambda\\rho_1\\,\\mathrm dQ_1+(1-\\lambda)\\rho_2\\,\\mathrm dQ_2}{\\lambda\\,\\mathrm dQ_1+(1-\\lambda)\\,\\mathrm dQ_2}$</span>。需证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\lambda(\\alpha)\\ge Z_1(\\alpha)^\\lambda Z_2(\\alpha)^{1-\\lambda}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\lambda(\\alpha)=\\int\\rho_\\lambda^\\alpha\\,\\mathrm d(\\lambda Q_1+(1-\\lambda)Q_2)$</span>。由 Hölder 不等式（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&lt;1$</span> 用反向 Hölder，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f^\\alpha g^{1-\\alpha}\\le(\\int f)^\\alpha(\\int g)^{1-\\alpha}$</span> 的凹版本），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int\\rho_\\lambda^\\alpha\\,\\mathrm dQ_\\lambda\\ge\\left(\\int\\rho_1^\\alpha\\,\\mathrm dQ_1\\right)^\\lambda\\left(\\int\\rho_2^\\alpha\\,\\mathrm dQ_2\\right)^{1-\\lambda}.$$</div>\n取对数并除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha-1&lt;0$</span>，不等号翻转，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha$</span> 的联合凸性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha$</span> 不联合凸（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>-联合凸性仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1)$</span> 成立），这与 KL（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span>）的联合凸性边界一致：KL 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to1$</span> 的极限，处于凸性成立的边界上。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-8-与-KL-链式法则的接口-f--散度的条件分解\">8. 与 KL 链式法则的接口：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度的条件分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-8-与-KL-链式法则的接口-f--散度的条件分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度在条件分解下的一个恒等式，它与第 3 节 KL 链式法则同构，但仅在特定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 下成立，说明 KL 链式法则并非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度族的普遍性质。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1（KL 的条件分解是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度中的特例）</strong> 假设 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(x,y)\\ll Q(x,y)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(x)\\ll Q(x)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(y|x)\\ll Q(y|x)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P(x,y)\\|Q(x,y))=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P(x)\\|Q(x))+\\mathbb E_{P(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P(y|x)\\|Q(y|x)).$$</div>\n而对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\neq t\\log t$</span> 的仿射变换），上述分解一般不成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式即第 3 节 KL 链式法则，此处仅验证其与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度框架的兼容性：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t)=t\\log t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_f(P\\|Q)=\\int\\rho\\log\\rho\\,\\mathrm dQ$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(x,y)=\\rho(x)\\rho(y|x)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\log\\rho=\\rho(x)\\rho(y|x)[\\log\\rho(x)+\\log\\rho(y|x)]$</span>，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(x,y)=Q(x)Q(y|x)$</span> 积分分解为两项，即链式法则。</p>\n<p>第二式：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t)=(t-1)^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 散度。在二值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\{0,1\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\{0,1\\}$</span> 上构造反例。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 为均匀分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(x,y)=1/4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(x=0)=P(x=1)=1/2$</span>（故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(x)=Q(x)$</span>，第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\chi^2}(P(x)\\|Q(x))=0$</span>），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(y|x=0)=(0.9,0.1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(y|x=1)=(0.1,0.9)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(y|x)\\neq Q(y|x)$</span>，条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 散度非零。计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\chi^2}(P\\|Q)=\\sum_{x,y}\\frac{(P(x,y)-Q(x,y))^2}{Q(x,y)}.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(0,0)=0.45$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(0,0)=0.25$</span>，贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.2)^2/0.25=0.16$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(0,1)=0.05$</span>，贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.2)^2/0.25=0.16$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(1,0)=0.05$</span>，贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.16$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(1,1)=0.45$</span>，贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.16$</span>。合计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\chi^2}(P\\|Q)=0.64$</span>。而第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{P(x)}D_{\\chi^2}(P(y|x)\\|Q(y|x))$</span>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(y|x=0)=(0.9,0.1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(y|x=0)=(0.5,0.5)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\chi^2}=((0.4)^2+(0.4)^2)/0.5=0.64$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=1$</span> 同样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.64$</span>。故第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=0.64$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\chi^2}(P\\|Q)=0+0.64$</span>，看似成立——但这是均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 的特殊情形。取非均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(x)=(0.7,0.3)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(y|x)$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，则交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x,y}\\frac{(P(x)-Q(x))(P(y|x)-Q(y|x))}{Q(x)Q(y|x)}$</span> 一般不为零，分解失效。完整反例的构造与数值验证归入第 10 节反例节，此处只声明：KL 链式法则的成立依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t)=t\\log t$</span> 使交叉项恰好抵消，这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度族中罕见的代数巧合，而非普遍结构。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一命题的意义在于：第 3 节的 KL 链式法则是后续自回归分解（第 5 章后续节）的数学基础，而它不能推广到任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度；因此在联合生成节中若采用非 KL 散度作为训练目标，链式分解必须重新推导，不能默认继承。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-9-可检验恒等式-f--散度与-Rényi-散度的数值一致性\">9. 可检验恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度与 Rényi 散度的数值一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-9-可检验恒等式-f--散度与-Rényi-散度的数值一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 2.3 与命题 6.1，给出一个可在任意离散分布上检验的恒等式链，用于后续代码节的数值验证。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.1</strong> 假设 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为可数集上正分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1)\\cup(1,\\infty)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_\\alpha(p\\|q)=\\frac{1}{\\alpha-1}\\log\\left(1+(\\alpha-1)\\,D_{f_\\alpha}(p\\|q)\\right),\\qquad f_\\alpha(t)=\\frac{t^\\alpha-1}{\\alpha-1},$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to1$</span> 时右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{f_2}(p\\|q)=\\chi^2(p\\|q)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式即命题 2.3。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to1$</span> 极限由命题 2.1 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\alpha\\to t\\log t$</span> 的连续性给出（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\alpha$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1$</span> 处连续延拓为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\log t$</span>，逐点收敛由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^\\alpha=e^{\\alpha\\log t}$</span> 的连续性保证）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_2(t)=t^2-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{f_2}=\\int(\\rho^2-1)\\,\\mathrm dq=\\int(\\rho-1)^2\\,\\mathrm dq=\\chi^2$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho\\,\\mathrm dq=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(\\rho^2-1)=\\int(\\rho-1)^2$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式链在数值上可逐项验证：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span>，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{f_\\alpha}$</span>、代入对数变换得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha$</span>，再与直接计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha$</span> 比较；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=2$</span> 时与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 比较；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to1$</span> 时与 KL 比较。三条路径应给出同一数值至机器精度，这构成后续代码节验证脚本的数学依据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-10-Rényi-散度的变分表示与-alpha--变分公式\">10. Rényi 散度的变分表示与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>-变分公式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-10-Rényi-散度的变分表示与-alpha--变分公式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1.2 给出了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度的 Fenchel–Young 变分表示。Rényi 散度作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\alpha$</span>-散度的对数变换，其变分表示不能直接继承该形式，因为对数变换破坏了线性结构。本节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha$</span> 的独立变分公式，它在后续熵估计节中用于构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>-变分下界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10.1（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>-变分表示）</strong> 假设 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1)\\cup(1,\\infty)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\rho^\\alpha\\,\\mathrm dQ&lt;\\infty$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_\\alpha(P\\|Q)=\\frac{1}{\\alpha-1}\\log\\sup_{g&gt;0}\\left\\{\\alpha\\,\\mathbb E_P[g^{1-1/\\alpha}]-(1-\\alpha)\\,\\mathbb E_Q[g]\\right\\},$$</div>\n其中上确界取遍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>-a.e. 正的可测函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span> 时要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_Q[g]&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\alpha)=\\int\\rho^\\alpha\\,\\mathrm dQ$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g&gt;0$</span>，由 Young 不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab\\le\\frac{a^p}{p}+\\frac{b^q}{q}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/p+1/q=1$</span>）取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\alpha$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\alpha/(\\alpha-1)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span> 时），得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\rho\\, g^{1-1/\\alpha}\\le\\frac{\\rho^\\alpha}{\\alpha}+\\frac{(\\alpha-1)\\,g}{\\alpha}.$$</div>\n关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 积分并乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\alpha\\int\\rho\\,g^{1-1/\\alpha}\\,\\mathrm dQ\\le\\int\\rho^\\alpha\\,\\mathrm dQ+(\\alpha-1)\\int g\\,\\mathrm dQ.$$</div>\n移项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\,\\mathbb E_P[g^{1-1/\\alpha}]-(\\alpha-1)\\,\\mathbb E_Q[g]\\le Z(\\alpha)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 并除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha-1&gt;0$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha\\ge\\frac{1}{\\alpha-1}\\log\\{\\cdots\\}$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha\\ge$</span> 上确界。</p>\n<p>反向：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\rho^\\alpha$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 有界时合法；一般情形用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^\\alpha\\wedge n$</span> 截断逼近，单调收敛定理控制），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{1-1/\\alpha}=\\rho^{\\alpha-1}$</span>，代入得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\alpha\\,\\mathbb E_P[\\rho^{\\alpha-1}]-(\\alpha-1)\\,\\mathbb E_Q[\\rho^\\alpha]=\\alpha\\int\\rho^\\alpha\\,\\mathrm dQ-(\\alpha-1)\\int\\rho^\\alpha\\,\\mathrm dQ=\\int\\rho^\\alpha\\,\\mathrm dQ=Z(\\alpha).$$</div>\n故上确界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge Z(\\alpha)$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha-1$</span> 得上确界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge D_\\alpha$</span>。合并得等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&lt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\alpha&lt;1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\alpha/(\\alpha-1)&lt;0$</span>，Young 不等式方向翻转，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha-1&lt;0$</span> 使最终不等号方向一致，证明结构相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 10.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to1$</span> 退化为 Donsker–Varadhan）</strong> 在命题 10.1 的假设下，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to1$</span>，则变分公式退化为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)=\\sup_{g&gt;0}\\left\\{\\mathbb E_P[\\log g]-\\mathbb E_Q[g]+1\\right\\},$$</div>\n与第 6 节 Donsker–Varadhan 公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=e^{h}$</span> 替换下一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1+\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to0$</span>。展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g^{1-1/\\alpha}=g^{1-1/(1+\\epsilon)}=g^{\\epsilon/(1+\\epsilon)}=1+\\frac{\\epsilon}{1+\\epsilon}\\log g+O(\\epsilon^2)$</span>。代入命题 10.1 的括号内：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\alpha\\,\\mathbb E_P[g^{1-1/\\alpha}]-(1-\\alpha)\\,\\mathbb E_Q[g]=(1+\\epsilon)\\mathbb E_P\\left[1+\\frac{\\epsilon}{1+\\epsilon}\\log g\\right]+\\epsilon\\,\\mathbb E_Q[g]+O(\\epsilon^2)$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$=1+\\epsilon\\,\\mathbb E_P[\\log g]+\\epsilon\\,\\mathbb E_Q[g]+O(\\epsilon^2).$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 并除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha-1=\\epsilon$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{\\epsilon}\\log\\left(1+\\epsilon(\\mathbb E_P[\\log g]+\\mathbb E_Q[g])+O(\\epsilon^2)\\right)\\to\\mathbb E_P[\\log g]+\\mathbb E_Q[g].$$</div>\n但注意符号：命题 10.1 中第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-(1-\\alpha)\\mathbb E_Q[g]=+\\epsilon\\mathbb E_Q[g]$</span>，故极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_P[\\log g]+\\mathbb E_Q[g]$</span>，与 Donsker–Varadhan 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_P[\\log g]-\\mathbb E_Q[g]+1$</span> 相差符号。更精确地说，命题 10.1 的括号在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to1$</span> 时应重写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_P[\\log g]-\\mathbb E_Q[g]+1$</span> 的形式，这要求将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-h}$</span> 并重新整理；具体地，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=e^{-h}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_P[\\log g]=-\\mathbb E_P[h]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_Q[g]=\\mathbb E_Q[e^{-h}]$</span>，代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_P[h]+\\mathbb E_Q[e^{-h}]$</span>，取负即得 Donsker–Varadhan 的标准形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_h\\{\\mathbb E_P[h]-\\mathbb E_Q[e^{-h}]\\}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论表明 Rényi 变分公式是 Donsker–Varadhan 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>-插值族：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 控制对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 下期望的惩罚指数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to1$</span> 时指数惩罚退化为线性惩罚 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-h}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to\\infty$</span> 时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ess\\,sup}$</span> 型惩罚。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-11-alpha--散度的链式分解障碍-一个精确的代数判据\">11. <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>-散度的链式分解障碍：一个精确的代数判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-11-alpha--散度的链式分解障碍-一个精确的代数判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 8 节已声明 KL 链式法则不能推广到一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度，并给出交叉项非零的定性论证。本节给出精确的代数判据：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度满足链式分解当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\log t$</span> 的仿射变换。这一判据把第 8 节的定性声明升级为可检验的充要条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11.1（链式分解的充要条件）</strong> 假设 (A1)(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C^2$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(1)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f''(1)&gt;0$</span>。则以下两条等价：</p>\n<p>(i) 对任意联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(x,y)\\ll Q(x,y)$</span> 且边缘与条件分布绝对连续，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_f(P(x,y)\\|Q(x,y))=D_f(P(x)\\|Q(x))+\\mathbb E_{P(x)}D_f(P(y|x)\\|Q(y|x));$$</div></p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t)=c\\,t\\log t$</span> 对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (ii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(i)：即第 8 节第一式的计算，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\,t\\log t$</span> 的散度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\,D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span>，KL 链式法则成立。</p>\n<p>(i)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(ii)：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\{0,1\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\{0,1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 为乘积分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(x,y)=Q(x)Q(y)$</span>（条件独立），<span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(x)=Q(x)$</span>（边缘相同）但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(y|x)$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>。此时第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_f(P(x)\\|Q(x))=0$</span>，链式分解要求\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_f(P(x,y)\\|Q(x,y))=\\mathbb E_{Q(x)}D_f(P(y|x)\\|Q(y)).$$</div>\n写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(x,y)=\\frac{P(y|x)}{Q(y)}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_f(P\\|Q)=\\sum_x Q(x)\\sum_y Q(y)\\,f(\\rho(x,y))$</span>。右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x Q(x)\\sum_y Q(y)\\,f(\\rho(x,y))$</span>——两者恒等，故此特例不提供约束。</p>\n<p>取非乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(x,y)=Q(x)Q(y|x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(x)=Q(x)$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(y|x)\\neq Q(y|x)$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(x,y)=\\frac{P(y|x)}{Q(y|x)}-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(x)=\\frac{P(x)}{Q(x)}-1=0$</span>。链式分解的两端之差为交叉项\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta=\\sum_{x,y}Q(x)Q(y|x)\\left[f\\!\\left(\\frac{P(x)}{Q(x)}\\cdot\\frac{P(y|x)}{Q(y|x)}\\right)-f\\!\\left(\\frac{P(y|x)}{Q(y|x)}\\right)\\right]-\\sum_x Q(x)f\\!\\left(\\frac{P(x)}{Q(x)}\\right).$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(x)=Q(x)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{P(x)}{Q(x)}=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(1)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=\\sum_{x,y}Q(x)Q(y|x)\\left[f(r(x,y)+1)-f(r(x,y)+1)\\right]-0=0$</span>。此特例仍不提供约束，因为边缘相同使第一项为零且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(1)=0$</span> 使交叉项消失。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(x)\\neq Q(x)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(y|x)\\neq Q(y|x)$</span> 的一般情形。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(x)=\\frac{P(x)}{Q(x)}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x,y)=\\frac{P(y|x)}{Q(y|x)}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(x,y)=a(x)b(x,y)$</span>。链式分解要求对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b$</span>（满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x Q(x)a(x)=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y Q(y|x)b(x,y)=1$</span>）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{x,y}Q(x)Q(y|x)\\,f(a(x)b(x,y))=\\sum_x Q(x)\\,f(a(x))+\\sum_x Q(x)\\sum_y Q(y|x)\\,f(b(x,y)).$$</div>\n这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的函数方程。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 为均匀分布（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(x)=1/2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(y|x)=1/2$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$a(x)=1+\\epsilon\\,u(x)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x,y)=1+\\epsilon\\,v(x,y)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to0$</span>。两端作二阶 Taylor 展开（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(1)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f'(1)=0$</span> 由 (i) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=b=1$</span> 附近成立的必要条件给出；<span class=\"math-inline\">$f'(1)=0$</span> 可由取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1+\\epsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=1$</span> 时两端一阶项比较得到）：\n左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx\\frac{f''(1)}{2}\\epsilon^2\\sum_{x,y}\\frac14(u(x)+v(x,y))^2$</span>，\n右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx\\frac{f''(1)}{2}\\epsilon^2\\left[\\sum_x\\frac12 u(x)^2+\\sum_{x,y}\\frac14 v(x,y)^2\\right]$</span>。\n两端相等要求交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x,y}\\frac14\\,2u(x)v(x,y)=\\sum_x\\frac12 u(x)\\sum_y\\frac12 v(x,y)$</span> 匹配。但右端无交叉项，故需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y v(x,y)=0$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立——这只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y Q(y|x)(b-1)=0$</span> 时成立，而该条件由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y Q(y|x)b(x,y)=1$</span> 自动给出，故交叉项在均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 下恰好抵消。这解释了第 8 节中均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 的特例为何\"看似成立\"。</p>\n<p>取非均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 打破这一抵消。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(x=0)=3/4$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(x=1)=1/4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(y|x=0)=(2/3,1/3)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(y|x=1)=(1/3,2/3)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(x)=1+\\epsilon\\,u(x)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b(x,y)=1+\\epsilon\\,v(x,y)$</span>，二阶展开后交叉项为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{f''(1)}{2}\\epsilon^2\\cdot2\\sum_{x,y}Q(x)Q(y|x)\\,u(x)v(x,y).$$</div>\n右端交叉项为零。故链式分解成立要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x,y}Q(x)Q(y|x)\\,u(x)v(x,y)=0$</span> 对任意满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x Q(x)u(x)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y Q(y|x)v(x,y)=0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u,v$</span> 成立。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(0)=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$u(1)=-3$</span>（满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac34\\cdot1+\\frac14\\cdot(-3)=0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(0,\\cdot)=(1,-1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(1,\\cdot)=(-1,1)$</span>（满足条件期望为零）。计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{x,y}Q(x)Q(y|x)u(x)v(x,y)=\\frac34\\left[\\frac23\\cdot1\\cdot1+\\frac13\\cdot1\\cdot(-1)\\right]+\\frac14\\left[\\frac13\\cdot(-3)\\cdot(-1)+\\frac23\\cdot(-3)\\cdot1\\right]$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$=\\frac34\\left[\\frac23-\\frac13\\right]+\\frac14\\left[1-2\\right]=\\frac34\\cdot\\frac13+\\frac14\\cdot(-1)=\\frac14-\\frac14=0.$$</div>\n该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u,v$</span> 仍给出零交叉项，说明二阶展开不足以区分。需取三阶项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的三阶 Taylor 系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f'''(1)$</span> 出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{f'''(1)}{6}\\epsilon^3\\sum Q(x)Q(y|x)(u+v)^3$</span>，右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{f'''(1)}{6}\\epsilon^3[\\sum Q(x)u^3+\\sum Q(x)Q(y|x)v^3]$</span>。交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{f'''(1)}{6}\\epsilon^3\\cdot3\\sum Q(x)Q(y|x)(u^2v+uv^2)$</span> 在右端不存在。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u,v$</span> 使该交叉项非零：<span class=\"math-inline\">$u(0)=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$u(1)=-3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(0,\\cdot)=(1,-1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(1,\\cdot)=(-1,1)$</span>，计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{x,y}Q(x)Q(y|x)(u^2v+uv^2)=\\frac34\\left[\\frac23(1\\cdot1+1\\cdot1)+\\frac13(1\\cdot(-1)+1\\cdot1)\\right]+\\frac14\\left[\\frac13(9\\cdot(-1)+(-3)\\cdot1)+\\frac23(9\\cdot1+(-3)\\cdot1)\\right]$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$=\\frac34\\left[\\frac43+0\\right]+\\frac14\\left[\\frac13(-12)+\\frac23(6)\\right]=\\frac34\\cdot\\frac43+\\frac14\\left[-4+4\\right]=1+0=1\\neq0.$$</div>\n故三阶交叉项非零，链式分解对任意非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\log t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 失效。特别地，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\alpha$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\neq1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\alpha'''(1)=\\alpha(\\alpha-1)(\\alpha-2)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\neq2$</span> 时非零；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_2'''=0$</span>，需四阶项，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f_2''''(1)=6\\neq0$</span>，四阶交叉项同样非零。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\alpha$</span> 的链式分解对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\neq1$</span> 失效。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的证明策略是\"逐阶 Taylor 展开 + 构造使交叉项非零的测试函数\"，它把第 8 节的定性声明转化为精确的代数判据：链式分解成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的三阶及以上导数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 处全部为零，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 为二次多项式——但二次多项式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t)=c(t-1)^2$</span> 的散度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\,\\chi^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 的链式分解在非均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 下同样失效（四阶项非零）。唯一使所有阶交叉项消失的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t)=c\\,t\\log t$</span>，因其 Taylor 系数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^{(n)}(1)=c\\,(-1)^{n-1}(n-2)!$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge2$</span>），代入交叉项求和后由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y Q(y|x)v(x,y)=0$</span> 逐阶抵消——这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\log t$</span> 的对数导数结构带来的代数巧合。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 11.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>-散度的链式分解误差下界）</strong> 在命题 11.1 的假设下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\neq1$</span>，存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\alpha&gt;0$</span> 与测试分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|D_\\alpha(P(x,y)\\|Q(x,y))-D_\\alpha(P(x)\\|Q(x))-\\mathbb E_{P(x)}D_\\alpha(P(y|x)\\|Q(y|x))\\right|\\ge C_\\alpha\\,\\|P-Q\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}^3.$$</div>\n即链式分解的误差至少是三阶小量，不能通过一阶修正消除。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 11.1 的证明，三阶交叉项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{f_\\alpha'''(1)}{6}\\cdot3\\sum Q(x)Q(y|x)(u^2v+uv^2)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_\\alpha'''(1)=\\alpha(\\alpha-1)(\\alpha-2)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\neq1,2$</span> 时该系数非零，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|u\\|,\\|v\\|$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|P-Q\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}$</span> 的量级，交叉项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|P-Q\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}^3)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=2$</span>，三阶系数为零但四阶系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_2''''(1)=6$</span> 非零，四阶交叉项同样为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\|P-Q\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}^4)$</span>，仍不低于三阶。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\alpha=\\frac{|\\alpha(\\alpha-1)(\\alpha-2)|}{6}\\cdot\\inf_{u,v}\\sum Q(x)Q(y|x)|u^2v+uv^2|$</span>（在归一化约束下为正），得下界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一推论对后续联合生成节有直接约束：若训练目标采用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>-散度（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\neq1$</span>），则自回归分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(x,y)=P(x)P(y|x)$</span> 的逐因子优化不能保证联合散度最小化，误差至少为三阶；因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>-散度目标下的联合生成必须直接优化联合散度，或显式补偿链式分解误差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-12-具体例子-alpha-2-时链式分解误差的数值验证\">12. 具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=2$</span> 时链式分解误差的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-12-具体例子-alpha-2-时链式分解误差的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取命题 11.1 证明中的测试分布：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(x=0)=3/4$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(x=1)=1/4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(y|x=0)=(2/3,1/3)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(y|x=1)=(1/3,2/3)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(x)=Q(x)$</span>（边缘相同），<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(y|x=0)=(0.8,0.2)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(y|x=1)=(0.2,0.8)$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=2$</span> 的 Rényi 散度与链式分解误差。</p>\n<p>联合分布：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(0,0)=\\frac34\\cdot\\frac23=\\frac12$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(0,1)=\\frac34\\cdot\\frac13=\\frac14$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(1,0)=\\frac14\\cdot\\frac13=\\frac1{12}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(1,1)=\\frac14\\cdot\\frac23=\\frac16$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(0,0)=\\frac34\\cdot0.8=0.6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(0,1)=\\frac34\\cdot0.2=0.15$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(1,0)=\\frac14\\cdot0.2=0.05$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(1,1)=\\frac14\\cdot0.8=0.2$</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$D_2(P\\|Q)=\\log\\sum_{x,y}\\frac{P(x,y)^2}{Q(x,y)}$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum=\\frac{0.36}{0.5}+\\frac{0.0225}{0.25}+\\frac{0.0025}{1/12}+\\frac{0.04}{1/6}=0.72+0.09+0.03+0.24=1.08.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_2(P\\|Q)=\\log1.08\\approx0.07696$</span>。</p>\n<p>边缘项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(x)=Q(x)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_2(P(x)\\|Q(x))=\\log\\sum_x\\frac{Q(x)^2}{Q(x)}=\\log1=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>条件项：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(y|x=0)=(0.8,0.2)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(y|x=0)=(2/3,1/3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y\\frac{P^2}{Q}=\\frac{0.64}{2/3}+\\frac{0.04}{1/3}=0.96+0.12=1.08$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_2=\\log1.08$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(y|x=1)=(0.2,0.8)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(y|x=1)=(1/3,2/3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y\\frac{P^2}{Q}=\\frac{0.04}{1/3}+\\frac{0.64}{2/3}=0.12+0.96=1.08$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_2=\\log1.08$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{P(x)}D_2(P(y|x)\\|Q(y|x))=\\log1.08$</span>。</p>\n<p>链式分解误差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_2(P\\|Q)-0-\\log1.08=0$</span>。此例中误差为零，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(x)=Q(x)$</span> 使交叉项消失（与命题 11.1 证明中\"边缘相同使交叉项消失\"一致）。需取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(x)\\neq Q(x)$</span> 才能观察到非零误差。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(x=0)=0.6$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(x=1)=0.4$</span>，条件分布同上。计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{x,y}\\frac{P(x,y)^2}{Q(x,y)}=\\frac{(0.6\\cdot0.8)^2}{0.5}+\\frac{(0.6\\cdot0.2)^2}{0.25}+\\frac{(0.4\\cdot0.2)^2}{1/12}+\\frac{(0.4\\cdot0.8)^2}{1/6}$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$=\\frac{0.2304}{0.5}+\\frac{0.0144}{0.25}+\\frac{0.0064}{1/12}+\\frac{0.1024}{1/6}=0.4608+0.0576+0.0768+0.6144=1.2096.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_2(P\\|Q)=\\log1.2096\\approx0.19031$</span>。</p>\n<p>边缘项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x\\frac{P(x)^2}{Q(x)}=\\frac{0.36}{0.75}+\\frac{0.16}{0.25}=0.48+0.64=1.12$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_2(P(x)\\|Q(x))=\\log1.12\\approx0.11333$</span>。</p>\n<p>条件项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{P(x)}D_2(P(y|x)\\|Q(y|x))=0.6\\log1.08+0.4\\log1.08=\\log1.08\\approx0.07696$</span>。</p>\n<p>链式分解右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=0.11333+0.07696=0.19029$</span>，与左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.19031$</span> 相差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times10^{-5}$</span>，即三阶小量。这验证了推论 11.2 的误差量级：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|P-Q\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}$</span> 约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.15$</span>，三阶量级约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\times10^{-3}$</span>，实际误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times10^{-5}$</span> 更小，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_2'''(1)=0$</span> 使三阶项消失，误差由四阶项主导（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|P-Q\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}^4$</span> 量级）。该数值例子说明链式分解误差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=2$</span> 时比一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 更小，但非零。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-13-与后续节的接口-alpha--散度在熵估计中的角色\">13. 与后续节的接口：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>-散度在熵估计中的角色<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-13-与后续节的接口-alpha--散度在熵估计中的角色\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节建立的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度与 Rényi 散度框架，为后续熵估计节提供两条接口。</p>\n<p>第一条接口是 Rényi 散度与 Rényi 熵的关系。定义 Rényi 熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_\\alpha(p)=\\frac{1}{1-\\alpha}\\log\\sum_x p(x)^\\alpha$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\neq1$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha(p\\|u)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_\\alpha(p)$</span> 通过均匀分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 联系：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_\\alpha(p\\|u)=\\frac{1}{\\alpha-1}\\log\\left(|\\mathcal X|^{1-\\alpha}\\sum_x p(x)^\\alpha\\right)=\\frac{1}{\\alpha-1}\\left[(1-\\alpha)\\log|\\mathcal X|+\\log\\sum_x p(x)^\\alpha\\right]$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$=\\log|\\mathcal X|-\\frac{1}{1-\\alpha}\\log\\sum_x p(x)^\\alpha=\\log|\\mathcal X|-H_\\alpha(p).$$</div>\n该恒等式把 Rényi 散度转化为 Rényi 熵的补，熵估计节可用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha(p\\|u)$</span> 的估计量间接估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_\\alpha(p)$</span>，避免直接估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum p^\\alpha$</span> 的数值不稳定性。</p>\n<p>第二条接口是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度的变分表示（命题 1.2、命题 10.1）与熵估计中的变分下界。命题 10.1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>-变分公式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha$</span> 的下界，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为参数化函数（如神经网络）时，最大化括号内期望即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha$</span> 的变分估计；该估计是后续代码节中\"KL 非负性数值验证\"的推广——<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>-变分估计的非负性由命题 1.1 保证，数值上可作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_\\alpha\\ge0$</span> 的独立验证路径。</p>\n<p>第三条接口（隐含）是命题 11.1 的链式分解判据对后续\"与最大似然章的接口\"节的约束：最大似然等价于最小化 KL（第 5 节已建立），而 KL 是唯一满足链式分解的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度；因此若后续节把最大似然推广到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span>-散度目标，必须放弃链式分解，或显式引入链式分解误差项。这一约束在联合生成节的训练目标设计中是硬性的，不能通过调参绕过。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar05--h-熵的估计与偏差\">熵的估计与偏差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-熵的估计与偏差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：对离散随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)$</span>；对连续随机变量，微分熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(p)=-\\int p(x)\\log p(x)\\,dx$</span>；KL 散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\mathbb E_{p}[\\log(p/q)]$</span>，且已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)\\ge 0$</span> 等号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iff p=q$</span> a.e.。本节新引入如下符号，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>样本：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,\\dots,X_n$</span> 为 i.i.d. <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim p$</span>，取值于可测空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal X,\\mathcal F)$</span>；离散情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限或可数，连续情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X\\subseteq\\mathbb R^d$</span> 配 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数。</li>\n<li>经验分布：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n(x)=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n \\delta_{X_i}(x)$</span>，离散情形即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n(x)=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n \\mathbf 1\\{X_i=x\\}$</span>。</li>\n<li>插件估计（plug-in estimator）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat H_n=H(\\hat p_n)=-\\sum_x \\hat p_n(x)\\log \\hat p_n(x)$</span>，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>。</li>\n<li>平滑估计：对离散分布取加性平滑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_n(x)=(\\hat p_n(x)+\\lambda)/(1+\\lambda|\\mathcal X|)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span>；对连续情形取核密度估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n(x)=\\frac1{nh^d}\\sum_{i=1}^n K\\!\\left(\\frac{x-X_i}{h}\\right)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 为核、<span class=\"math-inline\">$h&gt;0$</span> 为带宽。</li>\n<li>偏差（bias）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Bias}(\\hat\\theta)=\\mathbb E[\\hat\\theta]-\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 为被估泛函的真值。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需的假设逐条列出，并在每个命题前复述其所需子集：</p>\n<p>(A1) 离散情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=k&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X$</span> 成立（全支撑）。\n(A2) 连续情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 绝对连续，密度仍记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p|\\log p|&lt;\\infty$</span>（可积性），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上有界且具有紧支撑或指数尾（保证核估计的偏差展开中边界项可控）。\n(A3) 核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int K=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int x K(x)\\,dx=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int x^2 K(x)\\,dx=\\kappa_2&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有界且 Lipschitz。\n(A4) 带宽：<span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$nh^d\\to\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span>）。\n(A5) 平滑参数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=\\lambda_n\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\lambda_n\\to\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节的目标是量化“用有限样本估计熵”时不可避免的系统偏差，并给出偏差的显式主阶。这与前序节“KL 非负性”“交叉熵与最大似然”不同：那里讨论的是泛函本身的性质，这里讨论的是估计量的统计性质。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-离散插件估计的偏差主阶\">离散插件估计的偏差主阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-离散插件估计的偏差主阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.8.1（离散插件熵估计的偏差展开）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 2$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\hat H_n]=H(p)-\\frac{k-1}{2n}+O(n^{-2}),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=|\\mathcal X|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-2})$</span> 的常数只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min_x p(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_x=\\sum_{i=1}^n\\mathbf 1\\{X_i=x\\}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N_x)_{x\\in\\mathcal X}\\sim\\mathrm{Multinomial}(n;p)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n(x)=N_x/n$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat H_n=-\\sum_{x} \\frac{N_x}{n}\\log\\frac{N_x}{n}.$$</div>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_x\\ge 1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log N_x$</span> 有定义；<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_x=0$</span> 的项按约定取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\hat H_n]=-\\sum_x \\mathbb E\\!\\left[\\frac{N_x}{n}\\log\\frac{N_x}{n}\\right].$$</div>\n<p>对单项计算。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(m)=\\frac{m}{n}\\log\\frac{m}{n}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=0,\\dots,n$</span>。用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log m=\\log n+\\log(m/n)$</span> 不方便，改用展开：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\ge 1$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{m}{n}\\log\\frac{m}{n}=\\frac{m}{n}\\log m-\\frac{m}{n}\\log n.$$</div>\n<p>利用恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log m=\\log(np_x)+\\log\\frac{m}{np_x}$</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_m=\\frac{m-np_x}{np_x}$</span>，则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\ge1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac{m}{np_x}=\\log(1+\\epsilon_m)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\epsilon_m|&lt;1$</span> 时用 Taylor 展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1+\\epsilon)=\\epsilon-\\frac{\\epsilon^2}{2}+O(\\epsilon^3)$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_x$</span> 以高概率落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$np_x$</span> 的常数倍邻域内（Chernoff 界），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_x&gt;0$</span> 由 (A1)，尾项可被一致控制；具体地，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|m-np_x|\\le np_x/2$</span> 的项用展开，对其余项用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|f(m)|\\le \\frac{m}{n}|\\log\\frac{m}{n}|$</span> 与多项式尾界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(|N_x-np_x|&gt;np_x/2)\\le 2e^{-cnp_x}$</span>（Hoeffding），贡献为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(e^{-cn})$</span>，被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-2})$</span> 吸收。这一步用了 Dominated Convergence 的离散版本：对有限和逐项取极限，控制函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_m|f(m)|&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>在展开区域内，逐项写出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\!\\left[\\frac{N_x}{n}\\log\\frac{N_x}{n}\\right]=\\mathbb E\\!\\left[\\frac{N_x}{n}\\log p_x\\right]+\\mathbb E\\!\\left[\\frac{N_x}{n}\\log\\frac{N_x}{n p_x}\\right].$$</div>\n<p>第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\frac{\\mathbb E[N_x]}{n}\\log p_x=p_x\\log p_x$</span>。第二项令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=N_x/n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=p_x$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(Y/\\mu)=\\log(1+(Y-\\mu)/\\mu)$</span>，展开为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{Y-\\mu}{\\mu}-\\frac{(Y-\\mu)^2}{2\\mu^2}+O\\!\\left(\\frac{|Y-\\mu|^3}{\\mu^3}\\right).$$</div>\n<p>乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 后取期望。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=Y-\\mu$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\delta]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\delta^2]=\\mu(1-\\mu)/n$</span>（多项分布边际为二项分布），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\delta^3]=O(n^{-2})$</span>（三阶累积量）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\!\\left[Y\\log\\frac{Y}{\\mu}\\right]=\\mathbb E\\!\\left[(\\mu+\\delta)\\left(\\frac{\\delta}{\\mu}-\\frac{\\delta^2}{2\\mu^2}\\right)\\right]+O(n^{-2}).$$</div>\n<p>逐项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\mu\\cdot\\delta/\\mu]=\\mathbb E[\\delta]=0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\delta\\cdot\\delta/\\mu]=\\mathbb E[\\delta^2]/\\mu=\\frac{1-\\mu}{n}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\mu\\cdot(-\\delta^2/(2\\mu^2))]=-\\frac{\\mathbb E[\\delta^2]}{2\\mu}=-\\frac{1-\\mu}{2n}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\delta\\cdot(-\\delta^2/(2\\mu^2))]=-\\frac{\\mathbb E[\\delta^3]}{2\\mu^2}=O(n^{-2})$</span>。合并：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\!\\left[Y\\log\\frac{Y}{\\mu}\\right]=\\frac{1-\\mu}{n}-\\frac{1-\\mu}{2n}+O(n^{-2})=\\frac{1-\\mu}{2n}+O(n^{-2}).$$</div>\n<p>因此</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\!\\left[\\frac{N_x}{n}\\log\\frac{N_x}{n}\\right]=p_x\\log p_x+\\frac{1-p_x}{2n}+O(n^{-2}).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求和并取负号：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\hat H_n]=-\\sum_x p_x\\log p_x-\\frac{1}{2n}\\sum_x(1-p_x)+O(n^{-2})=H(p)-\\frac{k-1}{2n}+O(n^{-2}),$$</div>\n<p>末步用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p_x=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x(1-p_x)=k-1$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.8.2（偏差的符号与量级）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Bias}(\\hat H_n)=-\\frac{k-1}{2n}+O(n^{-2})&lt;0$</span> 对充分大的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 成立；即插件估计系统性低估熵，低估量随支撑大小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 线性增长、随样本量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 反比衰减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 5.8.1 直接相减；符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 充分大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-2})$</span> 被主阶支配。证毕。</p>\n<p>这个负偏差的机制是清楚的：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span> 在未观测到的类别上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span> 把这些类别的贡献抹去，等于系统性地丢弃了真实分布在这些类别上的熵贡献；<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 越大、<span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 越小，未观测类别越多，低估越严重。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-连续情形的核密度插件偏差\">连续情形的核密度插件偏差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-连续情形的核密度插件偏差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>连续情形不能直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int \\hat p_n\\log\\hat p_n$</span> 的期望并期待同样的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/n$</span> 修正，因为微分熵的插件估计偏差量级不同，且依赖带宽。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.8.3（核密度插件熵估计的偏差主阶）</strong><br>\n假设 (A2)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 二阶连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\,|\\nabla\\log p|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat h_n=-\\int \\hat p_n(x)\\log \\hat p_n(x)\\,dx$</span>。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$nh^d\\to\\infty$</span> 时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\hat h_n]=h(p)+\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi e h^2)+\\frac{\\kappa_2}{2}h^2\\int p(x)\\,|\\nabla\\log p(x)|^2\\,dx+o(h^2)+O\\!\\left(\\frac{1}{nh^d}\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_2=\\int x^2K(x)\\,dx$</span>（一维写法；<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_2$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int \\|x\\|^2K(x)\\,dx$</span> 并相应调整常数）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong> 分两步：先算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\log \\hat p_n(x)]$</span> 的逐点偏差，再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 积分；交换积分与期望用 Fubini，需验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int \\mathbb E|\\log\\hat p_n(x)|\\hat p_n(x)\\,dx&lt;\\infty$</span>，这由 (A2) 的有界性与紧支撑保证（在支撑外 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span> 的尾被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 的紧支撑控制）。逐点：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n(x)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个 i.i.d. 变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{h^d}K((x-X_i)/h)$</span> 的均值，其期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K_h*p)(x)$</span>，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/(nh^d))$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 在均值处展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\log\\hat p_n(x)]=\\log(K_h*p)(x)-\\frac{\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat p_n(x))}{2(K_h*p)(x)^2}+O\\!\\left(\\frac{1}{(nh^d)^2}\\right).$$</div>\n<p>第一项用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_h*p$</span> 的 Taylor 展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(K_h*p)(x)=p(x)+\\frac{\\kappa_2}{2}h^2\\Delta p(x)+o(h^2)$</span>（用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int K=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int xK=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int x^2K=\\kappa_2$</span>）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(K_h*p)=\\log p+\\frac{\\kappa_2 h^2}{2}\\frac{\\Delta p}{p}+o(h^2)$</span>。第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat p_n(x))=\\frac{1}{nh^d}\\left(\\int K^2\\right)p(x)+o(1/(nh^d))$</span>，故修正为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\int K^2}{2nh^d}\\cdot\\frac{1}{p(x)}$</span>。合并后乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span> 的期望再积分，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat p_n\\log\\hat p_n]$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\hat p_n$</span> 相关，需用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat p_n\\log\\hat p_n]=\\mathbb E[\\hat p_n]\\mathbb E[\\log\\hat p_n]+\\mathrm{Cov}$</span>，而协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/(nh^d))$</span> 的高阶，被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/(nh^d))$</span> 项吸收。最终对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 积分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\frac{\\Delta p}{p}=\\int\\Delta p=0$</span>（紧支撑或指数尾下边界通量消失，这是 (A2) 中紧支撑假设的用处），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p|\\nabla\\log p|^2=-\\int\\Delta p\\log p$</span>（分部积分，边界项为零），得到命题中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\kappa_2}{2}h^2\\int p|\\nabla\\log p|^2$</span> 项。证毕（关键等式已逐步写出，省略的仅为标准 Taylor 余项估计）。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.8.4（带宽的双重角色）</strong> 在命题 5.8.3 的条件下，偏差由两项竞争：<span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi e h^2)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 减小而趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>（核平滑带来的熵损失），<span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\frac{\\kappa_2}{2}h^2\\int p|\\nabla\\log p|^2$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 增大而增大。二者符号相反，故不存在使两项同时消失的带宽；最优带宽按均方误差平衡 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(nh^d)$</span>，量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^*\\asymp n^{-1/(d+4)}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一项对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 单调递减（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\downarrow0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log h\\to-\\infty$</span>），第二项对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 单调递增；令二者对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 的导数绝对值相等即得平衡条件，标准计算给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^*\\asymp n^{-1/(d+4)}$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>这与离散情形形成对照：离散插件偏差是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/n)$</span> 的加性常数，可通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\frac{k-1}{2n}$</span> 修正；连续情形的偏差含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log h$</span> 项，不能靠简单加性常数修正，必须选带宽。这正是后续“连续熵与离散熵的差异”一节要展开的接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-一个可检验的恒等式-偏差与-KL-的关系\">一个可检验的恒等式：偏差与 KL 的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-一个可检验的恒等式-偏差与-KL-的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.8.5（插件偏差的 KL 表示）</strong> 假设 (A1) 成立。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\hat H_n]=H(p)-\\mathbb E\\!\\left[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|p)\\right]+\\mathbb E\\!\\left[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|\\hat p_n)\\right],$$</div>\n<p>右端末项为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat H_n]=H(p)-\\mathbb E[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|p)]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对任意两个离散分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r,s$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 全支撑），有恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(r)=-\\sum_x r(x)\\log r(x)=-\\sum_x r(x)\\log s(x)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(r\\|s).$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\hat p_n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=p$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat H_n=-\\sum_x\\hat p_n(x)\\log p(x)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|p)$</span>。取期望，第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\mathbb E[-\\sum_x\\hat p_n(x)\\log p(x)]=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)=H(p)$</span>（用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat p_n(x)]=p(x)$</span> 与 Fubini，有限和）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat H_n]=H(p)-\\mathbb E[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|p)]$</span>。末项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|\\hat p_n)=0$</span> 由前序节 KL 等号条件。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.8.6</strong> 在 (A1) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|p)]=\\frac{k-1}{2n}+O(n^{-2})$</span>，与命题 5.8.1 一致。这给出偏差的第二种读法：插件熵的低估恰好等于经验分布到真实分布的平均 KL——估计误差就是散度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 5.8.5 与 5.8.1 相减即得。证毕。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-数值验证\">数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证命题 5.8.1 的偏差主阶与推论 5.8.6 的 KL 恒等式，并检查连续情形命题 5.8.3 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log h$</span> 项的存在性（用一维标准正态与高斯核，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.special import xlogy\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\n\n# ---------- 离散情形：验证 Bias = -(k-1)/(2n) ----------\nk = 5\np = np.array([0.05, 0.15, 0.3, 0.3, 0.2])\np = p / p.sum()\nH_true = -np.sum(xlogy(p, p))\n\ndef plugin_entropy(counts, n):\n    q = counts / n\n    return -np.sum(xlogy(q, q))  # xlogy(0,0)=0\n\nn = 2000\nreps = 4000\nbias_est = []\nkl_est = []\nfor _ in range(reps):\n    counts = rng.multinomial(n, p)\n    q = counts / n\n    bias_est.append(plugin_entropy(counts, n) - H_true)\n    mask = q &gt; 0\n    kl_est.append(np.sum(xlogy(q[mask], q[mask] / p[mask])))\nbias_est = np.array(bias_est)\nkl_est = np.array(kl_est)\n\npred = -(k - 1) / (2 * n)\nprint(&quot;离散: 经验平均偏差 =&quot;, bias_est.mean(), &quot; 预测主阶 =&quot;, pred)\nprint(&quot;离散: 经验平均 KL(hat p || p) =&quot;, kl_est.mean(), &quot; 预测主阶 =&quot;, (k - 1) / (2 * n))\nassert abs(bias_est.mean() - pred) &lt; 5e-4\nassert abs(kl_est.mean() - (k - 1) / (2 * n)) &lt; 5e-4\n\n# ---------- 连续情形：验证 log h 项 ----------\nfrom scipy.stats import norm\n\nd = 1\nh_true = 0.5 * np.log(2 * np.pi * np.e)  # 标准正态微分熵\n\ndef kde_entropy(samples, h):\n    # 高斯核，在样本网格上数值积分（足够细）\n    grid = np.linspace(-8, 8, 4001)\n    dens = np.zeros_like(grid)\n    for s in samples:\n        dens += norm.pdf((grid - s) / h) / h\n    dens /= len(samples)\n    dens = np.clip(dens, 1e-300, None)\n    return -np.trapezoid(dens * np.log(dens), grid)\n\nn_cont = 500\nreps_cont = 60\nfor h in [0.4, 0.2, 0.1]:\n    est = []\n    for _ in range(reps_cont):\n        xs = rng.standard_normal(n_cont)\n        est.append(kde_entropy(xs, h))\n    est = np.array(est)\n    pred_log = 0.5 * np.log(2 * np.pi * np.e * h**2)\n    print(f&quot;连续: h={h}, 经验平均 = {est.mean():.4f}, h(p)+0.5log(2πe h^2) = {h_true + pred_log:.4f}&quot;)\n    # 随 h 减小，估计值应下降（log h 项主导）\nassert kde_entropy(rng.standard_normal(n_cont), 0.1) &lt; kde_entropy(rng.standard_normal(n_cont), 0.4)\n\nprint(&quot;形状检查: bias_est&quot;, bias_est.shape, &quot;kl_est&quot;, kl_est.shape)\nprint(&quot;全部断言通过&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：离散部分经验偏差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-0.001$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$-(k-1)/(2n)=-4/4000=-0.001$</span>），KL 均值约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+0.001$</span>；连续部分随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.4$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span>，估计熵明显下降，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\frac12\\log(2\\pi e h^2)$</span> 的负向趋势一致。断言全部通过则验证了本节两个主阶公式与恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>离散插件熵估计的偏差主阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{k-1}{2n}$</span>，系统性低估、量级由支撑大小与样本量决定；该偏差可等价写成经验分布到真实分布的平均 KL，把“估计误差”与“散度”统一为同一对象。</li>\n<li>连续情形的核密度插件偏差含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi e h^2)$</span> 项，带宽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 同时控制平滑损失与方差，最优带宽按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n^{-1/(d+4)}$</span> 平衡，不能靠加性常数修正——这是连续熵与离散熵估计的分水岭。</li>\n<li>本节所有偏差展开均在显式假设 (A1)–(A5) 下给出，关键步骤用 Taylor 展开、Hoeffding 尾界与 Fubini 交换，边界通量消失由紧支撑或指数尾保证；支撑不匹配导致 KL 无界的情形留待反例节处理。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-平滑估计的偏差-加性平滑与-1-n-修正的极限\">平滑估计的偏差：加性平滑与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/n$</span> 修正的极限<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-平滑估计的偏差-加性平滑与-1-n-修正的极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>插件估计的负偏差提示我们：若能在估计前把零计数“填平”，偏差应当被压低。加性平滑正是这一思想的精确化。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限、<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=k$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde p_n(x)=\\frac{\\hat p_n(x)+\\lambda}{1+\\lambda k},\\qquad \\tilde H_n=-\\sum_x \\tilde p_n(x)\\log\\tilde p_n(x).$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 5.8.7（平滑估计的偏差展开）</strong> 假设 (A1) 与 (A5) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_n\\to0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\lambda_n\\to\\infty$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\tilde H_n]=H(p)-\\frac{1}{2n}\\sum_x\\frac{1-p_x}{1+\\lambda_n k}+O(\\lambda_n)+O\\!\\left(\\frac{1}{n^2\\lambda_n}\\right).$$</div>\n<p>特别地，若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_n=\\frac{1}{n}$</span>，则主阶偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{2n}\\sum_x\\frac{1-p_x}{1+k/n}$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 固定、<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{k-1}{2n}$</span> 的一阶修正，但二阶项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_n$</span> 项污染；若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_n\\gg 1/n$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_n\\to0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/(n^2\\lambda_n))$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\lambda_n)$</span> 同时可控，偏差可压到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(1/n)$</span> 以下。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\lambda_n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=1+ak$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_x=\\tilde p_n(x)=(N_x/n+a)/Z$</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_x$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_x$</span> 的仿射函数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[Y_x]=(p_x+a)/Z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(Y_x)=\\frac{p_x(1-p_x)}{nZ^2}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(y)=y\\log y$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_x=(p_x+a)/Z$</span> 处展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(Y_x)=f(\\mu_x)+f'(\\mu_x)(Y_x-\\mu_x)+\\tfrac12 f''(\\mu_x)(Y_x-\\mu_x)^2+\\tfrac16 f'''(\\xi_x)(Y_x-\\mu_x)^3,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f'(y)=\\log y+1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f''(y)=1/y$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f'''(y)=-1/y^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_x$</span> 介于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_x$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_x$</span> 之间。取期望，一次项消失：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[f(Y_x)]=\\mu_x\\log\\mu_x+\\frac{1}{2\\mu_x}\\mathrm{Var}(Y_x)+\\mathbb E\\!\\left[\\tfrac16 f'''(\\xi_x)(Y_x-\\mu_x)^3\\right].$$</div>\n<p>三阶项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|f'''(\\xi_x)|\\le 1/\\xi_x^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_x\\ge \\min(Y_x,\\mu_x)\\ge a/Z$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_x\\ge a/Z$</span> 恒成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_x\\ge a/Z$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|f'''(\\xi_x)|\\le (Z/a)^2$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|Y_x-\\mu_x|^3\\le (\\mathrm{Var}(Y_x))^{3/2}\\cdot C$</span>（由 Hölder 与二项分布三阶矩界），故三阶项绝对值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le C(Z/a)^2\\cdot(\\mathrm{Var}(Y_x))^{3/2}=O((n a)^{-3/2}\\cdot a^{-2})=O(n^{-3/2}a^{-7/2})$</span>，被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/(n^2a))$</span> 吸收（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$na\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n^{-3/2}a^{-7/2}\\le n^{-2}a^{-1}$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n^{1/2}\\ge a^{-5/2}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$na^5\\le 1$</span> 不成立时需另判；此处直接保留 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/(n^2a))$</span> 为主余项，三阶项更小，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a^{-7/2}$</span> 增长快于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a^{-1}$</span>，故须要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$na\\to\\infty$</span> 足够快，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n a^{5}\\to\\infty$</span>；在 (A5) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_n\\gg1/n$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_n\\to0$</span> 下该条件对充分大的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 成立，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_n=n^{-1/3}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$na^5=n^{1-5/3}=n^{-2/3}\\to0$</span> 不满足，故须 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_n\\gg n^{-1/5}$</span>；命题陈述中已将三阶项并入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/(n^2\\lambda_n))$</span>，其成立需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_n\\gg n^{-1/5}$</span>，此为 (A5) 的加强，下文明确写入假设）。</p>\n<p>于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[f(Y_x)]=\\frac{p_x+a}{Z}\\log\\frac{p_x+a}{Z}+\\frac{1-p_x}{2nZ(p_x+a)}+O\\!\\left(\\frac{1}{n^2a}\\right).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求和并取负号。先处理主项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x \\frac{p_x+a}{Z}\\log\\frac{p_x+a}{Z}$</span>。写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{p_x+a}{Z}=p_x\\cdot\\frac{1+a/p_x}{Z}$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{p_x+a}{Z}=\\log p_x+\\log(1+a/p_x)-\\log Z.$$</div>\n<p>故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_x\\frac{p_x+a}{Z}\\log\\frac{p_x+a}{Z}=\\sum_x\\frac{p_x+a}{Z}\\log p_x+\\sum_x\\frac{p_x+a}{Z}\\log(1+a/p_x)-\\log Z.$$</div>\n<p>第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\frac{1}{Z}\\sum_x p_x\\log p_x+\\frac{a}{Z}\\sum_x\\log p_x=\\frac{1}{Z}(-H(p))+\\frac{a}{Z}\\sum_x\\log p_x$</span>。第二项用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1+a/p_x)=a/p_x+O(a^2)$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x\\frac{p_x+a}{Z}\\cdot\\frac{a}{p_x}+O(a^2)=\\frac{a}{Z}\\sum_x\\frac{p_x+a}{p_x}+O(a^2)=\\frac{a}{Z}\\left(k+a\\sum_x\\frac{1}{p_x}\\right)+O(a^2)$</span>。第三项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z=-\\log(1+ak)=-ak+O(a^2)$</span>。合并，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{Z}=1-ak+O(a^2)$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_x\\frac{p_x+a}{Z}\\log\\frac{p_x+a}{Z}=-H(p)+ak\\,H(p)+\\frac{a}{Z}\\sum_x\\log p_x+\\frac{a}{Z}\\left(k+a\\sum_x\\frac1{p_x}\\right)-ak+O(a^2).$$</div>\n<p>取负号后，含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 的项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-akH(p)-\\frac{a}{Z}\\sum_x\\log p_x-\\frac{a}{Z}k+ak+O(a^2)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(a)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x\\log p_x$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 均为常数）。故主项贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)+O(a)$</span>。</p>\n<p>再处理方差修正项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_x\\frac{1-p_x}{2nZ(p_x+a)}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{Z(p_x+a)}\\to\\frac{1}{p_x}$</span>，故该项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=-\\frac{1}{2n}\\sum_x\\frac{1-p_x}{p_x}+O(a/n)$</span>。但注意这与命题陈述中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2n}\\sum_x\\frac{1-p_x}{1+ak}$</span> 形式不同：陈述中分母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+ak$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_x+a$</span>，这是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_x+a\\approx p_x$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\approx1$</span> 的近似写成了统一形式；严格的主阶应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{2n}\\sum_x\\frac{1-p_x}{p_x}$</span> 乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/Z$</span> 的修正，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\ll p_x$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{p_x+a}=\\frac{1}{p_x}(1-a/p_x+O(a^2))$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\sum_x\\frac{1-p_x}{2nZ(p_x+a)}=-\\frac{1}{2n}\\sum_x\\frac{1-p_x}{p_x}+O\\!\\left(\\frac{a}{n}\\right).$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x\\frac{1-p_x}{p_x}=\\sum_x\\frac1{p_x}-k$</span>，与插件情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x(1-p_x)=k-1$</span> 不同：平滑把零计数填平后，方差修正的分母变成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_x$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故平滑估计的偏差主阶一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{k-1}{2n}$</span>，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{2n}\\left(\\sum_x\\frac1{p_x}-k\\right)$</span>，仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 接近均匀（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_x\\approx1/k$</span>）时二者一致。命题陈述中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{1+\\lambda_n k}$</span> 形式是在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_x\\gg a$</span> 且把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_x$</span> 近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/k$</span> 时的简化写法；严格结论以本证明给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{2n}\\sum_x\\frac{1-p_x}{p_x}+O(a/n)$</span> 为准。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.8.8（平滑不能消除偏差，只能改变其常数）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A5) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_n\\gg n^{-1/5}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_n\\to0$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Bias}(\\tilde H_n)=-\\frac{1}{2n}\\left(\\sum_x\\frac1{p_x}-k\\right)+O(\\lambda_n)+O(1/(n^2\\lambda_n))$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_n=n^{-1/4}$</span> 可使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\lambda_n)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/(n^2\\lambda_n))=O(n^{-7/4})$</span> 均小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/n)$</span> 的主阶，故平滑估计的偏差主阶仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/n)$</span>，但常数从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{k-1}{2}$</span> 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12(\\sum_x 1/p_x-k)$</span>，后者一般更大（由 Jensen，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x1/p_x\\ge k^2$</span>，故常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge\\frac{k(k-1)}{2}$</span>，远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{k-1}{2}$</span>）。因此加性平滑在降低方差的同时可能放大偏差，不能作为“无偏化”手段。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 5.8.7 的严格主阶与 Jensen 不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x1/p_x\\ge k^2/\\sum_x p_x=k^2$</span> 直接得常数下界；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_n=n^{-1/4}$</span> 验证两项余项量级。证毕。</p>\n<p>这一推论纠正了一个常见误解：平滑估计并非“更准的熵估计”，它把偏差从“未观测类别被抹去”换成“方差修正的分母变小”，在稀疏分布（某些 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_x$</span> 很小）上偏差反而更糟。真正把偏差压到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(1/n)$</span> 需要更精细的修正项，例如在插件估计上直接加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\hat k-1}{2n}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat k$</span> 为观测到的非零类别数），这属于后续“与最大似然章的接口”一节的范围。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-偏差的可加分解-泛函与估计量的分离\">偏差的可加分解：泛函与估计量的分离<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-偏差的可加分解-泛函与估计量的分离\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上面的计算反复出现同一个结构：偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=$</span>（泛函在经验分布处的值）<span class=\"math-inline\">$-$</span>（泛函在真实分布处的值）的期望。把这一结构抽象出来，可得到本节的一般框架。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.8.9（泛函偏差的 Delta 方法）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P$</span> 为分布族，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 为泛函，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span> 为经验分布。假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 处 Fréchet 可微，一阶导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$DT_p$</span> 为有界线性泛函，二阶导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D^2T_p$</span> 存在且在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的邻域内有界。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[T(\\hat p_n)]=T(p)+\\frac{1}{2n}\\mathrm{tr}\\!\\left(D^2T_p[\\delta_x\\otimes\\delta_x]\\right)\\Big|_{x\\sim p}+o(1/n),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}$</span> 表示对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\sim p$</span> 取期望后的迹，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2n}\\mathbb E_{x\\sim p}D^2T_p[\\delta_x,\\delta_x]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 处作二阶 Taylor 展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T(\\hat p_n)=T(p)+DT_p[\\hat p_n-p]+\\frac12D^2T_p[\\hat p_n-p,\\hat p_n-p]+R_3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|R_3\\|=O(\\|\\hat p_n-p\\|^3)$</span>。取期望，一次项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[DT_p[\\hat p_n-p]]=DT_p[\\mathbb E\\hat p_n-p]=0$</span>（线性与 Fubini）。二次项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n-p=\\frac1n\\sum_i(\\delta_{X_i}-p)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E D^2T_p[\\hat p_n-p,\\hat p_n-p]=\\frac{1}{n^2}\\sum_{i,j}\\mathbb E D^2T_p[\\delta_{X_i}-p,\\delta_{X_j}-p].$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_i,X_j$</span> 独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\delta_{X_i}-p]=0$</span>，交叉项为零；<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=j$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E D^2T_p[\\delta_{X}-p,\\delta_{X}-p]=\\mathbb E D^2T_p[\\delta_X,\\delta_X]-2D^2T_p[p,p]+D^2T_p[p,p]=\\mathbb E D^2T_p[\\delta_X,\\delta_X]-D^2T_p[p,p]$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D^2T_p[p,p]$</span> 对概率泛函通常为零（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 在仿射方向上的二阶导消失，例如熵的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D^2T_p[r,s]=-\\sum_x r(x)s(x)/p(x)$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=s=p$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_x p_x=-1\\ne0$</span>，故此项不总为零，须保留）。合并：二次项期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\frac1n\\left(\\mathbb E D^2T_p[\\delta_X,\\delta_X]-D^2T_p[p,p]\\right)$</span>。三阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|R_3\\|=O(n^{-3/2})$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat p_n-p\\|^3=O(n^{-3/2})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_2$</span> 或全变差），被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(1/n)$</span> 吸收。证毕。</p>\n<p>对熵泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(r)=-\\sum_x r\\log r$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$DT_p[s]=-\\sum_x s(x)(\\log p(x)+1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D^2T_p[r,s]=-\\sum_x r(x)s(x)/p(x)$</span>。代入命题 5.8.9：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E D^2T_p[\\delta_X,\\delta_X]=-\\sum_x p_x/p_x=-k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D^2T_p[p,p]=-\\sum_x p_x=-1$</span>，故二次项期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\frac1n(-k+1)=-\\frac{k-1}{n}$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{k-1}{2n}$</span>，与命题 5.8.1 完全一致。这验证了 Delta 方法框架的正确性，也说明命题 5.8.1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-2})$</span> 余项对应 Taylor 三阶及更高阶项。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.8.10（偏差的泛函不变性）</strong> 若两个泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_1,T_2$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_1-T_2$</span> 为仿射泛函（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D^2(T_1-T_2)=0$</span>），则它们的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/n)$</span> 偏差相同。特别地，交叉熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(r)=-\\sum_x r\\log p$</span> 是仿射的，其偏差为零；故熵的偏差全部来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的非仿射部分，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|p)$</span> 的平均。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 仿射泛函的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D^2=0$</span>，由命题 5.8.9 二次项为零；交叉熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[-\\sum_x\\hat p_n\\log p]=H(p)$</span> 精确成立（Fubini，有限和），故偏差为零。熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=$</span> 交叉熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-$</span> KL，交叉熵无偏，故熵的偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=-\\mathbb E[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|p)]$</span>，与命题 5.8.5 一致。证毕。</p>\n<p>这一分解把“熵估计偏差”彻底归约为“KL 估计偏差”，而 KL 的偏差又由命题 5.8.9 的二次项给出。它同时说明：任何试图通过加性修正消除熵偏差的方案，本质上是在估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|p)]$</span> 的二次项，而该项依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的全部坐标（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x1/p_x$</span>），无法仅从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span> 的支撑大小读出——这正是平滑估计（推论 5.8.8）失败的根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-高维与稀疏情形-偏差随维度的增长\">高维与稀疏情形：偏差随维度的增长<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-高维与稀疏情形-偏差随维度的增长\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>离散情形中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 可随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 增长（高维离散分布），此时命题 5.8.1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-2})$</span> 余项常数依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min_x p_x$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_x$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 衰减时该常数爆炸，主阶不再可靠。给出一个可检验的边界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.8.11（稀疏离散分布的偏差下界）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限、<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上均匀（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_x=1/k$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 2$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\hat H_n]=\\log k-\\frac{k-1}{2n}+O\\!\\left(\\frac{k^2}{n^2}\\right),$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\gg n$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat H_n]\\le\\log n+O(1)$</span>，即插件估计的期望熵被样本量而非支撑大小控制。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由命题 5.8.1 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_x=1/k$</span> 直接得，余项常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min_x p_x=1/k$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-2})$</span> 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(k^2/n^2)$</span>（三阶项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E|\\delta|^3/\\mu^3$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=1/k$</span>，故量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k^3\\cdot n^{-3/2}\\cdot k^{-3}=n^{-3/2}$</span> 乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的幂需重算：实际三阶项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(k^2/n^2)$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\delta^3]=O(1/n^2)$</span> 且分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^2=k^2$</span>）。第二式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat H_n\\le\\log(\\text{非零类别数})\\le\\log n$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum\\hat p\\log\\hat p\\le\\log|\\mathrm{supp}\\,\\hat p|\\le\\log n$</span>，因非零类别数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>），取期望得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat H_n]\\le\\log n$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\gg n$</span> 时，真实熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log k$</span> 远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log n$</span>，插件估计严重低估——这不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/n$</span> 修正能弥补的，因为未观测类别占绝大多数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log0=0$</span> 抹去了它们的全部贡献。此时任何基于插件估计的熵估计都失效，必须改用未观测类别的显式修正（如 Good–Turing 类方法），这超出本节范围，但边界已由命题 5.8.11 精确刻画。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-偏差与方差的权衡-均方误差的显式表达\">偏差与方差的权衡：均方误差的显式表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-偏差与方差的权衡-均方误差的显式表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个可检验的恒等式，把偏差、方差与均方误差联系起来，作为本节与后续“代码：熵与 KL 的数值计算”一节的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.8.12（插件熵估计的均方误差主阶）</strong> 假设 (A1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{MSE}(\\hat H_n)=\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat H_n)+\\mathrm{Bias}(\\hat H_n)^2=\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_x p_x(\\log p_x+H(p))^2+O(n^{-3/2}),$$</div>\n<p>其中方差主阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n\\sum_x p_x(\\log p_x+H(p))^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 方差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat H_n$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span> 的光滑函数，由 Delta 方法，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat H_n)=\\frac1n\\mathrm{Var}_{X\\sim p}(DT_p[\\delta_X])+O(n^{-3/2})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$DT_p[\\delta_X]=-(\\log p(X)+1)$</span>，其方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[(\\log p(X)+1)^2]-(\\mathbb E_p[\\log p(X)+1])^2=\\sum_x p_x(\\log p_x+1)^2-(-H(p)+1)^2$</span>。展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p_x(\\log p_x+1)^2=\\sum_x p_x\\log^2p_x+2\\sum_x p_x\\log p_x+1=\\sum_x p_x\\log^2p_x-2H(p)+1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(-H(p)+1)^2=H(p)^2-2H(p)+1$</span>。相减得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p_x\\log^2p_x-H(p)^2=\\sum_x p_x(\\log p_x+H(p))^2$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p_x\\log p_x=-H(p)$</span>，交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2H(p)\\sum_x p_x\\log p_x=-2H(p)^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p_x(\\log p_x+H(p))^2=\\sum_x p_x\\log^2p_x+2H(p)(-H(p))+H(p)^2=\\sum_x p_x\\log^2p_x-H(p)^2$</span>）。偏差平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-2})$</span>，被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-3/2})$</span> 吸收（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n^{-2}\\le n^{-3/2}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge1$</span>）。证毕。</p>\n<p>该式表明：方差主阶由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_x$</span> 的离散程度决定，分布越不均匀方差越大；偏差平方是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(n^{-2})$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 充分大时被方差主阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/n)$</span> 支配。故 MSE 的最优修正策略是优先降方差（如平滑），而非消除偏差——这与推论 5.8.8 的结论互补：平滑降方差但升偏差，净效应需按上式逐项权衡。数值上，命题 5.8.12 的方差公式可直接用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span> 代入检验，是后续代码节的验证目标之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar05--h-连续熵与离散熵的差异\">连续熵与离散熵的差异<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-连续熵与离散熵的差异\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：对离散随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 取值于可数集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span>，概率质量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=\\mathbb P(X=x)$</span>，熵定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)=-\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal X}p(x)\\log p(x),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 取自然对数，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>。对连续随机变量取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>，若其分布关于 Lebesgue 测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 绝对连续，密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，微分熵定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h(f)=-\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}f(x)\\log f(x)\\,\\mathrm dx,$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f\\in L^1(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 时该积分存在（可能为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，但本节假设有限）。KL 散度对离散情形为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sum_x p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}$</span>，对连续情形为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(f\\|g)=\\int f\\log\\frac{f}{g}\\,\\mathrm d\\lambda$</span>，均在前序节已定义并证明非负性。本节新引入的符号仅有：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上 Lebesgue 测度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 表示 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数；对离散化网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta&gt;0$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G_\\Delta=\\{k\\Delta:k\\in\\mathbb Z^d\\}$</span> 与胞腔 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k=\\prod_{i=1}^d[k_i\\Delta,(k_i+1)\\Delta)$</span>；离散化质量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\Delta(k)=\\mathbb P(X\\in C_k)$</span>。所有命题的假设在陈述中逐条列出。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是澄清一个常被混淆的事实：离散熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 与微分熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(f)$</span> 在定义上形式相似，但在变换与极限意义下行为根本不同。离散熵是概率质量函数的泛函，对可逆重参数化不变；微分熵是密度的泛函，依赖坐标选取，且在粗粒化极限下发散。二者通过“离散化 + 减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\Delta$</span>”的桥梁公式相联系，但该桥梁仅在固定网格、固定密度下成立，不能反过来把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(f)$</span> 当作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 的极限。以下逐项展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-1-定义层面的差异-质量函数泛函-vs-密度泛函\">1. 定义层面的差异：质量函数泛函 vs 密度泛函<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-1-定义层面的差异-质量函数泛函-vs-密度泛函\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>离散熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 的自变量是概率质量函数，定义域为单纯形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p\\in\\ell^1(\\mathcal X):p\\ge 0,\\sum_x p(x)=1\\}$</span>，取值非负。微分熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(f)$</span> 的自变量是概率密度，定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{f\\in L^1(\\mathbb R^d):f\\ge 0,\\int f\\,\\mathrm d\\lambda=1\\}$</span>，取值可为负。二者的第一个结构性差异是<strong>坐标依赖性</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（微分熵的坐标变换公式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>，密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f\\in L^1$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=\\Phi(X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 的 Jacobi 矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\Phi$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det J_\\Phi\\neq 0$</span> 处处且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|\\det J_\\Phi|\\in L^1(g\\lambda)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h(g)=h(f)+\\mathbb E_{g}\\big[\\log|\\det J_\\Phi(\\Phi^{-1}(Y))|\\big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚；<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f\\in L^1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|\\det J_\\Phi|\\in L^1(g\\lambda)$</span>。这些条件保证换元公式与积分可加性均可用 Fubini 定理逐项验证。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由换元公式，对任意 Borel 集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_B g\\,\\mathrm d\\lambda=\\int_{\\Phi^{-1}(B)}f\\,\\mathrm d\\lambda$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(y)=f(\\Phi^{-1}(y))|\\det J_{\\Phi^{-1}}(y)|$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h(g)=-\\int g(y)\\log g(y)\\,\\mathrm dy\n=-\\int f(x)\\log\\big(f(x)|\\det J_{\\Phi^{-1}}(\\Phi(x))|\\big)\\,\\mathrm dx.$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det J_{\\Phi^{-1}}(\\Phi(x))=(\\det J_\\Phi(x))^{-1}$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h(g)=-\\int f(x)\\log f(x)\\,\\mathrm dx-\\int f(x)\\log|\\det J_\\Phi(x)|^{-1}\\,\\mathrm dx\n=h(f)+\\int f(x)\\log|\\det J_\\Phi(x)|\\,\\mathrm dx.$$</div>\n<p>将右端积分写成对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的期望即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 表明：微分熵在非线性坐标变换下<strong>不不变</strong>，而离散熵对任意可逆映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal X'$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p\\circ\\phi^{-1})=H(p)$</span>，因为求和只是重排。这是二者最本质的区别：离散熵是组合量，微分熵是几何量。工程上常说的“熵”若指微分熵，则必须在固定坐标系下比较，否则数值无意义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-2-粗粒化桥梁-离散化极限与-log-Delta-修正\">2. 粗粒化桥梁：离散化极限与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\Delta$</span> 修正<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-2-粗粒化桥梁-离散化极限与-log-Delta-修正\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>将连续变量离散化是连接两种熵的标准手段。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>，密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 连续且有界，定义网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal G_\\Delta$</span> 与胞腔 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span>，离散化质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\Delta(k)=\\int_{C_k}f\\,\\mathrm d\\lambda$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（粗粒化桥梁公式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上连续、有界、具有紧支撑，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f\\in L^1$</span>。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to 0$</span> 时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_\\Delta)+\\log\\Delta^d\\longrightarrow h(f).$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 连续、有界、紧支撑；<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f\\in L^1$</span>。紧支撑保证求和为有限项，连续性与有界性保证中值定理可用，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f\\in L^1$</span> 保证极限积分存在。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对每个胞腔 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span>，由积分中值定理存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_k\\in C_k$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\Delta(k)=\\Delta^d f(\\xi_k)$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_\\Delta)=-\\sum_k \\Delta^d f(\\xi_k)\\log\\big(\\Delta^d f(\\xi_k)\\big)\n=-\\Delta^d\\sum_k f(\\xi_k)\\log f(\\xi_k)-\\log\\Delta^d\\sum_k \\Delta^d f(\\xi_k).$$</div>\n<p>第二项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k p_\\Delta(k)=1$</span> 恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log\\Delta^d$</span>。第一项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f$</span> 的 Riemann 和；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 连续紧支撑，Riemann 和收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\log f\\,\\mathrm d\\lambda$</span>（此处用 Riemann 可积性，等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f$</span> 的有界性与支撑紧性）。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_\\Delta)+\\log\\Delta^d\\to-\\int f\\log f\\,\\mathrm d\\lambda=h(f).$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 的要点是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\Delta)$</span> 本身当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 时<strong>发散</strong>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(f)$</span> 有限，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\Delta)\\approx h(f)-\\log\\Delta^d\\to+\\infty$</span>），只有减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\Delta^d$</span> 后才收敛。这解释了为何不能把离散熵直接当作微分熵的近似：二者的量纲不同，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\Delta^d$</span> 是网格分辨率的“容量项”。在工程中若用离散熵估计微分熵，必须显式扣除该项，否则估计值随分箱数发散——这正是第 8 节熵估计偏差的来源之一。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-3-可检验推论-均匀密度的显式计算\">3. 可检验推论：均匀密度的显式计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-3-可检验推论-均匀密度的显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 3（均匀分布情形的桥梁恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{vol}(B)}\\mathbf 1_B$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B=\\prod_{i=1}^d[0,L_i]$</span> 为轴对齐盒子，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{vol}(B)=\\prod_i L_i$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_i/\\Delta\\in\\mathbb N$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\Delta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=\\prod_i(L_i/\\Delta)$</span> 个胞腔上均匀，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_\\Delta)=\\log N,\\qquad h(f)=\\log\\mathrm{vol}(B),\\qquad H(p_\\Delta)+\\log\\Delta^d=\\log\\mathrm{vol}(B)=h(f).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：每个胞腔质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\Delta(k)=1/N$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\Delta)=\\log N$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(f)=-\\int_B\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{vol}(B)}\\log\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{vol}(B)}\\,\\mathrm dx=\\log\\mathrm{vol}(B)$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=\\mathrm{vol}(B)/\\Delta^d$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log N+\\log\\Delta^d=\\log\\mathrm{vol}(B)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论给出一个可数值检验的恒等式：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_1=2,L_2=3,\\Delta=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=24$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H=\\log 24\\approx3.178$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=\\log 6\\approx1.792$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\Delta^2=\\log 0.25\\approx-1.386$</span>，三者相加验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3.178-1.386=1.792$</span>。代码节将用 <code>assert</code> 验证此恒等式到浮点精度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-4-差异的第二个来源-支撑与奇异部分\">4. 差异的第二个来源：支撑与奇异部分<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-4-差异的第二个来源-支撑与奇异部分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>离散熵对支撑为有限或可数集的情形天然良定义；微分熵要求分布关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的分布含原子部分，则不存在密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 无定义，但离散熵对原子部分仍有意义。更细致地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为混合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=(1-\\alpha)f_c+\\alpha\\sum_j w_j\\delta_{a_j}$</span>，则其微分熵按定义不存在；若强行用“广义熵”处理，原子部分贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\alpha\\sum_j w_j\\log(\\alpha w_j)$</span> 而连续部分贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\alpha)h(f_c)$</span>，二者量纲不同不能直接相加。这提示：在自回归生成模型中，若 token 空间离散而隐变量连续，联合熵必须分块处理，不能用一个统一的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 概括。第 10 节将给出支撑不匹配导致 KL 无界的完整反例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-5-与-KL-散度的交互-离散化不保持-KL\">5. 与 KL 散度的交互：离散化不保持 KL<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-5-与-KL-散度的交互-离散化不保持-KL\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>一个常见误解是“离散化后 KL 收敛于连续 KL”。事实并非如此，因为离散化是确定性粗粒化映射，数据处理不等式（第 4 节）给出的是不等式而非等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（离散化 KL 的下界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g&gt;0$</span> 处处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log(f/g)\\in L^1$</span>。对网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\Delta,q_\\Delta$</span> 为对应的离散化质量。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\Delta\\|q_\\Delta)\\le D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(f\\|g).$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 为概率密度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g&gt;0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log(f/g)\\in L^1$</span>。这是数据处理不等式在确定性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\mapsto k(X)$</span>（胞腔索引）下的直接应用，其证明已在第 4 节完成，此处仅引用结论。</p>\n<p>命题 4 说明离散化<strong>损失</strong>信息：粗粒化后的 KL 不超过原 KL，等号一般不成立。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\Delta\\|q_\\Delta)\\to D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(f\\|g)$</span> 需要额外的一致可积性条件（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f/g$</span> 有界），这属于第 10 节反例节的边界情形，本节不展开。工程含义：用离散 KL 做损失函数时，其梯度是连续 KL 的粗粒化版本，分辨率越高越接近真值，但方差随分箱数增大——这是第 13 节数值计算要处理的问题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-6-微分熵可为负-与离散熵非负性的对比\">6. 微分熵可为负：与离散熵非负性的对比<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-6-微分熵可为负-与离散熵非负性的对比\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>离散熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)\\ge0$</span> 恒成立，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p(x)\\ge0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\le1$</span> 成立。微分熵无此下界：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 支撑于测度小于 1 的集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h(f)$</span> 可为负。例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\mathbf 1_{[0,1/2]}\\cdot 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h(f)=\\log(1/2)=-\\log 2&lt;0$</span>。这与命题 1 一致：压缩坐标使微分熵减少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|\\det J|$</span>。因此微分熵的数值不能解释为“平均信息量”的非负度量；它是相对于 Lebesgue 测度的相对量。在生成模型中比较两个连续分布的熵时，必须固定参考测度，否则差值可因坐标变换任意改变。KL 散度则因分子分母同受坐标变换影响而保持不变（命题 1 应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|\\det J|$</span> 项相消），这是 KL 比微分熵更适合作为误差度量的根本原因，也是本章以 KL 为统一语言的理由。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>离散熵是概率质量函数的组合泛函，对可逆重参数化不变且非负；微分熵是密度的几何泛函，依赖坐标选取、可为负，二者不可直接比较数值。</li>\n<li>粗粒化桥梁公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\Delta)+\\log\\Delta^d\\to h(f)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 连续、有界、紧支撑且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f\\in L^1$</span> 时成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\Delta)$</span> 本身随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 发散，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\Delta^d$</span> 是必须显式扣除的分辨率容量项。</li>\n<li>离散化不保持 KL：由数据处理不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\Delta\\|q_\\Delta)\\le D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(f\\|g)$</span>，粗粒化损失信息；KL 因坐标变换下分子分母的 Jacobi 项相消而保持不变，故宜作为跨参数化的统一误差度量。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef entropy_discrete(p):\n    p = np.asarray(p, dtype=float)\n    assert np.all(p &gt;= 0) and abs(p.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\n    mask = p &gt; 0\n    return -np.sum(p[mask] * np.log(p[mask]))\n\ndef entropy_differential_uniform_box(L):\n    # f = 1/vol(B) on box B = prod [0, L_i]\n    vol = np.prod(L)\n    return np.log(vol)\n\n# 推论 3 的数值验证：d=2, L=(2,3), Delta=0.5\nL = np.array([2.0, 3.0])\nDelta = 0.5\nN = int(np.prod(L / Delta))\np_delta = np.full(N, 1.0 / N)\nH = entropy_discrete(p_delta)\nh = entropy_differential_uniform_box(L)\nbridge = H + np.log(Delta**2)\n\nprint(&quot;N =&quot;, N, &quot;shape of p_delta =&quot;, p_delta.shape)\nprint(&quot;H(p_Delta) =&quot;, H)\nprint(&quot;h(f) =&quot;, h)\nprint(&quot;H + log(Delta^2) =&quot;, bridge)\nassert N == 24\nassert abs(H - np.log(24)) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(h - np.log(6)) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(bridge - h) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;推论 3 恒等式验证通过：H + log(Delta^d) == h(f)&quot;)\n\n# 命题 1 的数值验证：一维仿射变换 Y = a X + b\n# f 为 [0,1] 上均匀，g 为 [b, b+a] 上均匀，h(g) = h(f) + log a\na, b = 2.0, 1.0\nh_f = 0.0  # [0,1] 上均匀密度的微分熵 = log 1 = 0\nh_g = np.log(a)\nassert abs(h_g - (h_f + np.log(a))) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;命题 1 仿射情形验证通过：h(g) = h(f) + log|det J| =&quot;, h_g)\n\n# 微分熵可为负的例子\nh_neg = np.log(0.5)\nassert h_neg &lt; 0\nprint(&quot;支撑于 [0,1/2] 的均匀密度微分熵 =&quot;, h_neg, &quot;&lt; 0&quot;)\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-7-相对熵在粗粒化下的精确分解\">7. 相对熵在粗粒化下的精确分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-7-相对熵在粗粒化下的精确分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 4 只给出不等式，本节需要更精确的恒等式来量化离散化损失。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>，密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span>，胞腔索引 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=k(X)$</span>，其质量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\Delta(k)=\\int_{C_k}f\\,\\mathrm d\\lambda$</span>。对另一密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g&gt;0$</span>），记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\Delta(k)=\\int_{C_k}g\\,\\mathrm d\\lambda$</span>。定义胞腔内条件密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_k(x)=f(x)/p_\\Delta(k)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in C_k$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_k(x)=g(x)/q_\\Delta(k)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（KL 的粗粒化分解）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 为概率密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g&gt;0$</span> 处处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log(f/g)\\in L^1$</span>，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\Delta(k)&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_k\\log(f_k/g_k)\\in L^1(C_k,p_\\Delta(k)\\lambda)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(f\\|g)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\Delta\\|q_\\Delta)+\\sum_{k:p_\\Delta(k)&gt;0}p_\\Delta(k)\\,D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(f_k\\|g_k).$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$g&gt;0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log(f/g)\\in L^1$</span>；逐胞腔条件 KL 可积。这些条件保证每一项有限且求和绝对收敛（因左端有限，右端两项非负，故逐项和收敛）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log(f/g)$</span> 在胞腔上分解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(x)\\log\\frac{f(x)}{g(x)}=f(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\Delta(k)}{q_\\Delta(k)}+f(x)\\log\\frac{f_k(x)}{g_k(x)},\\qquad x\\in C_k.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in C_k$</span> 积分，第一项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\Delta(k)\\log\\frac{p_\\Delta(k)}{q_\\Delta(k)}$</span>，第二项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\Delta(k)\\int_{C_k}f_k\\log\\frac{f_k}{g_k}\\,\\mathrm d\\lambda=p_\\Delta(k)D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(f_k\\|g_k)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 求和，第一项总和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\Delta\\|q_\\Delta)$</span>，第二项为所述求和。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 是命题 4 的加强：粗粒化 KL 恰为总 KL 减去“胞腔内残余 KL”。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 时，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,g$</span> 在每个点附近近似常数（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f_k\\approx g_k$</span> 在胞腔内），残余项趋于零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\Delta\\|q_\\Delta)\\to D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(f\\|g)$</span>。这给出了命题 4 等号成立的充分条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f/g$</span> 在胞腔内近似常数。反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在细尺度上剧烈交错（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 支撑在同一集合但密度在微小尺度上互补振荡），则残余项不消失，离散 KL 严格小于连续 KL，且差距不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 闭合。这正是第 10 节反例节要构造的“支撑匹配但细尺度不匹配”情形，本节只指出其存在性边界，不展开构造。</p>\n<p>命题 5 对生成模型有直接含义：若用离散 token 的 KL 近似连续隐变量的 KL，则误差恰为条件 KL 的加权和，权重是胞腔质量。要减小误差，要么细化网格（减小胞腔内变异），要么使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在胞腔内与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 形状匹配（减小条件 KL）。后者正是扩散模型中“噪声调度匹配数据局部几何”的理论依据，但本节不展开该接口，留待与最大似然章的接口节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-8-微分熵的平移与尺度协变性\">8. 微分熵的平移与尺度协变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-8-微分熵的平移与尺度协变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 给出了一般微分同胚下的变换公式。对生成模型最常用的两类变换——平移与尺度——可写出显式协变律，作为可检验的恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（平移与尺度协变律）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h(f)$</span> 有限。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=aX+b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 的密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(y)=a^{-d}f((y-b)/a)$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h(g)=h(f)+d\\log a.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：这是命题 1 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi(x)=ax+b$</span> 时的特例，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\Phi=aI_d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det J_\\Phi=a^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|\\det J_\\Phi|=d\\log a$</span> 为常数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_g[\\cdot]=d\\log a$</span>。也可直接计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h(g)=-\\int a^{-d}f\\!\\left(\\tfrac{y-b}{a}\\right)\\log\\left(a^{-d}f\\!\\left(\\tfrac{y-b}{a}\\right)\\right)\\mathrm dy\n=-\\int f(x)\\log f(x)\\,\\mathrm dx+d\\log a,$$</div>\n<p>其中换元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=ax+b$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dy=a^d\\mathrm dx$</span>，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(a^{-d}f)=-d\\log a+\\log f$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 6 表明：微分熵随尺度对数线性增长，随平移不变。这与离散熵形成鲜明对照：离散熵对值域的任意双射不变，故平移与尺度（在离散情形下无意义）都不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span>。工程上，若对连续观测做标准化（减去均值、除以标准差），微分熵改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\log\\sigma$</span>，而基于离散熵的度量不变。这解释了为何在连续生成模型中报告“熵”必须同时报告坐标尺度，否则数值不可复现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-9-离散熵作为微分熵的上界-一个常用但需假设的估计\">9. 离散熵作为微分熵的上界：一个常用但需假设的估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-9-离散熵作为微分熵的上界-一个常用但需假设的估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在熵估计实践中，常用离散化熵减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\Delta^d$</span> 作为微分熵的估计。命题 2 给出的是极限等式，但有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 下的偏差方向需要明确。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（有限网格下的偏差方向）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上连续、有界、紧支撑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f\\in L^1$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_\\Delta)+\\log\\Delta^d\\ \\ge\\ h(f)-\\log\\big(1+\\omega_f(\\Delta)/m\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_f(\\Delta)=\\sup_{|x-y|\\le\\Delta\\sqrt d}|f(x)-f(y)|$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的连续模，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=\\inf_{x\\in\\mathrm{supp}f}f(x)&gt;0$</span>（假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在支撑上下确界正）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 连续、有界、紧支撑；<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f\\in L^1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在支撑上下确界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m&gt;0$</span>。最后一条保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log f$</span> 有界，从而偏差可控。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>：在胞腔 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_k$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的取值落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[f(\\xi_k)-\\omega_f(\\Delta),f(\\xi_k)+\\omega_f(\\Delta)]$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\Delta(k)=\\Delta^d f(\\xi_k)(1+o(1))$</span> 且比值被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\pm\\omega_f(\\Delta)/m$</span> 控制。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_\\Delta)=-\\sum_k p_\\Delta(k)\\log p_\\Delta(k)\n=-\\sum_k p_\\Delta(k)\\big(\\log\\Delta^d+\\log f(\\xi_k)+\\log(1+\\epsilon_k)\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\epsilon_k|\\le\\omega_f(\\Delta)/m$</span>。第二项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f$</span> 的 Riemann 和，收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\log f$</span>；第三项的绝对值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k p_\\Delta(k)\\log(1+\\omega_f(\\Delta)/m)=\\log(1+\\omega_f(\\Delta)/m)$</span>。整理得所述不等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 说明：有限网格估计<strong>系统性偏高</strong>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H+\\log\\Delta^d\\ge h-\\text{小量}$</span>，即估计值不低于真值减去一个随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 缩小的小量）。这与第 8 节熵估计偏差的结论一致：粗粒化熵高估微分熵，偏差量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1+\\omega_f(\\Delta)/m)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的局部变异随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 线性缩小时偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>。工程含义：用离散熵估计连续熵时，估计值偏大是结构性的，不能靠增加样本消除，只能靠细化网格或对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 做局部平滑。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-10-一个具体例子-高斯密度的两种熵\">10. 一个具体例子：高斯密度的两种熵<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-10-一个具体例子-高斯密度的两种熵\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以一元高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\mathcal N(\\mu,\\sigma^2)$</span> 为例，验证上述全部公式并给出数值。</p>\n<p><strong>例 8（高斯密度的微分熵与离散化）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\sigma}\\exp(-\\frac{(x-\\mu)^2}{2\\sigma^2})$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h(f)=\\frac12\\log(2\\pi e\\sigma^2).$$</div>\n<p><strong>推导</strong>：直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int f\\log f$</span>。利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log f(x)=-\\frac12\\log(2\\pi\\sigma^2)-\\frac{(x-\\mu)^2}{2\\sigma^2}$</span>，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(X-\\mu)^2]=\\sigma^2$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h(f)=\\frac12\\log(2\\pi\\sigma^2)+\\frac{1}{2}=\\frac12\\log(2\\pi e\\sigma^2).$$</div>\n<p>由推论 6，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y=aX+b$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(g)=\\frac12\\log(2\\pi e\\sigma^2)+d\\log a$</span> 在一维即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\log(2\\pi e a^2\\sigma^2)$</span>，与直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y\\sim\\mathcal N(a\\mu+b,a^2\\sigma^2)$</span> 的熵一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>对离散化，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 充分小使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\Delta(k)\\approx\\Delta f(k\\Delta)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\Delta)\\approx h(f)-\\log\\Delta$</span>。数值上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=\\frac12\\log(2\\pi e)\\approx1.4189$</span>；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=0.01$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\Delta)\\approx1.4189-\\log 0.01=1.4189+4.6052=6.0241$</span>。差值恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log\\Delta$</span>，验证命题 2 的桥梁项。该例同时说明：高斯密度的微分熵随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 对数增长，而离散化熵在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 下随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 增长更快（因为支撑变宽、非零胞腔增多），二者增长率不同，不能混用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 例 8：高斯密度的微分熵与离散化桥梁\nsigma = 1.0\nh_gauss = 0.5 * np.log(2 * np.pi * np.e * sigma**2)\nprint(&quot;高斯微分熵 h(f) =&quot;, h_gauss)\nassert abs(h_gauss - 0.5 * np.log(2 * np.pi * np.e)) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# 离散化近似：在 [-6 sigma, 6 sigma] 上取 Delta 网格\nDelta = 0.01\nedges = np.arange(-6 * sigma, 6 * sigma + Delta, Delta)\n# 胞腔概率用正态 CDF 差分精确计算\nfrom math import erf, sqrt\ndef normal_cdf(x, mu=0.0, s=1.0):\n    return 0.5 * (1.0 + erf((x - mu) / (s * sqrt(2.0))))\np = np.diff([normal_cdf(e) for e in edges])\np = p / p.sum()  # 截断后归一化，截断质量 &lt; 1e-9\nmask = p &gt; 0\nH = -np.sum(p[mask] * np.log(p[mask]))\nbridge = H + np.log(Delta)\nprint(&quot;H(p_Delta) =&quot;, H, &quot; H + log(Delta) =&quot;, bridge)\n# 桥梁值应接近 h(f)，偏差来自截断与有限 Delta\nassert abs(bridge - h_gauss) &lt; 0.05\nprint(&quot;高斯情形桥梁验证通过：H + log(Delta) ≈ h(f)&quot;)\n\n# 推论 6：尺度协变律\na = 3.0\nh_scaled = h_gauss + np.log(a)\nh_direct = 0.5 * np.log(2 * np.pi * np.e * (a * sigma)**2)\nassert abs(h_scaled - h_direct) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;尺度协变律验证通过：h(aX) = h(X) + log a =&quot;, h_scaled)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>例 8 的数值验证同时覆盖了命题 2 的桥梁、推论 6 的尺度律与高斯熵的闭式，三者在浮点精度内一致。截断导致的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.05$</span> 容差来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-6\\sigma,6\\sigma]$</span> 外质量约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times10^{-9}$</span> 的归一化修正与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=0.01$</span> 下 Riemann 和的离散误差，量级与命题 7 的偏差估计相符。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-11-差异对生成模型误差度量的三条推论\">11. 差异对生成模型误差度量的三条推论<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-11-差异对生成模型误差度量的三条推论\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 1、2、4、5、7，可提炼出三条对全书后续章节直接可用的推论，每条均标注其依赖的假设。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9（度量选择）</strong> 在比较两个连续生成分布的误差时，若模型参数化涉及非线性坐标变换（如归一化流、扩散过程的噪声调度），微分熵的差值依赖参数化，而 KL 散度不变。故误差度量应取 KL，不应取微分熵之差。<strong>依赖假设</strong>：两分布均关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续，且变换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚（命题 1 的条件）。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 10（离散近似的偏差方向）</strong> 若用离散 token 熵近似连续隐变量熵，估计值系统性偏高，偏差量级由命题 7 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1+\\omega_f(\\Delta)/m)$</span> 控制；若用离散 KL 近似连续 KL，估计值系统性偏低，偏差由命题 5 的胞腔内残余 KL 控制。二者偏差方向相反，不可互相抵消。<strong>依赖假设</strong>：命题 5 与命题 7 的全部假设，特别是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在支撑上下确界正。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 11（分辨率与样本量的权衡）</strong> 由命题 2，固定样本量下细化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\Delta)$</span> 发散，故离散熵估计必须配合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\Delta^d$</span> 扣除；由命题 7，细化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 减小偏差但增大方差（非零胞腔增多、每胞腔样本减少）。存在最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^*$</span> 使均方误差最小，其量级由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的局部变异与样本量共同决定。<strong>依赖假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 连续有界紧支撑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\log f\\in L^1$</span>；方差分析的标准假设（样本独立同分布）。</p>\n<p>这三条推论构成本节与后续节的接口：推论 9 支撑“以 KL 为统一语言”的本章主旨；推论 10 与 11 直接进入第 8 节熵估计偏差与第 13 节数值计算的讨论；命题 5 的残余项则是第 10 节反例节构造“离散 KL 严格小于连续 KL 且不闭合”的出发点。本节不重复这些后续内容，仅在此标明依赖关系，保证符号与假设在全章内自洽。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar05--h-反例-KL-无界与支撑不匹配\">反例：KL 无界与支撑不匹配<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-反例-KL-无界与支撑不匹配\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：对可数集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的概率质量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span>，KL 散度定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal X}p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)},$$</div>\n约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>，且当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0,q(x)=0$</span> 时取值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。对一般测度空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)$</span> 上的概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span> 时\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)=\\int_{\\mathcal X}\\log\\frac{\\mathrm dP}{\\mathrm dQ}\\,\\mathrm dP,$$</div>\n否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)=+\\infty$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为相应密度（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>）。本节新引入的符号仅有：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_n=\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span> 表有限字母表；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Bern}(\\theta)$</span> 表参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的伯努利分布；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\mu,\\sigma^2)$</span> 表一元正态分布；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 表勒贝格测度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\#A$</span> 表集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的基数。本节所有命题均显式列出假设；凡假设被拆掉之处，均构造反例说明结论失效。</p>\n<p>本节的任务不是重复第 3 节已证的 Gibbs 不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)\\ge 0$</span>（等号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iff p=q$</span> a.e.），而是刻画该不等式在<strong>边界</strong>上的行为：非负性成立，但上界不存在；等号条件在支撑不匹配时以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 的形式“退化”；链式法则在条件 KL 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 时需单独处理。以下四个小节分别给出：支撑不匹配导致 KL 无穷的精确构造；拆掉绝对连续性假设后链式法则的失效；KL 关于参数的局部无界性与定量估计；以及离散化极限中 KL 不收敛的边界情形。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-1-支撑不匹配-KL-取-infty-的精确构造\">1. 支撑不匹配：KL 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 的精确构造<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-1-支撑不匹配-KL-取-infty-的精确构造\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（支撑不匹配导致无穷 KL）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 为可数集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为其上的概率质量函数。若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathcal X$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_0)&gt;0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为概率质量函数（非负、可数可加、总和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_0)&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义，求和项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=x_0$</span> 一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_0)\\log\\frac{p(x_0)}{0}$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_0)&gt;0$</span>，被加项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>；其余项非负（由第 3 节 Gibbs 不等式逐项形式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}\\ge p(x)-q(x)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)&gt;0$</span> 时有限；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0,p(x)=0$</span> 时约定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>）。故总和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一命题说明：Gibbs 不等式的“等号成立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iff p=q$</span> a.e.”在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=+\\infty$</span> 时自动成立（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ne q$</span> a.e.），但<strong>非负性本身不提供任何有限性信息</strong>。换言之，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,+\\infty]$</span> 值泛函是非负的，却不是实值有界的。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（连续情形：支撑不匹配）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\mathbb R$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\lambda$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=\\delta_0$</span>（点质量），<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)=+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q$</span> 为 Borel 概率测度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q\\ll\\lambda$</span> 有密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{0\\}$</span> 处给质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span> 不成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(\\{0\\})=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(\\{0\\})=1$</span>。由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)=+\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例同时说明：即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 的支撑是单点、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 的支撑是全直线，绝对连续性也可能失败。若强行用密度比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dP/\\mathrm dQ$</span> 的 Radon–Nikodym 导数，则该导数不存在；这正是第 3 节定义中“否则取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>”的必要性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（定量下界：支撑不匹配时的“无穷速率”）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_n=\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_n$</span> 上均匀，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X_n\\setminus\\{1\\}$</span> 上均匀、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(1)=0$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>；若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 修改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\epsilon(1)=\\epsilon$</span>、其余按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\epsilon$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n-1$</span> 个点上均匀，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q_\\epsilon)=\\frac1n\\log\\frac{1/n}{\\epsilon}+\\frac{n-1}{n}\\log\\frac{1/n}{(1-\\epsilon)/(n-1)}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\in(0,1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n\\log\\frac{1}{n\\epsilon}$</span>；第二项中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\ne 1$</span> 的密度比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1/n}{(1-\\epsilon)/(n-1)}=\\frac{n-1}{n(1-\\epsilon)}$</span>，共 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n-1$</span> 个点，贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{n-1}{n}\\log\\frac{n-1}{n(1-\\epsilon)}$</span>。相加即得。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to 0^+$</span> 时第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to+\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q_\\epsilon)\\to+\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出<strong>构造性定量估计</strong>：支撑不匹配不是“跳跃到无穷”，而是沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\downarrow 0$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n\\log\\frac1\\epsilon$</span> 的速率发散。这一速率在数值实现中必须被显式处理（见第 14 节代码），否则浮点下溢会把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 误判为有限值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-2-拆掉绝对连续性-链式法则的失效\">2. 拆掉绝对连续性：链式法则的失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-2-拆掉绝对连续性-链式法则的失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 3 节已证 KL 链式法则（canonical claim）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|q(x,y))=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x)\\|q(x))+\\mathbb E_{p(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y|x)\\|q(y|x)).$$</div>\n该等式的标准证明要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)\\ll q(x,y)$</span>（从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\ll q(x)$</span> 且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y|x)\\ll q(y|x)$</span>）。下面拆掉这一假设。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（链式法则在支撑不匹配时的精确形式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal Y$</span> 上概率质量函数。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_X\\|q_X)+\\mathbb E_{p_X}\\big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_{Y|X}(\\cdot|x)\\|q_{Y|X}(\\cdot|x))\\big],$$</div>\n其中右端各项按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,+\\infty]$</span> 取值，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X(x)&gt;0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_X(x)=0$</span> 时第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X(x)&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_X(x)&gt;0$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{Y|X}(y|x)&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{Y|X}(y|x)=0$</span> 时条件 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，此时约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_X}[+\\infty]=+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y$</span> 有限；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为联合概率质量函数；边缘与条件按标准定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X(x)=\\sum_y p(x,y)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{Y|X}(y|x)=p(x,y)/p_X(x)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X(x)&gt;0$</span> 时），<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 同理。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,y)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)&gt;0$</span> 时\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{p(x,y)}{q(x,y)}=\\log\\frac{p_X(x)}{q_X(x)}+\\log\\frac{p_{Y|X}(y|x)}{q_{Y|X}(y|x)},$$</div>\n因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)=p_X(x)p_{Y|X}(y|x)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x,y)=q_X(x)q_{Y|X}(y|x)$</span>。两边乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,y)$</span> 求和：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{x,y}p(x,y)\\log\\frac{p(x,y)}{q(x,y)}=\\sum_x p_X(x)\\log\\frac{p_X(x)}{q_X(x)}+\\sum_x p_X(x)\\sum_y p_{Y|X}(y|x)\\log\\frac{p_{Y|X}(y|x)}{q_{Y|X}(y|x)}.$$</div>\n右端第二项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_X}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_{Y|X}\\|q_{Y|X})$</span>。当某分母为零时，对应被加项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,+\\infty]$</span> 中成立（有限项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 相加仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论（拆掉绝对连续性后“链式法则”作为等式仍成立，但作为有限值等式失效）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{0,1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal Y=\\{0,1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,1)$</span> 各给质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,0)$</span> 各给质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\not\\ll q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_X=q_X=(1/2,1/2)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_X\\|q_X)=0$</span>；但对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{Y|X}(\\cdot|0)=\\delta_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{Y|X}(\\cdot|0)=\\delta_1$</span>，条件 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=1$</span> 同理。于是右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0+\\frac12(+\\infty)+\\frac12(+\\infty)=+\\infty$</span>，与左端一致。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同上；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 如构造。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：直接计算。<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(0,0)=1/2&gt;0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(0,0)=0$</span>，故左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。右端第一项因边缘相同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；条件项如上。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：<strong>链式法则的代数恒等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,+\\infty]$</span> 中普遍成立，无需绝对连续性假设</strong>；但若把它当作“有限值等式”使用（例如在梯度估计中交换期望与求导），则必须补上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_X}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_{Y|X}\\|q_{Y|X})&lt;+\\infty$</span> 的条件。缺此条件时，右端的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 不能参与算术运算，链式法则不能用于分解梯度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-3-KL-关于参数的局部无界性\">3. KL 关于参数的局部无界性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-3-KL-关于参数的局部无界性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（KL 在参数扰动下的局部无界性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathrm{Bern}(\\theta_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\epsilon=\\mathrm{Bern}(\\theta_0+\\epsilon)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_0\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\in(-\\theta_0,1-\\theta_0)\\setminus\\{0\\}$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q_\\epsilon)=\\theta_0\\log\\frac{\\theta_0}{\\theta_0+\\epsilon}+(1-\\theta_0)\\log\\frac{1-\\theta_0}{1-\\theta_0-\\epsilon}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_0\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_0+\\epsilon\\in(0,1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：伯努利分布只有两个原子，直接代入定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to-\\theta_0^+$</span> 时发散）</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_0\\in(0,1)$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\downarrow-\\theta_0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\epsilon(1)\\downarrow 0$</span>）。则第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac{1-\\theta_0}{1-\\theta_0-\\epsilon}\\to\\log\\frac{1-\\theta_0}{1}= -\\log(1-\\theta_0)$</span> 有限，而第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_0\\log\\frac{\\theta_0}{\\theta_0+\\epsilon}\\to+\\infty$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q_\\epsilon)\\to+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\in(-\\theta_0,0)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_0+\\epsilon\\to 0^+$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac{\\theta_0}{\\theta_0+\\epsilon}\\to+\\infty$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_0&gt;0$</span> 仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>；第二项有界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出<strong>边界情形的定量刻画</strong>：KL 在参数空间中不是局部有界的——当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的支撑收缩、把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的正质量点排除时，KL 以对数速率发散。这与命题 3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n\\log\\frac1\\epsilon$</span> 速率一致（伯努利情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=2$</span> 时系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_0$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 非均匀）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（正态情形：方差失配的无穷 KL）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma_0^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_\\epsilon=\\mathcal N(0,\\epsilon^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q_\\epsilon)=\\log\\frac{\\sigma_0}{\\epsilon}+\\frac{\\epsilon^2-\\sigma_0^2}{2\\epsilon^2}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q_\\epsilon\\ll\\lambda$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：两正态密度之比的对数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{\\varphi_{\\sigma_0}(x)}{\\varphi_\\epsilon(x)}=-\\frac{x^2}{2\\sigma_0^2}+\\frac{x^2}{2\\epsilon^2}+\\log\\frac{\\sigma_0}{\\epsilon}.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 取期望，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_P[x^2]=\\sigma_0^2$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_P\\Big[-\\frac{x^2}{2\\sigma_0^2}+\\frac{x^2}{2\\epsilon^2}\\Big]=-\\frac12+\\frac{\\sigma_0^2}{2\\epsilon^2}.$$</div>\n加上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac{\\sigma_0}{\\epsilon}$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\downarrow 0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sigma_0^2}{2\\epsilon^2}\\to+\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\to+\\infty$</span>。这给出<strong>连续情形支撑收缩的定量速率</strong>：KL 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0^2/(2\\epsilon^2)$</span> 的二次速率发散，快于离散情形的对数速率。原因是正态密度的 Radon–Nikodym 导数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_\\epsilon$</span> 支撑收缩时于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 的高密度区域爆炸。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-4-离散化极限-KL-不收敛的边界情形\">4. 离散化极限：KL 不收敛的边界情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-4-离散化极限-KL-不收敛的边界情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7（离散化不收敛）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q=\\mathcal N(0,2)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 1$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_n,Q_n$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q$</span> 在网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{k/n:k\\in\\mathbb Z\\}$</span> 上的离散化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_n(k/n)=P((k-1/2)/n,(k+1/2)/n]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_n$</span> 同理。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P_n\\|Q_n)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q),$$</div>\n但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_0$</span> 的离散化（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_n(0)=1$</span>、其余为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>），则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P_n\\|Q_n)=+\\infty$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)=+\\infty$</span> 亦成立——此例不构成“不收敛”，仅说明<strong>离散化不改变支撑不匹配的无穷性</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q\\ll\\lambda$</span> 有连续正密度；网格宽度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/n$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由第 9 节连续熵与离散熵的差异，离散化 KL 收敛于连续 KL 当两密度在紧集上一致连续且尾部指数衰减（正态满足）。第二断言由命题 1 逐点应用：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_n(0)&gt;0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_n(0)=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_n(0)&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_n(0)=1$</span> 不导致无穷；但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_n$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_n$</span> 正质量处为零则无穷。此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_n(0)=1$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_n(0)&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P_n\\|Q_n)$</span> 有限？核对如下：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_n(0)=1$</span> 意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_n$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处质量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_n(0)=P((-1/(2n),1/(2n)])&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_n(0)\\log(P_n(0)/1)$</span> 有限，其余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ne 0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_n(k/n)&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_n(k/n)=0$</span>，故为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的<strong>边界教训</strong>是：离散化保持 KL 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,+\\infty]$</span> 值语义，但不保持“有限性”——一个在连续情形有限的 KL，其离散化可能因尾部截断而变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_n$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_n$</span> 的尾部正质量处为零）。因此第 13、14 节的数值代码必须显式处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=0$</span> 的掩码，而不能依赖浮点除法。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（正确表述需补的条件）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q$</span> 为概率测度。则以下三条等价：(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)&lt;+\\infty$</span>；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\log\\frac{\\mathrm dP}{\\mathrm dQ}\\,\\mathrm dP&lt;+\\infty$</span>；(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_P[(\\log\\frac{\\mathrm dP}{\\mathrm dQ})^+]&lt;+\\infty$</span>（其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\cdot)^+=\\max(\\cdot,0)$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q$</span> 为可测空间上的概率测度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：(i)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(ii)：由定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}&lt;+\\infty$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span>（否则取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>），且积分有限。(ii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(iii)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac{\\mathrm dP}{\\mathrm dQ}$</span> 的负部有界（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dP/\\mathrm dQ\\ge 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 可任意负，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_P[\\log^-]\\le \\mathbb E_P[-\\log\\frac{\\mathrm dP}{\\mathrm dQ}\\cdot\\mathbf 1_{\\mathrm dP/\\mathrm dQ&lt;1}]$</span>，需可积性；由 (ii) 积分有限且正部非负，故负部可积）。(iii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(i)：正部可积、负部可积（负部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_P[\\log^-]\\le \\mathbb E_P[-\\log\\frac{\\mathrm dP}{\\mathrm dQ}]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dP/\\mathrm dQ&lt;1$</span> 时；需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_P[\\log^-]&lt;+\\infty$</span>，由 (iii) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log^+\\ge 0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_P[\\log]=\\mathbb E_P[\\log^+]-\\mathbb E_P[\\log^-]$</span> 有限）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题是<strong>正确表述的补条件</strong>：KL 有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iff$</span> 绝对连续性 + 对数密度比可积。第 3 节的 Gibbs 不等式只保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\ge 0$</span>，不保证有限；任何把 KL 当作实值损失函数的算法，都必须验证 (ii) 或 (iii)。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>支撑不匹配使 KL 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>：离散情形由命题 1 逐点给出，连续情形由命题 2 的绝对连续性失败给出；命题 3 与命题 6 分别给出离散对数速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n\\log\\frac1\\epsilon$</span> 与连续二次速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0^2/(2\\epsilon^2)$</span> 的定量发散估计。</li>\n<li>链式法则的代数恒等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,+\\infty]$</span> 中无需绝对连续性即成立（命题 4），但作为有限值等式使用时必须补 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span> 且条件 KL 期望有限；推论给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\not\\ll q$</span> 时两端同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 的精确构造。</li>\n<li>KL 有限性的正确刻画是命题 8 的三条等价条件（绝对连续性 + 对数密度比可积）；数值实现（第 13、14 节）必须显式掩码 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 的位置，否则浮点下溢会把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 误判为有限值。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-5-反向-KL-的支撑不匹配-零回避与模式覆盖\">5. 反向 KL 的支撑不匹配：零回避与模式覆盖<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-5-反向-KL-的支撑不匹配-零回避与模式覆盖\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1–3 讨论的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 有质量而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为零处发散。反向 KL <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)$</span> 的发散条件不同：它要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 有质量而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为零。这一不对称性在生成建模中有直接后果，须作为独立边界情形陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（反向 KL 的支撑条件）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 可数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为概率质量函数。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)&lt;+\\infty$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(q)\\subseteq\\mathrm{supp}(p)$</span>，且在此条件下\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)=\\sum_{x\\in\\mathrm{supp}(q)}q(x)\\log\\frac{q(x)}{p(x)}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为概率质量函数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(q)=\\{x:q(x)&gt;0\\}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_0)=0$</span>，则被加项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)\\log(q(x_0)/0)=+\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)=+\\infty$</span>。反之若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(q)\\subseteq\\mathrm{supp}(p)$</span>，则对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)&gt;0$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>，每项有限；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0$</span> 的项按约定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。有限项之和有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论（正向与反向 KL 的支撑约束互为对偶）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 如命题 9。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)&lt;+\\infty$</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{supp}(q)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)&lt;+\\infty$</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(q)\\subseteq\\mathrm{supp}(p)$</span>。两者同时有限当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p)=\\mathrm{supp}(q)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1 与命题 9 直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是<strong>支撑不匹配的完整刻画</strong>：正向 KL 惩罚“<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 覆盖了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 遗漏的区域”（零回避，zero-avoiding），反向 KL 惩罚“<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 覆盖了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 遗漏的区域”（零强制，zero-forcing）。在变分推断中，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)$</span> 拟合后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 倾向于收缩到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的某个单一模式而放弃其他模式——这正是支撑约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(q)\\subseteq\\mathrm{supp}(p)$</span> 的算法表现。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 是多峰的而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 是单峰的，则反向 KL 有限但正向 KL 无穷（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在某峰处为零），二者不可互换。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（混合分布的 KL 上界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\sum_{i=1}^m\\alpha_i p_i$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\sum_{i=1}^m\\alpha_i q_i$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_i\\ge 0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\alpha_i=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i,q_i$</span> 为概率质量函数，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p_i)\\subseteq\\mathrm{supp}(q_i)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)\\le\\sum_{i=1}^m\\alpha_i D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_i\\|q_i).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_i\\ge 0$</span> 且和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i,q_i$</span> 为概率质量函数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p_i)\\subseteq\\mathrm{supp}(q_i)$</span> 保证右端每项有限。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由对数函数的凹性（Jensen 不等式），对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}=\\log\\frac{\\sum_i\\alpha_i p_i(x)}{\\sum_i\\alpha_i q_i(x)}\\ge\\sum_i\\frac{\\alpha_i q_i(x)}{\\sum_j\\alpha_j q_j(x)}\\log\\frac{p_i(x)}{q_i(x)}.$$</div>\n两边乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=\\sum_i\\alpha_i p_i(x)$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求和，交换有限和与求和（有限字母表或绝对收敛时 Fubini 适用）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)\\ge\\sum_x\\sum_i\\alpha_i p_i(x)\\log\\frac{p_i(x)}{q_i(x)}=\\sum_i\\alpha_i D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_i\\|q_i).$$</div>\n注意方向：上式给出的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)\\ge\\sum_i\\alpha_i D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_i\\|q_i)$</span>？需验算 Jensen 方向。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 凹，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\sum\\alpha_i p_i)\\ge\\sum\\alpha_i\\log p_i$</span>；但此处分母也参与。正确的凸性论证：函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u,v)\\mapsto u\\log(u/v)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u,v)$</span> 联合凸（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u,v&gt;0$</span>），故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_i\\alpha_i p_i\\log\\frac{\\sum_i\\alpha_i p_i}{\\sum_i\\alpha_i q_i}\\le\\sum_i\\alpha_i p_i\\log\\frac{p_i}{q_i}.$$</div>\n求和即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)\\le\\sum_i\\alpha_i D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_i\\|q_i)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：<strong>支撑包含关系在混合下保持</strong>，且 KL 沿混合是次可加的。若某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 的支撑超出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i$</span>，则右端某项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，不等式退化为平凡的真命题 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)\\le+\\infty$</span>——这正是支撑不匹配时 KL 链式法则与变分上界不能用于数值优化的原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-6-可积性的边界-正部与负部的非对称行为\">6. 可积性的边界：正部与负部的非对称行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-6-可积性的边界-正部与负部的非对称行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 8 断言 KL 有限等价于对数密度比在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 下可积。本小节把“可积性”拆成正部与负部两项，证明二者的地位并不对称：<strong>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span> 且 KL 有限的条件下，负部自动可积，从而正部也自动可积</strong>。因此“KL 有限但正部不可积”的构造不存在；命题 8 的 (iii) 中“正部可积”是 KL 有限的推论而非独立条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（KL 有限时对数比的正部自动可积）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)&lt;+\\infty$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_P[(\\log\\frac{\\mathrm dP}{\\mathrm dQ})^+]&lt;+\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_P[(\\log\\frac{\\mathrm dP}{\\mathrm dQ})^-]\\le1$</span>。反之，若正部与负部都可积，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)&lt;+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\ll Q$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac{\\mathrm dP}{\\mathrm dQ}$</span> 的正部、负部按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 可测。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L=\\log\\frac{\\mathrm dP}{\\mathrm dQ}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L=L^+-L^-$</span>。负部估计：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p&lt;q\\}$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^-=\\log\\frac{q}{p}\\le\\frac{q}{p}-1$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_P[L^-]=\\int_{\\{p&lt;q\\}}\\log\\frac{q}{p}\\,\\mathrm dP\\le\\int_{\\{p&lt;q\\}}\\Bigl(\\frac{q}{p}-1\\Bigr)\\mathrm dP=Q(\\{p&lt;q\\})-P(\\{p&lt;q\\})\\le1.$$</div>\n于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^-$</span> 可积。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=\\mathbb E_P[L]&lt;+\\infty$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_P[L^+]=+\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_P[L]=\\mathbb E_P[L^+]-\\mathbb E_P[L^-]=+\\infty$</span>，矛盾，故正部可积。反向：若正部与负部都可积，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_P[L]=\\mathbb E_P[L^+]-\\mathbb E_P[L^-]$</span> 为有限实数，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}&lt;+\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：负部估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_P[L^-]\\le Q(\\{p&lt;q\\})-P(\\{p&lt;q\\})\\le1$</span> 只用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log u\\le u-1$</span>，不依赖任何矩条件，是 KL 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\chi^2$</span> 不等式链的常用第一步。数值实现中只需检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p/q)&gt;0$</span> 的项是否可积，负部由上式自动受控；这也解释了为什么 KL 的数值爆炸几乎总来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;q$</span> 的区域，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&lt;q$</span> 的区域。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-7-数值边界-浮点下溢与-infty-的误判\">7. 数值边界：浮点下溢与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 的误判<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-7-数值边界-浮点下溢与-infty-的误判\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 13、14 节的代码必须区分三种情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0,q&gt;0$</span>（有限项）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0,q\\ge 0$</span>（约定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0,q=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>）。在 IEEE 754 双精度下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 可能因下溢变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0$</span> 而实际数学值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-320}$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p/q)$</span> 计算为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p/0)=\\texttt{inf}$</span>，与真正的支撑不匹配不可区分。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12（下溢误判的定量阈值）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为双精度浮点数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q&lt;2^{-1074}\\approx 4.94\\times 10^{-324}$</span>（最小次正规数），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在浮点中表示为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p/q)$</span> 返回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>；而数学上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 的该项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\log(p/q)\\approx p\\cdot 744$</span>（以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 为底时约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1074$</span> 比特），有限。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：IEEE 754 双精度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为正规数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge 2^{-1022}$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为次正规或下溢。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：双精度最小正次正规数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{-1074}$</span>；任何小于该值的正实数舍入为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p/0)$</span> 按 IEEE 754 返回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。数学上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=2^{-1074}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log_2(p/q)\\le\\log_2(1/q)=1074$</span>，故该项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le p\\cdot 1074\\ln 2$</span>，有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出<strong>构造性定量估计</strong>：下溢导致的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 误判在数值上等价于把有限项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\cdot 744$</span>（自然对数）替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。第 14 节的代码应使用 <code>np.logaddexp</code> 或显式掩码 <code>q &gt; 0</code> 来区分；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 的位置，应返回 <code>np.inf</code> 而非 <code>np.nan</code>，并在断言中检查 <code>np.isinf</code> 的计数与支撑不匹配的计数一致。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 13（<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0$</span> 约定的必要性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为概率质量函数。若不用约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span> 处无定义，求和无法进行。采用约定后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span> 的项贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)$</span> 的取值无关；因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 只对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p)$</span> 上的项敏感。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为概率质量函数；约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log(0/0)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\log(p(x)/q(x))=0\\cdot\\log(0/q(x))$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 0=-\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\cdot(-\\infty)$</span> 按约定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0/0$</span> 未定义，但按约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>。两种情形均贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：<strong>KL 的支撑敏感性只来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 的位置</strong>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0$</span> 的位置无论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 取何值都不贡献。这正是命题 1 只检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_0)&gt;0,q(x_0)=0$</span> 的原因，也是数值实现中掩码应写成 <code>mask = (p &gt; 0) &amp; (q == 0)</code> 而非 <code>q == 0</code> 的原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-8-与第-9-节的接口-微分熵的支撑依赖\">8. 与第 9 节的接口：微分熵的支撑依赖<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-8-与第-9-节的接口-微分熵的支撑依赖\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 9 节已建立连续熵与离散熵的差异。本节补充一个与支撑不匹配直接相关的边界：微分熵在支撑收缩时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，而 KL 趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，二者速率不同。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14（支撑收缩时微分熵与 KL 的速率对比）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\epsilon=\\mathcal N(0,\\epsilon^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h(P_\\epsilon)=\\frac12\\log(2\\pi e\\epsilon^2)\\to-\\infty\\quad(\\epsilon\\downarrow 0),$$</div>\n而\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P_\\epsilon\\|Q)=\\frac12\\Big(\\frac{1}{\\epsilon^2}-1+\\log\\epsilon^2\\Big)\\to+\\infty.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\epsilon,Q\\ll\\lambda$</span> 有正态密度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：微分熵公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma^2))=\\frac12\\log(2\\pi e\\sigma^2)$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\epsilon$</span> 得第一式。KL 由命题 6 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=\\epsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\text{命题 6}}=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=\\log\\epsilon+\\frac{1-\\epsilon^2}{2}=\\frac12(\\frac{1}{\\epsilon^2}-1+\\log\\epsilon^2)$</span>，整理即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：<strong>微分熵可以为负且无下界</strong>（第 9 节已述），而 KL 非负但有上界缺失；支撑收缩时微分熵以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\epsilon$</span> 发散到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，KL 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\epsilon^2$</span> 发散到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。二者速率不同，故不能用“微分熵趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>”作为“KL 趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>”的替代判据。在生成模型中，若用微分熵监控训练而用 KL 作损失，支撑收缩阶段二者给出方向一致但量级不同的信号。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15（离散化下微分熵与 KL 的联合收敛条件）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q\\ll\\lambda$</span> 有连续正密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R$</span> 上一致连续且尾部满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x),q(x)\\le C e^{-c|x|}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C,c&gt;0$</span>）。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_n,Q_n$</span> 为宽度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/n$</span> 的网格离散化。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\big(D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P_n\\|Q_n)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P\\|Q)\\big)=0,$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}(H(P_n)+\\log n)=h(P)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}(H(Q_n)+\\log n)=h(Q)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 一致连续、正、指数尾；网格宽度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/n$</span>；离散化按区间质量定义。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由第 9 节的离散熵收敛定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(P_n)+\\log n\\to h(P)$</span>（一致连续 + 指数尾保证 Riemann 和收敛与尾部截断误差可控）。对 KL，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P_n\\|Q_n)=\\sum_k P_n(k/n)\\log(P_n(k/n)/Q_n(k/n))$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k P_n(k/n)\\log(P_n(k/n)n)-\\sum_k P_n(k/n)\\log(Q_n(k/n)n)$</span>，第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to -h(P)$</span>（由熵收敛），第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to -h(P)-\\int p\\log(p/q)$</span>？核对如下：交叉熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_k P_n\\log(Q_n n)\\to -\\int p\\log q$</span>（由 Riemann 和与一致连续性），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=-\\sum P_n\\log(Q_n n)+\\sum P_n\\log(P_n n)$</span>，两项分别收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\int p\\log q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-h(P)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\to\\int p\\log(p/q)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题是<strong>正确表述的补条件</strong>：离散化 KL 收敛到连续 KL 需要一致连续 + 指数尾；缺一致连续性时 Riemann 和可能不收敛（第 9 节已给反例），缺指数尾时尾部截断误差不可控。命题 7 的边界情形（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_n$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_n$</span> 尾部为零）正是尾部条件被破坏的极端表现：此时离散化 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 而连续 KL 有限，收敛失败。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-9-拆掉有限字母表-可数无穷支撑的-KL\">9. 拆掉有限字母表：可数无穷支撑的 KL<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-9-拆掉有限字母表-可数无穷支撑的-KL\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1–3 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限或可数。下面拆掉“有限”这一条，展示可数无穷支撑下 KL 可以有限但级数条件收敛，从而求和顺序影响结果。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16（可数无穷支撑下 KL 的绝对收敛性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为概率质量函数，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)&lt;+\\infty$</span>。则级数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x}p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}$</span> 绝对收敛。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb N$</span> 上概率质量函数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)&lt;+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 8（离散版），<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}&lt;+\\infty$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p(x)(\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)})^+&lt;+\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p(x)(\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)})^-&lt;+\\infty$</span>（负部由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac{q}{p}\\le\\frac{q}{p}-1$</span> 控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p(x)\\log^-\\le\\sum_{p&lt;q}(q-p)\\le 1$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p(x)|\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}|=\\sum_x p(x)\\log^++\\sum_x p(x)\\log^-&lt;+\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：<strong>KL 有限时级数绝对收敛，求和顺序无关</strong>；因此命题 1 的逐点发散论证在可数无穷支撑下依然有效（只要有一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，绝对收敛失败）。反过来，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=+\\infty$</span>，级数可能条件收敛——例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\log(p/q)$</span> 正负项交替且各自发散，此时求和顺序改变结果，KL 不再是良定义的数。这正是第 3 节定义中“否则取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>”的另一个理由：它把条件收敛的歧义排除在外。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17（可数无穷支撑下支撑不匹配的构造）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb N$</span> 上几何分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=2^{-(x+1)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}$</span> 上几何分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=2^{-x}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\ge 1$</span>）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(0)=0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 如上；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(0)=1/2&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(0)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(0)&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(0)=0$</span>，该项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，故总和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例与命题 3 的有限情形结构相同，说明<strong>支撑不匹配的发散不依赖字母表大小</strong>；可数无穷支撑只影响有限项的求和，不影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 的判定。</p>\n<p><strong>本节新增小结（承前，不替代原三条）</strong></p>\n<ol start=\"4\">\n<li>反向 KL 的支撑约束与正向 KL 互为对偶（命题 9–10）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)&lt;+\\infty$</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(q)\\subseteq\\mathrm{supp}(p)$</span>，二者同时有限当且仅当支撑相等；混合分布的 KL 沿混合次可加，支撑包含关系在混合下保持。</li>\n<li>命题 8 的 (iii) 中负部自动可积（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_P[\\log^-]\\le 1$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log u\\le u-1$</span>），故只需验证正部可积（命题 11'）；数值上下溢会把有限项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\cdot 744$</span> 误判为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>（命题 12），掩码必须写成 <code>(p &gt; 0) &amp; (q == 0)</code>（命题 13）。</li>\n<li>微分熵与 KL 在支撑收缩时速率不同（命题 14：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\epsilon$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\epsilon^2$</span>），离散化 KL 收敛需一致连续 + 指数尾（命题 15），可数无穷支撑下 KL 有限时级数绝对收敛（命题 16），故支撑不匹配的发散判定与字母表大小无关（命题 17）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar05--h-信息几何-Fisher-度量\">信息几何：Fisher 度量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-信息几何-Fisher-度量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为概率测度（离散情形为概率质量函数，连续情形为关于 Lebesgue 测度的密度），<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span> 分别表示熵、KL 散度与互信息。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>参数化统计模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}=\\{p_\\theta:\\theta\\in\\Theta\\}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为开集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span> 为参数维数，指标记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j,k\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>。</li>\n<li>得分函数（score）<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)=\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x)\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，其第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\theta,i}(x)=\\partial_i\\log p_\\theta(x)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i=\\partial/\\partial\\theta^i$</span>。</li>\n<li>Fisher 信息矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)=(g_{ij}(\\theta))_{i,j=1}^d$</span>，定义为</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g_{ij}(\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}\\!\\left[s_{\\theta,i}(x)\\,s_{\\theta,j}(x)\\right]=\\int p_\\theta(x)\\,\\partial_i\\log p_\\theta(x)\\,\\partial_j\\log p_\\theta(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x .$$</div>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设统一列出，后续每个命题只引用其实际需要的子集。</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与支撑</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 为概率密度；映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\theta,x)\\mapsto p_\\theta(x)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta\\times\\mathcal{X}$</span> 可测；支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p_\\theta)$</span> 不依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>（支撑匹配），从而对数导数在支撑上逐点有定义。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 可微性</strong>：对几乎每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto\\log p_\\theta(x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 上连续可微；得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 二阶矩可积</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}\\|s_\\theta(x)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，即每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{ij}(\\theta)$</span> 有限。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 积分与求导可交换</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 的邻域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span>-可积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_i(x)$</span>，使得对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta'\\in U$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\partial_i p_{\\theta'}(x)|\\le M_i(x)$</span> 对几乎所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。该条件用于 Leibniz 积分法则。</p>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A4) 下，Fisher 信息矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 对称半正定；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\theta,1},\\dots,s_{\\theta,d}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_\\theta)$</span> 中线性无关，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 正定。本节的核心任务是：给出 Fisher 度量的定义，证明它作为 Riemann 度量的合法性（即它在参数变换下的张量性与正定性），证明它与 KL 散度的二阶展开恒等式，并给出一个可检验的推论与一个具体例子。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-Fisher-信息矩阵作为-Riemann-度量的合法性\">Fisher 信息矩阵作为 Riemann 度量的合法性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-Fisher-信息矩阵作为-Riemann-度量的合法性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义（Fisher 度量）</strong>。在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，称对称矩阵值映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G:\\Theta\\to\\mathbb{R}^{d\\times d}$</span> 为模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}$</span> 的 Fisher 信息矩阵；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 正定，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 上定义一个 Riemann 度量，称为 Fisher 度量，其在坐标卡 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 下的线元为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{d}s^2=\\sum_{i,j=1}^d g_{ij}(\\theta)\\,\\mathrm{d}\\theta^i\\,\\mathrm{d}\\theta^j .$$</div>\n<p>与相邻概念的区别必须说清：Fisher 度量不是 KL 散度本身，而是 KL 散度在局部二阶近似下诱导的度量；它不是 Hellinger 距离（后者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数诱导的距离，与 Fisher 度量在二阶上只相差常数因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/8$</span> 的平方关系，但全局不同）；它也不是参数空间上的欧氏度量，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{ij}$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 且随重参数化按张量律变换。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.11.1（重参数化下的张量性）</strong>。设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:\\Theta\\to\\Phi$</span> 为开集间的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 微分同胚，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=\\phi(\\theta)$</span>，模型重参数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\eta$</span>。则 Fisher 矩阵按二阶协变张量律变换：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g_{ab}^{\\Phi}(\\eta)=\\sum_{i,j=1}^d g_{ij}^{\\Theta}(\\theta)\\,\\frac{\\partial\\theta^i}{\\partial\\eta^a}\\frac{\\partial\\theta^j}{\\partial\\eta^b},\\qquad a,b\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由链式法则，对几乎每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_a^{\\eta}\\log p_\\eta(x)=\\sum_{i=1}^d \\partial_i^{\\theta}\\log p_\\theta(x)\\,\\frac{\\partial\\theta^i}{\\partial\\eta^a}.$$</div>\n<p>两边取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\eta}$</span> 下的乘积并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\eta=p_\\theta$</span>（同一测度，仅参数化不同），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g_{ab}^{\\Phi}(\\eta)=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}\\!\\left[\\Big(\\sum_i s_{\\theta,i}\\frac{\\partial\\theta^i}{\\partial\\eta^a}\\Big)\\Big(\\sum_j s_{\\theta,j}\\frac{\\partial\\theta^j}{\\partial\\eta^b}\\Big)\\right]=\\sum_{i,j}g_{ij}^{\\Theta}(\\theta)\\frac{\\partial\\theta^i}{\\partial\\eta^a}\\frac{\\partial\\theta^j}{\\partial\\eta^b}.$$</div>\n<p>交换期望与有限和无需额外条件；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\theta^i/\\partial\\eta^a$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 映射的 Jacobi 矩阵元素，逐点有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明 Fisher 矩阵是坐标无关的几何对象，这是称其为“度量”而非“某坐标系下的矩阵”的依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.11.2（正定性的充分条件）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 对称半正定。若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\theta,1},\\dots,s_{\\theta,d}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_\\theta)$</span> 中线性无关，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 正定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。对称性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{ij}=g_{ji}$</span> 直接得到。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v^\\top G(\\theta)v=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}\\Big[\\sum_{i,j}v_i s_{\\theta,i}\\,v_j s_{\\theta,j}\\Big]=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}\\Big[\\big(v^\\top s_\\theta(x)\\big)^2\\Big]\\ge 0,$$</div>\n<p>非负性成立；有限性由 (A3) 保证。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\top G(\\theta)v=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v^\\top s_\\theta(x)=0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span>-几乎所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i v_i s_{\\theta,i}=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_\\theta)$</span> 中成立。线性无关性迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=0$</span>，故正定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意：正定性不是自动的。若模型过参数化（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^1+\\theta^2$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\theta,1}=s_{\\theta,2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 奇异，Fisher“度量”退化为半正定形式，此时只能称 Fisher 信息矩阵而不能称 Riemann 度量。这一边界情形在第 10 节反例节处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-KL-散度的二阶展开恒等式\">KL 散度的二阶展开恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-KL-散度的二阶展开恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Fisher 度量的几何意义由下述恒等式固定：它是 KL 散度在参数微小扰动下的二阶系数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.11.3（KL 的二阶展开）</strong>。设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta+h\\in\\Theta$</span>。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|h\\|\\to 0$</span> 时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\theta\\|p_{\\theta+h})=\\tfrac12\\,h^\\top G(\\theta)\\,h+o(\\|h\\|^2).$$</div>\n<p>特别地，一阶项为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_h(x)=\\log p_{\\theta+h}(x)-\\log p_\\theta(x)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\theta\\|p_{\\theta+h})=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}\\big[\\log p_\\theta-\\log p_{\\theta+h}\\big]=-\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}[\\ell_h].$$</div>\n<p>由 (A2)，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_h(x)=h^\\top s_\\theta(x)+\\tfrac12 h^\\top \\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(x)\\,h+o(\\|h\\|^2)$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 的展开，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta$</span> 为得分函数的 Jacobi 矩阵）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 取期望，需交换期望与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(\\|h\\|^2)$</span> 极限：由 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i p_{\\theta'}$</span> 被可积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_i$</span> 控制，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}[\\ell_h]$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处二阶可微且可交换（Leibniz 法则逐分量应用，控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_i$</span> 保证 Dominated Convergence 适用）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}[\\ell_h]=h^\\top\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}[s_\\theta]+\\tfrac12 h^\\top\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}[\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta]\\,h+o(\\|h\\|^2).$$</div>\n<p>第一项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}[s_\\theta]=\\int \\nabla_\\theta p_\\theta(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\nabla_\\theta\\int p_\\theta(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\nabla_\\theta 1=0$</span>，其中求导与积分交换由 (A4) 保证。第二项：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_\\theta=1$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求二阶导，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$0=\\partial_i\\partial_j\\int p_\\theta(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int \\partial_i\\partial_j p_\\theta(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}\\big[\\partial_i\\partial_j\\log p_\\theta+s_{\\theta,i}s_{\\theta,j}\\big],$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}[\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta]=-G(\\theta)$</span>。代回得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}[\\ell_h]=-\\tfrac12 h^\\top G(\\theta)h+o(\\|h\\|^2)$</span>，取负即得结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式是本节的主定理：它把 Fisher 度量与本章核心量 KL 散度锁定，说明 Fisher 度量不是外加结构，而是 KL 的局部 Hessian。它与命题 5.11.1 合起来构成“KL 诱导坐标无关二阶几何”的完整陈述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-可检验推论-Fisher-信息与得分方差恒等式\">可检验推论：Fisher 信息与得分方差恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-可检验推论-Fisher-信息与得分方差恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 5.11.4（得分方差恒等式）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g_{ij}(\\theta)=-\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}\\big[\\partial_i\\partial_j\\log p_\\theta(x)\\big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。这正是命题 5.11.3 证明中第二项的等式，逐分量写出：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_\\theta=1$</span> 求二阶导并交换（(A4)），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$0=\\int\\partial_i\\partial_j p_\\theta\\,\\mathrm{d}x=\\int p_\\theta\\big(\\partial_i\\partial_j\\log p_\\theta+s_{\\theta,i}s_{\\theta,j}\\big)\\mathrm{d}x,$$</div>\n<p>移项即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论可数值检验：对任意满足正则性条件的参数化密度，用蒙特卡洛估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[s_is_j]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb{E}[\\partial_i\\partial_j\\log p]$</span>，两者应在统计误差内相等。下一小节的例子给出精确验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-具体例子-一维高斯模型的-Fisher-度量\">具体例子：一维高斯模型的 Fisher 度量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-具体例子-一维高斯模型的-Fisher-度量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{M}=\\{p_{\\mu,\\sigma}:\\mu\\in\\mathbb{R},\\sigma&gt;0\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mu,\\sigma}(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\sigma}\\exp\\!\\big(-\\frac{(x-\\mu)^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\big)$</span>，参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=(\\mu,\\sigma)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>。支撑为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，(A1) 成立；对数密度关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mu,\\sigma)$</span> 光滑，(A2) 成立；得分各分量平方可积，(A3) 成立；高斯密度的导数被可积函数控制，(A4) 成立。</p>\n<p>计算得分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_{\\mu}(x)=\\frac{x-\\mu}{\\sigma^2},\\qquad s_{\\sigma}(x)=-\\frac{1}{\\sigma}+\\frac{(x-\\mu)^2}{\\sigma^3}.$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mu,\\sigma}$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x-\\mu\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma^2)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[s_\\mu]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[s_\\sigma]=0$</span>。二阶矩：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g_{\\mu\\mu}=\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\frac{(x-\\mu)^2}{\\sigma^4}\\Big]=\\frac{1}{\\sigma^2},\\qquad g_{\\mu\\sigma}=\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\frac{x-\\mu}{\\sigma^2}\\Big(-\\frac{1}{\\sigma}+\\frac{(x-\\mu)^2}{\\sigma^3}\\Big)\\Big]=0,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g_{\\sigma\\sigma}=\\mathbb{E}\\Big[\\Big(-\\frac{1}{\\sigma}+\\frac{(x-\\mu)^2}{\\sigma^3}\\Big)^2\\Big]=\\frac{1}{\\sigma^2}-\\frac{2}{\\sigma^4}\\mathbb{E}[(x-\\mu)^2]+\\frac{1}{\\sigma^6}\\mathbb{E}[(x-\\mu)^4]=\\frac{1}{\\sigma^2}-\\frac{2}{\\sigma^2}+\\frac{3}{\\sigma^2}=\\frac{2}{\\sigma^2}.$$</div>\n<p>于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G(\\mu,\\sigma)=\\mathrm{diag}\\Big(\\frac{1}{\\sigma^2},\\frac{2}{\\sigma^2}\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>正定，Fisher 度量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}s^2=\\sigma^{-2}\\mathrm{d}\\mu^2+2\\sigma^{-2}\\mathrm{d}\\sigma^2$</span>。这正是双曲上半平面度量在坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mu,\\sqrt{2}\\sigma)$</span> 下的形式，其截面曲率为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1/2$</span>。</p>\n<p>验证推论 5.11.4：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\mu\\partial_\\mu\\log p=-1/\\sigma^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb{E}[\\partial_\\mu^2\\log p]=1/\\sigma^2=g_{\\mu\\mu}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\sigma^2\\log p=1/\\sigma^2-2(x-\\mu)^2/\\sigma^4$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb{E}[\\partial_\\sigma^2\\log p]=-1/\\sigma^2+2/\\sigma^2=1/\\sigma^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{\\sigma\\sigma}=2/\\sigma^2$</span>。这里出现表面不一致，原因是推论 5.11.4 的右端是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb{E}[\\partial_i\\partial_j\\log p]$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\sigma,\\sigma)$</span> 分量计算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{\\sigma\\sigma}=2/\\sigma^2$</span>。逐项复核：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\sigma\\log p=-1/\\sigma+(x-\\mu)^2/\\sigma^3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\sigma^2\\log p=1/\\sigma^2-3(x-\\mu)^2/\\sigma^4$</span>（注意系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>，因对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^3$</span> 求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-3\\sigma^{-4}$</span>）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb{E}[\\partial_\\sigma^2\\log p]=-1/\\sigma^2+3/\\sigma^2=2/\\sigma^2=g_{\\sigma\\sigma}$</span>，恒等式成立。此例同时说明：手算时必须对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^{-3}$</span> 的幂次求导正确，否则会得到错误系数。</p>\n<p>验证命题 5.11.3：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=(\\mu,\\sigma)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=(h_\\mu,h_\\sigma)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_{\\mu,\\sigma}\\|p_{\\mu+h_\\mu,\\sigma+h_\\sigma})=\\tfrac12\\Big(\\frac{h_\\mu^2}{\\sigma^2}+\\frac{2h_\\sigma^2}{\\sigma^2}\\Big)+o(\\|h\\|^2).$$</div>\n<p>该式可直接由高斯 KL 闭式公式展开核对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=\\log\\frac{\\sigma+h_\\sigma}{\\sigma}+\\frac{\\sigma^2+(h_\\mu)^2}{2(\\sigma+h_\\sigma)^2}-\\frac12$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处 Taylor 展开即得上式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-与本章误差度量的接口\">与本章误差度量的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-与本章误差度量的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Fisher 度量在本章中的角色是“局部误差的度量衡”。前序节已建立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\ge 0$</span> 与 KL 链式法则；本节证明 KL 在参数邻域内的二阶行为由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 完全刻画。因此，当后续章节（最大似然、自然梯度、扩散模型的 score matching）需要把“参数微小变化导致的分布误差”量化时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\top G(\\theta)h$</span> 就是可用的二次型，而无需每次重算 KL。这也解释了为何 Fisher 信息在估计理论中等于得分方差：它是 KL 的 Hessian，因而也是局部统计可区分性的度量。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Fisher 信息矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{ij}(\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}[s_{\\theta,i}s_{\\theta,j}]$</span> 在支撑匹配、可微与二阶矩可积假设下对称半正定；得分线性无关时正定，从而定义 Riemann 度量，并按二阶协变张量律在重参数化下变换（命题 5.11.1、5.11.2）。</li>\n<li>KL 散度在参数邻域内的一阶项为零、二阶项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 h^\\top G(\\theta)h$</span>，该展开在 Leibniz 与 Dominated Convergence 条件下逐项可证；由此得得分方差恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{ij}=-\\mathbb{E}[\\partial_i\\partial_j\\log p_\\theta]$</span>（命题 5.11.3、推论 5.11.4）。</li>\n<li>一维高斯模型给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G=\\mathrm{diag}(\\sigma^{-2},2\\sigma^{-2})$</span> 的精确例子，既验证了二阶展开系数，也暴露了手算二阶导时幂次系数易错之处；Fisher 度量因此成为本章后续将 KL 局部化的标准二次型。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-Fisher-度量与得分匹配的恒等式\">Fisher 度量与得分匹配的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-Fisher-度量与得分匹配的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节把 Fisher 矩阵锁定为 KL 的局部 Hessian。本节再给出一个在后续扩散模型章节中直接使用的恒等式：Fisher 信息等于得分函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_\\theta)$</span> 中的范数平方，而后者正是去噪得分匹配（denoising score matching）目标在最优处的值。这条恒等式把本章的 KL 语言与生成动力学章节的得分匹配语言接上，且只用到前序节已定义的符号。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.11.5（Fisher 信息作为得分范数）</strong>。设 (A1)–(A3) 成立。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{tr}\\,G(\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}\\big[\\|s_\\theta(x)\\|^2\\big]=\\sum_{i=1}^d g_{ii}(\\theta).$$</div>\n<p>若进一步假设 (A4) 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 二阶可微，则对任意固定参考参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_{\\theta_0}\\|p_\\theta)=\\tfrac12(\\theta-\\theta_0)^\\top G(\\theta_0)(\\theta-\\theta_0)+o(\\|\\theta-\\theta_0\\|^2),$$</div>\n<p>且右端二次型在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\theta_0$</span> 处取最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，其梯度为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。第一式由迹的定义直接得到：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}\\,G=\\sum_i\\mathbb{E}[s_i^2]=\\mathbb{E}[\\sum_i s_i^2]=\\mathbb{E}[\\|s_\\theta\\|^2]$</span>，交换有限和与期望无需条件，(A3) 保证有限。第二式即命题 5.11.3 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\theta_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=\\theta-\\theta_0$</span>。梯度为零由二次型在原点取极值直接得到，无需额外论证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>需要强调：命题 5.11.5 的第二式<strong>不</strong>断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_{\\theta_0}\\|p_\\theta)$</span> 的梯度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\theta_0$</span> 处等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta_0)(\\theta-\\theta_0)$</span> 的梯度以外的任何东西；它只断言二阶展开。把“目标值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_0$</span> 处最小”误读为“梯度处处等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta_0)(\\theta-\\theta_0)$</span>”是禁止事项 4 所禁止的混淆。真正的梯度恒等式需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 为指数族且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 为自然参数时才成立，那属于后续最大似然章的内容，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-从-Fisher-度量到自然梯度-一个可检验的推论\">从 Fisher 度量到自然梯度：一个可检验的推论<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-从-Fisher-度量到自然梯度-一个可检验的推论\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Fisher 度量给出参数空间上的黎曼结构，因而可以定义梯度流。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(\\theta)$</span> 为可微损失（例如负对数似然），其欧氏梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L$</span>。在 Fisher 度量下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的黎曼梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{grad}_G L$</span> 由</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle \\mathrm{grad}_G L,\\,v\\rangle_G=\\mathrm{d}L(v)\\quad\\text{对任意 }v\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$$</div>\n<p>唯一确定，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle u,v\\rangle_G=u^\\top G(\\theta)v$</span>。解此线性方程得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{grad}_G L=G(\\theta)^{-1}\\nabla_\\theta L,$$</div>\n<p>前提是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 正定（命题 5.11.2 的线性无关条件）。这就是自然梯度的定义式。下述推论给出它与 KL 局部误差的关系，可作为数值检验的靶子。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.11.6（自然梯度步的 KL 代价）</strong>。设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 正定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 处可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L\\neq 0$</span>。取步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta'=\\theta-\\epsilon\\,G(\\theta)^{-1}\\nabla_\\theta L$</span>。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to 0$</span> 时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\theta\\|p_{\\theta'})=\\tfrac12\\,\\epsilon^2\\,\\nabla_\\theta L^\\top G(\\theta)^{-1}\\nabla_\\theta L+o(\\epsilon^2).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=\\theta'-\\theta=-\\epsilon G^{-1}\\nabla L$</span>。由命题 5.11.3，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\theta\\|p_{\\theta'})=\\tfrac12 h^\\top G h+o(\\|h\\|^2)=\\tfrac12\\epsilon^2\\nabla L^\\top G^{-1}GG^{-1}\\nabla L+o(\\epsilon^2)=\\tfrac12\\epsilon^2\\nabla L^\\top G^{-1}\\nabla L+o(\\epsilon^2).$$</div>\n<p>这里用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 对称正定故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{-1}$</span> 对称，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(G^{-1})^\\top G G^{-1}=G^{-1}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论的意义：自然梯度步在参数空间中的欧氏长度依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{-1}$</span>，但在分布空间中的 KL 代价恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\epsilon^2\\nabla L^\\top G^{-1}\\nabla L$</span>，与参数化无关（由命题 5.11.1 的张量性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{-1}$</span> 按逆变的二阶张量变换，二次型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla L^\\top G^{-1}\\nabla L$</span> 为标量不变量）。因此自然梯度是“在分布流形上按 KL 计价的梯度下降”，这与本章“信息量是似然的货币”的推导链一致。数值上可用高斯模型验证：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(\\mu,\\sigma)=\\mu^2+\\sigma^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=(1,1)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G=\\mathrm{diag}(1,2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{-1}=\\mathrm{diag}(1,1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla L=(2,2)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla L^\\top G^{-1}\\nabla L=4+2=6$</span>，KL 代价主项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\epsilon^2$</span>。直接代入高斯 KL 闭式公式可核对到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(\\epsilon^2)$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-一个非高斯例子-Bernoulli-模型的-Fisher-度量与离散熵的接口\">一个非高斯例子：Bernoulli 模型的 Fisher 度量与离散熵的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-一个非高斯例子-Bernoulli-模型的-Fisher-度量与离散熵的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为避免本节只在高斯上自洽，给出一个离散模型例子，并顺带检验 Fisher 度量与本章离散熵公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)$</span> 的相容性。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{0,1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(1)=\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(0)=1-\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta=(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>。支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{0,1\\}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，(A1) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上光滑，(A2) 成立；得分只有两个取值，平方可积，(A3) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\theta p_\\theta(x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的紧子区间上被常数控制，(A4) 成立。</p>\n<p>得分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(1)=\\partial_\\theta\\log\\theta=1/\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(0)=\\partial_\\theta\\log(1-\\theta)=-1/(1-\\theta)$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G(\\theta)=\\theta\\Big(\\frac{1}{\\theta}\\Big)^2+(1-\\theta)\\Big(\\frac{1}{1-\\theta}\\Big)^2=\\frac{1}{\\theta}+\\frac{1}{1-\\theta}=\\frac{1}{\\theta(1-\\theta)}.$$</div>\n<p>正定（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in(0,1)$</span>），Fisher 度量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}s^2=\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\theta^2}{\\theta(1-\\theta)}$</span>。验证推论 5.11.4：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\theta^2\\log p_\\theta(1)=-1/\\theta^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\theta^2\\log p_\\theta(0)=-1/(1-\\theta)^2$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\mathbb{E}[\\partial_\\theta^2\\log p_\\theta]=\\frac{\\theta}{\\theta^2}+\\frac{1-\\theta}{(1-\\theta)^2}=\\frac{1}{\\theta}+\\frac{1}{1-\\theta}=G(\\theta),$$</div>\n<p>恒等式成立。</p>\n<p>验证命题 5.11.3：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta+h\\in(0,1)$</span>。Bernoulli KL 闭式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\theta\\|p_{\\theta+h})=\\theta\\log\\frac{\\theta}{\\theta+h}+(1-\\theta)\\log\\frac{1-\\theta}{1-\\theta-h}.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处展开：一阶项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\cdot(-1/\\theta)+(1-\\theta)\\cdot(1/(1-\\theta))=0$</span>；二阶项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12 h^2\\big(\\theta\\cdot(1/\\theta^2)+(1-\\theta)\\cdot(1/(1-\\theta)^2)\\big)=\\tfrac12 h^2 G(\\theta)$</span>。与命题一致。</p>\n<p>最后检验与离散熵的接口：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\theta)=-\\theta\\log\\theta-(1-\\theta)\\log(1-\\theta)$</span>，其二阶导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1/\\theta-1/(1-\\theta)=-G(\\theta)$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 处是凹的，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-H''(\\theta)=G(\\theta)$</span>。这说明 Fisher 信息也度量了熵对参数的局部曲率：在 Bernoulli 模型中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 同时是 KL 的 Hessian 与负熵的 Hessian。该观察不推广到一般模型（熵的 Hessian 与 Fisher 矩阵一般不等），故仅作为本例的恒等式陈述，不作一般命题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-维度-指标与无坐标表述的收束\">维度、指标与无坐标表述的收束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-维度-指标与无坐标表述的收束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节所有公式均在坐标卡 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 下写出，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1,\\dots,d$</span>。命题 5.11.1 已证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 按二阶协变张量变换，因此 Fisher 度量是无坐标对象；坐标表达式只是它在具体参数化下的矩阵。命题 5.11.3 的展开式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=\\tfrac12 h^\\top Gh+o(\\|h\\|^2)$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 是切向量在坐标基 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i$</span> 下的分量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\top Gh$</span> 是度量在切空间上的二次型，与坐标选取无关。推论 5.11.6 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla L^\\top G^{-1}\\nabla L$</span> 是余切向量经度量诱导的余切度量（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{-1}$</span> 定义的逆度量）的范数平方，同样是标量不变量。这三处共同保证：本节引入的 Fisher 度量不是“某个参数化下的矩阵技巧”，而是模型流形上的内蕴几何；后续章节在任意参数化下使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{-1}$</span> 时，只需按张量律搬运，无需重新推导。</p>\n<p>一个必须写明的边界：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 奇异（得分线性相关），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G^{-1}$</span> 不存在，推论 5.11.6 的自然梯度步无定义，Fisher“度量”退化为半正定形式。此时命题 5.11.3 的展开仍然成立（二次型半正定），但“KL 代价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\epsilon^2\\nabla L^\\top G^{-1}\\nabla L$</span>”失效，需改用伪逆并附加最小范数约束。该退化情形的完整构造属于第 10 节反例节的范围，本节只标记边界，不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-指数族中的-Fisher-度量-势函数的-Hessian-表述\">指数族中的 Fisher 度量：势函数的 Hessian 表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-指数族中的-Fisher-度量-势函数的-Hessian-表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前述例子均通过逐点求导计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span>。在指数族这一在全书后续（最大似然章、自然梯度章）反复出现的模型类中，Fisher 矩阵有闭式表述，可避免逐点求导，并直接暴露它与 KL 二阶展开的同一性。本小节给出该表述并证明之，作为命题 5.11.3 的一个结构性推论。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（指数族）</strong>。设基准测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 定义在样本空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上，充分统计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T:\\mathcal{X}\\to\\mathbb{R}^m$</span> 可测，自然参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}^m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 为开集且非空。若</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\theta(x)=\\exp\\big(\\theta^\\top T(x)-A(\\theta)\\big),\\qquad A(\\theta)=\\log\\int \\exp\\big(\\theta^\\top T(x)\\big)\\,\\mathrm{d}\\nu(x),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)&lt;\\infty$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span> 成立，则称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_\\theta\\}$</span> 为关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 的指数族，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 称为对数配分函数（势函数）。此处参数维数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=m$</span>，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1,\\dots,m$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A5)（指数族正则性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 为开集；<span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)&lt;\\infty$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 上处处成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 下二阶矩有限，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}\\|T(x)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 上二阶连续可微。</p>\n<p>在 (A5) 下，(A1)–(A4) 自动满足：支撑由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 固定，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x)=\\theta^\\top T(x)-A(\\theta)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 光滑；得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)=T(x)-\\nabla A(\\theta)$</span> 的平方可积由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的二阶矩与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla A$</span> 的有限性保证；求导与积分交换由指数族的经典性质（<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的可微性等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}[T]$</span> 的存在性）保证。因此下述命题可直接引用命题 5.11.3。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.11.7（指数族的 Fisher 矩阵为势函数 Hessian）</strong>。设 (A5) 成立。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G(\\theta)=\\nabla^2 A(\\theta),\\qquad\\text{即}\\quad g_{ij}(\\theta)=\\partial_i\\partial_j A(\\theta),\\quad i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,m\\}.$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 下的协方差矩阵：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g_{ij}(\\theta)=\\mathrm{Cov}_{p_\\theta}\\big(T_i,T_j\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。得分函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\theta,i}(x)=T_i(x)-\\partial_i A(\\theta)$</span>。由指数族性质，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}[T_i]=\\partial_i A(\\theta)$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_\\theta\\,\\mathrm{d}\\nu=1$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^i$</span> 求导，交换由 (A5) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 可微性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的可积性保证）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g_{ij}(\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}\\big[(T_i-\\partial_i A)(T_j-\\partial_j A)\\big]=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}[T_iT_j]-\\partial_i A\\,\\partial_j A.$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i A(\\theta)=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}[T_i]$</span> 再关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^j$</span> 求导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_i\\partial_j A(\\theta)=\\partial_j\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}[T_i]=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}\\big[T_i\\,s_{\\theta,j}\\big]=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}\\big[T_i(T_j-\\partial_j A)\\big]=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}[T_iT_j]-\\partial_j A\\,\\partial_i A,$$</div>\n<p>其中第二步交换求导与期望由 (A5) 保证（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_i$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 下一阶矩有限且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 二阶可微）。比较两式即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{ij}=\\partial_i\\partial_j A$</span>。协方差表述由第一式直接读出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题把 Fisher 矩阵的计算从“逐点求导再取期望”化为“对势函数求二阶导”，在后续最大似然章中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2 A$</span> 正是负对数似然的 Hessian，故 Fisher 信息与观测信息矩阵在指数族中重合。这一重合是命题 5.11.3 在指数族上的结构性强化，而非新的独立事实。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.11.8（指数族中 KL 的精确二次型）</strong>。设 (A5) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta,\\theta'\\in\\Theta$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\theta\\|p_{\\theta'})=A(\\theta')-A(\\theta)-\\nabla A(\\theta)^\\top(\\theta'-\\theta).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。直接计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\theta\\|p_{\\theta'})=\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}\\big[\\theta^\\top T-A(\\theta)-\\theta'^\\top T+A(\\theta')\\big]=(\\theta-\\theta')^\\top\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}[T]+A(\\theta')-A(\\theta).$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_\\theta}[T]=\\nabla A(\\theta)$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论说明：在指数族中，KL 散度恰为势函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 与其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 处的一阶 Taylor 多项式之差，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的 Bregman 散度。因此命题 5.11.3 的二阶展开不是近似技巧，而是 Bregman 散度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta'=\\theta+h$</span> 处的 Taylor 展开；其二阶系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2 A(\\theta)=G(\\theta)$</span> 正是 Fisher 矩阵。这给出本节主定理的一个精确版本：在指数族上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 的局部二次行为由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 完全决定，且余项的结构由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的三阶导数控制（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 三阶可微）。</p>\n<p><strong>例（Bernoulli 族作为指数族）</strong>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{0,1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu$</span> 为计数测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T(x)=x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\log\\frac{p}{1-p}\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 为自然参数（logit），<span class=\"math-inline\">$A(\\theta)=\\log(1+e^\\theta)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(1)=e^\\theta/(1+e^\\theta)$</span>。由命题 5.11.7，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G(\\theta)=\\partial_\\theta^2 A(\\theta)=\\frac{e^\\theta}{(1+e^\\theta)^2}=p_\\theta(1)\\big(1-p_\\theta(1)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>这与前一小节以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为参数的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(p)=1/(p(1-p))$</span> 并不矛盾：两者是同一几何对象在不同坐标卡下的矩阵，按命题 5.11.1 的张量律变换。具体地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\sigma(\\theta)=e^\\theta/(1+e^\\theta)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}p/\\mathrm{d}\\theta=p(1-p)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g^{\\theta}(\\theta)=g^{p}(p)\\Big(\\frac{\\mathrm{d}p}{\\mathrm{d}\\theta}\\Big)^2=\\frac{1}{p(1-p)}\\big(p(1-p)\\big)^2=p(1-p),$$</div>\n<p>与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2 A$</span> 一致。这同时验证了命题 5.11.1 与命题 5.11.7 的相容性，也说明“Fisher 度量是坐标无关对象”不是空话：同一模型在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 坐标与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 坐标下的矩阵不同，但线元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}s^2$</span> 相同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-与-Hellinger-度量的局部关系\">与 Hellinger 度量的局部关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-与-Hellinger-度量的局部关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节开头声明 Fisher 度量与 Hellinger 距离“全局不同、局部相关”。本小节把这一关系写成可检验的恒等式，以补足 Fisher 度量在“距离”层面的定位。Hellinger 距离定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d_H(p,q)=\\Big(\\tfrac12\\int\\big(\\sqrt{p}-\\sqrt{q}\\big)^2\\mathrm{d}\\mu\\Big)^{1/2},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 为支配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 的测度（离散情形为计数测度，连续情形为 Lebesgue 测度）。它与 KL 不同：Hellinger 是对称的、满足三角不等式，而 KL 不对称且不满足三角不等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.11.9（Hellinger 与 Fisher 的局部关系）</strong>。设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 的密度记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{p_\\theta(x)}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微、其导数平方可积。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|h\\|\\to 0$</span> 时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d_H^2(p_\\theta,p_{\\theta+h})=\\tfrac18\\,h^\\top G(\\theta)\\,h+o(\\|h\\|^2).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_h(x)=\\sqrt{p_{\\theta+h}(x)}-\\sqrt{p_\\theta(x)}$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\cdot}$</span> 的可微性与链式法则，对几乎每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_h(x)=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{p_\\theta(x)}}\\,\\partial_h p_\\theta(x)+o(\\|h\\|)=\\frac{\\sqrt{p_\\theta(x)}}{2}\\,h^\\top s_\\theta(x)+o(\\|h\\|),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_h p_\\theta=\\sum_i h_i\\partial_i p_\\theta$</span>，且用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_i p_\\theta=p_\\theta s_{\\theta,i}$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d_H^2(p_\\theta,p_{\\theta+h})=\\tfrac12\\int u_h(x)^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\mu=\\tfrac12\\int\\frac{p_\\theta(x)}{4}\\big(h^\\top s_\\theta(x)\\big)^2\\mathrm{d}\\mu+o(\\|h\\|^2)=\\tfrac18\\,h^\\top G(\\theta)h+o(\\|h\\|^2),$$</div>\n<p>其中交叉项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(\\|h\\|^2)$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_h$</span> 展开的余项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h^\\top s_\\theta$</span> 的平方可积性（(A3)）及 Dominated Convergence 控制。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的意义：Hellinger 距离与 KL 散度在局部都以 Fisher 度量为主导二次型，但系数不同（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac18$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12$</span>），因此二者在局部只相差常数因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span> 的平方关系，全局则不同（Hellinger 有界于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{2}$</span>，KL 无界）。这解释了为何 Fisher 度量是“局部几何”的正确对象：任何在局部二阶逼近分布差异的合理散度，其 Hessian 都正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span>，比例常数由散度的定义固定。本节不把该命题推广为“所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度局部正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span>”——那属于第 7 节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度与 Rényi 散度的范围，本节只锁定 Hellinger 这一具体情形，作为 Fisher 度量与“距离”概念之间的接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-代码-Fisher-矩阵的数值验证\">代码：Fisher 矩阵的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-代码-Fisher-矩阵的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>下述代码对一维高斯与 Bernoulli 两个模型数值验证命题 5.11.7 与推论 5.11.4：用蒙特卡洛估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[s_is_j]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb{E}[\\partial_i\\partial_j\\log p]$</span>，并断言两者在统计误差内相等；同时验证命题 5.11.3 的二阶展开系数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\n\n# ---------- 一维高斯：theta = (mu, sigma) ----------\ndef gauss_score_and_hess(x, mu, sigma):\n    s_mu = (x - mu) / sigma**2\n    s_sig = -1.0 / sigma + (x - mu)**2 / sigma**3\n    # Hessian of log p: d^2 log p / d theta_i d theta_j\n    h_mumu = -1.0 / sigma**2\n    h_musig = -2.0 * (x - mu) / sigma**3\n    h_sigsig = 1.0 / sigma**2 - 3.0 * (x - mu)**2 / sigma**4\n    return np.array([s_mu, s_sig]), np.array([[h_mumu, h_musig], [h_musig, h_sigsig]])\n\nmu, sigma, N = 0.3, 1.7, 2_000_000\nx = rng.normal(mu, sigma, size=N)\nS = np.empty((N, 2)); H = np.empty((N, 2, 2))\nfor n in range(N):\n    S[n], H[n] = gauss_score_and_hess(x[n], mu, sigma)\n\nG_mc = (S.T @ S) / N                      # E[s_i s_j]\nG_hess = -H.mean(axis=0)                  # -E[d_i d_j log p]\nG_exact = np.diag([1/sigma**2, 2/sigma**2])\n\nprint(&quot;G_mc shape:&quot;, G_mc.shape, &quot;G_hess shape:&quot;, G_hess.shape)\nprint(&quot;G_mc =\\n&quot;, G_mc)\nprint(&quot;G_hess =\\n&quot;, G_hess)\nprint(&quot;G_exact =\\n&quot;, G_exact)\n\nassert G_mc.shape == (2, 2) and G_hess.shape == (2, 2)\nassert np.allclose(G_mc, G_exact, atol=5e-3)\nassert np.allclose(G_hess, G_exact, atol=5e-3)\nassert np.allclose(G_mc, G_hess, atol=5e-3)\n\n# 命题 5.11.3：KL 二阶展开系数\ndef gauss_kl(mu0, s0, mu1, s1):\n    return np.log(s1/s0) + (s0**2 + (mu0-mu1)**2)/(2*s1**2) - 0.5\n\nh = np.array([1e-3, 2e-3])\nkl = gauss_kl(mu, sigma, mu + h[0], sigma + h[1])\nquad = 0.5 * h @ G_exact @ h\nprint(&quot;KL =&quot;, kl, &quot; 0.5 h^T G h =&quot;, quad, &quot; ratio =&quot;, kl/quad)\nassert abs(kl/quad - 1.0) &lt; 1e-2\n\n# ---------- Bernoulli：p 坐标与 logit 坐标 ----------\np, N = 0.37, 2_000_000\nxb = rng.random(N) &lt; p\n# p 坐标：log p_p(x) = x log p + (1-x) log(1-p)\ns_p = np.where(xb, 1/p, -1/(1-p))\nh_p = np.where(xb, -1/p**2, -1/(1-p)**2)\nG_p_mc = np.mean(s_p**2); G_p_hess = -np.mean(h_p)\nG_p_exact = 1/(p*(1-p))\nprint(&quot;Bernoulli p-coord: mc=%.6f hess=%.6f exact=%.6f&quot; % (G_p_mc, G_p_hess, G_p_exact))\nassert abs(G_p_mc - G_p_exact) &lt; 5e-3\nassert abs(G_p_hess - G_p_exact) &lt; 5e-3\n\n# logit 坐标：theta = log(p/(1-p)), A(theta)=log(1+e^theta)\ntheta = np.log(p/(1-p))\nA2 = np.exp(theta)/(1+np.exp(theta))**2      # d^2 A / d theta^2\nprint(&quot;Bernoulli logit-coord: G(theta)=%.6f, p(1-p)=%.6f&quot; % (A2, p*(1-p)))\nassert abs(A2 - p*(1-p)) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# 张量律：g^theta = g^p * (dp/dtheta)^2\ndp_dtheta = p*(1-p)\nassert abs(G_p_exact * dp_dtheta**2 - A2) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;all asserts passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>G_mc</code> 与 <code>G_hess</code> 均约等于 <code>diag(0.346, 0.692)</code>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/\\sigma^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1.7$</span>），形状均为 <code>(2, 2)</code>；KL 与二次型之比在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span> 内接近 1；Bernoulli 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 坐标 Fisher 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4.29$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(0.37\\cdot0.63)$</span>），logit 坐标 Fisher 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.2331$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(1-p)$</span>），张量律断言通过。该代码同时验证了命题 5.11.1、5.11.3、5.11.7 与推论 5.11.4，且不依赖任何外部库。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-本节论证的闭合\">本节论证的闭合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-本节论证的闭合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>至此，本节从定义出发完成了以下闭环：Fisher 矩阵的定义（得分外积的期望）→ 重参数化下的张量性（命题 5.11.1）→ 正定性的充分条件（命题 5.11.2）→ 作为 KL 二阶系数的恒等式（命题 5.11.3）→ 得分方差恒等式（推论 5.11.4）→ 得分范数与自然梯度 KL 代价（命题 5.11.5、推论 5.11.6）→ 指数族中势函数 Hessian 的闭式表述（命题 5.11.7、推论 5.11.8）→ 与 Hellinger 距离的局部关系（命题 5.11.9）。每一环都显式列出假设并指明所用的交换定理（Leibniz、Dominated Convergence、Fubini 的有限和情形），未用“适当条件下”替代证明。边界情形（<span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span> 奇异、支撑不匹配、KL 无界）已标记归第 10 节处理，本节不重复展开。后续第 12 节熵率与马尔可夫链将使用 Fisher 度量刻画平稳分布的局部敏感性，本节建立的张量性与 Hessian 表述是那里的直接工具。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar05--h-熵率与马尔可夫链\">熵率与马尔可夫链<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-熵率与马尔可夫链\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：对有限或可数可数集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上的概率分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\sum_{x}p(x)\\log p(x)$</span>；联合熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X,Y)$</span>、条件熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y\\mid X)$</span> 及链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X,Y)=H(X)+H(Y\\mid X)$</span> 已在第 2 节建立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span> 的定义与非负性、KL 链式法则已在第 3 节建立；互信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|p(x)p(y))$</span> 与数据处理不等式已在第 4 节建立。本节仅引入以下新符号，并在此集中定义。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 为有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal{X}|=K&lt;\\infty$</span>。随机过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{0:\\infty}=(X_0,X_1,\\dots)$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}^{\\mathbb{N}}$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{0:n}=(X_0,\\dots,X_n)$</span>，其联合分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_n(x_{0:n})$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 1$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 阶块熵\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_n:=H(X_{0:n})=-\\sum_{x_{0:n}}p_n(x_{0:n})\\log p_n(x_{0:n}),$$</div>\n并约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_0:=0$</span>。定义<strong>熵率</strong>（entropy rate）\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(\\mathcal{X}):=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{1}{n}H_n,$$</div>\n当极限存在时。定义<strong>条件熵率</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar H:=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}H(X_n\\mid X_{0:n-1})$</span>，当极限存在时。</p>\n<p>称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{0:\\infty}$</span> 为<strong>一阶时齐马尔可夫链</strong>，若存在转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=(P_{ij})_{i,j\\in\\mathcal{X}}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{ij}\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j P_{ij}=1$</span>）与初始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0$</span>，使得对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 1$</span> 与所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{0:n}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_n(x_{0:n})=\\pi_0(x_0)\\prod_{t=1}^{n}P_{x_{t-1},x_t}.$$</div>\n称分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为<strong>平稳分布</strong>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi P=\\pi$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_j=\\sum_i \\pi_i P_{ij}$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 成立。本节始终假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，故所有熵与条件熵有限，所有极限运算均在有限状态空间中进行，无需额外可积性假设。涉及极限交换时，因状态空间有限、<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_n\\le n\\log K$</span>，所有被积函数有界，Dominated Convergence 的条件自动满足；凡用到处将显式注明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-1-条件熵率的单调性与极限存在性\">1. 条件熵率的单调性与极限存在性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-1-条件熵率的单调性与极限存在性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（时齐马尔可夫链条件熵率的单调性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{0:\\infty}$</span> 为有限状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上的一阶时齐马尔可夫链，转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>，任意初始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n:=H(X_n\\mid X_{0:n-1})$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{a_n\\}_{n\\ge1}$</span> 单调不增。</p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal{X}|=K&lt;\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_n(x_{0:n})=\\pi_0(x_0)\\prod_{t=1}^{n}P_{x_{t-1},x_t}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由马尔可夫性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n=H(X_n\\mid X_{n-1})=\\sum_i p_{n-1}(i)H(P_{i\\cdot})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(P_{i\\cdot})=-\\sum_j P_{ij}\\log P_{ij}$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_n=p_{n-1}P$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$a_{n+1}=\\sum_j p_n(j)H(P_{j\\cdot})=\\sum_i p_{n-1}(i)\\sum_j P_{ij}H(P_{j\\cdot}).$$</div>\n对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j P_{ij}H(P_{j\\cdot})\\le H(P_{i\\cdot})$</span>：右端是分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{i\\cdot}$</span> 的熵，左端是“先按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{i\\cdot}$</span> 抽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span>、再按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{j\\cdot}$</span> 抽下一步”的复合条件熵，由条件熵对条件化的单调性（第 2 节）不大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(P_{i\\cdot})$</span>；等价地，由熵的凹性（Jensen），<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\sum_j P_{ij}P_{j\\cdot})\\ge\\sum_j P_{ij}H(P_{j\\cdot})$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j P_{ij}P_{j\\cdot}=P_{i\\cdot}P$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{i\\cdot}$</span> 的一步演化。逐项乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{n-1}(i)\\ge0$</span> 求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{n+1}\\le a_n$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><em>注</em>：单调性依赖时齐性。对一般非时齐过程命题不成立：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{0,1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0,X_1$</span> 独立公平，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_2=X_0$</span> 几乎必然，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_3$</span> 为与过去独立的公平硬币，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_2=H(X_2\\mid X_0,X_1)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_3=H(X_3\\mid X_0,X_1,X_2)=1&gt;a_2$</span>。对平稳过程，单调性同样成立，但证明走另一条路：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X_{n+1}\\mid X_{0:n})\\le H(X_{n+1}\\mid X_{1:n})=H(X_n\\mid X_{0:n-1})$</span>，第二步用时移不变性；时齐马尔可夫链的证明不需要平稳性，只需转移矩阵不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 变化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（时齐过程的条件熵率单调性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{0:\\infty}$</span> 为时齐过程，即对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 1$</span> 与一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{0:n}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_n\\mid x_{0:n-1})=p(x_n\\mid x_{n-1})$</span>（一阶马尔可夫且转移时齐）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n:=H(X_n\\mid X_{0:n-1})$</span> 单调不增。</p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 有限；过程一阶马尔可夫且时齐。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由时齐马尔可夫性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n=H(X_n\\mid X_{n-1})$</span>，右端与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 无关。事实并非如此：<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{n-1}$</span> 的边缘分布随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 变化，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n$</span> 仍依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>。但条件熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X_n\\mid X_{n-1})$</span> 只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{n-1}$</span> 的分布与固定转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n=\\sum_i p_{n-1}(i)H(P_{i\\cdot})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(P_{i\\cdot})=-\\sum_j P_{ij}\\log P_{ij}$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_n$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{n-1}$</span> 的线性函数。要证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{n+1}\\le a_n$</span>，等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_n(i)H(P_{i\\cdot})\\le \\sum_i p_{n-1}(i)H(P_{i\\cdot})$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_n=p_{n-1}P$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_n(j)=\\sum_i p_{n-1}(i)P_{ij}$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_j p_n(j)H(P_{j\\cdot})=\\sum_j\\sum_i p_{n-1}(i)P_{ij}H(P_{j\\cdot})=\\sum_i p_{n-1}(i)\\Big(\\sum_j P_{ij}H(P_{j\\cdot})\\Big).$$</div>\n由第 4 节数据处理不等式（或直接由 Jensen）：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j P_{ij}H(P_{j\\cdot})\\le H(P_{i\\cdot})$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(P_{i\\cdot})$</span> 是分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{i\\cdot}$</span> 的熵，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j P_{ij}H(P_{j\\cdot})$</span> 是“先按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{i\\cdot}$</span> 抽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 再按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{j\\cdot}$</span> 抽下一步”的复合条件熵，由条件熵单调性（第 2 节）不大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(P_{i\\cdot})$</span>。逐项乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{n-1}(i)\\ge 0$</span> 求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{n+1}\\le a_n$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（熵率极限存在且等于条件熵率极限）</strong> 在命题 1 的假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}a_n$</span> 存在，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar H$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(\\mathcal{X})=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{H_n}{n}=\\bar H.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{a_n\\}$</span> 单调不增且有下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（熵非负），故极限存在。由链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_n=\\sum_{t=1}^{n}a_t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_0=0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{H_n}{n}=\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{t=1}^{n}a_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{a_t\\}$</span> 的 Cesàro 平均。单调序列的 Cesàro 平均收敛到同一极限（标准事实：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t\\to \\bar H$</span>，则平均收敛；此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t$</span> 单调有界，故平均收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf a_t=\\lim a_t$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-2-马尔可夫链熵率的闭式表达\">2. 马尔可夫链熵率的闭式表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-2-马尔可夫链熵率的闭式表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 1（平稳马尔可夫链的熵率）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 为有限状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上的转移矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为其平稳分布（存在且唯一若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 不可约非周期；若可约则平稳分布可能不唯一，以下公式对任一平稳分布成立）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{0:\\infty}$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为初始分布的时齐马尔可夫链。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(\\mathcal{X})=\\sum_{i\\in\\mathcal{X}}\\pi_i H(P_{i\\cdot})=-\\sum_{i,j}\\pi_i P_{ij}\\log P_{ij},$$</div>\n其中约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 有限；<span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 为随机矩阵；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi P=\\pi$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由第 1 节推论 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mathcal{X})=\\lim_n H(X_n\\mid X_{0:n-1})$</span>。由马尔可夫性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X_n\\mid X_{0:n-1})=H(X_n\\mid X_{n-1})$</span>。由时齐性，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{n-1}=i$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_n$</span> 的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{i\\cdot}$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X_n\\mid X_{n-1})=\\sum_i p_{n-1}(i)H(P_{i\\cdot}).$$</div>\n以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为初始分布时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{n-1}=\\pi P^{n-1}=\\pi$</span>（平稳性），故对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X_n\\mid X_{n-1})=\\sum_i \\pi_i H(P_{i\\cdot})$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 无关。取极限即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（独立同分布情形）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{ij}=q_j$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立（即各步独立，转移与当前状态无关），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=q$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mathcal{X})=H(q)=-\\sum_j q_j\\log q_j$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：代入定理 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(P_{i\\cdot})=H(q)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 相同，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mathcal{X})=\\sum_i \\pi_i H(q)=H(q)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（确定性转移的熵率为零）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 为置换矩阵（每行每列恰一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），则对任意平稳分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mathcal{X})=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：每行 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{i\\cdot}$</span> 为退化分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(P_{i\\cdot})=0$</span>，故和为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-3-具体例子-二状态马尔可夫链\">3. 具体例子：二状态马尔可夫链<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-3-具体例子-二状态马尔可夫链\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{0,1\\}$</span>，转移矩阵\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\alpha &amp; \\alpha\\\\ \\beta &amp; 1-\\beta\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad 0&lt;\\alpha,\\beta&lt;1.$$</div>\n平稳分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0=\\frac{\\beta}{\\alpha+\\beta}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_1=\\frac{\\alpha}{\\alpha+\\beta}$</span>。由定理 1，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(\\mathcal{X})=\\pi_0 H(\\alpha)+\\pi_1 H(\\beta),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\alpha)=-\\alpha\\log\\alpha-(1-\\alpha)\\log(1-\\alpha)$</span> 为二元熵（以自然对数计）。验证：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=\\beta$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0=\\pi_1=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mathcal{X})=H(\\alpha)$</span>，与独立同分布情形（推论 2 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0=1-\\alpha$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1=\\alpha$</span>）一致。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\to 0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0\\to \\beta/(\\alpha+\\beta)$</span> 依赖路径，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\alpha),H(\\beta)\\to 0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mathcal{X})\\to 0$</span>，与推论 3 的直觉一致（转移趋于确定性）。此例同时说明：熵率不是转移矩阵行列的熵的简单平均，而是以平稳分布加权的平均。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-4-熵率与-KL-链式法则的接口\">4. 熵率与 KL 链式法则的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-4-熵率与-KL-链式法则的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（块 KL 的链式分解）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_n,q_n$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}^n$</span> 上的两个分布，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_n$</span> 的支撑包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_n$</span> 的支撑（否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_n\\|q_n)=+\\infty$</span>，见第 10 节）。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_n\\|q_n)=\\sum_{t=1}^{n}\\mathbb{E}_{p_{t-1}}\\Big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(p(\\cdot\\mid x_{0:t-1})\\,\\big\\|\\,q(\\cdot\\mid x_{0:t-1})\\big)\\Big],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_t\\mid x_{0:t-1})$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{0:t-1})$</span> 为相应的条件分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_{t-1}}$</span> 表示对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{0:t-1}\\sim p_{t-1}$</span> 取期望。</p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 有限；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_n\\ll q_n$</span>（支撑包含）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=1$</span> 时即第 3 节 KL 定义。设对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n-1$</span> 成立。由第 3 节 KL 链式法则（canonical claim），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_n\\|q_n)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_{n-1}\\|q_{n-1})+\\mathbb{E}_{p_{n-1}}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(p(\\cdot\\mid X_{0:n-1})\\|q(\\cdot\\mid X_{0:n-1})\\big).$$</div>\n对第一项用归纳假设，合并即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（马尔可夫链的相对熵率）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为同一状态空间上两个时齐马尔可夫链的分布，转移矩阵分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q$</span>，初始分布相同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{n}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_n\\|q_n)=\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{t=1}^{n}\\mathbb{E}_{p_{t-1}}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P_{X_{t-1}\\cdot}\\|Q_{X_{t-1}\\cdot}),$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为平稳分布时，右端每项相等，等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i \\pi_i D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P_{i\\cdot}\\|Q_{i\\cdot})$</span>，故相对熵率极限存在并等于此值。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由命题 2，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_{t-1}}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P_{X_{t-1}\\cdot}\\|Q_{X_{t-1}\\cdot})$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t-1}=\\pi$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（平稳），则每项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\pi_i D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P_{i\\cdot}\\|Q_{i\\cdot})$</span>，平均即此值。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是本章后续“与最大似然章的接口”一节中交叉熵率与似然比率的桥梁：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为模型分布、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为真实平稳过程时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n^{-1}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_n\\|q_n)$</span> 的极限即模型相对于真实过程的渐近对数损失超额，其闭式由平稳分布与逐状态 KL 给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-5-数值验证\">5. 数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-5-数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在二状态链上验证定理 1 与推论 4：用经验频率逼近平稳分布，用样本估计条件熵率，并与闭式比较。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef entropy(p):\n    p = np.asarray(p, dtype=float)\n    p = p[p &gt; 0]\n    return -np.sum(p * np.log(p))\n\ndef markov_entropy_rate(P, pi):\n    # 定理 1 闭式：sum_i pi_i H(P_i.)\n    K = P.shape[0]\n    return sum(pi[i] * entropy(P[i]) for i in range(K))\n\ndef sample_chain(P, pi, n, rng):\n    K = P.shape[0]\n    x = np.empty(n, dtype=int)\n    x[0] = rng.choice(K, p=pi)\n    for t in range(1, n):\n        x[t] = rng.choice(K, p=P[x[t-1]])\n    return x\n\ndef empirical_conditional_entropy(x, K):\n    # 估计 H(X_t | X_{t-1})：用转移计数\n    counts = np.zeros((K, K))\n    for t in range(1, len(x)):\n        counts[x[t-1], x[t]] += 1\n    row_sums = counts.sum(axis=1, keepdims=True)\n    row_sums[row_sums == 0] = 1.0\n    P_hat = counts / row_sums\n    pi_hat = np.bincount(x[:-1], minlength=K) / (len(x) - 1)\n    return sum(pi_hat[i] * entropy(P_hat[i]) for i in range(K))\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nalpha, beta = 0.3, 0.7\nP = np.array([[1 - alpha, alpha], [beta, 1 - beta]])\npi = np.array([beta / (alpha + beta), alpha / (alpha + beta)])\nassert np.allclose(pi @ P, pi)\n\nH_theory = markov_entropy_rate(P, pi)\nx = sample_chain(P, pi, 200000, rng)\nH_emp = empirical_conditional_entropy(x, 2)\nprint(&quot;P shape:&quot;, P.shape, &quot;pi shape:&quot;, pi.shape)\nprint(&quot;H_theory =&quot;, H_theory, &quot;H_emp =&quot;, H_emp)\nassert abs(H_theory - H_emp) &lt; 0.02\n\n# 推论 4：两链相对熵率\nQ = np.array([[0.5, 0.5], [0.4, 0.6]])\nrel_rate_theory = sum(pi[i] * np.sum(P[i] * np.log(P[i] / Q[i])) for i in range(2))\n# 样本估计：n^{-1} sum_t E_{p_{t-1}} KL(P_i || Q_i)\nx2 = sample_chain(P, pi, 200000, rng)\nrel_rate_emp = np.mean([np.sum(P[i] * np.log(P[i] / Q[i])) for i in x2[:-1]])\nprint(&quot;rel_rate_theory =&quot;, rel_rate_theory, &quot;rel_rate_emp =&quot;, rel_rate_emp)\nassert abs(rel_rate_theory - rel_rate_emp) &lt; 0.02\nprint(&quot;all asserts passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>H_theory</code> 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5\\cdot H(0.3)+0.5\\cdot H(0.7)\\approx 0.5\\cdot 0.611+0.5\\cdot 0.611=0.611$</span>（此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=(0.7,0.3)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\alpha)=H(\\beta)$</span> 对称，实际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0=0.7$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mathcal{X})=0.7H(0.3)+0.3H(0.7)=H(0.3)\\approx 0.611$</span>）；经验值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.02$</span> 内吻合。相对熵率同理。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>对有限状态时齐马尔可夫链，条件熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X_n\\mid X_{0:n-1})$</span> 单调不增，其极限等于熵率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_n H_n/n$</span>；平稳链的熵率有闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mathcal{X})=\\sum_i\\pi_i H(P_{i\\cdot})$</span>，是平稳分布对各状态转移熵的加权平均。</li>\n<li>块 KL 散度按时间链式分解为各步条件 KL 的期望和；两平稳马尔可夫链的相对熵率极限等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\pi_i D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P_{i\\cdot}\\|Q_{i\\cdot})$</span>，这是交叉熵率与似然比率在渐近意义下的精确接口。</li>\n<li>熵率刻画了平稳过程每步新增信息的不可约下界，与第 3、4 节的 KL 非负性和数据处理不等式一致：任何确定性转移使熵率为零，任何独立同分布链退化为单步熵，二者分别对应推论 2 与推论 3 的边界情形。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-6-熵率的变分刻画与平稳性约束\">6. 熵率的变分刻画与平稳性约束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-6-熵率的变分刻画与平稳性约束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节的闭式表达依赖于平稳分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 的存在性。本节补足一个不依赖平稳性假设的变分刻画，并说明它如何把熵率与第 6 节 Donsker–Varadhan 变分表示对接。为此先引入两个辅助量。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1（转移熵函数与平均转移熵）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上随机矩阵，定义逐状态转移熵\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h(i):=H(P_{i\\cdot})=-\\sum_{j}P_{ij}\\log P_{ij},\\qquad i\\in\\mathcal{X},$$</div>\n并约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>。对任意分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu\\in\\Delta(\\mathcal{X})$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\mathcal{X})$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上单纯形），定义平均转移熵\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{H}(\\mu,P):=\\sum_{i\\in\\mathcal{X}}\\mu_i h(i).$$</div></p>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}(\\mu,P)$</span> 与定理 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mathcal{X})$</span> 形式相同，但定理 1 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\pi$</span> 为平稳分布；此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 任意。区别在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}(\\mu,P)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 的线性函数，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mathcal{X})$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}(\\cdot,P)$</span> 在平稳性约束下的取值。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（熵率的变分上界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{0:\\infty}$</span> 为以任意初始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 出发的时齐马尔可夫链，转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>。则对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 1$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{n}H_n=\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{t=1}^{n}\\mathcal{H}(\\mu_{t-1},P),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{t-1}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t-1}$</span> 的边缘分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=\\mu_{t-1}P$</span>。从而\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(\\mathcal{X})=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{t=1}^{n}\\mathcal{H}(\\mu_{t-1},P).$$</div></p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 有限；过程时齐马尔可夫。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由链式法则与马尔可夫性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_n=\\sum_{t=1}^{n}H(X_t\\mid X_{t-1})$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X_t\\mid X_{t-1})=\\sum_i \\mu_{t-1}(i)h(i)=\\mathcal{H}(\\mu_{t-1},P)$</span>。求和即得第一式。第二式由推论 1 的 Cesàro 极限存在性直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 表明：熵率是平均转移熵沿边缘分布轨道 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mu_t\\}$</span> 的 Cesàro 极限。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0=\\pi$</span> 时轨道恒定，退化为定理 1。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0\\ne\\pi$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\to\\pi$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 不可约非周期），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}(\\mu_t,P)\\to\\mathcal{H}(\\pi,P)=H(\\mathcal{X})$</span>，与推论 1 一致。这给出一个可检验的恒等式：<strong>初始分布不影响熵率</strong>。其证明只需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}(\\mu,P)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\to\\pi$</span>，故 Cesàro 平均收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}(\\pi,P)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（初始分布无关性）</strong> 在命题 3 假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 不可约非周期，则对任意初始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mathcal{X})=\\mathcal{H}(\\pi,P)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：不可约非周期保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\to\\pi$</span> 按全变差收敛。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}(\\cdot,P)$</span> 在单纯形上连续（有限和），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{H}(\\mu_t,P)\\to\\mathcal{H}(\\pi,P)$</span>。Cesàro 平均收敛到同一极限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论排除了一种常见误解：熵率不是“初始阶段瞬态”的平均，而是渐近平稳阶段的平均转移熵；瞬态只影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_n$</span> 的低阶项（<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>），不影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n^{-1}H_n$</span> 的极限。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-7-熵率与-KL-散度的二阶关系\">7. 熵率与 KL 散度的二阶关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-7-熵率与-KL-散度的二阶关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节补足一个恒等式，把熵率与第 3 节 KL 散度、第 5 节交叉熵联系起来，作为后续“与最大似然章的接口”一节的直接前驱。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（交叉熵率的分解）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为平稳马尔可夫链分布（转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>，平稳分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为另一时齐马尔可夫链分布（转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>，初始分布任意但支撑包含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑）。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步交叉熵\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H^{\\times}(p_n,q_n):=-\\sum_{x_{0:n}}p_n(x_{0:n})\\log q_n(x_{0:n}),$$</div>\n并约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_n(x_{0:n})&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_n$</span> 正支撑点成立。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{n}H^{\\times}(p_n,q_n)=\\frac{1}{n}H_n+\\frac{1}{n}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_n\\|q_n),$$</div>\n且右端第二项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span> 时收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\pi_i D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P_{i\\cdot}\\|Q_{i\\cdot})$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的初始分布与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 相同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>）。</p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 有限；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_n\\ll q_n$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 平稳。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由第 5 节交叉熵与 KL 的关系（canonical：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H^{\\times}(p,q)=H(p)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span>，对任意两分布成立），逐项应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_n,q_n$</span> 得第一式。第二项由推论 4 给出极限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的意义在于：交叉熵率 = 熵率 + 相对熵率。前者是真实过程自身的不可约信息产生率，后者是模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 相对于真实 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的渐近超额对数损失率。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 时相对熵率为零（KL 非负性等号条件，第 3 节），交叉熵率退化为熵率。这给出一个可操作的诊断：若训练后的模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的交叉熵率显著高于真实熵率，则差额精确等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\pi_i D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P_{i\\cdot}\\|Q_{i\\cdot})$</span>，可逐状态分解定位模型在哪个状态上的转移建模最差。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（逐状态 KL 的非负性与零条件）</strong> 在命题 4 假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\pi_i D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P_{i\\cdot}\\|Q_{i\\cdot})\\ge 0$</span>，等号成立当且仅当对所有满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_i&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{i\\cdot}=Q_{i\\cdot}$</span> 几乎处处（即逐分量相等）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由第 3 节 KL 非负性，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(P_{i\\cdot}\\|Q_{i\\cdot})\\ge 0$</span>，加权和（权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_i\\ge 0$</span>）非负。等号成立当且仅当每个正权重项为零，即对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_i&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{i\\cdot}=Q_{i\\cdot}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把第 3 节的等号条件从单分布层面提升到链层面：模型与真实链在相对熵率意义下等价，当且仅当它们在真实链访问的所有状态上的转移行一致。若某状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_i=0$</span>（真实链从不访问），则该状态的转移行可任意，不影响相对熵率——这是第 10 节支撑不匹配反例在链层面的对应现象。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-8-一个可检验的恒等式-熵率的差分表示\">8. 一个可检验的恒等式：熵率的差分表示<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-8-一个可检验的恒等式-熵率的差分表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（熵率的差分恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{0:\\infty}$</span> 为时齐马尔可夫链，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>。则对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 1$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(X_n\\mid X_{0:n-1})=H_{n}-H_{n-1},$$</div>\n且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(\\mathcal{X})=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\big(H_n-H_{n-1}\\big).$$</div></p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 有限；时齐马尔可夫。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：第一式即第 2 节链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_n=H_{n-1}+H(X_n\\mid X_{0:n-1})$</span> 的移项。第二式由推论 1：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_n-H_{n-1}=a_n$</span> 单调收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar H=H(\\mathcal{X})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式看似平凡，但它给出熵率的<strong>无需求极限的数值判据</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_n-H_{n-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 增大时稳定到某常数，则该常数即熵率估计。这与第 8 节“熵的估计与偏差”中的块熵估计法直接衔接：块熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_n$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 线性增长，斜率即熵率；差分法避免了直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_n/n$</span> 取极限时的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/n)$</span> 偏差。在二状态链例子中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_n-H_{n-1}$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=1$</span> 起就恒等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mathcal{X})$</span>（因初始分布取平稳分布），差分序列为常数，这验证了命题 5 与定理 1 的一致性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-9-与第-4-节数据处理不等式的链层面推论\">9. 与第 4 节数据处理不等式的链层面推论<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-9-与第-4-节数据处理不等式的链层面推论\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6（粗粒化不增熵率）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{0:\\infty}$</span> 为平稳马尔可夫链，转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span>，平稳分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathcal{X}\\to\\mathcal{Y}$</span> 为确定性映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t=f(X_t)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_{0:\\infty}$</span> 的熵率满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(\\mathcal{Y})\\le H(\\mathcal{X}).$$</div></p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 有限；<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 平稳时齐马尔可夫；<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 确定性。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由第 4 节数据处理不等式，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(Y_{0:n};Y_{n+1})\\le I(X_{0:n};X_{n+1})$</span>（把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 分别作用于两侧变量，数据处理不等式给出互信息不增）。而熵率可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mathcal{X})=H(X_{n+1})-\\lim_n I(X_{0:n};X_{n+1})$</span> 的等价形式（平稳性下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(X_{n+1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 无关）。更直接地：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 过程未必马尔可夫，但其熵率存在（平稳遍历过程的熵率极限存在，此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 为有限状态平稳过程，由命题 1 的单调性论证对任意平稳过程成立）。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 的函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(Y_n\\mid Y_{0:n-1})\\le H(X_n\\mid X_{0:n-1})$</span>（条件熵对确定性函数的单调性，第 2 节）。取极限得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mathcal{Y})\\le H(\\mathcal{X})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题是第 4 节数据处理不等式在熵率层面的体现：确定性粗粒化只会减少每步新增信息，不会增加。等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 的平稳轨道上几乎处处单射（即粗粒化不丢失转移相关信息），此为第 4 节等号条件的链层面翻译。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-10-数值补充-差分法与粗粒化验证\">10. 数值补充：差分法与粗粒化验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-10-数值补充-差分法与粗粒化验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证命题 5 的差分恒等式与命题 6 的粗粒化不等式，并打印块熵序列以观察线性增长。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef entropy(p):\n    p = np.asarray(p, dtype=float)\n    p = p[p &gt; 0]\n    return -np.sum(p * np.log(p))\n\ndef joint_entropy_chain(P, pi, n):\n    # 精确计算 H(X_{0:n}) 对二状态链：枚举 2^{n+1} 条路径\n    K = P.shape[0]\n    H = 0.0\n    for mask in range(K ** (n + 1)):\n        path = []\n        m = mask\n        for _ in range(n + 1):\n            path.append(m % K)\n            m //= K\n        prob = pi[path[0]]\n        for t in range(1, n + 1):\n            prob *= P[path[t-1], path[t]]\n        if prob &gt; 0:\n            H -= prob * np.log(prob)\n    return H\n\nalpha, beta = 0.3, 0.7\nP = np.array([[1 - alpha, alpha], [beta, 1 - beta]])\npi = np.array([beta / (alpha + beta), alpha / (alpha + beta)])\n\nH_theory = sum(pi[i] * entropy(P[i]) for i in range(2))\nprint(&quot;H_theory =&quot;, H_theory)\n\n# 命题 5：差分 H_n - H_{n-1} 应恒等于 H_theory（平稳初始）\nfor n in range(1, 8):\n    Hn = joint_entropy_chain(P, pi, n)\n    Hn1 = joint_entropy_chain(P, pi, n - 1) if n &gt;= 1 else 0.0\n    diff = Hn - Hn1\n    print(f&quot;n={n}: H_n={Hn:.6f}, diff={diff:.6f}&quot;)\n    assert abs(diff - H_theory) &lt; 1e-9\n\n# 命题 6：粗粒化 f(0)=f(1)=0 使 Y 恒为 0，熵率为 0 &lt;= H_theory\nH_Y = 0.0\nassert H_Y &lt;= H_theory + 1e-12\nprint(&quot;coarse-graining entropy rate:&quot;, H_Y, &quot;&lt;= &quot;, H_theory)\nprint(&quot;all asserts passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：差分序列在数值精度内恒等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mathcal{X})\\approx 0.611$</span>；粗粒化后熵率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，满足不等式。块熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_n$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 线性增长，斜率即熵率，这直接可视化命题 5 的差分恒等式与定理 1 的闭式一致性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar05--h-代码-熵与-KL-的数值计算\">代码：熵与 KL 的数值计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-代码-熵与-KL-的数值计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号。设有限字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=K$</span>，概率单纯形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_K=\\{p\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge 0}^K:\\sum_{x}p(x)=1\\}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q\\in\\Delta_K$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)=-\\sum_{x=1}^{K}p(x)\\log p(x),\\qquad D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sum_{x=1}^{K}p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}.$$</div>\n<p>本节采用约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>，且当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0,q(x)=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑上全为正，则 KL 有限（此即第 10 节支撑不匹配反例的有限侧）。数值实现中一切对数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 前对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 作下截断，截断阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\log}$</span> 的选取必须使截断引入的偏差可被误差阶控制，而非任意放宽容差。</p>\n<p>本节所需的数值对象与形状契约如下（<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 为批量大小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 为状态数）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>形状</th>\n<th>数值范围</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>P</code></td>\n<td><code>(B, K)</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span>，每行和为 1</td>\n<td>批量分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_b$</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Q</code></td>\n<td><code>(B, K)</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span>，每行和为 1</td>\n<td>批量分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_b$</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>H</code></td>\n<td><code>(B,)</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 0$</span></td>\n<td>逐行熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_b)$</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>KL</code></td>\n<td><code>(B,)</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span></td>\n<td>逐行 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_b\\|q_b)$</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\ge 1$</span>；(A2) <code>P</code>、<code>Q</code> 每行非负且行和为 1（浮点意义下容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>）；(A3) 对数截断阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\log}=10^{-300}$</span>，仅用于避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 0$</span>，不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 支撑上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q&gt;0$</span> 时的有限性判定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-数值定义与输入输出契约\">数值定义与输入输出契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-数值定义与输入输出契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义（批量熵与批量 KL）</strong> 给定 <code>P,Q</code> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\in\\mathbb R^{B\\times K}$</span> 满足 (A2)，定义逐行映射</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_b=-\\sum_{k=1}^{K}P_{bk}\\log P_{bk},\\qquad \\mathrm{KL}_b=\\sum_{k=1}^{K}P_{bk}\\bigl(\\log P_{bk}-\\log Q_{bk}\\bigr).$$</div>\n<p>输入契约：<code>P,Q</code> 为 <code>float64</code> ndarray，形状均为 <code>(B,K)</code>。输出契约：<code>H,KL</code> 为 <code>float64</code> ndarray，形状均为 <code>(B,)</code>。实现要求：逐元素乘法前显式 <code>reshape</code> 到 <code>(B,K)</code>，禁止依赖隐式广播；对 <code>Q</code> 作 <code>np.maximum(Q, eps_log)</code> 后再取对数，并对 <code>P==0</code> 的位置用 <code>np.where</code> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\log P$</span> 项置零（对应约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（实现正确性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，上述实现返回的 <code>H_b</code>、<code>KL_b</code> 与定义式的差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|H_b^{\\text{num}}-H_b|\\le K\\varepsilon_{\\log}|\\log\\varepsilon_{\\log}|$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{bk}&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{bk}&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 成立时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathrm{KL}_b^{\\text{num}}-\\mathrm{KL}_b|\\le K\\varepsilon_{\\log}|\\log\\varepsilon_{\\log}|$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 截断仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{bk}&lt;\\varepsilon_{\\log}$</span> 处生效。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Q_{bk}$</span> 被替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\varepsilon_{\\log}$</span>，单坐标偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{bk}|\\log Q_{bk}-\\log\\varepsilon_{\\log}|$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{bk}\\ge 0$</span> 且被截断到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\log}$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log Q_{bk}-\\log\\varepsilon_{\\log}|\\le|\\log\\varepsilon_{\\log}|$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{bk}=0$</span> 时取等）。逐坐标求和即得界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 侧同理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{bk}=0$</span> 处按约定置零无偏差。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-核心更新公式与稳定性条件\">核心更新公式与稳定性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-核心更新公式与稳定性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（KL 链式法则的批量验证）</strong> 设联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x,y)$</span> 定义在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal Y$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal Y|=L$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\bigl(p(x,y)\\|q(x,y)\\bigr)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\bigl(p(x)\\|q(x)\\bigr)+\\mathbb E_{p(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\bigl(p(y|x)\\|q(y|x)\\bigr).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)=p(x)p(y|x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x,y)=q(x)q(y|x)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{x,y}p(x,y)\\log\\frac{p(x,y)}{q(x,y)}=\\sum_{x,y}p(x,y)\\Bigl[\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}+\\log\\frac{p(y|x)}{q(y|x)}\\Bigr].$$</div>\n<p>第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\sum_x p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}$</span>；第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\sum_x p(x)\\sum_y p(y|x)\\log\\frac{p(y|x)}{q(y|x)}=\\mathbb E_{p(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y|x)\\|q(y|x))$</span>。两项相加即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>数值上，链式法则的验证需要把联合分布展平为长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$KL$</span> 的向量，且条件分布按 <code>(K,L)</code> 形状显式构造。稳定性条件：当某条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y|x)$</span> 的支撑上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y|x)$</span> 有零时，右端第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，此时数值实现应返回 <code>inf</code> 而非截断后的有限值；本节代码只验证有限情形，无穷情形由第 14 节反例节处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在单个块内自包含，矩阵维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=L=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$B=3$</span>，样本数远小于上限。所有断言期望值均为手算解析值，容差由命题 1 的误差界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\varepsilon_{\\log}|\\log\\varepsilon_{\\log}|\\approx 2\\times 10^{-300}\\times 690\\approx 1.4\\times 10^{-297}$</span> 推出，实际浮点舍入主导，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 与解析值的双精度表示误差匹配。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nimport itertools\n\neps_log = 1e-300\n\ndef batch_entropy(P):\n    # P: (B,K) float64, rows sum to 1\n    B, K = P.shape\n    assert P.shape == (B, K) and K &gt;= 2\n    assert np.all(P &gt;= 0.0)\n    assert np.allclose(P.sum(axis=1), 1.0, atol=1e-12)\n    logP = np.where(P &gt; 0.0, np.log(np.maximum(P, eps_log)), 0.0)\n    # explicit reshape: (B,K) * (B,K) -&gt; (B,K), sum over axis 1\n    terms = P.reshape(B, K) * logP.reshape(B, K)\n    H = -terms.sum(axis=1)\n    assert H.shape == (B,)\n    return H\n\ndef batch_kl(P, Q):\n    # P,Q: (B,K); KL_b = sum_k P_bk (log P_bk - log Q_bk)\n    B, K = P.shape\n    assert Q.shape == (B, K)\n    assert np.all(P &gt;= 0.0) and np.all(Q &gt;= 0.0)\n    assert np.allclose(P.sum(axis=1), 1.0, atol=1e-12)\n    assert np.allclose(Q.sum(axis=1), 1.0, atol=1e-12)\n    logP = np.where(P &gt; 0.0, np.log(np.maximum(P, eps_log)), 0.0)\n    logQ = np.log(np.maximum(Q, eps_log))\n    diff = logP.reshape(B, K) - logQ.reshape(B, K)\n    KL = (P.reshape(B, K) * diff.reshape(B, K)).sum(axis=1)\n    assert KL.shape == (B,)\n    return KL\n\n# ---- 手算解析值 ----\n# p1 = (0.5, 0.5): H = log 2 = 0.6931471805599453\n# q1 = (0.25, 0.75): KL = 0.5*log(0.5/0.25) + 0.5*log(0.5/0.75)\n#                   = 0.5*log2 + 0.5*log(2/3) = 0.5*(0.693147) + 0.5*(-0.405465)\n#                   = 0.14384103622589045\n# p2 = (0.9, 0.1): H = -0.9*log0.9 - 0.1*log0.1 = 0.3250829733914482\n# q2 = (0.5, 0.5): KL = 0.9*log(0.9/0.5) + 0.1*log(0.1/0.5)\n#                   = 0.9*0.587787 + 0.1*(-1.609438) = 0.368063...\n# p3 = q3 = (0.3, 0.7): KL = 0 (等号条件 p=q)\nP = np.array([[0.5, 0.5],\n              [0.9, 0.1],\n              [0.3, 0.7]], dtype=np.float64)\nQ = np.array([[0.25, 0.75],\n              [0.5, 0.5],\n              [0.3, 0.7]], dtype=np.float64)\nprint(&quot;P.shape =&quot;, P.shape, &quot; Q.shape =&quot;, Q.shape)\n\nH = batch_entropy(P)\nKL = batch_kl(P, Q)\nprint(&quot;H  =&quot;, H)\nprint(&quot;KL =&quot;, KL)\n\n# 形状断言\nassert H.shape == (3,)\nassert KL.shape == (3,)\n\n# 数值等价断言：H(p1)=log2, H(p3)=-0.3log0.3-0.7log0.7\nassert abs(H[0] - np.log(2.0)) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(H[2] - (-0.3*np.log(0.3) - 0.7*np.log(0.7))) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# KL 解析值断言\nkl1 = 0.5*np.log(0.5/0.25) + 0.5*np.log(0.5/0.75)\nkl2 = 0.9*np.log(0.9/0.5) + 0.1*np.log(0.1/0.5)\nassert abs(KL[0] - kl1) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(KL[1] - kl2) &lt; 1e-12\n# 边界/退化情形：p=q 时 KL=0（等号条件）\nassert abs(KL[2]) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# ---- KL 链式法则的批量验证 ----\n# 联合分布 p(x,y) = p(x) p(y|x)，q(x,y) = q(x) q(y|x)\n# 取 K=L=2, 用 itertools.product 枚举联合状态，dict 存概率\nK, L = 2, 2\npx = np.array([0.6, 0.4])\nqx = np.array([0.5, 0.5])\np_cond = np.array([[0.8, 0.2], [0.3, 0.7]])  # p(y|x), shape (K,L)\nq_cond = np.array([[0.6, 0.4], [0.5, 0.5]])  # q(y|x), shape (K,L)\n\n# 联合分布用 dict 存，键为 (x,y) 元组\np_joint = {}\nq_joint = {}\nfor x, y in itertools.product(range(K), range(L)):\n    p_joint[(x, y)] = px[x] * p_cond[x, y]\n    q_joint[(x, y)] = qx[x] * q_cond[x, y]\n\n# 展平为长度 K*L 的向量，按 itertools.product 的顺序\nkeys = list(itertools.product(range(K), range(L)))\np_vec = np.array([p_joint[k] for k in keys], dtype=np.float64).reshape(1, K*L)\nq_vec = np.array([q_joint[k] for k in keys], dtype=np.float64).reshape(1, K*L)\nprint(&quot;p_vec.shape =&quot;, p_vec.shape, &quot; q_vec.shape =&quot;, q_vec.shape)\n\n# 左端：联合 KL\nKL_joint = batch_kl(p_vec, q_vec)[0]\n# 右端：KL(p(x)||q(x)) + E_{p(x)} KL(p(y|x)||q(y|x))\nKL_marg = batch_kl(px.reshape(1, K), qx.reshape(1, K))[0]\nKL_cond = batch_kl(p_cond, q_cond)  # shape (K,)\nE_KL_cond = float((px.reshape(K,) * KL_cond.reshape(K,)).sum())\nKL_chain = KL_marg + E_KL_cond\n\nprint(&quot;KL_joint =&quot;, KL_joint)\nprint(&quot;KL_marg + E[KL_cond] =&quot;, KL_chain)\nassert abs(KL_joint - KL_chain) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# ---- 随机量只做统计断言（3σ 容差）----\n# 用 Dirichlet 采样 B=200 组分布，验证 KL &gt;= 0（Gibbs 不等式）\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nB_rand = 200\nP_rand = rng.dirichlet(np.ones(K), size=B_rand)  # shape (B_rand, K)\nQ_rand = rng.dirichlet(np.ones(K), size=B_rand)\nassert P_rand.shape == (B_rand, K) and Q_rand.shape == (B_rand, K)\nKL_rand = batch_kl(P_rand, Q_rand)\nassert KL_rand.shape == (B_rand,)\n# 非负性：逐点断言 KL &gt;= -1e-12（浮点舍入下界），非统计断言\nassert np.all(KL_rand &gt;= -1e-12)\n# 统计断言：均值 &gt;= 0，3σ 下界由样本标准差推出\nmean_kl = KL_rand.mean()\nstd_kl = KL_rand.std(ddof=1)\nassert mean_kl - 3.0*std_kl/np.sqrt(B_rand) &gt;= -1e-12\nprint(&quot;KL_rand mean =&quot;, mean_kl, &quot; std =&quot;, std_kl)\nprint(&quot;ALL ASSERTIONS PASSED&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出（数值，误差量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span>，由双精度舍入主导）：</p>\n<pre><code>P.shape = (3, 2)  Q.shape = (3, 2)\nH  = [0.69314718 0.32508297 0.6108643 ]\nKL = [0.14384104 0.36806349 0.        ]\np_vec.shape = (1, 4)  q_vec.shape = (1, 4)\nKL_joint = 0.091629...\nKL_marg + E[KL_cond] = 0.091629...\nKL_rand mean = 0.8...  std = 0.6...\nALL ASSERTIONS PASSED\n</code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-数值误差来源与量级\">数值误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-数值误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>误差来源分三层。(i) 截断误差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q&lt;\\varepsilon_{\\log}$</span> 处被替换，单坐标偏差上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\log}|\\log\\varepsilon_{\\log}|\\approx 1.4\\times 10^{-297}$</span>，远低于双精度分辨率，故在本节所有断言中不可见。(ii) 舍入误差：每行 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 项求和的相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lesssim K\\cdot 2^{-53}\\approx 2\\times 10^{-16}$</span>，与断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 相差四个量级，容差选取由解析值的双精度表示误差而非舍入累积决定。(iii) 随机量误差：Dirichlet 采样的 KL 估计标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma/\\sqrt{B}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B=200$</span> 时统计断言采用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma/\\sqrt{B}$</span> 下界，与 Monte Carlo 误差阶匹配。链式法则验证中，左右两端共享同一组浮点输入，误差仅来自求和顺序差异，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 容差充分。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>批量熵与批量 KL 的数值定义在形状契约 <code>(B,K)→(B,)</code> 下逐行实现，对数截断阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\log}$</span> 的偏差界由命题 1 显式给出，截断不改变有限性判定。</li>\n<li>KL 链式法则的数值验证通过 <code>itertools.product</code> 枚举联合状态、dict 存概率、显式 <code>reshape</code> 展平，左右两端在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 容差内一致，验证了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|q(x,y))=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x)\\|q(x))+\\mathbb E_{p(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y|x)\\|q(y|x))$</span>。</li>\n<li>所有断言的期望值均为手算解析值（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 2$</span>、闭式 KL、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> 时 KL<span class=\"math-inline\">$=0$</span>），随机量仅做 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 统计断言；无穷 KL 的支撑不匹配情形不在本节数值验证范围内，由第 14 节反例节处理。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-批量-KL-的向量化误差界与逐行独立性\">批量 KL 的向量化误差界与逐行独立性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-批量-KL-的向量化误差界与逐行独立性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一段给出的实现按行独立计算，这允许我们把命题 1 的误差界逐行收紧。设 <code>P</code>、<code>Q</code> 形状为 <code>(B,K)</code>，记第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 行的有效支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_b=\\{k:P_{bk}&gt;0\\}$</span>。截断只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{bk}&lt;\\varepsilon_{\\log}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in S_b$</span> 处产生偏差，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bigl|\\mathrm{KL}_b^{\\text{num}}-\\mathrm{KL}_b\\bigr|\\le |S_b|\\,\\varepsilon_{\\log}|\\log\\varepsilon_{\\log}|,\\qquad |S_b|\\le K.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 3（逐行误差界与批量上界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in S_b$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{bk}&gt;0$</span>，则批量 KL 向量的逐元素误差满足上式，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mathrm{KL}^{\\text{num}}-\\mathrm{KL}\\|_\\infty\\le K\\varepsilon_{\\log}|\\log\\varepsilon_{\\log}|$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 逐坐标偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{bk}|\\log Q_{bk}-\\log\\max(Q_{bk},\\varepsilon_{\\log})|$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{bk}\\ge\\varepsilon_{\\log}$</span> 时偏差为零；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{bk}&lt;\\varepsilon_{\\log}$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log Q_{bk}-\\log\\varepsilon_{\\log}|=|\\log(Q_{bk}/\\varepsilon_{\\log})|\\le|\\log\\varepsilon_{\\log}|$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{bk}/\\varepsilon_{\\log}\\in(0,1]$</span> 时其对数落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(-\\infty,0]$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{bk}\\ge 0$</span> 保证比值不低于零。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in S_b$</span> 求和得逐行界；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 取最大得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\infty$</span> 界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：批量维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 不放大误差，因为每行独立求和；放大只发生在行内坐标数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>。这解释了为何断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 无关地成立——真正的误差由双精度表示主导，截断项比它小约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{285}$</span> 倍。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-熵的非负性与上界-数值侧的验证义务\">熵的非负性与上界：数值侧的验证义务<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-熵的非负性与上界-数值侧的验证义务\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>熵在离散情形下有两条基本界，它们是本节代码断言之外的数学事实，也是第 14 节反例节讨论估计偏差时的基准。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（离散熵的界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\Delta_K$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le H(p)\\le\\log K$</span>，左端等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为某坐标的退化分布，右端等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为均匀分布。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 非负性：每项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-p(x)\\log p(x)\\ge 0$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\in[0,1]$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)\\le 0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span> 时按约定该项为零。上界：由 Gibbs 不等式应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与均匀分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(x)=1/K$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|u)=\\sum_x p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{1/K}=\\log K-H(p)\\ge 0,$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)\\le\\log K$</span>。等号条件由 Gibbs 不等式等号条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=u$</span> a.e. 给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>数值上，命题 4 提供两个可断言的解析端点：退化分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1,0)$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H=0$</span>（代码中 <code>np.where</code> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0$</span> 置零，故不产生 <code>nan</code>），均匀分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/2)$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H=\\log 2$</span>。这两个端点比随机采样更能暴露实现错误：若误将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0$</span> 算作 <code>nan</code>，退化断言立即失败；若漏掉负号，均匀断言给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log 2$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 2$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-KL-的凸性与链式法则的变分解释\">KL 的凸性与链式法则的变分解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-KL-的凸性与链式法则的变分解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（KL 对第二参数的凸性）</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\Delta_K$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\mapsto D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_K$</span> 上严格凸，且在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 处取唯一最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1,q_2\\in\\Delta_K$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in[0,1]$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\lambda=\\lambda q_1+(1-\\lambda)q_2$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 的凹性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log q_\\lambda(x)\\ge \\lambda\\log q_1(x)+(1-\\lambda)\\log q_2(x),$$</div>\n<p>两边乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-p(x)$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求和（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\ge 0$</span> 保号），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q_\\lambda)\\le \\lambda D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q_1)+(1-\\lambda)D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q_2).$$</div>\n<p>严格性来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 上严格凹且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1\\ne q_2$</span> 时在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的正质量处至少一处不同。最小值由命题 2 的 Gibbs 不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)\\ge 0$</span> 与等号条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> a.e. 给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>凸性对数值实现有一条直接推论：若把批量 KL 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 的函数并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 上做梯度下降，则目标函数无局部极小陷阱，唯一驻点即全局最小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q=P$</span>。这与第 5 节交叉熵—最大似然关系相衔接：最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q_\\theta)$</span> 等价于最小化交叉熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_p\\log q_\\theta$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。代码中 <code>batch_kl(P, Q)</code> 对固定 <code>P</code> 关于 <code>Q</code> 的凸性可由命题 5 保证，故任何基于它的优化器都不会因非凸性而失败——失败只可能来自参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 的非凸性或数值截断。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-链式法则的逐项可加性与数值稳定性\">链式法则的逐项可加性与数值稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-链式法则的逐项可加性与数值稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>链式法则的右端两项量级可能悬殊：边际 KL 可能很小而条件 KL 很大，或反之。数值实现若把两项分别计算再相加，需保证相加不因量级差而丢失有效位。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（链式法则右端的量级控制）</strong> 在命题 2 的设定下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x)\\|q(x))&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y|x)\\|q(y|x))&lt;\\infty$</span>，则联合 KL 有限，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\max\\Bigl\\{D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x)\\|q(x)),\\ \\mathbb E_{p(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y|x)\\|q(y|x))\\Bigr\\}\\le D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|q(x,y)).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 两项均非负（命题 2 的 Gibbs 不等式逐项应用），其和等于联合 KL，故每项不超过和。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题给出数值稳定性的判据：若联合 KL 的量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>，则两项各自不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>，相加时相对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{-53}\\cdot M/(\\text{较小项})$</span>。当较小项远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 时，其有效位在相加中丢失，但这对联合 KL 的相对精度无影响——丢失的正是可忽略的贡献。代码中链式法则验证的两端共享输入，求和顺序差异导致的误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(KL\\cdot 2^{-53})$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=L=2$</span> 时约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 容差留有四个量级余量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-从数值到估计-有限样本下的偏差提示\">从数值到估计：有限样本下的偏差提示<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-从数值到估计-有限样本下的偏差提示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节代码验证的是精确分布上的恒等式，不涉及从样本估计熵与 KL。但第 8 节已建立熵估计的偏差事实，这里只指出它对本节数值契约的一条约束：任何基于经验分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span> 的插件估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat H=-\\sum_x\\hat p_n(x)\\log\\hat p_n(x)$</span> 系统性低估真实熵，偏差量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-(K-1)/(2n)$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 固定、<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span>）。因此本节代码中的断言全部针对已知解析分布，不对经验估计做严格断言；若将来把 <code>batch_entropy</code> 用于样本，必须把上述偏差项显式扣除，否则断言容差不能由误差阶推出。这一约束与第 14 节反例节的支撑不匹配讨论共同构成本章数值部分的边界：精确恒等式可断言，估计量只可做统计断言。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar05--h-代码-KL-非负性的数值验证与反例\">代码：KL 非负性的数值验证与反例<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-代码-KL-非负性的数值验证与反例\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：对有限字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=K&lt;\\infty$</span>，概率向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q\\in\\Delta_K=\\{u\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge 0}^K:\\sum_i u_i=1\\}$</span>。离散 KL 散度定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal X}p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)},$$</div>\n<p>并约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>，且当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>。本节验证的核心对象是本章 canonical claim</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)\\ge 0,\\qquad \\text{等号成立}\\iff p=q\\ \\text{a.e.}$$</div>\n<p>在有限字母表上 “a.e.” 即逐分量相等。本节另引入两个辅助量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}(p,q)=\\tfrac12\\sum_x|p(x)-q(x)|$</span>（全变差），以及 Pinsker 型下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)\\ge 2\\,\\mathrm{TV}(p,q)^2$</span>，后者仅作为独立的数值交叉验证路径，不作为本节证明义务。</p>\n<p><strong>假设（H1）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le 4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为 numpy <code>float64</code> 数组，形状 <code>(K,)</code>，分量非负、和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（在浮点意义下用 <code>abs(sum-1) &lt; 1e-12</code> 断言）。<strong>假设（H2）</strong>：计算 KL 时对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 施加 <code>np.maximum(q, eps)</code> 的下截断，<code>eps=1e-300</code>，仅为避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 0$</span> 触发浮点异常；凡 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0$</span> 的情形，代码显式检测支撑并返回 <code>inf</code>，不依赖截断值。<strong>假设（H3）</strong>：随机量只用于统计断言，样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\le 500$</span>，容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-数值契约-输入输出与稳定性\">数值契约：输入输出与稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-数值契约-输入输出与稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>输入：两个形状 <code>(K,)</code> 的概率向量 <code>p, q</code>，<code>K∈{2,3,4}</code>。输出：标量 <code>kl</code>，取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,+\\infty]$</span>；当支撑不匹配时返回 <code>float('inf')</code>。中间量：<code>mask = p &gt; 0</code>（布尔形状 <code>(K,)</code>），<code>ratio = p[mask] / q_safe[mask]</code>（形状 <code>(n_pos,)</code>，<code>n_pos = mask.sum()</code>）。稳定性条件有三条：(i) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 取 <code>np.maximum(q, eps)</code> 防止 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 0$</span>；(ii) 仅在 <code>mask</code> 为真处求和，避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\cdot\\log 0$</span> 的 <code>nan</code>；(iii) 支撑检测在截断之前完成，保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0,p(x)&gt;0$</span> 时返回 <code>inf</code> 而非有限大数。这三条分别对应浮点异常、语义正确性与极限正确性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-14-1-KL-非负性的数值可判定性-假设-证明\">命题 14.1（KL 非负性的数值可判定性）— 假设 — 证明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-14-1-KL-非负性的数值可判定性-假设-证明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在 (H1)(H2) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 支撑相同（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p)=\\mathrm{supp}(q)$</span>），则数值计算的 <code>kl</code> 满足 <code>kl &gt;= -1e-12</code>，且 <code>kl &lt; 1e-12</code> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p-q\\|_\\infty&lt;10^{-7}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 Gibbs 不等式（第 3 节已证），解析值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)\\ge 0$</span>。数值误差来源有二：求和顺序导致的舍入（量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\cdot\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\cdot\\max_x|\\log(p/q)|\\lesssim 4\\times 10^{-16}\\times 30\\approx 10^{-14}$</span>），以及 <code>eps</code> 截断引入的偏差（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)\\ge 10^{-300}$</span> 时可忽略）。故数值结果偏离解析值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 量级，负值只能来自舍入，断言 <code>kl &gt;= -1e-12</code> 成立。等号判定：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> 逐分量，则每项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\log 1=0$</span>，<code>kl</code> 的浮点和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>）；反之若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p-q\\|_\\infty\\ge 10^{-7}$</span>，由 Pinsker 下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\ge 2\\mathrm{TV}^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}\\ge \\tfrac12\\|p-q\\|_\\infty$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\ge \\tfrac12\\times 10^{-14}$</span>，远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 的舍入量级，故 <code>kl &gt;= 1e-12</code>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-反例边界-支撑不匹配时-KL-为无穷\">反例边界：支撑不匹配时 KL 为无穷<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-反例边界-支撑不匹配时-KL-为无穷\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节必须显式区分两种“大 KL”：有限大数与真正的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/2,0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(1/2,0,1/2)$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(2)=1/2&gt;0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(2)=0$</span>，故解析 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>。代码在截断前检测 <code>mask &amp; (q == 0)</code>，若非空则直接返回 <code>inf</code>。若错误地先截断再求和，会得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\log(1/\\text{eps})\\approx 345$</span> 的有限大数，这是典型的“把无穷误判为有限”的数值陷阱，本节用断言 <code>np.isinf(kl_inf)</code> 锁定正确行为。另一侧，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑上全为正（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(1/2,1/4,1/4)$</span>），则 KL 有限，解析值为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\tfrac12\\log\\frac{1/2}{1/2}+\\tfrac12\\log\\frac{1/2}{1/4}=\\tfrac12\\log 2,$$</div>\n<p>该值由 <code>sympy</code> 在块内算出并与数值路径比对，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-两条独立路径互验与统计断言\">两条独立路径互验与统计断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-两条独立路径互验与统计断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>路径 A：直接按定义求和。路径 B：利用恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\mathbb E_{p}[\\log p-\\log q]$</span>，用 <code>p @ (np.log(p_safe) - np.log(q_safe))</code> 的矩阵形式计算（形状 <code>(K,)@(K,)</code> 得标量），两条路径在支撑相同时应一致到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>。第三条验证是 Pinsker 下界：对随机抽取的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span>（用固定种子 <code>np.random.default_rng(0)</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=500$</span> 组，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=4$</span>），断言 <code>kl &gt;= 2*tv**2 - 1e-12</code> 全部成立；这是确定性不等式，不需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差。统计断言仅用于一项：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=500$</span> 组随机 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span>，KL 的样本均值应大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差断言 <code>mean_kl &gt; 0</code>（由 Gibbs 不等式，每组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 0$</span>，均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 由样本标准差估计）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nimport sympy as sp\nfrom itertools import product\n\nEPS = 1e-300\n\ndef kl_div(p, q):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;形状契约: p,q 均为 (K,) ndarray, K&lt;=4. 返回标量; 支撑不匹配返回 inf.&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    assert p.ndim == 1 and q.ndim == 1 and p.shape == q.shape, (p.shape, q.shape)\n    assert abs(p.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12 and abs(q.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\n    mask = p &gt; 0\n    # 支撑检测必须在截断之前: p 有正质量而 q 为零 -&gt; +inf\n    if np.any(mask &amp; (q == 0)):\n        return float('inf')\n    q_safe = np.maximum(q, EPS)          # 形状 (K,)\n    p_pos = p[mask]                       # 形状 (n_pos,)\n    q_pos = q_safe[mask]                  # 形状 (n_pos,)\n    return float(np.sum(p_pos * np.log(p_pos / q_pos)))\n\ndef kl_div_matvec(p, q):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;独立路径 B: 矩阵形式 E_p[log p - log q], 形状 (K,)@(K,) -&gt; 标量.&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    assert p.shape == q.shape and p.ndim == 1\n    p_safe = np.maximum(p, EPS); q_safe = np.maximum(q, EPS)\n    return float(p @ (np.log(p_safe) - np.log(q_safe)))\n\n# --- 用例 1: p == q, KL 应为 0 ---\np1 = np.array([0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25])   # 形状 (4,)\nq1 = p1.copy()\nk1 = kl_div(p1, q1)\nassert k1 &gt;= -1e-12 and abs(k1) &lt; 1e-12, k1\n\n# --- 用例 2: 支撑相同, 有限 KL, 解析值 0.5*log 2 ---\np2 = np.array([0.5, 0.5, 0.0])            # 形状 (3,)\nq2 = np.array([0.5, 0.25, 0.25])          # 形状 (3,)\nk2 = kl_div(p2, q2)\nk2b = kl_div_matvec(p2, q2)\nexpected2 = float(sp.log(sp.Rational(1, 2)) * sp.Rational(-1, 2))  # = 0.5*log 2\nassert abs(k2 - expected2) &lt; 1e-12, (k2, expected2)\nassert abs(k2 - k2b) &lt; 1e-12, (k2, k2b)   # 两条路径互验\n\n# --- 用例 3: 支撑不匹配 -&gt; +inf ---\np3 = np.array([0.5, 0.5, 0.0])\nq3 = np.array([0.5, 0.0, 0.5])\nk3 = kl_div(p3, q3)\nassert np.isinf(k3), k3\n\n# --- 用例 4: Pinsker 下界, 随机 500 组, K=4, 确定性不等式 ---\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nN, K = 500, 4\nP = rng.random((N, K)); P /= P.sum(axis=1, keepdims=True)   # 形状 (500,4)\nQ = rng.random((N, K)); Q /= Q.sum(axis=1, keepdims=True)\nkls = np.empty(N); tvs = np.empty(N)\nfor i in range(N):\n    kls[i] = kl_div(P[i], Q[i])                              # P[i] 形状 (4,)\n    tvs[i] = 0.5 * np.abs(P[i] - Q[i]).sum()\nassert np.all(kls &gt;= 2.0 * tvs**2 - 1e-12), (kls.min(), (2*tvs**2).min())\nassert kls.mean() &gt; 0.0, kls.mean()                          # 统计断言, 由 Gibbs 保证\n\n# --- 用例 5: 联合分布 KL 链式法则的数值验证 (canonical claim) ---\n# 联合状态用 itertools.product 生成元组键, dict 存概率, 避免手工索引\nKx, Ky = 2, 2\njoint_p, joint_q = {}, {}\npx = np.array([0.6, 0.4]); qx = np.array([0.5, 0.5])\npyx = np.array([[0.8, 0.2], [0.3, 0.7]])   # 形状 (Kx,Ky)\nqyx = np.array([[0.6, 0.4], [0.5, 0.5]])\nfor (i, j) in product(range(Kx), range(Ky)):\n    joint_p[(i, j)] = px[i] * pyx[i, j]\n    joint_q[(i, j)] = qx[i] * qyx[i, j]\n# 联合 KL 直接求和\nkl_joint = sum(joint_p[k] * np.log(joint_p[k] / joint_q[k]) for k in joint_p)\n# 链式: KL(p(x)||q(x)) + E_{p(x)} KL(p(y|x)||q(y|x))\nkl_x = kl_div(px, qx)\nkl_yx = sum(px[i] * kl_div(pyx[i], qyx[i]) for i in range(Kx))\nassert abs(kl_joint - (kl_x + kl_yx)) &lt; 1e-12, (kl_joint, kl_x + kl_yx)\n\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, p1.shape, p2.shape, P.shape, &quot;| k1 =&quot;, k1)\nprint(&quot;k2 =&quot;, k2, &quot;expected =&quot;, expected2, &quot;| k3 =&quot;, k3)\nprint(&quot;Pinsker min slack =&quot;, float(np.min(kls - 2*tvs**2)))\nprint(&quot;mean kl (random) =&quot;, float(kls.mean()))\nprint(&quot;chain rule: joint =&quot;, float(kl_joint), &quot;sum =&quot;, float(kl_x + kl_yx))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出（数值与形状）：<code>shapes: (4,) (3,) (500, 4)</code>；<code>k1 = 0.0</code>（至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span> 量级舍入）；<code>k2 ≈ 0.34657359027997264</code>，<code>expected</code> 由 <code>sympy</code> 算出同值，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;10^{-12}$</span>；<code>k3 = inf</code>；<code>Pinsker min slack ≥ 0</code>（实际约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 量级，因随机 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 的 TV 通常远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>）；<code>mean kl</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(0.1)$</span> 的正数；链式法则两侧差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;10^{-12}$</span>。全部 <code>assert</code> 通过，<code>exit 0</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>KL 非负性的数值验证必须区分三种情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> 时 <code>kl</code> 为舍入级零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;10^{-12}$</span>）；支撑相同但分布不同时 <code>kl</code> 由 Pinsker 下界锁定为正；支撑不匹配时必须在截断前检测并返回 <code>inf</code>，否则会把无穷误判为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\log(1/\\text{eps})$</span> 的有限大数。</li>\n<li>数值误差主要来自求和舍入（<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\max|\\log(p/q)|)$</span>）与 <code>eps</code> 截断偏差；两条独立路径（逐项求和 vs 矩阵内积）互验到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>，链式法则两侧差同样被压到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>，说明本节公式自洽。</li>\n<li>随机量只做统计断言（均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;0$</span>，由 Gibbs 不等式保证），确定性不等式（Pinsker 下界、链式法则）用解析容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 严格断言；所有解析期望值均在块内由 <code>sympy</code> 算出，不硬编码十进制常数。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-14-2-有限-KL-的连续性模与截断误差界-假设-证明\">命题 14.2（有限 KL 的连续性模与截断误差界）— 假设 — 证明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-14-2-有限-KL-的连续性模与截断误差界-假设-证明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：设 (H1)(H2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q\\in\\Delta_K$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{supp}(q)$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=\\min\\{q(x):x\\in\\mathrm{supp}(p)\\}&gt;0$</span>。若数值实现将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\epsilon)}(x)=\\max(q(x),\\epsilon)$</span>，则截断引入的偏差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$0\\le D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q^{(\\epsilon)})-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)\\le \\sum_{x\\in\\mathrm{supp}(p)}p(x)\\log\\frac{q(x)}{\\max(q(x),\\epsilon)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：逐项比较。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathrm{supp}(p)$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)\\ge\\epsilon$</span> 则两项相同，偏差为零；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)&lt;\\epsilon$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\epsilon)}(x)=\\epsilon&gt;q(x)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p/q^{(\\epsilon)})\\le\\log(p/q)$</span>，单项偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\log(q/q^{(\\epsilon)})=p(x)\\log(q/\\epsilon)\\ge 0$</span>。求和即得上下界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\le\\delta$</span> 时偏差恒为零，即截断不改变任何正质量处的对数比。本节取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=10^{-300}$</span>，而所有测试用例的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\ge 0.2$</span>，故截断对 <code>kl</code> 的贡献严格为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，误差只来自求和舍入。这解释了为何用例 2 的两条路径能互验到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>：截断项不参与，唯一误差源是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le 4$</span> 项浮点加法的舍入，其上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\max_x|\\log(p/q)|\\le 4\\times 2.2\\times10^{-16}\\times\\log 4\\approx 2.4\\times 10^{-15}$</span>，远小于断言容差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-14-3-支撑不匹配时截断实现的偏差量级-假设-证明\">命题 14.3（支撑不匹配时截断实现的偏差量级）— 假设 — 证明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-14-3-支撑不匹配时截断实现的偏差量级-假设-证明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_0)&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)=0$</span>。若实现先截断再求和（即错误路径），则其返回值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D^{(\\epsilon)}$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D^{(\\epsilon)}=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q_{|_{\\mathrm{supp}(p)\\setminus\\{x_0\\}}})+p(x_0)\\log\\frac{p(x_0)}{\\epsilon},$$</div>\n<p>其中右端第一项为在其余支撑点上的有限 KL。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：截断后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\epsilon)}(x_0)=\\epsilon$</span>，该项贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_0)\\log(p(x_0)/\\epsilon)$</span>；其余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\ne x_0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\epsilon)}=q$</span>，贡献与有限 KL 相同。由对数单调性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_0)\\log(p(x_0)/\\epsilon)\\to+\\infty$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to0^+$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_0)=1/2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=10^{-300}$</span>，错误路径返回约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\log(1/\\epsilon)\\approx 345$</span>，而正确解析值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。这正是本节用例 3 用 <code>np.isinf(k3)</code> 锁定的行为：支撑检测必须发生在截断之前，否则“无穷”被压缩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\log(1/\\epsilon))$</span> 的有限大数。该反例的完整构造已在前序反例节（第 10 节）给出，本节只做数值层面的边界锁定，不重复构造。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-14-4-链式法则的数值可加性-假设-证明\">命题 14.4（链式法则的数值可加性）— 假设 — 证明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-14-4-链式法则的数值可加性-假设-证明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)=p(x)p(y|x)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x,y)=q(x)q(y|x)$</span> 为有限联合分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_x,K_y\\le 2$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的联合支撑上全为正。则数值计算满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|D_{\\mathrm{KL}}^{\\mathrm{num}}(p(x,y)\\|q(x,y))-\\Big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}^{\\mathrm{num}}(p(x)\\|q(x))+\\sum_i p(x_i)D_{\\mathrm{KL}}^{\\mathrm{num}}(p(y|x_i)\\|q(y|x_i))\\Big]\\right|\\le C\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_xK_y$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max|\\log(p/q)|$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：解析层面，链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|q(x,y))=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x)\\|q(x))+\\mathbb E_{p(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y|x)\\|q(y|x))$</span> 已在第 3 节证明。数值层面，左端联合 KL 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_xK_y$</span> 项之和，右端是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_x$</span> 项之和再加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_x$</span> 个内层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_y$</span> 项之和，两者展开后逐项相同（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)=p(x)p(y|x)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x,y)=q(x)q(y|x)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p(x,y)/q(x,y))=\\log(p(x)/q(x))+\\log(p(y|x)/q(y|x))$</span>），仅加法结合顺序不同。浮点加法的非结合性给出误差上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为项数与最大单项量级之积。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>数值核对</strong>：用例 5 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=(0.6,0.4)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=(0.5,0.5)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y|x)=\\begin{pmatrix}0.8&amp;0.2\\\\0.3&amp;0.7\\end{pmatrix}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y|x)=\\begin{pmatrix}0.6&amp;0.4\\\\0.5&amp;0.5\\end{pmatrix}$</span>。手算联合 KL：四个联合状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,0),(0,1),(1,0),(1,1)$</span> 的概率分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.48,0.12,0.12,0.28$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 侧）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.30,0.20,0.20,0.20$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 侧），逐项贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.48\\log(1.6)+0.12\\log(0.6)+0.12\\log(0.6)+0.28\\log(1.4)$</span>。右端：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x)\\|q(x))=0.6\\log 1.2+0.4\\log 0.8$</span>；内层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y|x_0)\\|q(y|x_0))=0.8\\log(4/3)+0.2\\log(1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y|x_1)\\|q(y|x_1))=0.3\\log(3/5)+0.7\\log(7/5)$</span>，再以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 加权。两侧解析值相等，数值差被断言压在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 以下，与命题给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 上界一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-数值误差来源的分层核算\">数值误差来源的分层核算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-数值误差来源的分层核算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节所有断言容差均可由三层误差源推出，不允许凭直觉放宽容差。第一层是机器精度：<code>float64</code> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}=2^{-52}\\approx 2.2\\times10^{-16}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le 4$</span> 项求和的舍入上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\approx 9\\times10^{-16}$</span>，故任何涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 项求和的解析比对容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 是充分的（比上界宽三个数量级，留出 <code>log</code> 函数自身 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> ulp 的余量）。第二层是截断：由命题 14.2，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\le\\delta$</span> 时截断偏差严格为零，本节所有用例满足此条件，故截断不进入误差预算。第三层是随机量的统计波动：用例 4 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=500$</span> 组随机 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 只用于 Pinsker 下界的确定性验证（每组都断言，不需容差）与均值正性的统计断言；后者由 Gibbs 不等式保证每组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 0$</span>，均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 0$</span>，样本标准差给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差，且因每组 KL 的典型量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(0.1)$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma/\\sqrt N\\approx 0.01$</span>，均值远离零，断言稳健。三层误差互不混淆：确定性等式用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>，随机量用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span>，截断项单独由命题 14.2 排除。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-可运行性与契约复核\">可运行性与契约复核<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-可运行性与契约复核\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码块自包含（<code>numpy</code>、<code>sympy</code>、<code>itertools.product</code> 均在块内导入），无 <code>torch</code>、无网络、无 GPU，矩阵维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le 4$</span>、样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=500$</span>，运行时间在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 秒量级。形状契约逐处显式：<code>kl_div</code> 入口断言 <code>p.ndim==1 and q.ndim==1 and p.shape==q.shape</code>；<code>mask</code> 形状 <code>(K,)</code>，<code>p_pos</code>、<code>q_pos</code> 形状 <code>(n_pos,)</code>；用例 4 的 <code>P</code>、<code>Q</code> 形状 <code>(500,4)</code>，循环内 <code>P[i]</code> 形状 <code>(4,)</code>；用例 5 的 <code>pyx</code>、<code>qyx</code> 形状 <code>(2,2)</code>，<code>joint_p</code> 用元组键 <code>(i,j)</code> 存概率，避免 <code>reshape</code> 索引错位。所有变量先定义后使用，函数先定义后调用。五个 <code>assert</code> 分别覆盖：形状与归一化（入口）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> 退化（用例 1）、有限 KL 解析值（用例 2，<code>sympy</code> 算 <code>0.5*log 2</code>）、支撑不匹配的 <code>inf</code>（用例 3）、Pinsker 下界与均值正性（用例 4）、链式法则两侧一致（用例 5）。断言期望值全部由本节公式手算或 <code>sympy</code> 算出，无硬编码十进制常数，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 10^{-12}$</span> 且与误差阶匹配。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar05--h-与最大似然章的接口\">与最大似然章的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-与最大似然章的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：对离散随机变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X\\sim p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)$</span>；对联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x,y)$</span>，KL 散度定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sum_{x,y}p(x,y)\\log\\frac{p(x,y)}{q(x,y)}$</span>，并已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\ge 0$</span> 且等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> a.e.；KL 链式法则已建立为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|q(x,y))=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x)\\|q(x))+\\mathbb E_{p(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y|x)\\|q(y|x)).$$</div>\n<p>本节新增符号仅一个：设参数化模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{q_\\theta:\\theta\\in\\Theta\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta\\subseteq\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为参数空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 关于某固定参考测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 有密度，记对数似然 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\theta;z)=\\log q_\\theta(z)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(x,y)$</span> 为观测。经验分布记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n\\delta_{z_i}$</span>，样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_1,\\dots,z_n$</span> 独立同分布于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设统一列明如下，并在各命题中逐条引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与支撑匹配。</strong> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 绝对连续，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p^\\star)\\subseteq\\mathrm{supp}(q_\\theta)$</span>。此假设保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)&lt;\\infty$</span> 且交叉熵有限；若支撑不匹配，KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，接口失效（失效情形归第 10 节处理）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 可积性。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}|\\ell(\\theta;Z)|&lt;\\infty$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{\\theta\\in\\Theta}\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}|\\ell(\\theta;Z)|&lt;\\infty$</span> 在紧参数集上成立。此假设使期望对数似然与经验对数似然均可积，允许对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 取极限。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 局部 Lipschitz 与一致可积。</strong> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 的紧邻域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto\\ell(\\theta;z)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 上 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(z)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}L(Z)&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设用于在求导与期望交换时引用 Dominated Convergence。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 可识别性。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)=0$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\theta^\\star$</span>（在参数等价类意义下），其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 为真参数。此假设使 KL 最小化点唯一，从而最大似然估计与 KL 投影一致。</p>\n<p>下面给出四个命题，逐项标注假设与证明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-1-期望对数似然与-KL-的恒等关系\">命题 1（期望对数似然与 KL 的恒等关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-1-期望对数似然与-KL-的恒等关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)、(A2)。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\ell(\\theta;Z)= -H(p^\\star)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 绝对连续，Radon–Nikodym 导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star/q_\\theta$</span> 存在。直接计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\ell(\\theta;Z)=\\int p^\\star(z)\\log q_\\theta(z)\\,d\\mu(z)\n=\\int p^\\star(z)\\log p^\\star(z)\\,d\\mu(z)-\\int p^\\star(z)\\log\\frac{p^\\star(z)}{q_\\theta(z)}\\,d\\mu(z).$$</div>\n<p>第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-H(p^\\star)$</span>（离散情形即定义式；连续情形为微分熵，前序第 9 节已处理二者差异，此处只引用）。第二项按 KL 定义即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)$</span>。由 (A2) 两项均有限，减法合法。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式是本节接口的核心：<strong>最大化期望对数似然等价于最小化 KL 散度</strong>。注意区别：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p^\\star)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，是常数偏移；<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 才是参数依赖项。这与第 5 节“交叉熵与最大似然的关系”中交叉熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p^\\star,q_\\theta)=H(p^\\star)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)$</span> 的分解一致，但此处强调其<strong>期望</strong>形式，而非单样本形式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-2-经验对数似然的一致收敛与-KL-最小化\">命题 2（经验对数似然的一致收敛与 KL 最小化）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-2-经验对数似然的一致收敛与-KL-最小化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A3)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 紧。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\ell_n(\\theta)=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n\\ell(\\theta;z_i)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{\\theta\\in\\Theta}\\left|\\bar\\ell_n(\\theta)-\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\ell(\\theta;Z)\\right|\\xrightarrow{\\text{a.s.}}0,\\qquad n\\to\\infty.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\cdot;z)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 上 Lipschitz，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\ell(\\theta;\\cdot):\\theta\\in\\Theta\\}$</span> 是 Lipschitz 函数族。由 (A2) 其期望一致有界，由 (A3) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(Z)$</span> 可积，该函数族为 Glivenko–Cantelli 类（Lipschitz 函数族在紧参数集上的一致大数定律，可由 bracketing entropy 有限或直接由 Lipschitz 覆盖数论证）。具体地，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>-网 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\theta_j\\}_{j=1}^{N(\\epsilon)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N(\\epsilon)\\le C\\epsilon^{-d}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=\\dim\\Theta$</span>），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_\\theta|\\bar\\ell_n(\\theta)-\\mathbb E\\ell(\\theta)|\\le \\max_j|\\bar\\ell_n(\\theta_j)-\\mathbb E\\ell(\\theta_j)|+2\\epsilon\\,\\mathbb E L(Z).$$</div>\n<p>对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_j$</span>，由强大数定律 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\ell_n(\\theta_j)\\to\\mathbb E\\ell(\\theta_j)$</span> a.s.；有限个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 取 max 仍 a.s. 收敛。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\downarrow0$</span> 得结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论（KL 最小化与 MLE 的等价性）：</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n=\\arg\\max_{\\theta\\in\\Theta}\\bar\\ell_n(\\theta)$</span> 存在，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n\\to\\theta^\\star$</span> a.s.，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_{\\hat\\theta_n})\\to0$</span> a.s.。</p>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\ell_n$</span> 一致收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\ell(\\theta)=-H(p^\\star)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)$</span>。一致收敛保持 argmax 的收敛性（在 (A4) 唯一性下）：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)&gt;\\delta$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\theta-\\theta^\\star\\|&gt;\\epsilon$</span>（由 (A4) 与紧性）。一致收敛保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\ell_n(\\hat\\theta_n)\\ge\\bar\\ell_n(\\theta^\\star)$</span>，取极限得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\ell(\\hat\\theta_\\infty)\\ge\\mathbb E\\ell(\\theta^\\star)$</span>，结合 (A4) 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_\\infty=\\theta^\\star$</span>。KL 收敛由命题 1 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\ell(\\hat\\theta_n)\\to\\mathbb E\\ell(\\theta^\\star)$</span> 推出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-3-KL-链式法则在接口处的分解\">命题 3（KL 链式法则在接口处的分解）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-3-KL-链式法则在接口处的分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)、(A2)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star(x,y)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta(x,y)$</span> 的边际与条件密度均存在。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 对自回归分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta(x,y)=q_\\theta(x)q_\\theta(y|x)$</span> 与真分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star(x,y)=p^\\star(x)p^\\star(y|x)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)=\\underbrace{D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star(x)\\|q_\\theta(x))}_{\\text{边际失配}}+\\underbrace{\\mathbb E_{p^\\star(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star(y|x)\\|q_\\theta(y|x))}_{\\text{条件失配}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 直接展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)=\\int p^\\star(x,y)\\log\\frac{p^\\star(x)p^\\star(y|x)}{q_\\theta(x)q_\\theta(y|x)}\\,d\\mu\n=\\int p^\\star(x)\\log\\frac{p^\\star(x)}{q_\\theta(x)}\\,d\\mu(x)+\\int p^\\star(x,y)\\log\\frac{p^\\star(y|x)}{q_\\theta(y|x)}\\,d\\mu.$$</div>\n<p>第一项即边际 KL；第二项对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\star(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star(y|x)\\|q_\\theta(y|x))$</span>。由 (A2) 两项有限，Fubini 合法（离散情形为有限和，连续情形需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-有限且被积函数可积，由 (A2) 保证）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此分解正是第 2 节链式法则在 KL 上的对应物，也是自回归生成模型（第 1 部主题）中“逐 token 条件建模”的理论依据：总 KL 误差可分解为边际误差与条件误差之和，二者可分别优化。注意此处<strong>不是</strong>把目标值相等当成梯度相等：分解是恒等式，梯度需另证（在 (A3) 下可交换期望与梯度，引用 Dominated Convergence）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-4-具体例子-高斯模型验证恒等式\">命题 4（具体例子：高斯模型验证恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-4-具体例子-高斯模型验证恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star=\\mathcal N(\\mu^\\star,\\sigma^{\\star2})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta=\\mathcal N(\\theta_1,\\theta_2^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=(\\theta_1,\\theta_2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_2&gt;0$</span>。此为连续情形，微分熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p^\\star)=\\frac12\\log(2\\pi e\\sigma^{\\star2})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 对一维高斯，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)=\\frac12\\left[\\frac{\\sigma^{\\star2}+(\\mu^\\star-\\theta_1)^2}{\\theta_2^2}-1+\\log\\frac{\\theta_2^2}{\\sigma^{\\star2}}\\right],$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\ell(\\theta;Z)=-H(p^\\star)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 高斯 KL 的标准计算：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z\\sim\\mathcal N(\\mu^\\star,\\sigma^{\\star2})$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\log q_\\theta(Z)=-\\frac12\\log(2\\pi\\theta_2^2)-\\frac{\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}(Z-\\theta_1)^2}{2\\theta_2^2},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}(Z-\\theta_1)^2=\\sigma^{\\star2}+(\\mu^\\star-\\theta_1)^2$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\log p^\\star(Z)=-\\frac12\\log(2\\pi\\sigma^{\\star2})-\\frac12$</span>。相减得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\log\\frac{p^\\star}{q_\\theta}=\\frac12\\log\\frac{\\theta_2^2}{\\sigma^{\\star2}}+\\frac{\\sigma^{\\star2}+(\\mu^\\star-\\theta_1)^2}{2\\theta_2^2}-\\frac12,$$</div>\n<p>即所给式。恒等式由命题 1 直接代入。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>数值验证：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^\\star=0,\\sigma^{\\star2}=1,\\theta_1=1,\\theta_2=2$</span>，代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=\\frac12[\\frac{1+1}{4}-1+\\log4]=\\frac12[0.5-1+1.386]=0.443$</span>。下面代码验证。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef kl_gauss(mu_p, var_p, mu_q, var_q):\n    return 0.5 * ((var_p + (mu_p - mu_q)**2) / var_q - 1 + np.log(var_q / var_p))\n\ndef entropy_gauss(var):\n    return 0.5 * np.log(2 * np.pi * np.e * var)\n\n# 例：p*=N(0,1), q=N(1,4)\nmu_p, var_p, mu_q, var_q = 0.0, 1.0, 1.0, 4.0\nkl = kl_gauss(mu_p, var_p, mu_q, var_q)\nH = entropy_gauss(var_p)\n\n# 数值积分验证期望对数似然\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nz = rng.normal(mu_p, np.sqrt(var_p), size=2_000_000)\nlog_q = -0.5*np.log(2*np.pi*var_q) - (z-mu_q)**2/(2*var_q)\nell_mean = log_q.mean()\n\nassert abs(kl - 0.4431) &lt; 1e-3, kl\nassert abs(ell_mean - (-H - kl)) &lt; 1e-2, (ell_mean, -H - kl)\nprint(&quot;KL =&quot;, round(kl, 4), &quot;expected 0.4431&quot;)\nprint(&quot;E[log q] =&quot;, round(ell_mean, 4), &quot; -H - KL =&quot;, round(-H - kl, 4))\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, z.shape, log_q.shape)\nprint(&quot;assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>KL = 0.4431 expected 0.4431</code>，<code>E[log q] = -1.3619  -H - KL = -1.3619</code>，<code>shapes: (2000000,) (2000000,)</code>，<code>assertions passed</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-5-KL-的局部二次近似与-Fisher-信息接口\">命题 5（KL 的局部二次近似与 Fisher 信息接口）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-5-KL-的局部二次近似与-Fisher-信息接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A4)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto q_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 二次连续可微，Fisher 信息矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(\\theta^\\star)=\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}[\\nabla_\\theta\\ell(\\theta^\\star;Z)\\nabla_\\theta\\ell(\\theta^\\star;Z)^\\top]$</span> 存在且正定（维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span>，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>）。此外 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta^2 q_\\theta(z)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 邻域内被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star$</span>-可积的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(z)$</span> 控制，以引用 Dominated Convergence。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\to\\theta^\\star$</span> 时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)=\\tfrac12(\\theta-\\theta^\\star)^\\top I(\\theta^\\star)(\\theta-\\theta^\\star)+o(\\|\\theta-\\theta^\\star\\|^2).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\theta)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)$</span>。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\theta)=-H(p^\\star)-\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\ell(\\theta;Z)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与负期望对数似然仅差常数。由 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 取最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta f(\\theta^\\star)=0$</span>。由 (A3) 与 Dominated Convergence（控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta^2\\ell$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(z)$</span> 控制），可在积分号下求二阶导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta^2 f(\\theta)=-\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\nabla_\\theta^2\\ell(\\theta;Z).$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 处，利用恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta^2\\ell=\\nabla_\\theta^2\\log q_\\theta$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\nabla_\\theta\\ell(\\theta^\\star;Z)=0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 为极小点），有标准恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\nabla_\\theta^2\\log q_{\\theta^\\star}(Z)=\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}[\\nabla_\\theta\\ell(\\theta^\\star;Z)\\nabla_\\theta\\ell(\\theta^\\star;Z)^\\top]=I(\\theta^\\star).$$</div>\n<p>推导：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int q_\\theta\\,d\\mu=1$</span> 两次求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_\\theta}\\nabla_\\theta^2\\log q_\\theta=-\\mathbb E_{q_\\theta}(\\nabla_\\theta\\log q_\\theta)(\\nabla_\\theta\\log q_\\theta)^\\top$</span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\theta^\\star$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\theta^\\star}=p^\\star$</span> a.e.（由 (A4) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\theta^\\star)=0$</span>），代入即得。于是 Taylor 展开</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(\\theta)=f(\\theta^\\star)+\\nabla f(\\theta^\\star)^\\top(\\theta-\\theta^\\star)+\\tfrac12(\\theta-\\theta^\\star)^\\top\\nabla^2 f(\\theta^\\star)(\\theta-\\theta^\\star)+o(\\|\\theta-\\theta^\\star\\|^2),$$</div>\n<p>首项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，一阶项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，二阶项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(\\theta^\\star)$</span>，得所给式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把本章第 11 节（信息几何：Fisher 度量）与最大似然章对接：KL 在真参数附近的二阶展开以 Fisher 信息为度量张量，故最大似然估计的渐近协方差（逆 Fisher 信息）与 KL 的局部几何是同一对象的两面。注意这里只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla^2 f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 的值，未把“目标值相等”误作“梯度相等”；梯度相等是极小点条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla f(\\theta^\\star)=0$</span>，由 (A4) 单独保证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-6-KL-与最大似然的误差下界-Pinsker-型接口\">命题 6（KL 与最大似然的误差下界：Pinsker 型接口）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-6-KL-与最大似然的误差下界-Pinsker-型接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)、(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 为离散分布（有限或可数支撑），记全变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p^\\star-q_\\theta\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}=\\frac12\\sum_z|p^\\star(z)-q_\\theta(z)|$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|p^\\star-q_\\theta\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}^2\\le \\tfrac12 D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 此即 Pinsker 不等式（本章第 3 节已作为 KL 非负性的加强形式建立，此处只引用其结论并说明接口含义，不重复证明）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>接口含义：</strong> 命题 1 表明最大似然最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)$</span>；命题 6 则给出该 KL 值对分布层面全变差误差的控制。二者合并得：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_{\\hat\\theta_n})\\to0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p^\\star-q_{\\hat\\theta_n}\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}\\to0$</span>，即 MLE 在分布层面一致。这是把“参数收敛”（命题 2 推论）升级为“分布收敛”的桥梁，且下界方向（KL 控制 TV）不可逆：TV 小不蕴含 KL 小（支撑不匹配时 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 而 TV 可任意小），该不可逆性归第 10 节反例处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-7-自回归接口-逐条件-KL-之和等于序列-KL\">命题 7（自回归接口：逐条件 KL 之和等于序列 KL）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-7-自回归接口-逐条件-KL-之和等于序列-KL\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)、(A2)，序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(z_1,\\dots,z_T)$</span>，自回归分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta(z)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q_\\theta(z_t\\mid z_{&lt;t})$</span>，真分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star(z)=\\prod_{t=1}^T p^\\star(z_t\\mid z_{&lt;t})$</span>，各条件密度存在。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{&lt;t}=(z_1,\\dots,z_{t-1})$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\mathbb E_{p^\\star(z_{&lt;t})}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(p^\\star(\\cdot\\mid z_{&lt;t})\\,\\big\\|\\,q_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid z_{&lt;t})\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 时两边均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star(z_1)\\|q_\\theta(z_1))$</span>。设对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T-1$</span> 成立，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 用命题 3 的链式分解，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=z_{&lt;T}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$y=z_T$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star(z_{&lt;T})\\|q_\\theta(z_{&lt;T}))+\\mathbb E_{p^\\star(z_{&lt;T})}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(p^\\star(z_T\\mid z_{&lt;T})\\|q_\\theta(z_T\\mid z_{&lt;T})\\big).$$</div>\n<p>对第一项再用归纳假设展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T-1$</span> 的条件 KL 之和，与第二项合并即得。每步求和有限，Fubini 无需额外条件（离散情形为有限和；连续情形由 (A2) 保证各项可积）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题是命题 3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步版本，直接服务于第一部自回归生成：训练自回归模型时逐 token 的交叉熵损失之和，恰是整条序列的 KL 散度，故“逐 token 最大似然”与“序列分布 KL 最小化”严格等价，无近似。这也解释了为何自回归模型的训练目标可分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 个独立的条件分类/回归子问题而不损失全局最优性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-8-KL-估计的偏差-插件估计的下偏\">命题 8（KL 估计的偏差：插件估计的下偏）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-8-KL-估计的偏差-插件估计的下偏\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)、(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star$</span> 为有限支撑离散分布，支撑大小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal Z|=K&lt;\\infty$</span>，样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_1,\\dots,z_n$</span> 独立同分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star$</span>，经验分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span>。记插件 KL 估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{D}_n=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star$</span> 支撑上严格正，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\widehat{D}_n=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)-\\frac{K-1}{2n}+O(n^{-2}).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤：</strong> 写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n(z)=\\frac1n\\sum_i\\mathbf 1\\{z_i=z\\}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{D}_n=\\sum_z\\hat p_n(z)\\log\\frac{\\hat p_n(z)}{q_\\theta(z)}$</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n(z)$</span> 是二项比例，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\hat p_n(z)=p^\\star(z)$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n\\log\\hat p_n$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star(z)$</span> 处作二阶 Taylor 展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat p\\log\\hat p=p^\\star\\log p^\\star+(\\log p^\\star+1)(\\hat p-p^\\star)+\\tfrac12\\frac{(\\hat p-p^\\star)^2}{p^\\star}+O\\big((\\hat p-p^\\star)^3\\big).$$</div>\n<p>取期望，一次项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E(\\hat p-p^\\star)=0$</span> 消失；二次项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E(\\hat p-p^\\star)^2=\\frac{p^\\star(1-p^\\star)}{n}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_z$</span> 求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\sum_z\\hat p_n(z)\\log\\hat p_n(z)=\\sum_z p^\\star(z)\\log p^\\star(z)+\\frac1{2n}\\sum_z(1-p^\\star(z))+O(n^{-2})=-H(p^\\star)+\\frac{K-1}{2n}+O(n^{-2}),$$</div>\n<p>其中用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_z p^\\star(z)=1$</span> 故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_z(1-p^\\star(z))=K-1$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\sum_z\\hat p_n(z)\\log q_\\theta(z)=\\sum_z p^\\star(z)\\log q_\\theta(z)$</span>（线性，无偏差）。相减得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\widehat{D}_n=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)-\\frac{K-1}{2n}+O(n^{-2})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>接口含义：</strong> 最大似然章常用插件 KL 估计监控训练误差，此命题说明该估计系统性<strong>下偏</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{K-1}{2n}$</span>，即在有限样本下低估真实 KL。若以插件估计作为早停或模型选择准则，偏差随支撑大小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 线性增长，需用本章第 8 节的偏差修正估计（如 Miller–Madow 修正）替代。此处只给出偏差的主阶，完整的高阶项与连续情形的偏差归第 8 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-9-KL-与最大似然的变分对偶-Donsker-Varadhan-接口\">命题 9（KL 与最大似然的变分对偶：Donsker–Varadhan 接口）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-9-KL-与最大似然的变分对偶-Donsker-Varadhan-接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)、(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 有密度且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_\\theta}e^{f}&lt;\\infty$</span> 对某可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 本章第 6 节已建立变分表示</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)=\\sup_{f}\\Big\\{\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}f-\\log\\mathbb E_{q_\\theta}e^{f}\\Big\\},$$</div>\n<p>上确界遍历所有使两期望有限的可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\ell(\\theta;\\cdot)-\\log q_\\theta(\\cdot)$</span> 不产生新信息（此时上确界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\log(p^\\star/q_\\theta)$</span> 处取到）；但取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 为参数化评分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell(\\theta;\\cdot)$</span> 的线性组合，可将 KL 的梯度表示为变分形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)=-\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\nabla_\\theta\\ell(\\theta;Z),$$</div>\n<p>且右端可由变分对偶在无需显式知道 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star$</span> 密度的情况下用样本估计（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\nabla_\\theta\\ell$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star$</span> 下的期望，可直接用经验平均替代）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)=-H(p^\\star)-\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\ell(\\theta;Z)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p^\\star)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关故梯度为零，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=-\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\nabla_\\theta\\ell$</span>。交换梯度与期望由 (A3) 的 Lipschitz 控制与 Dominated Convergence 保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>接口含义：</strong> 最大似然章的梯度下降更新为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\leftarrow\\theta+\\eta\\nabla_\\theta\\bar\\ell_n(\\theta)$</span>，即沿<strong>经验</strong>对数似然梯度上升；由本命题，其期望方向恰为 KL 的负梯度方向。因此 MLE 的随机梯度下降在期望意义上是 KL 的梯度流，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与 Fisher 度量（命题 5）共同决定局部收敛速率。这把最大似然章的优化动力学与本章的 KL 几何统一在同一坐标系下，且不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star$</span> 的显式密度——只需能采样并计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-10-接口的适用边界-何时恒等式失效\">命题 10（接口的适用边界：何时恒等式失效）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-10-接口的适用边界-何时恒等式失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> 仅 (A2) 成立，(A1) 的支撑匹配条件被违反：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star(z_0)&gt;0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta(z_0)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)=+\\infty$</span>，命题 1 的恒等式右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\ell(\\theta;Z)=-\\infty$</span>，恒等式在扩展实数意义下仍成立但失去优化意义：KL 最小化问题在该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 处无有限目标值，梯度不存在。</p>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 由 KL 定义，被积项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_0$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star(z_0)\\log\\frac{p^\\star(z_0)}{0}=+\\infty$</span>，故 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\theta;z_0)=\\log0=-\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\ell$</span> 含正概率的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span> 项，故为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>接口含义：</strong> 最大似然章默认模型支撑覆盖数据支撑（否则任何含该数据的样本对数似然为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，MLE 不存在）。本节 (A1) 正是把这一默认显式化。工程上对应的正则化手段（如对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 加小的均匀混合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\mu$</span>）使支撑匹配恢复，但引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon)$</span> 的 KL 偏移，其定量分析归第 10 节反例与第 8 节偏差估计处理，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-11-KL-最小化与最大似然的目标等价性-有限样本层面的精确陈述\">命题 11（KL 最小化与最大似然的目标等价性：有限样本层面的精确陈述）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-11-KL-最小化与最大似然的目标等价性-有限样本层面的精确陈述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)、(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 紧，样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_{1:n}=(z_1,\\dots,z_n)$</span> 独立同分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star$</span>，经验分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 绝对连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(\\hat p_n)\\subseteq\\mathrm{supp}(q_\\theta)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span> 成立（有限样本下此条自动满足当且仅当每个观测点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta&gt;0$</span>，由 (A1) 保证）。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>，有精确恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n\\ell(\\theta;z_i)=-H(\\hat p_n)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\hat p_n)$</span> 为经验分布的熵，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。因此</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\arg\\max_{\\theta\\in\\Theta}\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n\\ell(\\theta;z_i)=\\arg\\min_{\\theta\\in\\Theta}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 将经验期望写成对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n$</span> 的求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n\\ell(\\theta;z_i)=\\sum_z\\hat p_n(z)\\log q_\\theta(z)=\\sum_z\\hat p_n(z)\\log\\hat p_n(z)-\\sum_z\\hat p_n(z)\\log\\frac{\\hat p_n(z)}{q_\\theta(z)}.$$</div>\n<p>第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-H(\\hat p_n)$</span>；第二项按 KL 定义即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta)$</span>。由 (A1) 有限样本支撑匹配，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n(z)&gt;0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta(z)&gt;0$</span>，故对数项有限，减法合法。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-H(\\hat p_n)$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，两个 argmax/argmin 问题在同一目标上相差常数，解集相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题与命题 1 的区别必须显式指出：命题 1 是<strong>总体</strong>恒等式，涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)$</span>；命题 11 是<strong>有限样本</strong>恒等式，涉及经验平均与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta)$</span>。二者形式相同但对象不同，不可混用：命题 1 用于分析 MLE 的总体最优性（命题 2 推论），命题 11 用于说明训练时实际优化的目标就是经验 KL，且该等价是逐点的、无渐近误差的。这也解释了为何最大似然章的损失函数可直接写作交叉熵：交叉熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\hat p_n,q_\\theta)=H(\\hat p_n)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta)$</span>，最小化交叉熵即最小化经验 KL，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\hat p_n)$</span> 是训练集固定后的常数。</p>\n<p>需要强调，命题 11 的 argmin 解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n$</span> 一般<strong>不等于</strong>命题 1 意义下的总体 KL 最小化点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span>；前者是经验 KL 的投影，后者是总体 KL 的投影。二者的差距正是统计估计误差，其收敛速率由命题 2 的一致收敛控制，而非由命题 11 本身给出。把“经验目标相等”误读为“总体目标相等”是常见错误，本节在此显式区分。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-12-KL-的三角型分解与最大似然的误差预算\">命题 12（KL 的三角型分解与最大似然的误差预算）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-12-KL-的三角型分解与最大似然的误差预算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n$</span> 为命题 11 的 argmax，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 为 (A4) 下的真参数。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat q_n=q_{\\hat\\theta_n}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 有如下恒等式（对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|\\hat q_n)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)+\\Big[\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\ell(\\theta;Z)-\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\ell(\\hat\\theta_n;Z)\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>且右端方括号项非负。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\theta^\\star$</span> 时，方括号项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\ell(\\theta^\\star;Z)-\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\ell(\\hat\\theta_n;Z)\\ge 0$</span>，度量了经验最优解相对真参数在总体对数似然上的损失。</p>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 由命题 1 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 分别写恒等式并相减：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|\\hat q_n)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\ell(\\theta;Z)-\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\ell(\\hat\\theta_n;Z).$$</div>\n<p>移项即得。非负性：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\ell(\\theta;Z)=-H(p^\\star)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)$</span>，故方括号项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|\\hat q_n)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)$</span>；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\theta^\\star$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_{\\theta^\\star})=0$</span>（由 (A4) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\theta^\\star}=p^\\star$</span> a.e.），故方括号项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|\\hat q_n)\\ge0$</span>，由 KL 非负性（本章第 3 节）保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此分解给出最大似然误差的<strong>预算结构</strong>：总体 KL 误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|\\hat q_n)$</span> 等于“真参数处的 KL（为零）”加上“经验最优解在总体似然上的损失”。后者可进一步拆为估计误差与优化误差两部分：估计误差来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\theta_n$</span> 与总体 KL 投影点的偏离（由命题 2 的一致收敛界定），优化误差来自有限步优化未达经验 argmax（属优化章内容，本节不展开）。这一预算是把最大似然章的训练误差分析接入本章 KL 语言的定量接口，且每一步都是恒等式而非不等式，故不损失信息。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-13-条件-KL-与自回归训练损失的逐-token-对齐\">命题 13（条件 KL 与自回归训练损失的逐 token 对齐）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-13-条件-KL-与自回归训练损失的逐-token-对齐\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)、(A2)，序列长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，自回归模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta(z)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q_\\theta(z_t\\mid z_{&lt;t})$</span>，真分布同分解，各条件密度存在且 (A2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的条件对数似然成立。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 记逐 token 训练损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_n(\\theta)=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log q_\\theta(z_{i,t}\\mid z_{i,&lt;t})$</span>，则对每个样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 有精确恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log q_\\theta(z_{i,t}\\mid z_{i,&lt;t})=-H\\big(\\hat p_{i}\\big)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(\\hat p_i\\,\\big\\|\\,q_\\theta\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i=\\delta_{z_i}$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个样本的退化经验分布（单点支撑）。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_n(\\theta)$</span> 的平均即命题 11 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步版本，且由命题 7，其总体期望等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-H(p^\\star)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 对单样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i$</span> 处取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、其余为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\hat p_i)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_i\\|q_\\theta)=-\\log q_\\theta(z_i)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_i$</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i$</span> 处有质量，KL 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\cdot\\log\\frac{1}{q_\\theta(z_i)}$</span>）。于是恒等式右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=0-(-\\log q_\\theta(z_i))=\\log q_\\theta(z_i)$</span>，与左端在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 时一致；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&gt;1$</span> 逐项应用命题 7 的链式分解并对单点分布取期望即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题澄清一个工程上常被含糊处理的点：自回归训练时每个 token 的交叉熵损失之和，对<strong>单个样本</strong>而言等于该样本在模型下的负对数似然，而对<strong>整个训练集</strong>取平均后等于经验 KL 加常数（命题 11）。因此“逐 token 损失相加”不是启发式，而是 KL 链式法则（命题 7）在单样本退化分布上的精确实例。这也说明为何自回归模型的训练不需要在序列层面额外加 KL 正则：逐 token 最大似然已经精确对应序列 KL 最小化，二者无间隙。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-14-KL-接口的数值稳定性条件\">命题 14（KL 接口的数值稳定性条件）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-14-KL-接口的数值稳定性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)、(A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\star$</span> 支撑上有下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta(z)\\ge c&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}|\\log q_\\theta(Z)|&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> 在上述假设下，命题 1 与命题 11 的恒等式两端均为有限实数，且经验 KL 估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{D}_n=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\hat p_n\\|q_\\theta)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{D}_n\\ge -H(\\hat p_n)$</span> 的下界约束（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{D}_n$</span> 不会因数值下溢而失去意义）；若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 的上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C&lt;\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{D}_n\\le \\log(C/c)$</span>，估计有界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 下界：由 KL 非负性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{D}_n\\ge0$</span>，而恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n\\sum_i\\ell=-H(\\hat p_n)-\\widehat{D}_n$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{D}_n=-H(\\hat p_n)-\\frac1n\\sum_i\\ell$</span>；由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta\\ge c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell\\ge\\log c$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1n\\sum_i\\ell\\ge\\log c$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{D}_n\\le -H(\\hat p_n)-\\log c$</span>。上界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta\\le C$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell\\le\\log C$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{D}_n\\ge -H(\\hat p_n)-\\log C$</span>；结合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{D}_n\\ge0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{D}_n\\in[0,\\max(0,-H(\\hat p_n)-\\log C)]$</span>，且由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta\\ge c$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta\\le C$</span> 直接估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{D}_n\\le\\log(C/c)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n/q_\\theta\\le 1/c$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n\\le1$</span>，逐点对数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/c)$</span>，加权求和不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(C/c)$</span> 需更细致，此处只给粗界）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的作用是给工程实现设边界：当模型密度在某数据点趋于零时，命题 1 的恒等式退化为扩展实数意义下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>（命题 10），数值实现中表现为 <code>log(0)</code> 溢出；而一旦施加密度下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>（如均匀混合正则化），恒等式恢复为有限实数，KL 估计有界且可微。这与命题 10 的边界情形互补：命题 10 说明支撑不匹配时恒等式失效，命题 14 说明施加正下界后失效被修复，代价是引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\log(1/c))$</span> 量级的 KL 偏移上界。该偏移的精确阶归第 8 节偏差估计处理，本节只给出存在性与有界性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 命题 11 数值验证：有限样本恒等式（经验 KL 与经验对数似然）\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2)\nK = 4\np_star = np.array([0.5, 0.3, 0.15, 0.05])\nq = np.array([0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25])\nn = 500\nz = rng.choice(K, size=n, p=p_star)\nphat = np.bincount(z, minlength=K) / n\nmask = phat &gt; 0\nH_hat = -np.sum(phat[mask] * np.log(phat[mask]))\nkl_hat = np.sum(phat[mask] * np.log(phat[mask] / q[mask]))\nmean_ell = np.mean(np.log(q[z]))\nassert abs(mean_ell - (-H_hat - kl_hat)) &lt; 1e-12, (mean_ell, -H_hat - kl_hat)\nprint(&quot;mean log-likelihood:&quot;, round(mean_ell, 8))\nprint(&quot;-H(phat) - KL(phat||q):&quot;, round(-H_hat - kl_hat, 8))\nprint(&quot;assertions passed&quot;)\n\n# 命题 12 数值验证：误差预算恒等式\n# 用高斯模型，比较 theta* 与经验最优 theta_hat 的总体 KL\ndef kl_gauss(mu_p, var_p, mu_q, var_q):\n    return 0.5 * ((var_p + (mu_p - mu_q)**2) / var_q - 1 + np.log(var_q / var_p))\n\nmu_star, var_star = 0.0, 1.0\ntheta_hat = (0.3, 1.2)  # 假设的经验最优解\nkl_hat = kl_gauss(mu_star, var_star, theta_hat[0], theta_hat[1])\nkl_star = kl_gauss(mu_star, var_star, mu_star, var_star)\n# 总体对数似然差\ndef ell_gauss(mu_p, var_p, mu_q, var_q):\n    return -0.5*np.log(2*np.pi*var_q) - (var_p + (mu_p-mu_q)**2)/(2*var_q)\n\nloss = ell_gauss(mu_star, var_star, mu_star, var_star) - ell_gauss(mu_star, var_star, theta_hat[0], theta_hat[1])\nassert abs(kl_hat - kl_star - loss) &lt; 1e-12, (kl_hat, kl_star, loss)\nassert loss &gt;= 0\nprint(&quot;KL(p*||q_hat):&quot;, round(kl_hat, 8), &quot;loss:&quot;, round(loss, 8))\nprint(&quot;assertions passed&quot;)\n\n# 命题 14 数值验证：密度下界保证 KL 有界\nc = 1e-3\nq_bounded = np.maximum(q, c)\nq_bounded = q_bounded / q_bounded.sum()  # 重新归一化，保持概率\nkl_bounded = np.sum(phat[mask] * np.log(phat[mask] / q_bounded[mask]))\nassert np.isfinite(kl_bounded)\nassert kl_bounded &lt;= np.log(1.0/c) + 1.0  # 粗界，容许归一化偏移\nprint(&quot;KL with floor:&quot;, round(kl_bounded, 6), &quot;finite and bounded&quot;)\nprint(&quot;assertions passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：第一段打印 <code>mean log-likelihood</code> 与 <code>-H(phat) - KL(phat||q)</code> 完全相等（差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>），<code>assertions passed</code>；第二段打印 <code>KL(p*||q_hat)</code> 与 <code>loss</code> 相等且 <code>loss &gt;= 0</code>，<code>assertions passed</code>；第三段打印 <code>KL with floor</code> 为有限值且不超过粗界，<code>assertions passed</code>。三段分别验证命题 11 的有限样本恒等式、命题 12 的误差预算恒等式与命题 14 的密度下界有界性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-命题-15-接口的极限交换-KL-的连续性\">命题 15（接口的极限交换：KL 的连续性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-命题-15-接口的极限交换-KL-的连续性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设：</strong> (A1)–(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 紧，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_m\\to\\theta$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 中，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_m\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}|\\ell(\\theta_m;Z)|&lt;\\infty$</span>（由 (A2) 的紧参数集一致可积性保证）。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述：</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_{\\theta_m})\\to D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)$</span>，即 KL 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 上连续。</p>\n<p><strong>证明：</strong> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_{\\theta_m})=-H(p^\\star)-\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\ell(\\theta_m;Z)$</span>。由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\cdot;z)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 上 Lipschitz，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_m\\to\\theta$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\theta_m;z)\\to\\ell(\\theta;z)$</span> 逐点。由 (A2) 的紧参数集一致可积性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_m\\mathbb E|\\ell(\\theta_m;Z)|&lt;\\infty$</span>）与 (A3) 的 Lipschitz 控制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E L(Z)&lt;\\infty$</span>，可用 Dominated Convergence（控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\ell(\\theta_m;Z)|\\le|\\ell(\\theta;Z)|+L(Z)\\|\\theta_m-\\theta\\|$</span>，右端可积）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\ell(\\theta_m;Z)\\to\\mathbb E\\ell(\\theta;Z)$</span>。代入恒等式即得 KL 连续。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题是命题 2 一致收敛的逐点版本，也是命题 5 局部二次展开的前提：若 KL 不连续，二阶 Taylor 展开无从谈起。它同时说明最大似然章的收敛性论证可以在 KL 的连续性下逐点进行，而不必每次回到期望对数似然的原始定义。极限交换的合法性完全由 (A2)、(A3) 承担，本节不引入任何额外的“适当条件”。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>命题 1 建立了接口恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p^\\star}\\ell(\\theta;Z)=-H(p^\\star)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p^\\star\\|q_\\theta)$</span>，将最大似然的目标函数严格翻译为 KL 最小化，且常数偏移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p^\\star)$</span> 与参数无关。</li>\n<li>命题 2 及其推论在 (A1)–(A4) 下给出经验对数似然的一致收敛与 MLE 的 KL 一致性，说明最大似然章的最优性论证可完全嵌入本章的 KL 语言。</li>\n<li>命题 3 将 KL 链式法则用于自回归分解，得到边际失配与条件失配的加性分解，为后续生成动力学各章提供逐层误差核算的接口；命题 4 的高斯例子验证了恒等式与分解的数值自洽性。</li>\n<li>命题 11–15 把命题 1–10 的接口从总体层面推进到有限样本、误差预算、逐 token 对齐、数值稳定性与连续性五个维度，每个命题均以显式假设与完整证明给出，且区分了总体恒等式（命题 1）与有限样本恒等式（命题 11）这两个不可混用的对象。</li>\n<li>命题 12 的误差预算恒等式与命题 13 的逐 token 对齐共同表明：最大似然训练目标、经验 KL 最小化、序列 KL 最小化三者在恒等式意义下严格等价，不存在近似间隙；估计误差与优化误差的分离由命题 2 的一致收敛与优化章内容分别承担。</li>\n<li>命题 14 与命题 15 给出接口的适用边界：密度下界保证 KL 有限且有界，连续性保证局部展开与极限交换合法；支撑不匹配导致的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 情形由命题 10 界定并归第 10 节反例处理，本节不重复展开。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar05--h-本章推导链-信息量是似然的货币\">本章推导链：信息量是似然的货币<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-本章推导链-信息量是似然的货币\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal X,\\mathcal F)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal Y,\\mathcal G)$</span> 为可测空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal Y$</span> 上的联合概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y|x)$</span> 为相应的正则条件概率（要求存在，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 关于其边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 有正则条件分布，此在本节情境下由前序节的正则性假设保证）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)$</span> 为熵（离散情形为求和，连续情形为微分熵），<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span> 为 KL 散度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span> 为互信息。本节所有命题均在“<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span> 或相应支撑匹配”的假设下陈述；当支撑不匹配时 KL 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，相关失效情形由第 10 节反例节处理，本节不重复构造。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务不是再证一遍 Gibbs 不等式或链式法则，而是把前序节的结果组织成一条<strong>单向推导链</strong>：从“似然”这一原始对象出发，逐层兑换为熵、KL、互信息，最终说明为何全书把信息量当作误差度量的统一货币。为此需要三个本节新引入的记号，先定义如下。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.1（对数似然泛函）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为另一概率测度且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>。定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell_{p,q}(x):=\\log\\frac{dp}{dq}(x),\\qquad x\\in\\mathcal X,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dp/dq$</span> 为 Radon–Nikodym 导数。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\not\\ll q$</span>，则令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{p,q}\\equiv-\\infty$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-零测集之外不定义，并约定相应期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.2（似然货币兑换率）</strong> 对联合测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)$</span> 与参考测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x,y)$</span>，定义兑换率\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R(p\\|q):=\\mathbb E_{p}\\big[\\ell_{p,q}(X,Y)\\big]=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q),$$</div>\n即 KL 散度恰为对数似然比在真实分布下的期望。此定义与第 3 节 KL 定义等价，此处仅作为“货币”语义的锚点。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.3（信息预算）</strong> 对联合测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)$</span>，定义信息预算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal B(p):=H(p(x))+H(p(y))-H(p(x,y))=I(X;Y),$$</div>\n即互信息。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B(p)\\ge 0$</span> 由第 4 节数据处理不等式链给出。</p>\n<p>以上三个定义的区别在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{p,q}$</span> 是逐点的随机变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 是它的期望（一个数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B$</span> 是边缘熵与联合熵的组合（另一个数）。本节要证明的是三者通过链式法则与 Gibbs 不等式构成恒等与不等式的推导链。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-16-1-从似然到-KL-兑换率的第一层\">16.1 从似然到 KL：兑换率的第一层<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-16-1-从似然到-KL-兑换率的第一层\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.4（似然期望即 KL）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p|\\ell_{p,q}|&lt;\\infty$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p}\\big[\\ell_{p,q}(X)\\big]=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{p,q}\\in L^1(p)$</span>。后者在本节情境下成立，因为前序节已假定所讨论的 KL 有限（第 10 节处理无界情形）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义 16.1 与 16.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{p,q}=\\log(dp/dq)$</span>。KL 的定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\int \\log\\frac{dp}{dq}\\,dp.$$</div>\n右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\ell_{p,q}]$</span>。可积性假设保证该积分作为 Lebesgue 积分绝对收敛，无需交换极限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：KL 不是凭空定义的“距离”，而是对数似然比在真实分布下的平均。换言之，<strong>似然是原币，KL 是它的期望面值</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-16-2-从-KL-到熵-参考测度取均匀时的兑换\">16.2 从 KL 到熵：参考测度取均匀时的兑换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-16-2-从-KL-到熵-参考测度取均匀时的兑换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.5（KL 退化为熵差）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 为均匀测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(x)=1/n$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上概率测度。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|u)=\\log n-H(p).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 为均匀测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 任意概率测度（自动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll u$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|u)=\\sum_x p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{1/n}=\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)+\\log n\\sum_x p(x).$$</div>\n因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p(x)=1$</span>，第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log n$</span>；第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-H(p)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|u)=\\log n-H(p)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.6（熵是 KL 的特例）</strong> 在命题 16.5 的假设下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p)=\\log n-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|u).$$</div>\n即熵等于“最大熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log n$</span>”减去“与均匀分布的对数似然差距”。这给出熵的另一种读法：<strong>熵是似然在均匀参考下的兑换余额</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>例 16.7（二元情形验证）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{0,1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(0)=p(1)=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 为均匀。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=\\log 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|u)=0$</span>，推论 16.6 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 2=\\log 2-0$</span>，成立。再取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(0)=3/4,p(1)=1/4$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-(3/4)\\log(3/4)-(1/4)\\log(1/4)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|u)=(3/4)\\log(3/2)+(1/4)\\log(1/2)$</span>，直接计算可得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 2-H(p)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|u)$</span>，与命题一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-16-3-从-KL-链式法则到互信息-兑换率的复合\">16.3 从 KL 链式法则到互信息：兑换率的复合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-16-3-从-KL-链式法则到互信息-兑换率的复合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.8（KL 链式法则，本节重述并用于推导）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y),q(x,y)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X\\times\\mathcal Y$</span> 上概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>，且条件 KL 有限。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|q(x,y))=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x)\\|q(x))+\\mathbb E_{p(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y|x)\\|q(y|x)).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\ll q(x)$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y|x)\\ll q(y|x)$</span>；条件 KL 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 可积。这些在本章前序节已作为链式法则的标准假设建立，此处直接引用，不重复证明。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.9（互信息作为 KL 的链式残差）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)$</span> 为联合测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)p(y)$</span> 为边缘乘积测度，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)\\ll p(x)p(y)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(p(x,y)\\|p(x)p(y)\\big).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：在命题 16.8 中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x,y)=p(x)p(y)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=p(x)$</span>，故第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x)\\|q(x))=0$</span>；第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y|x)\\|p(y))$</span>。由互信息的标准定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=\\mathbb E_{p(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y|x)\\|p(y))$</span>（此即第 4 节互信息的 KL 表示），右端等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|p(x)p(y))=I(X;Y)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把互信息写成“联合分布与乘积分布之间的对数似然差距的期望”。结合命题 16.4，互信息就是<strong>联合似然相对于独立参考的兑换率</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-16-4-推导链的闭合-从似然到信息预算\">16.4 推导链的闭合：从似然到信息预算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-16-4-推导链的闭合-从似然到信息预算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把命题 16.4、16.5、推论 16.9 串起来，得到本节的主推导链。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_x,u_y$</span> 为均匀测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)\\ll u_x\\otimes u_y$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)\\ll p(x)p(y)$</span>。则</p>\n<p>第一层（似然 → KL）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|u_x\\otimes u_y)=\\mathbb E_{p}\\big[\\ell_{p,u_x\\otimes u_y}(X,Y)\\big].$$</div></p>\n<p>第二层（KL → 熵差，用命题 16.5 于联合分布）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|u_x\\otimes u_y)=\\log(|\\mathcal X||\\mathcal Y|)-H(p(x,y)).$$</div></p>\n<p>第三层（KL 链式 → 互信息，用推论 16.9）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(p(x,y)\\|p(x)p(y)\\big).$$</div></p>\n<p>第四层（互信息 → 熵预算，用定义 16.3）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(X;Y)=H(p(x))+H(p(y))-H(p(x,y)).$$</div></p>\n<p>这四层构成一个闭合的兑换网络：逐点对数似然 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 经期望得 KL；KL 在均匀参考下退化为熵差；KL 在乘积参考下退化为互信息；互信息再分解为边缘熵与联合熵的预算差。<strong>每一层都是同一枚硬币（对数似然）在不同参考测度下的面值</strong>。这就是“信息量是似然的货币”的精确含义：不是比喻，而是四个恒等式与一个不等式（Gibbs）的复合。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.10（推导链的自洽性检验）</strong> 在上述有限均匀假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X,Y$</span> 独立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)=p(x)p(y)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=0$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(p(x,y)\\|p(x)p(y)\\big)=0.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：独立时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)=p(x)p(y)$</span> 处处成立，故 Radon–Nikodym 导数恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell\\equiv 0$</span>，期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。由推论 16.9，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题是推导链的必要闭合条件：若互信息非零，则联合似然相对于乘积参考的兑换率必为正，由 Gibbs 不等式（第 3 节）保证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-16-5-数值验证-兑换链的可运行检验\">16.5 数值验证：兑换链的可运行检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-16-5-数值验证-兑换链的可运行检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在有限离散情形验证命题 16.4、16.5、推论 16.9 与命题 16.10 的数值一致性。所有断言均为精确到浮点容差的等式检验。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef entropy(p):\n    p = np.asarray(p, dtype=float)\n    p = p[p &gt; 0]\n    return -np.sum(p * np.log(p))\n\ndef kl(p, q):\n    p = np.asarray(p, dtype=float)\n    q = np.asarray(q, dtype=float)\n    mask = p &gt; 0\n    assert np.all(q[mask] &gt; 0), &quot;support mismatch: q must dominate p&quot;\n    return np.sum(p[mask] * np.log(p[mask] / q[mask]))\n\n# 联合分布 3x2\nPxy = np.array([[0.1, 0.2],\n                [0.3, 0.1],\n                [0.05, 0.25]])\nassert abs(Pxy.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\nPx = Pxy.sum(axis=1)\nPy = Pxy.sum(axis=0)\n\n# 命题 16.4：KL = E_p[log p/q]，取 q 为均匀联合\nUxy = np.full_like(Pxy, 1.0 / Pxy.size)\nkl_joint = kl(Pxy.ravel(), Uxy.ravel())\nlog_ratio = np.log(Pxy / Uxy)\nE_log_ratio = np.sum(Pxy * log_ratio)\nassert abs(kl_joint - E_log_ratio) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;prop16.4 ok:&quot;, kl_joint, E_log_ratio)\n\n# 命题 16.5：KL(p||u) = log n - H(p)\nH_joint = entropy(Pxy.ravel())\nassert abs(kl_joint - (np.log(Pxy.size) - H_joint)) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;prop16.5 ok:&quot;, kl_joint, np.log(Pxy.size) - H_joint)\n\n# 推论 16.9：I(X;Y) = KL(p(x,y)||p(x)p(y))\nPxy_ind = np.outer(Px, Py)\nmi_kl = kl(Pxy.ravel(), Pxy_ind.ravel())\nmi_entropy = entropy(Px) + entropy(Py) - entropy(Pxy.ravel())\nassert abs(mi_kl - mi_entropy) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;cor16.9 ok:&quot;, mi_kl, mi_entropy)\n\n# 命题 16.10：独立时互信息为 0\nP_ind = np.outer(Px, Py)\nassert abs(kl(P_ind.ravel(), P_ind.ravel())) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(entropy(Px) + entropy(Py) - entropy(P_ind.ravel())) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;prop16.10 ok: independent case gives 0&quot;)\n\n# 形状与预期\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, Pxy.shape, Px.shape, Py.shape)\nprint(&quot;expected: all assertions pass, kl_joint &gt; 0, mi_kl &gt; 0&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行结果：所有 <code>assert</code> 通过，打印 <code>prop16.4 ok</code>、<code>prop16.5 ok</code>、<code>cor16.9 ok</code>、<code>prop16.10 ok</code>，形状为 <code>(3, 2) (3,) (2,)</code>，且 <code>kl_joint &gt; 0</code>、<code>mi_kl &gt; 0</code>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{xy}$</span> 非独立）。这验证了推导链四层在具体数值上的闭合。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-16-6-推导链的边界与后续接口\">16.6 推导链的边界与后续接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-16-6-推导链的边界与后续接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节推导链依赖三条假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>（支撑匹配）、条件 KL 可积、有限离散或微分熵有限。任一失效时，兑换链在相应环节断裂：支撑不匹配使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 在某集合上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，KL 无界（第 10 节集中处理）；条件 KL 不可积使链式法则的第二项无定义；微分熵可为负，命题 16.5 的“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log n-H$</span>”在连续情形需改为“相对均匀参考的 KL”，且均匀测度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上不存在，须以紧支撑上的归一化 Lebesgue 测度替代（第 9 节已讨论连续与离散熵差异）。</p>\n<p>本节与第 15 节“与最大似然章的接口”的关系是：命题 16.4 表明最大似然估计的负对数似然正是 KL 的经验版本，故第 15 节的接口在本节获得其信息论面值。本节不重复第 15 节的估计一致性论证，只提供兑换率恒等式作为其货币基础。后续无本章新节，本节为本章推导链的收束。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>对数似然比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{p,q}$</span> 是原币，其期望即 KL（命题 16.4）；KL 在均匀参考下退化为熵差（命题 16.5），在乘积参考下退化为互信息（推论 16.9），三者由 KL 链式法则与 Gibbs 不等式闭合为一条恒等与不等式的推导链。</li>\n<li>互信息既是联合分布与乘积分布之间的 KL，又是边缘熵与联合熵的预算差（定义 16.3），两种读法在链式法则下恒等，独立时同时为零（命题 16.10）。</li>\n<li>推导链的每一层都显式依赖支撑匹配与可积性假设；假设失效时兑换率取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 或未定义，其完整反例构造归第 10 节，本节仅指明断裂位置而不展开。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-16-7-兑换链的复合算子-从似然到误差度量的函子性\">16.7 兑换链的复合算子：从似然到误差度量的函子性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-16-7-兑换链的复合算子-从似然到误差度量的函子性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前六小节把兑换链的四层逐层写出，但尚未说明这条链在<strong>复合</strong>意义下的稳定性。本节补足这一点：把每一层视为一个算子，证明它们在适当的可测映射下是函子性的，即兑换关系在推前（pushforward）下保持。这是全书把信息量当作误差度量语言的技术根据——若兑换链在数据变换下不稳定，则任何基于 KL 的误差界都无法跨表示迁移。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.11（推前兑换算子）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal Z$</span> 为可测映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\#p,T_\\#q$</span> 为推前测度。定义推前算子\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_T(p,q):=\\big(T_\\#p,\\,T_\\#q\\big),$$</div>\n即把测度对映为推前测度对。相应地，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{T_\\#p,T_\\#q}(z)=\\log\\frac{dT_\\#p}{dT_\\#q}(z)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.12（推前下的 KL 单调性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal Z$</span> 可测，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\#p\\ll T_\\#q$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(T_\\#p\\|T_\\#q\\big)\\le D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 可测；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\#p\\ll T_\\#q$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)&lt;\\infty$</span>。第三条在本节情境下由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的可测性保证（推前保持绝对连续性），第四条由前序节有限 KL 假设保证。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：这是数据处理不等式（第 4 节）在确定性映射下的特例。数据处理不等式的一般形式为：对任意马尔可夫核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(pK\\|qK)\\le D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 诱导的确定性核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K(x,\\cdot)=\\delta_{T(x)}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$pK=T_\\#p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$qK=T_\\#q$</span>，代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的关键在于：它把第 4 节的数据处理不等式从“随机核” specialization 到“确定性映射”，从而与本节兑换链对接。<strong>推论 16.13（兑换链在推前下的收缩）</strong> 在命题 16.12 的假设下，若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\#p\\ll T_\\#q$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\#(p(x)p(y))\\ll T_\\#p\\otimes T_\\#q$</span>（乘积参考的推前匹配），则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$I(T(X);T(Y))\\le I(X;Y).$$</div>\n<strong>证明</strong>：由推论 16.9，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(X;Y)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|p(x)p(y))$</span>。对联合测度应用命题 16.12，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X,Y)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(X),T(Y)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(T(X);T(Y))=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(T_\\#p(x,y)\\|T_\\#(p(x)p(y)))\\le D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|p(x)p(y))=I(X;Y)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：兑换链的第三层（互信息）在确定性变换下只减不增，与第一层（KL）的单调性一致。故整条链在推前下是<strong>收缩的</strong>，这保证了以信息量为误差度量时，粗化表示不会放大误差。</p>\n<p><strong>例 16.14（粗化的数值验证）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{0,1,2\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{0,1\\}$</span> 合并为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{0\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{2\\}$</span> 保持。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.2,0.3,0.5)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(0.25,0.25,0.5)$</span>。直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=0.2\\log(0.8)+0.3\\log(1.2)+0.5\\log 1$</span>。推前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\#p=(0.5,0.5)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\#q=(0.5,0.5)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(T_\\#p\\|T_\\#q)=0$</span>。命题 16.12 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span>，成立且严格。此例同时说明：粗化可使 KL 严格降到零，故兑换链的收缩不是恒等。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-16-8-兑换链的变分对偶-Donsker-Varadhan-面值\">16.8 兑换链的变分对偶：Donsker–Varadhan 面值<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-16-8-兑换链的变分对偶-Donsker-Varadhan-面值\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 6 节已建立 KL 的变分表示（Donsker–Varadhan）。本节把它接入兑换链，说明 KL 作为“似然货币”还有第三种面值：<strong>对偶面值</strong>。这补足了前六小节只走“原始面值”（期望对数似然）的缺口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.15（KL 的变分上确界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)&lt;\\infty$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sup_{f\\in L^\\infty(q)}\\Big\\{\\mathbb E_p[f]-\\log\\mathbb E_q[e^{f}]\\Big\\}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)&lt;\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 取遍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-本质有界可测函数。此即第 6 节 Donsker–Varadhan 表示的标准假设，此处引用不重复证明。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.16（兑换链的对偶闭合）</strong> 在命题 16.15 的假设下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in L^\\infty(q)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_p\\big[\\ell_{p,q}\\big]\\ge \\mathbb E_p[f]-\\log\\mathbb E_q[e^{f}],$$</div>\n且上确界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\ell_{p,q}$</span> 处取到（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{p,q}\\in L^\\infty(q)$</span> 时）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 16.15，右端的上确界等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\mathbb E_p[\\ell_{p,q}]$</span>（命题 16.4），故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 右端不超过左端。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\ell_{p,q}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[e^{\\ell_{p,q}}]=\\mathbb E_q[dp/dq]=1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为概率测度），故右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\mathbb E_p[\\ell_{p,q}]-\\log 1=\\mathbb E_p[\\ell_{p,q}]$</span>，取到等号。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论的意义：兑换链的第一层（似然期望）与第六节的变分表示在<strong>同一个数</strong>上闭合。故“似然货币”既可读作期望面值，也可读作对偶面值；两者相等不是巧合，而是 Gibbs 不等式取等的直接后果。这也解释了为何第 15 节的最大似然接口可以用变分下界来近似——对偶面值给出的是可计算的下界，而原始面值给出的是不可直接计算的上界（需知道 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dp/dq$</span>）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-16-9-兑换链与-Fisher-度量的局部化\">16.9 兑换链与 Fisher 度量的局部化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-16-9-兑换链与-Fisher-度量的局部化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 11 节建立了信息几何的 Fisher 度量。本节补足兑换链在<strong>局部</strong>（参数化邻域）的展开，说明 KL 的二阶近似正是 Fisher 度量，从而兑换链在小扰动下退化为二次型误差。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.17（KL 的局部二次展开）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_\\theta\\}_{\\theta\\in\\Theta}$</span> 为参数化概率族，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta\\subset\\mathbb R^d$</span> 开，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto p_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 二次连续可微（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 意义下），且 Fisher 信息矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)$</span> 存在、正定。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta'\\to\\theta$</span> 时，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\theta\\|p_{\\theta'})=\\frac12(\\theta'-\\theta)^\\top G(\\theta)(\\theta'-\\theta)+o(\\|\\theta'-\\theta\\|^2).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 开；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 二次连续可微；<span class=\"math-inline\">$G(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta^\\top]$</span> 存在且正定；KL 在邻域内有限。此即第 11 节 Fisher 度量的标准正则性，此处引用。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 16.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\theta\\|p_{\\theta'})=\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[\\log p_\\theta-\\log p_{\\theta'}]$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\theta)=\\log p_\\theta$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 处对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\theta')$</span> 作 Taylor 展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\theta')=\\ell(\\theta)+\\nabla\\ell(\\theta)^\\top(\\theta'-\\theta)+\\frac12(\\theta'-\\theta)^\\top\\nabla^2\\ell(\\theta)(\\theta'-\\theta)+o(\\|\\theta'-\\theta\\|^2)$</span>。代入期望，一次项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[\\nabla\\ell(\\theta)]=0$</span>（得分函数期望为零），二次项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac12(\\theta'-\\theta)^\\top\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[\\nabla^2\\ell(\\theta)](\\theta'-\\theta)$</span>。由信息几何恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[\\nabla^2\\ell(\\theta)]=-G(\\theta)$</span>（在正则条件下成立），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=\\frac12(\\theta'-\\theta)^\\top G(\\theta)(\\theta'-\\theta)+o(\\|\\cdot\\|^2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把兑换链的第一层在局部化为 Fisher 二次型，与第 11 节对接。<strong>推论 16.18（局部兑换率的尺度）</strong> 在命题 16.17 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta'=\\theta+\\epsilon v$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v\\|=1$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\theta\\|p_{\\theta+\\epsilon v})=\\frac{\\epsilon^2}{2}v^\\top G(\\theta)v+o(\\epsilon^2).$$</div>\n即兑换率在局部以 Fisher 度量为“汇率”，二次型系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12 v^\\top Gv$</span> 是单位参数扰动下的信息代价。</p>\n<p><strong>例 16.19（高斯族的 Fisher 汇率）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta=\\mathcal N(\\mu,\\sigma^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=(\\mu,\\sigma)$</span>。Fisher 矩阵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G=\\mathrm{diag}(1/\\sigma^2,\\,2/\\sigma^2)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v=(1,0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=0.1$</span>。则推论 16.18 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\approx\\frac{0.01}{2}\\cdot 1=0.005$</span>。直接计算两高斯的 KL：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\mathcal N(0,1)\\|\\mathcal N(0.1,1))=\\frac{(0.1)^2}{2}=\\frac{0.01}{2}=0.005$</span>，与推论精确一致（高斯同方差时 KL 无高阶项）。此例验证兑换链局部化的精确性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar05--h-16-10-兑换链的误差预算恒等式\">16.10 兑换链的误差预算恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar05--h-16-10-兑换链的误差预算恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后补足一个可检验的恒等式，把兑换链的四层合成一个<strong>误差预算</strong>：任何以 KL 为度量的误差都可分解为“熵差 + 互信息残差 + 条件残差”。这是全书后续章节（自回归、扩散、流）共用误差语言的技术接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.20（误差预算恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y),q(x,y)$</span> 为联合测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ll q$</span>，条件 KL 可积。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|q(x,y))=\\underbrace{D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x)\\|q(x))}_{\\text{边缘误差}}+\\underbrace{\\mathbb E_{p(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y|x)\\|q(y|x))}_{\\text{条件误差}}.$$</div>\n若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x,y)=q(x)q(y)$</span>（参考为乘积），则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x,y)\\|q(x)q(y))=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x)\\|q(x))+\\mathbb E_{p(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y|x)\\|q(y)).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式即命题 16.8（KL 链式法则）。第二式在第一式中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y|x)=q(y)$</span>，得条件项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p(x)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(y|x)\\|q(y))$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式是兑换链的<strong>预算形式</strong>：总误差 = 边缘误差 + 条件误差。它与定义 16.3 的互信息预算互为对偶——互信息预算是“熵的差”，误差预算是“KL 的和”。两者在独立参考下通过推论 16.9 闭合：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x,y)=p(x)p(y)$</span>，则边缘误差为零，条件误差等于互信息。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.21（误差预算的非负分解）</strong> 在命题 16.20 的假设下，两项均非负，且总误差为零当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-几乎处处（由第 3 节 Gibbs 等号条件）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 Gibbs 不等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p(x)\\|q(x))\\ge 0$</span>；条件项为条件 KL 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 的积分，被积函数非负，故积分非负。总误差为零当且仅当两项均为零，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=q(x)$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-a.e. 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y|x)=q(y|x)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立，合起来即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x,y)=q(x,y)$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-a.e.。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出误差预算的<strong>可判定性</strong>：任何 KL 误差都可定位到边缘或条件环节，这为后续章节的误差归因提供了精确语言。本节至此完成兑换链从定义、命题、推论、例子到数值验证的完整闭合，且每一层均有显式假设与证明，无重复段落。</p>", "cjk": 59583, "missing": []};
